字段与消费者协议可比较，但尚未证明ModuleFrame如何写执行计数、何时允许复用及同帧读取。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>0x7fa0所选创建/扩容成功支在映射首地址写像素长度，+0xe写ushort0x80，+8写byte0，并把描述中的共享名复制到头+0x10的0x40字节区域。之后公共尾段更新长度和头+0x50的uint0，向第四实参输出base+0x80，向第五实参输出描述+0x14的共享名地址。0x18000827f–0x1800082d9汇编核对了这些写入及两个返回槽。因此CopyImage保存到描述+0x20的附加值可定位为该共享名地址，而非凭名称猜为所有权令牌。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>    plVar4 = (longlong *)*plVar15;</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="27849712167741a1c361f6ac38c2d3c0a8f108608f8c5ad78fef6660b8da71a8" href="../../证据/27849712167741a1c361f6ac38c2d3c0a8f108608f8c5ad78fef6660b8da71a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>278497121677</small></a><p>  *param_4 = *plVar15 + 0x80;</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f5eba9cc09d8f659594caa3241a7014088362a3729fd4a2c68df176c4cba0364" href="../../证据/f5eba9cc09d8f659594caa3241a7014088362a3729fd4a2c68df176c4cba0364.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f5eba9cc09d8</small></a><p>18000827f</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e557e81e04c1ab5c04318f78b75cf899d15885068d98f95ebe2cf99f024b6dd" href="../../证据/1e557e81e04c1ab5c04318f78b75cf899d15885068d98f95ebe2cf99f024b6dd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e557e81e04c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：消费者offset>84/计数门另由OD取证；协议对齐不能替代生产者到消费者的同实例、同计数与完整租约证据。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="NM03" id="NM03"><summary>NM03 · 原CreateOpenMapping / CloseMapping → 创建句柄、映射视图、关闭本地视图与句柄</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>描述保存本地映射视图、OS句柄、容量、名称；这些不是托管ImageData或WPF位图。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>映射创建尺寸含原件常量参与的计算，本条没有按常见策略把它解释成恰好length+128；更名helper与完整碰撞合同仍待核。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清本地描述不证明OS对象已消失、其它进程/显示映射已关闭或原指针的所有使用者已退出；错误时字段归零与真正关闭成功分开。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>0x8d90在描述大小/共享名门满足后调用CreateFileMappingA，并把句柄保存到描述+8；GetLastError非0走关闭/更名helper与一次重试，仍错误则返回0xe0000015。MapViewOfFile结果保存到描述首字段，为空则关闭并报错。0x90f0先拒绝空描述或容量0；非空视图调用UnmapViewOfFile，非空句柄调用CloseHandle，分别保留错误码，随后即使关闭失败仍清本地地址、句柄和容量字段。所选汇编及原PE IAT分别确认UnmapViewOfFile/CloseHandle。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>  if (param_3 != (undefined8 *)0x0)</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3eb73fe205f27d59f7a8b05515504815e854b35105a16464b0f50fe16d0d0541" href="../../证据/3eb73fe205f27d59f7a8b05515504815e854b35105a16464b0f50fe16d0d0541.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3eb73fe205f2</small></a><p>LAB_180008fad:</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cc737a7e56a12ea38d0010faaac710c3c9d8c3c3fc65aa5c842967fc84e9b07b" href="../../证据/cc737a7e56a12ea38d0010faaac710c3c9d8c3c3fc65aa5c842967fc84e9b07b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cc737a7e56a1</small></a><p>  if (param_3 ==</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a69284e4ab4faa785a1035826d151e53bbc95c07ab62548456b34b0a79b26a6f" href="../../证据/a69284e4ab4faa785a1035826d151e53bbc95c07ab62548456b34b0a79b26a6f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a69284e4ab4f</small></a><p>18000922b</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b456628e8301a7d07de22a7ea85d0c02641360d2f15709e795d930a541ddf6fe" href="../../证据/b456628e8301a7d07de22a7ea85d0c02641360d2f15709e795d930a541ddf6fe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b456628e8301</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未执行任何Win32映射API；全部创建/碰撞/错误/多读者行为只按所选静态体限定。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="NM04" id="NM04"><summary>NM04 · 原缓存节点、模块析构与共享池析构 → 描述拷贝、队列删除与关闭映射三层退役</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>缓存节点保存含像素指针/共享名地址的描述；共享池另外保存映射资源。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>节点被删时，基类池可能仍持映射；模块销毁再走不同资源域的清理。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>现已定位所选共享池映射清理callee，但没有证明模块销毁前所有结果、显示任务或外部消费者排空；不宣称原版生命周期全安全。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>追加helper0xf190分配0x48字节链表节点；0xf630以三次16字节和一次8字节搬运把0x38字节图像描述写到节点+0x10，没有在此复制其像素。模块析构先摘链删除缓存节点及哨兵，再以RCX=this+0x50调用0x7de0。该共享内存基类析构遍历池描述，对每项调用0x90f0关闭映射，然后处理引用控制块和容器。NB04的DeInit只清队列，不能替代这条模块/基类析构链。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>  puVar1 = operator_new</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ca857696c6b00c866a5706df03c4a96332e8c3053eef96fb4ec3cfd3d7f1f8e6" href="../../证据/ca857696c6b00c866a5706df03c4a96332e8c3053eef96fb4ec3cfd3d7f1f8e6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ca857696c6b0</small></a><p>18000f647</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5747ecccf771c1ff8a036c7ae869b4633f9a25affd5a63dae2242a5fed4ee1df" href="../../证据/5747ecccf771c1ff8a036c7ae869b4633f9a25affd5a63dae2242a5fed4ee1df.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5747ecccf771</small></a><p>  FUN_180007de0</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7b4c7a9b6639d1a838f0d5bdbb1da8cee490963d77ab2175254acf701721de01" href="../../证据/7b4c7a9b6639d1a838f0d5bdbb1da8cee490963d77ab2175254acf701721de01.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7b4c7a9b6639</small></a><p>18000dc54</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="498e4aa8eb176febd19213f6f445b9677fc1f1e9b466092ea303f47c762c27fb" href="../../证据/498e4aa8eb176febd19213f6f445b9677fc1f1e9b466092ea303f47c762c27fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>498e4aa8eb17</small></a><p>    for (puVar7 =</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e445dfe6da0a2e59a4e385ed7d0a23f15657bd20d7b0a5f4993ee777fd21907f" href="../../证据/e445dfe6da0a2e59a4e385ed7d0a23f15657bd20d7b0a5f4993ee777fd21907f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e445dfe6da0a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：基类析构末尾的反编译间接跳转警告保留；引用控制块所有callee、模块Destroy调用时序和最后像素读者仍未闭合。</p></details></details></article><article><h4>模块结果三仓：换角色，旧图还在</h4><p>display → 字典D0；buffer → 字典B0</p><p>变更后：普通交换后 display → B0；buffer → D0。D0内容未清空，计数字段不随字典互换。</p><p class="dd-gap">后续覆盖、该仓新批次Clear或DeInit才撤相应仓持有；已取走的显示引用另算。</p><details><summary>展开对应成员与源码</summary><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC01" id="RC01"><summary>RC01 · ValueEventArgs.ExecuteCount与固定标志 → buffer / spare入仓路由及整仓覆盖</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>仓库装的是ImageData/事件对象引用，不是复制像素帧；ExecuteCount是入仓批次标记，不应画成固定容量逐帧历史列表。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>同一执行计数的多次回调在所选仓内合并；新批次在同一仓覆盖旧批次。spare与buffer计数相等时只记录错误日志，未在该体强制去重或丢弃。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Clear字典移除该仓持有的引用，没有对每张ImageData执行Dispose、解除固定或释放共享映射。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>三个仓库均有ImageData字典和shape字典：display供TryGetImage/GetShapeStore读取，buffer和spare供回调入仓。SetDataToStore先拒绝sender为空或非ValueEventArgs，再按(NeedFixed &amp;&amp; e.ExecuteCount != FixedExcuteCount) || e.ExecuteCount == SpareExecuteCount选择spare；若所选spare批次改变，就更新SpareExecuteCount并Clear整套spare图像/图形仓。其它回调走buffer，批次改变则更新BufferExecuteCount并Clear整套buffer仓。同一批次再次到达只更新相关键，未更新键不在此路径自动清除。NeedFixedSpare并不出现在这个分流谓词里。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>private Dictionary&lt;string, ImageData> displayImageStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d466077ed678fd281c1b970d22b7b11f07d4af56a5d30b89ab23960e7ee066b7" href="../../证据/d466077ed678fd281c1b970d22b7b11f07d4af56a5d30b89ab23960e7ee066b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d466077ed678</small></a><p>public void SetDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a><p>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb787362f3f6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::SetDataToStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="607f54f594575d973842149b52502e5f73ff9b2ee14fff6e99aaac03caccee62" href="../../证据/607f54f594575d973842149b52502e5f73ff9b2ee14fff6e99aaac03caccee62.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>607f54f59457</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::SetRenderDataToStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="520b3aeb33a62e9a38e07fa69d07e734ccd61ff5b86a72b0e7c137f13398e2c7" href="../../证据/520b3aeb33a62e9a38e07fa69d07e734ccd61ff5b86a72b0e7c137f13398e2c7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>520b3aeb33a6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_BufferExecuteCount</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4c68392ec1ef2e9b2f0337d87545e40e827cbcd3d13bc0f8bde6a2d9de6752f3" href="../../证据/4c68392ec1ef2e9b2f0337d87545e40e827cbcd3d13bc0f8bde6a2d9de6752f3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4c68392ec1ef</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_SpareExecuteCount</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f07415d3eb6a66b7dfca41e9e26d5b164a2fa08c349072f619df969e1e29e13e" href="../../证据/f07415d3eb6a66b7dfca41e9e26d5b164a2fa08c349072f619df969e1e29e13e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f07415d3eb6a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：实际回调顺序、所有生产者的ExecuteCount分配及调用线程约束未在本切片闭合；不能把此分流谓词推成所有线程间的完整隔离保证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC02" id="RC02"><summary>RC02 · BeforeExchange / ExchangeBuffer → 仓库角色交换后旧display转成待写仓并继续持图</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>例：display=D0、buffer=B0；普通交换后display=B0、buffer=D0。旧D0的对象内容仍存在，交换的是字段引用。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>已显示的上一批图像可留在角色改变后的仓中；同一批次的后续写入未必触发整仓Clear，必须分别跟踪字典身份、字段角色和计数。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>交换本身不消除旧display持图，也不让ModuleDisplayDecorator/ImageViewBox的已取引用自动失效。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>BeforeExchange把FixedExcuteCount设为请求计数：等于SpareExecuteCount时置NeedFixedSpare，否则置NeedFixed；它不检查该请求一定等于BufferExecuteCount，也不先清另一侧已有标志。Exchange按捕获的NeedFixedSpare调用ExchangeBuffer：true时交换display与spare的图像/图形字典引用，false时交换display与buffer引用。不是逐项复制、逐像素复制或转移后清空。原display字典带着旧ImageData变成spare/buffer，继续持有旧值，直到后续相关键被覆盖、该仓新批次Clear、ClearDisplayStore（若它此时又是display）或DeInit。ExchangeBuffer也不交换BufferExecuteCount/SpareExecuteCount字段，因此不能把计数字段当成每个字典对象内所有键都已逐项认证的帧身份。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>public void BeforeExchange(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a3a618743e1fc086dc09826434e5db7c97caa0de0fa2e82fccf7c0cdaaa2b36" href="../../证据/2a3a618743e1fc086dc09826434e5db7c97caa0de0fa2e82fccf7c0cdaaa2b36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a3a618743e1</small></a><p>private void ExchangeBuffer(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da1ab55f0d543842f088cd74f47b7f310239a485e0e686ec19a5f45adf85a26b" href="../../证据/da1ab55f0d543842f088cd74f47b7f310239a485e0e686ec19a5f45adf85a26b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da1ab55f0d54</small></a><p>public bool IsBusy =></p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b872bf3475abf461dd0858b6a314a12250fb47e89f0047bf2d2fe3e3c6d5662c" href="../../证据/b872bf3475abf461dd0858b6a314a12250fb47e89f0047bf2d2fe3e3c6d5662c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b872bf3475ab</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::BeforeExchange</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0c9bb3c7691fc9f7fb5ae1d2766ce205a2004aaf67e01095ccbfab2c17eafb43" href="../../证据/0c9bb3c7691fc9f7fb5ae1d2766ce205a2004aaf67e01095ccbfab2c17eafb43.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0c9bb3c7691f</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::ExchangeBuffer</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9d46dfc61e5fd2f8f836811cd808781c86c92796354fd9857ae7a9607a1fda2" href="../../证据/e9d46dfc61e5fd2f8f836811cd808781c86c92796354fd9857ae7a9607a1fda2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9d46dfc61e5</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_IsBusy</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8edc1e2e511392c6ed798cca5e406763f6f185a45c2041151ee9e8fb4054383f" href="../../证据/8edc1e2e511392c6ed798cca5e406763f6f185a45c2041151ee9e8fb4054383f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8edc1e2e5113</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：IsBusy只是两个bool的OR；所选体未显示对声明_exchangelock加锁，不能据名字证明跨线程交换原子性，也不能在无运行时序证据时直接宣称实际数据竞争。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：外部调用方如何避免重复BeforeExchange和错误计数请求需结合ModuleResultView/回调调度继续核对。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC04" id="RC04"><summary>RC04 · ClearDisplayStore / Init / DeInit → 仅清当前display、清三仓及迟到回调的边界</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>清仓、清选择身份、禁止下层存值、原生像素释放是四个不同层次；A链ModuleResultView另持有的ImageData不由此字段写入直接清掉。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>ClearDisplayStore仍保留两待写仓里的旧图；DeInit删除三仓持有，但已交给装饰器、视图或扩展消费者的对象可继续可达。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>所选清理体没有调用ImageData.Dispose、FreeHGlobal或共享映射关闭；不能用DeInit的完成代替最后读者和所有像素已释放的证据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ClearDisplayStore仅Clear当前display图像/图形字典，不改buffer/spare、三个计数、两个固定标志或SelectedImage等选择引用。Init只设isInit=true。DeInit则设isInit=false，Clear三套图像/图形字典，清计数和固定标志，置CheckImagesName/SelectedImage/SelectedInputImage为空；没有逐图Dispose或像素free。SetRenderDataToStore以isInit阻止继续入值，但SetDataToStore本身并未先检查isInit：反初始化后迟到的有效回调仍可更新仓库计数和走Clear，然后在下层不存值。所以DeInit不等同所有生产回调已经停止或排空。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public void ClearDisplayStore()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf" href="../../证据/9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dfdc6e88917</small></a><p>public void Init()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2" href="../../证据/910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>910f799075bb</small></a><p>public void DeInit()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42" href="../../证据/4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4119f226ce97</small></a><p>public void SetDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a><p>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb787362f3f6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::ClearDisplayStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792" href="../../证据/2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2dab3ce386c5</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::DeInit</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95" href="../../证据/cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb340b8a3316</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::Init</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b" href="../../证据/aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aeb564366760</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：三仓只属于RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator的A链；不得归到没有引用RenderDataCenter的RenderControlBase/tempImageStore B链。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原机异步排空、外部消费者、图像/位图与native资源最终释放仍未验证。</p></details></details></article><article><h4>公共显示任务：任务也会延长持有</h4><p>事件与控件被Task闭包捕获</p><p>变更后：任务执行时再读控件当前状态和仓库；不是提交时冻结一份图像快照。</p><p class="dd-gap">所选Clear/Unloaded/DeInit体未等待这些Task；这只说明局部未证排空，不断言全局无排空或必现错帧。</p><details><summary>展开对应成员与源码</summary><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF01" id="IF01"><summary>IF01 · RenderControlBase自执行回调排队 → Task闭包保留控件/事件/sender，稍后才读当前状态</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Task/Dispatcher持有闭包，闭包持有控件与事件引用；图像至少可经控件稍后访问的临时仓库/属性间接可达，不是提交时复制一帧。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>OwnerProcessID、选图/临时仓库属于被捕获控件的当前字段；任务不是冻结后的全套来源快照。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>丢弃Task/Dispatcher返回句柄不取消工作；本方法未提供等待其结束后再退役控件/缓存的所有权协议。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OnModuleResultCallBackArrived仅在回调Value为bIsSelfExecute=1时考虑Task.Run；needUpdateRender=false时先清临时相关项并返回。实际排队的编译器闭包字段是valueEventArgs、&lt;>4__this、sender，没有一张独立ImageData快照。工作体开始后才从事件读取ExecuteCount，并经所捕获控件读取OwnerProcessID，while GetDataSendFinishState为true就Sleep(3)，结束再调用UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute(sender)。原CIL调用Task.Run(Action)后立即pop返回Task，没有在这个方法保存/await该句柄。另一个Dispatcher.BeginInvoke闭包同样保留该控件并在执行时选imageView/imageViewIn更新ROI。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>private void OnModuleResultCallBackArrived(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e1b45d06009250cd283fca06c30e99a87cfa48c2bf347576acca1e86e38a0342" href="../../证据/e1b45d06009250cd283fca06c30e99a87cfa48c2bf347576acca1e86e38a0342.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e1b45d060092</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0 captured fields</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="70a7534756244d48ba9e74bbbc77053ff3f5bb4913f7db73a9620250ad1ee4ce" href="../../证据/70a7534756244d48ba9e74bbbc77053ff3f5bb4913f7db73a9620250ad1ee4ce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>70a753475624</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::OnModuleResultCallBackArrived / 0x0600033e</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e016fdbeff470b28b74ca9d10181af859f1d887ddb637acf04f569d551ede71b" href="../../证据/e016fdbeff470b28b74ca9d10181af859f1d887ddb637acf04f569d551ede71b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e016fdbeff47</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0::&lt;OnModuleResultCallBackArrived>b__0 / 0x06000e3e</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f22e48a598591ec402123afe9c7bdbb7fc3f11b0e1e66eb565b4fb4eff7d3390" href="../../证据/f22e48a598591ec402123afe9c7bdbb7fc3f11b0e1e66eb565b4fb4eff7d3390.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f22e48a59859</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0::&lt;OnModuleResultCallBackArrived>b__1 / 0x06000e3f</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="752cd891fba4394e3f6620dd7a7b516024ddd18c212b3b7576bd4a6c0b71a1ff" href="../../证据/752cd891fba4394e3f6620dd7a7b516024ddd18c212b3b7576bd4a6c0b71a1ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>752cd891fba4</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚未运行原版乱序/切模块场景，不能从缺少本方法的取消句柄直接宣称实际必现过期显示或泄漏。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute对非null图、空图、回退的门分别见RB04；不能把sender归属校验扩大为全部分支统一校验。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF02" id="IF02"><summary>IF02 · 流程完成信号与图形计数筛选 → 普通Task稍后读取当前图像仓库</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>形状事件、临时图像引用与回调计数分开持有；没有提交时独立ImageData数组。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>排队后UpdateRender才读取控件当前tempImageStore；计数筛图门不能代替图像最后读者/身份门。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Task.Run(Action)返回值同样pop；工作体没有取消token、超时计数或卸载检查，轮询持续条件仅为所调用状态函数的返回值。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived要求Value是nWorkStatus=0的模块工作状态；先处理needUpdateRender，再在tempShapeStore中移除与nExecuteCount不符的图形事件，并检查IsNeedRender时间门后启动Task。该Task闭包只保存valueEventArgs和控件this；ExecuteCount在工作体中读取。计数0直接UpdateImageView(null)，非0则轮询当前OwnerProcessID的GetDataSendFinishState，再调用UpdateRender(executeCount)。这次计数筛选作用于临时图形表，不是把tempImageStore复制成受同一计数封装的帧包。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>private void OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ada9bc8c6e2dcebbd1dea7c2e718aa48af948dcfb3b2d8a90cb96f32e4eb14ba" href="../../证据/ada9bc8c6e2dcebbd1dea7c2e718aa48af948dcfb3b2d8a90cb96f32e4eb14ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ada9bc8c6e2d</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass55_0 captured fields</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed8e079fee44131f4c4bfc5b7daebe7e35a6d647f2036523a7f7e7329a5eedfd" href="../../证据/ed8e079fee44131f4c4bfc5b7daebe7e35a6d647f2036523a7f7e7329a5eedfd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed8e079fee44</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived / 0x0600033f</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ea2030c96a6c3252218a7bfba2b231779bee8c45a9525fca8846397339656a24" href="../../证据/ea2030c96a6c3252218a7bfba2b231779bee8c45a9525fca8846397339656a24.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ea2030c96a6c</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass55_0::&lt;OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived>b__0 / 0x06000e41</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="99e218adf5741b7380a33f898859ad8388169404f6629eb90d5412bacd576e99" href="../../证据/99e218adf5741b7380a33f898859ad8388169404f6629eb90d5412bacd576e99.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>99e218adf574</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：GetDataSendFinishState的生产端协议和何时终止轮询尚未在此闭合，不把函数名解释为已证明全部原生读写完成。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：IsNeedRender是显示节流/准入的一部分，不证明任务已排空或所有旧图像被释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF05" id="IF05"><summary>IF05 · ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>清空控件属性与排队闭包的强引用是两套可达关系；旧工作仍可通过this访问当前属性/仓库。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清临时仓库不销毁控件实例，且其它路径可能在其后重新赋ImageDataSource。这里只界定缺少哪一种排空保证，不断言必然覆盖新帧。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>退订阻止后续相关事件接入，不撤回已经创建的Task/Dispatcher委托；最后读者与像素释放仍需宿主层关闭协议和运行证据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>已核选定ClearImageView调用Init/UpdateImageView(null)或清输入图属性，Unloaded退掉OnSetImageEnd与OnFreshExtendContent委托，DeInitRenderControl解除显示事件/过滤并清临时字典。对应CIL中没有等待此前两条Task.Run返回句柄、DispatcherOperation.Abort或取消token操作；Task调用点又没有保留该句柄。这些动作因此不能作为已排队闭包不再持有控件、不能再读当前状态/调用更新的证明。下一次源为空的ImageViewBox回调仍是自己的同步清显示/通知旧新图像事件链，不构成上游工作排空屏障。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>public void ClearImageView(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a><p>private void RenderControlBase_Unloaded(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d" href="../../证据/e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e39cf2e044e0</small></a><p>private void DeInitRenderControl(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a><p>private static void ImageSourceChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957" href="../../证据/78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78da8122f616</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::ClearImageView / 0x06000345</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747" href="../../证据/a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a08ab0b721c3</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::RenderControlBase_Unloaded / 0x06000338</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3" href="../../证据/d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70a3f93d624</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da" href="../../证据/b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b970a4656f4d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不能仅凭选定体没有取消调用断言原程序全局不存在排空；进程/父窗口关闭及其它所有者仍需独立追踪。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未观察原机清空/卸载与回调竞争，实际过期呈现、异常或内存滞留是否发生及概率均未知。</p></details></details></article><article><h4>当前：清掉可见结果，不等于旧会话放手</h4><p>results视图、workflowSessions、调试Task和插件State是不同持有者。</p><p>变更后：新一轮可只隐藏旧结果；取消是否覆盖取决于有无返回新session。删节点也不在同一条路径裁剪所有旧会话。</p><p class="dd-gap">停止、关工具窗、切方案和主窗关闭分别核退役动作；图像源的State.Dispose仅关闭Folder，不主动清Cache/PendingFrame/StitchBuffer。引用何时不可达仍需逐个持有者判断。</p><details><summary>展开对应成员与源码</summary><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR01" id="CR01"><summary>CR01 · 新一轮开始 / 停止 / 抛取消异常 → 隐藏旧结果视图与保存旧会话是两个动作</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>results是可见NodeRunRecord索引，workflowSessions是完整ExecutionSessionResult；隐藏索引不等于移除图像持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>旧session可继续保持Nodes、WorkflowOutputs、WorkflowDisplays、LocalVariables和Calls中的PortValue引用；不能将空白显示当零像素缓存。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>停止请求不等于清旧结果或FIFO；本轮没有新session时不会自动用空session覆盖旧session。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>BeginWorkflowResults增加过程执行计数，仅在count>1、workStatus非0且清旧结果偏好开启时，标记该过程及所调用子过程为cleared并清当前results视图；它不删除workflowSessions。RunCore返回session才StoreWorkflowCallResults覆盖对应会话并移除cleared标记。若Task.Run被取消或执行抛异常而没有返回session，catch只改状态文字，旧session仍在；偏好开启时可处于隐藏状态，未开启时也未由这个catch主动清除。工具栏停止只Cancel activeRun，FinishWorkflowRun清运行标记并Dispose该取消源，不清会话或插件scope状态。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p> void BeginWorkflowResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="906d7cf57bdf8339ab5ca2514f2fba86c6ae18a05d1a7b4e33387608010c9e52" href="../../证据/906d7cf57bdf8339ab5ca2514f2fba86c6ae