8b10cfd38182295471ce9f343d73ba976360d21b616ee810a24b93e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61a0f0198b10</small></a><p>public sealed record ExecutionSessionResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a624e1107d0fc0939aaeebd75f8cf5259eab85a687e6877a8ebbffc7440706a7" href="../../证据/a624e1107d0fc0939aaeebd75f8cf5259eab85a687e6877a8ebbffc7440706a7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a624e1107d0f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：此事实仅区分返回session与抛异常两条路径，不把所有取消都判成保留旧会话；返回Cancelled session的覆盖路径见CR02。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR02" id="CR02"><summary>CR02 · GraphExecutor本轮取消 / 失败 / 跳过 → 本轮混合结果可替换上轮会话；旧插件状态另留</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>取消后保留的可能是本轮成功前缀，不是自动合并上一轮成功图像；失败记录与成功记录的图像持有不同。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>覆盖旧会话只移除该字典入口的旧引用，不清插件缓存、配置结果、调试记录或独立视图；新session本身仍可保留本轮成功图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清输出字典、返回取消状态、取消源Dispose均没有逐帧图像Dispose语义。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>GraphExecutor每轮新建records，不拿上一轮NodeRunRecord补失败节点。节点开始前发现取消会Record(Cancelled)且输出默认Empty；前驱失败或不可用会Record(Skipped)且输出Empty。单节点执行后取消/超时/异常与失败输出过滤按TD04生成本轮记录，已经成功完成的前序节点记录不因此统一清空。最终把全部本轮记录组成session，状态可为Cancelled/Failed/TimedOut。RunCore只检查owner、未以session成功作为发布前提，所以正常返回的取消/失败session也可替换workflowSessions，包含本轮早先成功节点图像与后续空输出。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>  var calls=new Dictionary&lt;string,ExecutionSessionResult>();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c7144a5f850927830edc406166c971f52e77b9968d6f6ea0aec41d31578cea76" href="../../证据/c7144a5f850927830edc406166c971f52e77b9968d6f6ea0aec41d31578cea76.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c7144a5f8509</small></a><p>   void Record(NodeRunStatus s,</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f1440ee0600786c122f0d86ac78832d707143388f584c292c495a9f8eb204f54" href="../../证据/f1440ee0600786c122f0d86ac78832d707143388f584c292c495a9f8eb204f54.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f1440ee06007</small></a><p>   if(executionEdges.Where(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11cf5bf31a1b62f258250b166cff21ce3305c5ec960ca40048bbb592167d77bf" href="../../证据/11cf5bf31a1b62f258250b166cff21ce3305c5ec960ca40048bbb592167d77bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11cf5bf31a1b</small></a><p>   if(cancellationToken.IsCancellationRequested){Record(NodeRunStatus.Cancelled,code:</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4" href="../../证据/1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1edcf7aa0e18</small></a><p>  var all=validation.ExecutionOrder.Select(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f" href="../../证据/f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f68913b1df0b</small></a><p>   WorkflowCallbacks.PublishModuleResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="267f0dc129d0e1d9039b2874b4463ef9adafd5a3a1001d76e3cd72a5e464bab6" href="../../证据/267f0dc129d0e1d9039b2874b4463ef9adafd5a3a1001d76e3cd72a5e464bab6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>267f0dc129d0</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Task.Run调度前取消或外层异常可能不产生session，需与CR01分别判断；未执行竞争、GC或内存峰值探针。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR03" id="CR03"><summary>CR03 · GraphEditorDocument.DeleteNodes → Changed → scope节点状态移除不等于裁剪旧session/配置记录</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>编辑文档的节点/JSON历史与运行NodeRunRecord在不同容器；删除图结构不自动改写历史运行session。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>configurationResults还可保存已删节点的旧记录；新配置请求available从旧session与configurationResults组装引用视图。具体能否再被有效订阅消费仍受当前文档解析和验证限制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>scope移除仅退役该层state持有；显示不再列出节点不等于所有结果载荷不可达。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>DeleteNodes修改节点、连线与配置引用，Edit提交文档后发Changed；主窗Changed调用ValidateToolConfigurationOwner、RetainExecutionNodes和刷新。RetainExecutionNodes只将现存(过程,模块,节点)集合交scope.RetainProcedureNodes并裁剪pointAliasPresentation。scope移除对应参数缓存与state，state若IDisposable才Dispose。这个删除链没有按被删节点裁剪workflowSessions.Nodes、configurationResults或toolDebugRecords；这些容器先前保存的记录不能因文档节点消失而推定已释放。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>    public void DeleteNodes(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="55d45978667d8145c9adc9da30a45d75ec8b9741f7221a07673f0ad6d36d96be" href="../../证据/55d45978667d8145c9adc9da30a45d75ec8b9741f7221a07673f0ad6d36d96be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>55d45978667d</small></a><p>        SolutionStore.ValidateStructure(next); RecordEditHistory();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b89579065a8ee9f9af3570bc103d2944630d50bee54ddd11515cddf3118608d2" href="../../证据/b89579065a8ee9f9af3570bc103d2944630d50bee54ddd11515cddf3118608d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b89579065a8e</small></a><p>doc.Changed+=()=></p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85" href="../../证据/bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bff6c0b3eb08</small></a><p> void RetainExecutionNodes()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b" href="../../证据/649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>649bacd49f44</small></a><p> public void RemoveNode(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a><p> void RetainProcedureNodes(IEnumerable&lt;(string Procedure,string Module,string Node)> current,string? only)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac" href="../../证据/fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd003545d04d</small></a><p>  var available=(workflowSessions.TryGetValue(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="981b8452e46fdcdc33b3db47f2114d8e3c2f5be28823b36d88836b7b543560a6" href="../../证据/981b8452e46fdcdc33b3db47f2114d8e3c2f5be28823b36d88836b7b543560a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>981b8452e46f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：只证明所选删除/Changed链没有这些裁剪，不宣称任意其它用户动作永远不会清记录；结果字典的最终可达时刻未测。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR04" id="CR04"><summary>CR04 · ImageSource状态缓存 / SDK待提交帧 / ImageBuffer FIFO → scope退役、Reset、像素格式变化分别影响哪些持有者</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>源Cache、PendingFrame、拼接数组、FIFO和NodeRunRecord是不同持有者；State.Dispose并不表示它的每个字段被清空。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>即使state从scope字典移除，正在运行的局部state引用或旧结果仍可能继续持有像素；停止不触发这里的Reset。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>是否由GC回收取决于其它引用；本切片只报告显式字段/容器变化，不宣称旧字节立刻归还系统。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ImageSource.State除Cache还持PendingFrame及StitchBuffer；其Dispose仅Dispose Folder并置null，不主动Clear Cache、清PendingFrame或StitchBuffer。SDK提交以Interlocked.Exchange替换PendingFrame，执行SDK模式再Exchange为null取走，不克隆。文件模式仅像素格式变化时Clear Cache，路径命中复用同一图像；缓存容量参数只限制新准入，不在此段按减少后的容量主动裁剪。ImageBuffer.State不是IDisposable，FIFO淘汰/Reset及scope移除均只是移除特定持有，旧结果仍可指向已出队图像（复制/发布见TD03）。主窗InvalidateSourceResults清results、调用fallback Reset并移除scope节点，却未在此方法清workflowSessions或configurationResults。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p> sealed class State:IDisposable</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89f6bf8036f5d726b62111368975cd50b32b1df8611de20688bbe3fe4a9d7186" href="../../证据/89f6bf8036f5d726b62111368975cd50b32b1df8611de20688bbe3fe4a9d7186.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89f6bf8036f5</small></a><p> public void SubmitImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e95d5c3ddca051a3b34f99a3ef3062deccf4070cd0b6ca5ec44633d55904fad8" href="../../证据/e95d5c3ddca051a3b34f99a3ef3062deccf4070cd0b6ca5ec44633d55904fad8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e95d5c3ddca0</small></a><p> public void Reset(ModuleExecutionScope</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105" href="../../证据/92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92647cab0979</small></a><p> public void Reset(string nodeId)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943" href="../../证据/13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13df7359670c</small></a><p>    if(state.PixelFormat!=</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d" href="../../证据/c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9b08bf7272f</small></a><p>     image=Interlocked.Exchange(ref state.PendingFrame,null)!;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30ce5b0d645bf5ba8fa53f0cded075c39a1ec1afa54cb9cd0511427e6077413b" href="../../证据/30ce5b0d645bf5ba8fa53f0cded075c39a1ec1afa54cb9cd0511427e6077413b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30ce5b0d645b</small></a><p> sealed class State {</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3cd0cb0fbffbb7a8227782f59fd5f627759a587ca5984feb13b1e97e1d90e5cf" href="../../证据/3cd0cb0fbffbb7a8227782f59fd5f627759a587ca5984feb13b1e97e1d90e5cf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3cd0cb0fbffb</small></a><p> void InvalidateSourceResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9768a53926729a080ff8249575d37b3e3fce7bbc03804fea3956145139ca4818" href="../../证据/9768a53926729a080ff8249575d37b3e3fce7bbc03804fea3956145139ca4818.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9768a5392672</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：无scope fallback状态的外部调用/所有Reset时序未穷尽；已知的托管持有关系不能替代native相机帧租用与释放证据。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR05" id="CR05"><summary>CR05 · 工具调试 / 普通配置自执行 / 关闭编辑器 → 停止调度与LastResult、Task结果、宿主缓存分别退役</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>完成Task&lt;T>、配置执行器LastResult、configurationResults、toolDebugRecords和工具窗口LastResult是独立持有者，不能统一命名成一个“会话结果”。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>正常失败record可覆盖配置缓存旧记录；配置失活导致不发布时旧configurationResults可留存。调试Invalidate还只做宿主特定失效标记，不消灭其它session旧引用。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>停止、Dispose调度器、从窗口集合移除、清LastResult和清宿主记录是不同动作；不能从窗口关闭推断所有输出图像已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>当前实际类型是ToolDebugSession和ExecutionSessionResult，并未发现名为ToolExecutionSession/RunRecord的同一实体。ToolDebugSession.active保存Start返回的Task，完成finally仅清取消源/更新状态，不把active置null；若为RunOnce，该完成Task可继续持有NodeRunRecord直到active被下次Start替换或session不再可达。StopAsync取消并等待active，不清已保存结果。普通配置调度ToolConfigurationExecution.Dispatch开始把LastResult=null，完成再置结果；StopAsync只取消轮询并等loop，不清LastResult；DisposeAsync再等待inFlight也不清它。宿主RunConfiguredTool按owner/配置存活/节点身份准入后缓存record，不限成功状态；关闭配置可阻止晚发布，但CloseToolConfiguration没有清configurationResults。独立调试窗口的关闭另等待session.DisposeAsync后移除session集合项，不等同清宿主toolDebugRecords。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（9）</summary><p> Task? active;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2" href="../../证据/5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5222f1b9a889</small></a><p>   async Task&lt;T> Execute()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7" href="../../证据/d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d22473d11e55</small></a><p> public async Task StopAsync()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392" href="../../证据/d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d03635ba61cc</small></a><p> async Task Dispatch(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7" href="../../证据/17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>17ad97750ddb</small></a><p> public async Task StopAsync(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38" href="../../证据/7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c2e184d34c3</small></a><p>  }catch(Exception ex){record=new(nodeId,</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742" href="../../证据/de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de435e16af18</small></a><p> void CloseToolConfiguration()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde" href="../../证据/4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4ae7013d1039</small></a><p> void BindToolEditorLifetime(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6" href="../../证据/560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>560abd8d493d</small></a><p> void StoreToolDebugResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3" href="../../证据/f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f654b99be709</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Task对象是否实际继续可达取决于窗口/context/session持有；此处只指出字段可达链，不声称关闭后必然泄漏。工具窗口内部额外结果/图像字段仍按各工具另核。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR06" id="CR06"><summary>CR06 · 切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>scope的租约控制state/services清理；NodeRunRecord与WPF/工具显示引用不由同一引用计数统一管理。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>失败资源被保留用于CleanupFailures诊断；旧在飞方法局部引用、关闭窗口/context、外部消费者与结果Task可另外保持载荷可达。FrameworkRunHistory只存摘要（TD08），不能把它当图像历史释放机制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>新owner阻止旧结果进入新方案，但不是销毁所有旧像素；窗口生命周期、scope清理、查询容器释放和最后图像读者退出需分别说明。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>切方案ReplaceExecutionScope先使执行owner失效、取消当前请求，显式Clear调试记录、configurationResults、workflowSessions、results等，再Dispose旧scope并创建新scope。scope.Dispose先closing并Cancel，只有取消完成且leases==0才Release；Release清state/services/参数字典，再逐个Dispose可释放资源，失败资源额外存failedResources。主窗关闭与切方案不同：DrainWorkflowBeforeClose先取消活动流程并等activeRun换出；独立调试session由OnClosing等停。OnClosed关闭owner/回调队列、关配置并Dispose scope，但该体没有Clear workflowSessions/results/configurationResults或逐个清控件图像。只可说关闭启动退役，不能说所有外部对象已同步归零。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p> void ReplaceExecutionScope()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403" href="../../证据/059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059edbdec789</small></a><p> public void Dispose(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf" href="../../证据/4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e8fd932d9bb</small></a><p> void Release(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a><p> void RecordCleanupFailure(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a><p> async void DrainWorkflowBeforeClose(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb" href="../../证据/6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6be2984eb8a0</small></a><p> protected override async void OnClosing(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797" href="../../证据/f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6d959502fe5</small></a><p> protected override void OnClosed(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b" href="../../证据/9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9244b0ac6bbc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：没有强制GC、原机内存峰值或最终外部读者测量；不得由静态Dispose路径推断释放的精确时刻、无泄漏或native等价。</p></details></details></article></details><p class="site-notice">该分支已独立分页：<a href="../../retirement-operation-map.html">图像回收：操作与最后读者</a></p><p class="dd-gap">原版接点：缓存工具像素/共享名 → ModuleFrame提交 → 内部长度_指针_共享名文本槽（MF01–MF03）；【SDK typed构造及header执行计数一处写入已证SN02/SN03，但内部对象来源、像素映射头同计数与同帧关联尚未闭合】；SDK回调 → VmIO（PB01–PB04）。不把缺口两侧拼成已验证的同帧链。</p><details open><summary>原版静态显示桥已补齐：两条宿主通路分别看</summary><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article><h4>A · 模块结果 / 工具参数结果视图</h4><ol><li>VmIO特征事件聚合</li><li>Object通知队列</li><li>RenderDataCenter三仓</li><li>ModuleResultView回调或主动GetValue</li><li>ModuleDisplayDecorator.ImageDataSource</li><li>原moduleresultview.baml绑定</li><li>该页ImageViewBox → Byte2ImageSource</li></ol><p class="dd-gap">回调仓库取值、图像下拉主动取值与结果树行点击是三种入口；结果树点击只改路径，不能推成主图切换。</p><details><summary>展开这条通路的逐段证据</summary><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="MF01" id="MF01"><summary>MF01 · 原VM_M_SetImageEx导出 → 像素指针、长度与第五实参共享名继续向内转发</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>调用侧临时描述 → ModuleFrame入口 → 内部像素指针/长度/flag/共享名；没有因描述展开就复制像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>flag按描述+c字节等于1且全局开关为0计算；不据该flag名称或位置推断接收方完整所有权。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>入口非空检查不能证明指针有效或像素租约仍在；未运行厂商DLL或确认实际进程DLL解析。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>安装目录ModuleProxy/x64/ModuleFrame.dll的原PE将VM_M_SetImageEx绑定RVA0x1312f0。入口检查context、参数名、图像描述和第五实参均非空；从描述+0取像素指针、+8取uint长度。0x180131377–1392汇编把第五入口实参转为后续调用第七参数（调用前[RSP+0x30]），长度放[RSP+0x20]，计算的flag放[RSP+0x28]，随后调用0x122a40。它不是只有伪码显示的四参调用；NB03的额外共享名在这个静态接收候选中未被丢弃。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>  if ((((param_1</p><p>原件 · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d4c51e70a89557c6371421319b5a25a244a5ce8205662bcadebb69e389916798" href="../../证据/d4c51e70a89557c6371421319b5a25a244a5ce8205662bcadebb69e389916798.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d4c51e70a895</small></a><p>180131312</p><p>原件 · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6dd068f0e7aa8d6c1d050b59522fbf3b3228f3282c4d3a7e08203947282dcfa5" href="../../证据/6dd068f0e7aa8d6c1d050b59522fbf3b3228f3282c4d3a7e08203947282dcfa5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6dd068f0e7aa</small></a><p>180131377</p><p>原件 · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d4c94e4e9ad9894b14e1f12a10d902bcab22f106822af097c06c471cb967b8bd" href="../../证据/d4c94e4e9ad9894b14e1f12a10d902bcab22f106822af097c06c471cb967b8bd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d4c94e4e9ad9</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：两DLL导入/导出名和ABI建立静态候选关系；原运行实例的装载解析、同帧/同计数及SDK接收对象仍未闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="MF02" id="MF02"><summary>MF02 · 原内部0x122a40 → 条件取共享映射指针，失败回到原像素指针再提交</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>原指针与接收端共享映射指针是两个地址来源；同一共享映射不意味着虚拟地址相等。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>映射记录按模块/参数/索引等上下文持有，命中还核名称和容量；所选记录结构与图像工具FIFO不是同一个容器。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本切片没有闭合映射记录析构、全部回调和最后读者；共享名匹配不替代完整租约证明。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>0x122a40读取context内模块标识及关联对象，模块标识-1不进入有效提交。模块条件函数0x108b20返回非0时，调用0xeee30，传模块标识、参数名、索引、原指针、长度、共享名及返回指针槽；成功可使用输出映射指针，非0错误则回到原像素指针并按日志门记录。0xeee30所选体在已有名称/容量匹配时使用其映射字段+0x80，否则经0xeff60建立记录并替换/追加缓存项。之后0x122a40将实际选中的指针、长度、共享名继续交0xc99f0→模块对象0xf49a0，不能把它画成无条件像素复制。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>      uVar5 = FUN_18008e5d0</p><p>原件 · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11a8286c43ba6e10ef8d21f0c11e39d0c860f98597d239aa5bd9112af14c6c1e" href="../../证据/11a8286c43ba6e10ef8d21f0c11e39d0c860f98597d239aa5bd9112af14c6c1e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11a8286c43ba</small></a><p>      pcStack_98 = param_7;</p><p>原件 · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1db9e8f82d81761245e84454ba2a5912009cbc9a040a6354b4444578a5b40b2a" href="../../证据/1db9e8f82d81761245e84454ba2a5912009cbc9a040a6354b4444578a5b40b2a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1db9e8f82d81</small></a><p>    if (uVar15 &lt; uStack_100)</p><p>原件 · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="407fc64e8b11f85d1d1a42d5e5db192392036b4433e41cee91457b4e95698a8e" href="../../证据/407fc64e8b11f85d1d1a42d5e5db192392036b4433e41cee91457b4e95698a8e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>407fc64e8b11</small></a><p>      uVar4 = FUN_1800f49a0</p><p>原件 · 45c57bc46f72fd1f9e0b3a6f9183ff974d14590cfd05ecf4e9fa97a4ff95ae9b · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2abce3ad9f8bc75904b8cb685028ed6fa80a0942257aa761f019e5ff3c0