13665cdb086ff87cee475d58375f3e" href="../../证据/7a1a52ce081fa74aa958f9af3d8918349f13665cdb086ff87cee475d58375f3e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7a1a52ce081f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它类型/映射模式及分割/数值转换的全部错误语义没有由本切片泛化；中间描述来源到ModuleFrame同一次写入仍未闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="SN04" id="SN04"><summary>SN04 · 原动态释放selector9 → 图像数组与像素指针按内部字分开清理</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>根容器、模块记录、参数数组、chunk数组和pData像素分别有释放门；公开模式字段与内部释放字独立。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>该API清调用者查询容器，不意味着原SDK内部cache、托管副本或显示位图清空。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>内部字1跳过所选pData删除并非证明最后读者安全；根释放后外部像素的真正owner/复用仍须继续追踪。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原IMVS_RELEASE_MEMORY_TYPE中历史结果列表为值9；本次直接读取原native跳转表9项得到0x6af272。该片段先MOV RDX,RSI再call0x6c1390，其中RSI由分发入口R8保存，证实传入查询根指针；返回后另delete根。0x6c1390按每模块0xe8、每参数0xd0、每图像chunk0x120遍历：pImage中的像素指针非0且元素+0x114为0才调用delete[]，随后清指针；元素数组本身仍另delete[]。因此释放查询描述数组，并不无条件释放每个图像像素，更不等于关闭所有映射与显示读者。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>1806af09c</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cf3f161b6f6bef9d39fb405b8d2ff89a8fb0bd41ce14ea9f8fc13ee801a31e46" href="../../证据/cf3f161b6f6bef9d39fb405b8d2ff89a8fb0bd41ce14ea9f8fc13ee801a31e46.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cf3f161b6f6b</small></a><p>1806af272</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3571e2280915f10aa297eccb9a73551b2ff14af05646c2ed0350229b2e20972" href="../../证据/e3571e2280915f10aa297eccb9a73551b2ff14af05646c2ed0350229b2e20972.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3571e228091</small></a><p>                if (*(longlong *)(uVar8 + 0xa8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e1a265ced8f579232a260db4ef0f98dab9d38573b15592fe069379e62e097940" href="../../证据/e1a265ced8f579232a260db4ef0f98dab9d38573b15592fe069379e62e097940.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e1a265ced8f5</small></a><p>1806c14c8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b04df70330654ea8bfc5b5c58b11a8e727769f8db5d4da3750a6a7f921cb569" href="../../证据/0b04df70330654ea8bfc5b5c58b11a8e727769f8db5d4da3750a6a7f921cb569.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b04df703306</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它selector/异常/部分构造失败的全清理未全部关闭；所选private释放字不能反推全部模式下像素owner。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="WL01" id="WL01"><summary>WL01 · 原CVmObjectBase平台注册 → 无后缀IMVS_RegisterOutputPlatformInfoCallBack及静态委托根</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>平台通用回调=外层结构指针+user指针；不是直接的单模块图像数组回调。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>静态委托字段与静态事件保持托管引用；ModuleManager构造订阅OnModuleResultExCallBack，不据此声称全部实例生命周期与解订阅已闭合。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>DestroyHandle是native句柄边界，不证明回调已排空；委托被静态引用与native停止调用是两项独立寿命条件。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>CVmObjectBase将delegateOutputCallBackFunc保存在静态字段PlatformInfoCallBack，再以mhandle、此委托和default(IntPtr) user调用ServerSDKAPI.IMVS_RegisterOutputPlatformInfoCallBack。包装直接调用同名NativeMethods，DllImport绑定.\iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.dll，CharSet.Ansi，无EntryPoint改名；V32是另一独立声明/包装，不是这条注册边。delegateOutputCallBack声明StdCall/Ansi，参数为两个IntPtr、返回void。静态字段保持托管委托可达，所选DisconnectServer仅FtpDeInit、DestroyHandle及清mhandle，未清委托字段。注册非0分支只new VmException，没有throw，故不能把走到后续初始化当成注册成功。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>CVmObjectBase.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="785528b2b56b08e9fd37146affa777dec5dcaae8a5dc76006529efddd82fbeb0" href="../../证据/785528b2b56b08e9fd37146affa777dec5dcaae8a5dc76006529efddd82fbeb0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>785528b2b56b</small></a><p>CVmObjectBase.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb46c900a63e4a0dbf222fc409a3527292192d623bb440baf67f66948e728932" href="../../证据/bb46c900a63e4a0dbf222fc409a3527292192d623bb440baf67f66948e728932.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb46c900a63e</small></a><p>CVmObjectBase.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0dc273aa8a29a7ed67e2f0bd152c1a89c20f6d70b6aa733d4cc0b11468b02cb5" href="../../证据/0dc273aa8a29a7ed67e2f0bd152c1a89c20f6d70b6aa733d4cc0b11468b02cb5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0dc273aa8a29</small></a><p>delegateOutputCallBack.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f9a933fa6b37fa8ad4e5d9164a9badafb49963a09aab27068c138fa655d651f3" href="../../证据/f9a933fa6b37fa8ad4e5d9164a9badafb49963a09aab27068c138fa655d651f3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f9a933fa6b37</small></a><p>ServerSDKAPI.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9588abb20fa5b49501aab8c4da9ae97794d3359563c4d12f464e410747a7ef0e" href="../../证据/9588abb20fa5b49501aab8c4da9ae97794d3359563c4d12f464e410747a7ef0e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9588abb20fa5</small></a><p>NativeMethods.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7f2bd3d12b9349363b3b3b5908bbdd0fd8e7c21e21d5a5beb6e57584a4a3b2b7" href="../../证据/7f2bd3d12b9349363b3b3b5908bbdd0fd8e7c21e21d5a5beb6e57584a4a3b2b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7f2bd3d12b93</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚无实际注册运行结果、native callback排空/解绑本体；不将静态root等同于线程安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：本条只针对当前ConnectServer实际caller，不把其他PF/Object/V32导出并入同一路。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="WL02" id="WL02"><summary>WL02 · 原SDK结果wire结构元数据 → x64字段偏移、固定数组与描述指针布局</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>固定内联名称/字符串和IntPtr目标是不同存储；ByValTStr在此Ansi声明不能按UTF16的260×2误算。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>wire结构保存的是描述/指针，不因此拥有指向的图像或字节数据。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Marshal布局查询不分配/释放原版数据；结构大小吻合不证明native分配长度、同帧或最后读者安全。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>对SHA34c0c90b…401c1、MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2原件，仅ReflectionOnlyLoadFrom后查询Marshal.SizeOf(Type)/OffsetOf(Type,field)。6个结构均Sequential/Pack8/Ansi，进程指针8。CHUNK_VALUE_EX大小288：pData@0、nLen@8、ByValTStr260 strValue@12、nUseRealData@272、reserved[3]@276；RESULT_INFO_EX大小208：status@0、名称byte[128]@4、type@132、count@136、六种值指针@144/152/160/168/176/184、reserved@192。RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX大小232：cycleID@8、moduleID@12、self@176、executeCount@180、resultNum@188、pInfo@192。外层OUTPUT_PLATFORM_INFO大小40：type@0、dataPtr@8、dataSize@16、dataLen@20。BYTEDATA_VALUE_EX大小32；RESULT_RESERVED_INFO大小272。完整字段/token/offset保留在原查询JSON与可核摘要。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>layout-summary.txt</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="20ee4d8150f0ea6132d4f4cc5b80112095b227656f62e47eb2bf82ba7be18e7a" href="../../证据/20ee4d8150f0ea6132d4f4cc5b80112095b227656f62e47eb2bf82ba7be18e7a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>20ee4d8150f0</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3e7626ed8716ad70720166fb455ff64b17fb39a20dd4d3d9603c5fd5f2e1d397" href="../../证据/3e7626ed8716ad70720166fb455ff64b17fb39a20dd4d3d9603c5fd5f2e1d397.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3e7626ed8716</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cc17df2deb80dfb60cad8018331219e2c87d2a3782c3385e9fe3815f61fac59d" href="../../证据/cc17df2deb80dfb60cad8018331219e2c87d2a3782c3385e9fe3815f61fac59d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cc17df2deb80</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90fee1029a3b28a56c3ecf982aa8126838f28b08b430339cfad15153369df25d" href="../../证据/90fee1029a3b28a56c3ecf982aa8126838f28b08b430339cfad15153369df25d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90fee1029a3b</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：查询只读加载元数据，未执行厂商代码；不得写成assembly完全未加载，也不得据布局代替native生产者实际写字段。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：外层nDataSize/nDataLen与nResultNum的运行合法域和实际分配范围仍需native原体/动态校验。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="WL03" id="WL03"><summary>WL03 · 原平台callback外层type=23 → RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX → PreProData的身份与计数复制</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>身份和执行计数属于结果列表header；每个chunk描述有pointer/length/name/useRealData，未额外携带该header计数。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>PreProData创建新的托管结果描述数组，但不等于所有像素已经独立复制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>PtrToStructure解包不转移native缓冲所有权，也不证明callback返回后所有借用指针仍有效。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>callback先PtrToStructure解外层，case23u再将pData按RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX解包，传ref moduleResultExInfo。ModuleManager.GetModuleResultCallBack直接以PreProData(moduleResInfo)触发托管结果事件；PreProData复制status/error/cycleID/moduleID/pubAddress/时间/self/executeCount/resultNum到托管header，按resultNum从pInfo取描述并逐项转换。executeCount来自结果header，而LargeObject只接CHUNK_VALUE_EX、目标对象和异常标记，没有header计数实参；所选链未比较映射头计数或据其拒绝过期帧。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>CVmObjectBase.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e69752e35678fd640373e1cbdd3b73dedb5e771ae2c916990ab1b41c4dbcefae" href="../../证据/e69752e35678fd640373e1cbdd3b73dedb5e771ae2c916990ab1b41c4dbcefae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e69752e35678</small></a><p>ModuleManager.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7144fe134121b554fe5aefd367b1293b94923f1ca881f2195e1624c7852c403b" href="../../证据/7144fe134121b554fe5aefd367b1293b94923f1ca881f2195e1624c7852c403b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7144fe134121</small></a><p>ModuleManager.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aa3e1bd1ea074284e2b6d6fcc64adec202df1ecb51048962769ba3da134b696a" href="../../证据/aa3e1bd1ea074284e2b6d6fcc64adec202df1ecb51048962769ba3da134b696a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aa3e1bd1ea07</small></a><p>ModuleManager.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="472615a54b2680de5eb9ec76bc979b1cda7220ad3c7a303ad7b76408c638a4b6" href="../../证据/472615a54b2680de5eb9ec76bc979b1cda7220ad3c7a303ad7b76408c638a4b6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>472615a54b26</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚未证明result header executeCount与对应共享图像映射头计数的native同帧关系。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：仅所选PreProData/LargeObject链没有该比较，不扩大为全应用任何地方都不比较计数。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="WL04" id="WL04"><summary>WL04 · 原NativeData2Data按nParamType分派 → 图像/chunk描述转换或byte[]内容复制</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>类型4/5=描述数组+持有/延迟解析对象；类型6=独立托管byte[]及截短的文本表现。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>类型6hexValue是完整内容副本，4096只是十六进制展示上限；图像缓存范围依赖WL05具体模式。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>byte[]内容复制完成后不再依赖原pByteValue像素内存；本代码没有因此归还生产者native块。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>类型4图像和5 chunk在!isFilter下将各自pointer指向的CHUNK_VALUE_EX描述序列读成托管描述数组，再逐项LargeObject；这一步不是每种模式均复制像素。类型6则为每项nLen创建byte[]并Marshal.Copy(pData,array,0,array.Length)，hexValue保留全部复制结果，显示strValue仅取前min(nLen,4096)字节转十六进制。图像/chunk路径与byte路径不可合并为一个“结果都已深拷贝”的结论。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>ModuleManager.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dc5fdb8b21e16dcc119aabb70645b54a90d8759afb703b8771211ff75c333635" href="../../证据/dc5fdb8b21e16dcc119aabb70645b54a90d8759afb703b8771211ff75c333635.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dc5fdb8b21e1</small></a><p>ModuleManager.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f22457d261449386bf877f87daee7ce9d7fc9bf8d3cecf027089780f1eeb6c07" href="../../证据/f22457d261449386bf877f87daee7ce9d7fc9bf8d3cecf027089780f1eeb6c07.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f22457d26144</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：描述转换helper的异常/长度合法域没有由本条动态校验。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：捕获byte转换异常为空catch，不能由结果项存在认定其字节已完整成功复制。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="WL05" id="WL05"><summary>WL05 · 原LargeObject nUseRealData与IMVS_MODULE_CHUNK_VALUE_EX_Data → 共享名延迟读取、指针入池复制或最终byte[]复制</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>模式0/2在LargeObject时延迟持有名字/地址描述；模式1默认即时复制到SDK共享池。之后GetData()返回托管数组又是一层复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>对象pData缓存的是SDK池地址；池wrap或扩容可改变该地址内容/有效性，不能把对象还存活当作原帧仍有效。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>共享映射正常路径UnmapViewOfFile/CloseHandle；池扩容释放旧HGlobal，未见按每个chunk单独free池片段的机制。返回byte[]交GC；生产者指针仍须其生命周期协议。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>LargeObject模式0只保存共享名并置IsMemory；模式2保存共享名、native指针和长度但仍IsMemory；模式1保存指针/长度且立即FillData。FillData通过ImvsSdkDefine.GetByteFromMemoryIntptr默认bUseMemPool=true进MemoryHelper.VMReadFromMemoryPtr，GetBytes取得池区后memcpy复制；禁用pool的该helper支路才直接返回原pointer。共享名FillData走VMReadFromMemory，读16字节头，解析长度/状态字节8/偏移14，复制映射内容到池或byte[]后Unmap/Close。对象GetData()另建byte[]并Marshal.Copy，是再一次独立内容复制。池GetBytes在容量越界时offset回0，单块超过容量时free旧pool再分配，故池指针缓存不是永久不可变像素所有权。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>ModuleManager.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="472615a54b2680de5eb9ec76bc979b1cda7220ad3c7a303ad7b76408c638a4b6" href="../../证据/472615a54b2680de5eb9ec76bc979b1cda7220ad3c7a303ad7b76408c638a4b6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>472615a54b26</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4777db9ae688b46f3d8966bc1eea385713d051b1c404ddbee72761eb97b180ab" href="../../证据/4777db9ae688b46f3d8966bc1eea385713d051b1c404ddbee72761eb97b180ab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4777db9ae688</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9416949c498b3f3bc211558c76dc7eb96de5e2bf2aed505dfb8a2e01ed57d7ee" href="../../证据/9416949c498b3f3bc211558c76dc7eb96de5e2bf2aed505dfb8a2e01ed57d7ee.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9416949c498b</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6eb8aa45f7fa6fd202509757aabaedada66c6afa176b370ef1a04e2c2f37c68f" href="../../证据/6eb8aa45f7fa6fd202509757aabaedada66c6afa176b370ef1a04e2c2f37c68f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6eb8aa45f7fa</small></a><p>MemoryHelper.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82cc07837eb973ef6d4693ba4c5388deb3f1ab243707aa89b5afea89324e7465" href="../../证据/82cc07837eb973ef6d4693ba4c5388deb3f1ab243707aa89b5afea89324e7465.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82cc07837eb9</small></a><p>MemoryHelper.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b259f943bf2371dc4748d5694f6a07f6c5b78b2455aa66e0e57174716b971258" href="../../证据/b259f943bf2371dc4748d5694f6a07f6c5b78b2455aa66e0e57174716b971258.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b259f943bf23</small></a><p>MemoryHelper.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f721d129949d474b58a2633218aff3b2cb586b0037deb614ad9115fb8731fd0" href="../../证据/0f721d129949d474b58a2633218aff3b2cb586b0037deb614ad9115fb8731fd0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f721d129949</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：共享名读取只检查16字节头，未在此比较结果header executeCount；与另一VMGetMemDataPtr读取80位置计数的接口不可混同。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：池并发/最后消费者协调与模式2何时实际读名字路径需具体consumer时序，不能仅凭字段布局宣称同帧安全。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ01" id="RQ01"><summary>RQ01 · ModuleParam字符串/二进制参数读取 → GetParamValue字符串返回与GetBinaryData固定托管数组的独立通道</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>GetParamValue输出string；GetBinaryData(ref byte[])输出此方法分配的托管数组，pin只是临时地址固定，不是像素永久租约。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>成功返回数组由调用者继续持有；参数读取自身不写VmIO结果缓存，也不调用PB回调桥。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>GCHandle.Free仅解除这次数组固定，不释放托管数组；此ref byte[]分支没有调用历史查询容器Release。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ModuleParam字符串索引getter在Parent未Dispose时，普通参数调用GetParamValue并要求错误抛出；VmModuleSet且键以%开头则走动态运行参数查询。ModuleManager.GetParamValue无长度重载传4096给显式长度重载，再把ref string交IMVS_GetParamValue；它没有查询模块结果或构造ImageData。ModuleParam二进制索引另走GetBinaryData：普通路径先查长度、new byte[length]并固定该数组，把数组地址交IMVS_GetBinaryData写入；调用返回后解除固定，finally再次检查保证异常也解除固定。native错误时把data置null。参数二进制读取不能被画成SDK结果chunk/共享图像名返回的同一路径。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public virtual string this[string key]</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89be3ef2d0428f8e3a544243521b37587d317a58abf50effa5064a71e7225602" href="../../证据/89be3ef2d0428f8e3a544243521b37587d317a58abf50effa5064a71e7225602.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89be3ef2d042</small></a><p>byte[] IUserBytesData.this[string key]</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a1b9a356c292060c70e67b3f061fbaf53c9aa0bfcaad3511e42e33806503ff58" href="../../证据/a1b9a356c292060c70e67b3f061fbaf53c9aa0bfcaad3511e42e33806503ff58.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a1b9a356c292</small></a><p>public void GetParamValue(uint nModuleID, string strName, int </p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="94092b68fb802c6639fd5c49059984fbdf16a1765a12889bce6926f829662cf1" href="../../证据/94092b68fb802c6639fd5c49059984fbdf16a1765a12889bce6926f829662cf1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>94092b68fb80</small></a><p>public int GetBinaryData(uint moduleId, string paramName, ref byte[]</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="37d3cb5f5e038d1ebe41e21903289c3340518315c7aa8b18760937db1ab1fbf0" href="../../证据/37d3cb5f5e038d1ebe41e21903289c3340518315c7aa8b18760937db1ab1fbf0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>37d3cb5f5e03</small></a><p>VM.Core.ModuleParam::get_Item</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fec48e8d8c50020f9100180f81d0a4dc12babdb60874726b2d057a82ccbf9595" href="../../证据/fec48e8d8c50020f9100180f81d0a4dc12babdb60874726b2d057a82ccbf9595.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fec48e8d8c50</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::GetParamValue</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="899f07f099c67f1f7adfca5ec3ca11800d64fad98639d1672f2062f8a71c8450" href="../../证据/899f07f099c67f1f7adfca5ec3ca11800d64fad98639d1672f2062f8a71c8450.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>899f07f099c6</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::GetParamValue</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c6ffb5748afbd7d7bd81bc8aa5d5b004564876b83498f4cf9b61a9f55711c08" href="../../证据/2c6ffb5748afbd7d7bd81bc8aa5d5b004564876b83498f4cf9b61a9f55711c08.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c6ffb5748af</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::GetBinaryData</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f41c57cbfaaacf8d98fecb8514739f0b450a0d20dbbc82dea89e8fe83a408062" href="../../证据/f41c57cbfaaacf8d98fecb8514739f0b450a0d20dbbc82dea89e8fe83a408062.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f41c57cbfaaa</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：动态参数、out IntPtr二进制重载以及native参数存储的寿命不由此ref byte[]路径代替；未执行native查询。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ02" id="RQ02"><summary>RQ02 · QueryModuleHistoryResultData主动查询 → PreProData托管结果数组与正常尾释放；不是无条件像素深拷贝</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>新分配的是托管结果描述符数组；其内部image/chunk载荷的所有权必须逐分支解释，不等于整批像素都独立。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>本方法直接返回转换结果，不把它提交给VmSolution结果回调或VmIO；调用方保存数组可独立延长其中引用的可达性。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>正常尾请求释放查询根容器；返回后的共享名、复制池指针与外部像素的有效性不能由此Release成功推出。异常路径是否有native外层回收仍未知。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>此方法明确以bResBuffFirst=false、bNeedImage=true、bUseResStructMap=false查询历史页。成功且根指针非零后读取结构、展开原结果数组，为每项调用ModuleManager.PreProData，再调用IMVS_ReleaseDynamicMemory释放历史结果列表，错误码非零则抛异常，最后返回托管结果数组。尽管注释称“深拷贝”，方法没有逐图强制GetData或复制共享映射：图像是否借用、保留共享名或已物化仍由DI04/DI07中LargeObject与chunk分支决定。预处理或结构展开抛异常时，该体没有finally保证走到正常尾Release。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>public ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX_Data[] QueryModuleHistoryResultData(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c89528c775244a8b6825a9ec835e8d991bd62768a57243b54d2b39d8a1fca29" href="../../证据/5c89528c775244a8b6825a9ec835e8d991bd62768a57243b54d2b39d8a1fca29.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c89528c7752</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::QueryModuleHistoryResultData</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f5855c829665e2df874ddfecc95a59d0da72c3d2393feed4c9233d334cb5b294" href="../../证据/f5855c829665e2df874ddfecc95a59d0da72c3d2393feed4c9233d334cb5b294.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f5855c829665</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：native释放种类的递归释放范围、借用像素在根容器释放后的有效期及异常外部清理尚未闭合；不能仅因无finally就声称原机已发生泄漏。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ03" id="RQ03"><summary>RQ03 · 历史分页查询 / QueryModuleOneResult → 显式所有权页句柄与映射结构返回的不同契约</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>OneResult返回包含指针的原始结果结构，尚未PreProData；历史页另向调用者提供查询根句柄。原始结构不是ImageData或已独立byte[]。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>OneResult本体不向VmIO提交结果，也不发布PB01事件；映射结构可能由native结果缓存管理，其实际有效期未在托管体说明。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本体没有显式Release并不足以判定泄漏，也不足以保证可永久保留；必须恢复bUseResStructMap=true的native所有权契约。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>历史分页重载以bUseResStructMap=false查询，成功时把根pQueryModuResInfoList交ref pstModuleResBuff，并返回浅结构；成功释放才把传入ref置零（容器Release的非幂等边界见DR02）。QueryModuleOneResult则请求index0、count1，只显式传bResBuffFirst（默认true）；ServerSDKAPI默认bNeedImage=true、bUseResStructMap=true。OneResult成功且nNum==1时只返回array[0]，其余正常情况返回null；未把本地查询根指针传给调用方，也没有本体显式Release。两条路径的映射模式不同，不能要求或推定调用方用同一容器释放协议。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_QUERY_MODULE_RES_INFO_LIST? QueryModuleHistoryResult(uint nModuleID, int nIndex, uint </p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9e2e504cb3f0db9f2a6e195347b7787d499c9d9d65fbea1ad1a82d1dead7307" href="../../证据/b9e2e504cb3f0db9f2a6e195347b7787d499c9d9d65fbea1ad1a82d1dead7307.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9e2e504cb3f</small></a><p>public int ReleaseModuleHistoryResult(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="00fa40a130c8139de3f081dadc2add7bcd0c9351efd7fc8562303c16a22cf9d7" href="../../证据/00fa40a130c8139de3f081dadc2add7bcd0c9351efd7fc8562303c16a22cf9d7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>00fa40a130c8</small></a><p>public ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX? QueryModuleOneResult(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="476577d41fc4f856ec2706f213d03931fd9bb02c9c2b00ccc511b3c890dc18a2" href="../../证据/476577d41fc4f856ec2706f213d03931fd9bb02c9c2b00ccc511b3c890dc18a2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>476577d41fc4</small></a><p>public static int IMVS_QueryModuleHistoryResult(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="101aa8ff02f52ff0598f105e46ffd819c6f9863b69d551e17e04b62fa787df4b" href="../../证据/101aa8ff02f52ff0598f105e46ffd819c6f9863b69d551e17e04b62fa787df4b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>101aa8ff02f5</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::QueryModuleHistoryResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d2a09f5e808ac8a517dfd85b6fb19cd25a03e3ce2a1389f409d260ed676ab3d1" href="../../证据/d2a09f5e808ac8a517dfd85b6fb19cd25a03e3ce2a1389f409d260ed676ab3d1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d2a09f5e808a</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::ReleaseModuleHistoryResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10819bfdb712bc2cc5b8055252489581273fbb28ced5c45188c314282f5947fd" href="../../证据/10819bfdb712bc2cc5b8055252489581273fbb28ced5c45188c314282f5947fd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10819bfdb712</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::QueryModuleOneResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="56edddf6a82f7044ad214fa5e6e6adfbfb8464608922b98c812f902d504fade0" href="../../证据/56edddf6a82f7044ad214fa5e6e6adfbfb8464608922b98c812f902d504fade0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>56edddf6a82f</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ServerSDKAPI::IMVS_QueryModuleHistoryResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a25d72e897a875b3c3198009e270fc8882070abec741f44d57c865180e8e2263" href="../../证据/a25d72e897a875b3c3198009e270fc8882070abec741f44d57c865180e8e2263.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a25d72e897a8</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：映射结果是否借用缓存、何时换帧/覆盖、是否按模块保存根容器及并发查询失效规则仍是native未知；不能把映射true等同历史页false的malloc所有权。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ04" id="RQ04"><summary>RQ04 · DynamicOutput.GetOutputImage / GetOutputImageV2 → 主动OneResult物化字节与已有IO载荷按模式构造SDK图像两分支</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>旧入口输出ByteArrayData.pData；V2输出SDK ImageBaseData。二者都不是UI Apps.Data.ImageData，也不直接接RenderDataCenter。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>旧入口对GetData(false)返回值不再额外复制；V2浅模式保持共享名/映射对象，深模式使用字节数组，后续SDK指针、pin及映射寿命仍分别见DI01–03。浅模式遇非0/2的MemoryType可返回仅填几何元数据、未挂共享对象的ImageBaseData，不能虚构自动回退复制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这些调用者没有释放查询页容器；旧入口使用映射true的OneResult，不能套用历史分页Release。V2构造对象不等于复制/释放原IO载荷；SDK Dispose解除pin与共享映射关闭仍是分开的机制。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>旧GetOutputImage先验证输出IO存在，再QueryModuleOneResult→PreProData；按type4及去%后的参数名找图像，nValueNum>0时只取第0个chunk.GetData(false)，把所得byte[]及长度直接赋ByteArrayData。V2不走该旧入口：它调用VmModule.GetImageByteData读取IMAGE父IO的第0子项chunk及宽高格式子项；浅复制模式只在MemoryType0/2时取共享名，其余模式调用GetData(false)。V2浅复制新建ImageBaseData、填宽高格式，有共享名才InitImageObjBySharedMem（new SharedMemoryItemVM(name,模块ExecuteCount)）；非浅复制用得到的数组构造ImageBaseData。IO.Value可能先触发DR01按计数刷新，不能把V2误画成无条件重新OneResult或PB回调路径。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public ByteArrayData GetOutputImage(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c9334a81378ce99e32f6a1fddb6878cbbe2f06de4efd0483b882d42f67b6b4b" href="../../证据/2c9334a81378ce99e32f6a1fddb6878cbbe2f06de4efd0483b882d42f67b6b4b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c9334a81378</small></a><p>public ImageBaseData GetOutputImageV2(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8c9050ada41e5b22991a315c314c6788c16a30809aac387ec43e755623d8c3fc" href="../../证据/8c9050ada41e5b22991a315c314c6788c16a30809aac387ec43e755623d8c3fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8c9050ada41e</small></a><p>public IVmImageData GetImageByteData(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="442220815679a7d78086bd28813d80c671967954e2b373ed78be9d65bffab3ac" href="../../证据/442220815679a7d78086bd28813d80c671967954e2b373ed78be9d65bffab3ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>442220815679</small></a><p>public void InitImageObjBySharedMem(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2dd127846362aac9bf7d968a6979c3f5219a97e67577a253f97f7bbc0b425771" href="../../证据/2dd127846362aac9bf7d968a6979c3f5219a97e67577a253f97f7bbc0b425771.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2dd127846362</small></a><p>VM.Core.DynamicOutput::GetOutputImage</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b14df34eec9074f8d308dac5a714653ded2ad277aef61ad7cb5792110e16bded" href="../../证据/b14df34eec9074f8d308dac5a714653ded2ad277aef61ad7cb5792110e16bded.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b14df34eec90</small></a><p>VM.Core.DynamicOutput::GetOutputImageV2</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d8f631ca311a37d1b5ede47dd41448ba6f8ccd16af891dc05c15447558278daa" href="../../证据/d8f631ca311a37d1b5ede47dd41448ba6f8ccd16af891dc05c15447558278daa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d8f631ca311a</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmModule::GetImageByteData</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c2bb861235f457a2d8ff8439f9dc72851b2e1dd1f1014376d04e7262f9be78e4" href="../../证据/c2bb861235f457a2d8ff8439f9dc72851b2e1dd1f1014376d04e7262f9be78e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c2bb861235f4</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleResultManager::InitImageObjBySharedMem</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="57b43645cf5c82bd38a1803843b5a792b9b11fd18014a48933f034042fbe1a90" href="../../证据/57b43645cf5c82bd38a1803843b5a792b9b11fd18014a48933f034042fbe1a90.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>57b43645cf5c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原机同次宽高格式与共享图像的帧一致性、模块ExecuteCount与共享头当前计数的完整校验规则仍需运行/native证据；名字相同不证明同一实例。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="PB01" id="PB01"><summary>PB01 · CVmObjectBase.OnModuleResultExCallBack → ModuleManager → TempVmSolution订阅 → VmSolution回调</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>这里传递托管结果描述符及其载荷字段；原生回调描述符经过PreProData，随后事件没有额外逐像素复制操作。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>事件订阅建立具体托管调用桥；观察者可能另外保存结果结构里的引用，不能仅从方法返回判断载荷不可达。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>回调入口没有走QueryModuleOneResult/其Release；查询容器释放规则不能移植成回调缓冲的寿命承诺。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ModuleManager构造订阅CVmObjectBase.OnModuleResultExCallBack；GetModuleResultCallBack对原生结果描述符调用PreProData，再发布OnModuleResultCallBack。TempVmSolution静态构造把此事件明确订阅到VmSolution.MModuleManager_OnModuleResultCallBack。VmSolution单参入口先调用OnModuleResultCallbackEvent，再进入ref重载按模块ID查AllModules并写IO，最后调用GetFrameMeanCount。因此外部结果事件发布发生在本入口本轮IO提交之前，不应把两个观察时点画成同一原子提交。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（10）</summary><p>CVmObjectBase.OnModuleResultExCallBack += GetModuleResultCallBack;</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cbc438383bd62aa43d756da28654c23871a591842edaf9bd189c6c30a505c7e8" href="../../证据/cbc438383bd62aa43d756da28654c23871a591842edaf9bd189c6c30a505c7e8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cbc438383bd6</small></a><p>public void GetModuleResultCallBack(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c4541977b0bed4a6b9bdcef01912ccbeb47b4f7ddba7afe6bc73025263e6f889" href="../../证据/c4541977b0bed4a6b9bdcef01912ccbeb47b4f7ddba7afe6bc73025263e6f889.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c4541977b0be</small></a><p>mModuleManager.OnModuleResultCallBack += VmSolution.MModuleManager_OnModuleResultCallBack;</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="20818791b401728516193838fbf1b84e45a06089360360346b1496122349ab90" href="../../证据/20818791b401728516193838fbf1b84e45a06089360360346b1496122349ab90.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>20818791b401</small></a><p>internal static void MModuleManager_OnModuleResultCallBack(ImvsSdkDefine.</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="092a70d3dec3a962c9e888a73d74b2b76d837844c74a2278ce206ae44bc5d279" href="../../证据/092a70d3dec3a962c9e888a73d74b2b76d837844c74a2278ce206ae44bc5d279.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>092a70d3dec3</small></a><p>internal static void MModuleManager_OnModuleResultCallBack(ref </p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="40aaded516e42e19ac2680ec72e92cd8060ce478b6f0e8fb037f747c177bb2a2" href="../../证据/40aaded516e42e19ac2680ec72e92cd8060ce478b6f0e8fb037f747c177bb2a2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>40aaded516e4</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::.ctor</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8d24dbe70a36f4cc7632adba0c3ddab3ae15e7a6f641b7242df74f8e89883b21" href="../../证据/8d24dbe70a36f4cc7632adba0c3ddab3ae15e7a6f641b7242df74f8e89883b21.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8d24dbe70a36</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::GetModuleResultCallBack</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="710c86f4b5ab5d9f491333bbd615f223c7090120f9466ff3a2f0864c6e82693f" href="../../证据/710c86f4b5ab5d9f491333bbd615f223c7090120f9466ff3a2f0864c6e82693f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>710c86f4b5ab</small></a><p>VM.Core.TempVmSolution::.cctor</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="45ed1311feeaeb7b29e94581d41eb131c11185523d1e08f67bd4d8cad660adcf" href="../../证据/45ed1311feeaeb7b29e94581d41eb131c11185523d1e08f67bd4d8cad660adcf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>45ed1311feea</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmSolution::MModuleManager_OnModuleResultCallBack</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b05b77be118d1d834f037c07c1cd3a9c29a261cab039c2aff2deee0ddfa58cb9" href="../../证据/b05b77be118d1d834f037c07c1cd3a9c29a261cab039c2aff2deee0ddfa58cb9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b05b77be118d</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmSolution::MModuleManager_OnModuleResultCallBack</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="94bab1e7f43958ac0ecc9b13d2e2b6da516972a0f593941e74f11512b798588c" href="../../证据/94bab1e7f43958ac0ecc9b13d2e2b6da516972a0f593941e74f11512b798588c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>94bab1e7f439</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：此处闭合的是CVmObjectBase已发布事件后的托管桥；VM_M_SetImageEx接收端如何形成该次事件、该次查询的描述符仍未闭合。外部事件处理器异常也不能由ref重载内部catch替代覆盖。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="PB02" id="PB02"><summary>PB02 · 结果nModuleID / pInfo[].strParamName / nExecuteCount → 模块输出VmIO的批次重置、循环合并及事件闸门</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>模块ID、参数名哈希及执行计数分别决定目的地、字段与批次；尚无按每张ImageData逐像素身份匹配的代码。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清本轮IO列表只移除该层持有；循环路径可累积载荷，后续模块回调队列另保存结果与执行计数。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本层清_value/_valueList与缺失参数默认化没有释放ImageData、关闭共享映射或等待显示读者。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ref回调先按nModuleID找模块；SetValue按模块是否IVmModuleSet选择叶IO字典，再以参数名GetHashCode查找各结果目标。计数改变、自执行、禁止循环合并或VmProcedure时，先给每个目标IO更新计数、清_value/_valueList并恢复RaiseValueChanged；同批合并且isCallBack时则先禁止叶IO事件。已匹配参数调用VmIO.SetValueFromServer并置isNull=false；缺失参数走SetValueFromDefault。循环未结束继续抑制事件，结束分支才按门恢复并通知。不能把每次原生结果都等同立即显示一张新图。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>private static void SetValue(VmModule module,</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6de1f28a0bd0702d34f0c02d527df74ae4746ed4bef33dc5c16702f528a3b99a" href="../../证据/6de1f28a0bd0702d34f0c02d527df74ae4746ed4bef33dc5c16702f528a3b99a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6de1f28a0bd0</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmSolution::SetValue</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6806722be30d2616ffa432a5e366525bd46dc1d0e53ee90d5138b275c0552e24" href="../../证据/6806722be30d2616ffa432a5e366525bd46dc1d0e53ee90d5138b275c0552e24.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6806722be30d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：参数名哈希冲突及全部Group嵌套调度不是本有限切片的验证范围；外部持有者不能由IO批次重置自动清理。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="PB03" id="PB03"><summary>PB03 · pImageValue / pChunkValue → VmIO.SetValue → 图像跳过FillData，chunk先填充；同引用入值与排队</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>输入为SDK chunk描述符数组或ByteData数组；IO事件仍是类型化载荷，之后FeatureBase/Object才组装ImageData（见ON01/ON02），不是此处直接生成ImageData。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>image不强制FillData使其可能继续依赖共享名/借用指针；非image的FillData也不能绕开DI07/DI08已证的缓存/复制池规则。队列事件与IO可同时保持载荷可达。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这里没有释放原生查询结果容器；也没有像素租约或最后读者协议。查询finally Release不能推出image事件载荷已复制或已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>静态SetValueFromServer按ImageType直接把pImageValue传给SetValue，ChunkType传pChunkValue，ByteType传pByteValue。SetValue只在newValue是chunk描述符枚举且TypeName != image时逐项FillData；图像类型跳过这一步。随后_value=newValue，_valueList首次Add同引用，IsImageIOParent时覆盖第0项，否则追加并标记待合并。needRaiseEvent为true才进入InvokeValueChangedEvent；后者还要RaiseValueChanged且IsOpenSetValueToDisplay，调用MergeIOLoopValue后将_value、ExecuteCount、TypeName装进事件参数并排队。该桥不是把所有图像都先转成独立byte[]再通知。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>internal static void SetValueFromServer(VmIO io,</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13626b47b6418ff21cc98b42c906a495e8f07a9fd26e7603b8bc640135ec8453" href="../../证据/13626b47b6418ff21cc98b42c906a495e8f07a9fd26e7603b8bc640135ec8453.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13626b47b641</small></a><p>private void SetValue&lt;T>(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="768dc014ee93337d42cc07a081d15d2b4533291765469c7ec042334b54dd4067" href="../../证据/768dc014ee93337d42cc07a081d15d2b4533291765469c7ec042334b54dd4067.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>768dc014ee93</small></a><p>internal void InvokeValueChangedEvent()</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5a426e6ac3fedfaf0baed1e55900d6700c0c90aa7766f0f63265965d4910c0db" href="../../证据/5a426e6ac3fedfaf0baed1e55900d6700c0c90aa7766f0f63265965d4910c0db.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5a426e6ac3fe</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::SetValueFromServer</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fdb41d65e5fe2fd4c725d7c9ff1602acae9c52057f52c6baed7926d6cc449713" href="../../证据/fdb41d65e5fe2fd4c725d7c9ff1602acae9c52057f52c6baed7926d6cc449713.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fdb41d65e5fe</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::SetValue</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9c9f933f6ae86d942dbee3aecd84750913dbed5fbe76f967925bf096a0973aa" href="../../证据/c9c9f933f6ae86d942dbee3aecd84750913dbed5fbe76f967925bf096a0973aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9c9f933f6ae</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::InvokeValueChangedEvent</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f7450e07bc8c42353c42dab13e477bfa57024d58147cb12f9227c1b8258daff8" href="../../证据/f7450e07bc8c42353c42dab13e477bfa57024d58147cb12f9227c1b8258daff8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f7450e07bc8c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：MergeIOLoopValue的合并复制与特定图像父节点配置需独立跟踪；这里不把readonly、队列对象或计数相同作为像素稳定保证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="PB04" id="PB04"><summary>PB04 · SDK NativeData2Data的nParamType 4 / 5 / 6 → 图像描述符、chunk描述符与普通字节结果三种载荷</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>type4/5是载荷描述符新包装，不等于其像素深拷贝；type6的hexValue在此处确实新分配复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>type6展示文本截断不截断hexValue；type4异常标志未清计数与type5清计数是不同失败保留规则，不应合并。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>托管数组复制与原生查询容器释放是不同动作；本方法未证明共享映射、借用像素或native生产缓存已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>NativeData2Data把type4的pImageValue和type5的pChunkValue分别解析为原生chunk描述符数组，再逐项new托管chunk并调用LargeObject；两者都受isFilter影响。type5在LargeObject报告isExcOccur后把nValueNum置0并break，type4虽传该标志却没有同样清计数分支。type6普通ByteData则逐项new byte[nLen]并Marshal.Copy，把完整数组存hexValue，strValue最多转换前4096字节。因此“结果里有byte[]”必须区分普通ByteData、chunk.GetData物化及ImageData.Buffer，不可混为同一个原生图像对象或统一所有权。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>case 4:</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cda28b0597ec7a853fa64f928b23fbce007973af801587c085b6861679e78e61" href="../../证据/cda28b0597ec7a853fa64f928b23fbce007973af801587c085b6861679e78e61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cda28b0597ec</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::NativeData2Data</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="686a7be81e63253e8065259feac5c639108aa0ce4555915e5a4e10a493a7f450" href="../../证据/686a7be81e63253e8065259feac5c639108aa0ce4555915e5a4e10a493a7f450.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>686a7be81e63</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::PreProData</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da5879a0410f89d8cbe95c58def4da61f0c8155c2fba59765dd024889154c292" href="../../证据/da5879a0410f89d8cbe95c58def4da61f0c8155c2fba59765dd024889154c292.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da5879a0410f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：VM_M_SetImageEx的第五实参、native缓存描述符、SDK chunk的strValue/pData与ImageData.ExecuteCount之间尚缺同次生产/消费实例的直接桥证据；共享头偏移相似不能填补该缺口。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON01" id="ON01"><summary>ON01 · VmIO.ValueChanged → FeatureBase.IO_ValueChanged → 按执行计数聚合Feature.ValueStore → Object.FeatureNotifyValueChanged</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>VmIO事件值Array → FeatureBase.ValueStore槽位保留同一引用 → 父Object值；不在这里统一复制像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>执行计数/重建门决定新建聚合容器；清标记和实际换数组是不同时间点。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>弱事件退订不清所有数据；ClearValueStore未逐元素Dispose，旧ValueStore引用要到后续替换或对象退役再减少。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>FeatureBase.SetOutputFilter为每个vmIO安装WeakEventManager处理器，RemoveOutputFilter对应退订。回调在执行计数变化、ValueStore为空或重建标记为true时新建object[]，收到Array时直接存入该数组引用；待VmIO_Notnull_Count等于已收数后，GetValue组值并调用父Object.FeatureNotifyValueChanged，随后ClearValueStore只设重建标记，不立即清旧数组。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>public void SetOutputFilter()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32510c6434b913be1a6f6bd6fce1fc0647846189e69800261024fa1f64b7f3f0" href="../../证据/32510c6434b913be1a6f6bd6fce1fc0647846189e69800261024fa1f64b7f3f0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32510c6434b9</small></a><p>private void IO_ValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3faadd80b5dfcab9f5b7e0dc2878a6da18a87a2d91187bce46641b4838c77a65" href="../../证据/3faadd80b5dfcab9f5b7e0dc2878a6da18a87a2d91187bce46641b4838c77a65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3faadd80b5df</small></a><p>internal void ClearValueStore()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1d9128166716d4d315ea390920d98914acefe1849875a17f80831b3c62f4dbc0" href="../../证据/1d9128166716d4d315ea390920d98914acefe1849875a17f80831b3c62f4dbc0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1d9128166716</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::SetOutputFilter 0x060000e1</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1cb236dfeb86dc6320fdc7139105a75475dbd279259f6a01ecd05f102a3eb38f" href="../../证据/1cb236dfeb86dc6320fdc7139105a75475dbd279259f6a01ecd05f102a3eb38f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1cb236dfeb86</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::RemoveOutputFilter 0x060000e2</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="040656f3dc5a6a00ff3bebbb663a6af19b3b156e1e8a8870e4e87348efdcf203" href="../../证据/040656f3dc5a6a00ff3bebbb663a6af19b3b156e1e8a8870e4e87348efdcf203.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>040656f3dc5a</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::IO_ValueChanged 0x060000e3</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0842678ceaa89565f00aaf9e8f22106673abbbe71f4168dc3d870f068a162606" href="../../证据/0842678ceaa89565f00aaf9e8f22106673abbbe71f4168dc3d870f068a162606.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0842678ceaa8</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::ClearValueStore 0x060000e4</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb2a9a8548ba93be0cedde69b6d36425c8643c771cdbd2c46343bee01fced370" href="../../证据/fb2a9a8548ba93be0cedde69b6d36425c8643c771cdbd2c46343bee01fced370.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb2a9a8548ba</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：GetValue的全部数据类型/索引/数组拼接语义与多个IO并发回调的原子性未由所选方法证明；不能从WeakEventManager推断像素已释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON02" id="ON02"><summary>ON02 · Object.FeatureNotifyValueChanged的特征到齐门 → FillImageValue → 带计数的ImageData载荷</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>多个特征 → 同一轮ImageData；创建包装对象不表示共享像素也复制了一份。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>固定Feature保留；新轮清非固定槽；对象Value字段与后续通知元组可以额外持有图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清Feature槽仅减少对应持有，不归还所有chunk/共享生产者缓冲。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>父Object在计数变化、首次计数或已收数为0时清非固定Feature槽并重置计数，然后保留本次Feature值引用。只有已收Feature数等于ValueStore.Length才NotifyValueChanged。图像填充从Image特征取chunk：共享模式保留地址名，非共享模式GetData取数组，赋给新ImageData的ImageBuffer/MemoryAddress并写宽高、格式、NeedCheckExecuteCount=true及ExecuteCount；输入已是ImageData时直接返回原对象。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>internal void FeatureNotifyValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f45a381c6c0730836cc136fe49d49c47c15c4c0809e1380c92586eba34c0ecd" href="../../证据/8f45a381c6c0730836cc136fe49d49c47c15c4c0809e1380c92586eba34c0ecd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f45a381c6c0</small></a><p>private object FillImageValue(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="571ca486fafd6290179d4ca8c98d04b093a59b140ef694403fd3aa0e64409199" href="../../证据/571ca486fafd6290179d4ca8c98d04b093a59b140ef694403fd3aa0e64409199.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>571ca486fafd</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::FeatureNotifyValueChanged 0x060001d8</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ac3ce88ed8b8042bb6fb0386a97bc70ddf990a68c307009186c8062e4b6bd87" href="../../证据/8ac3ce88ed8b8042bb6fb0386a97bc70ddf990a68c307009186c8062e4b6bd87.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ac3ce88ed8b</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::FillImageValue 0x060001e0</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="034720684b7a763cdd8e72aa90ab2e660c370de501184b832be2ce256b61275f" href="../../证据/034720684b7a763cdd8e72aa90ab2e660c370de501184b832be2ce256b61275f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>034720684b7a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：特征计数门不证明原生生产者写入与读取之间有完整帧租约；GetImageValue主动拉取是另一分支，不套用此通知门。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON03" id="ON03"><summary>ON03 · Object.NotifyValueChanged → 双数组通知队列 → 后台OnValueChanged分发</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Tuple持Object与事件，事件Value持ImageData；传递是引用包装，不是隔离像素快照。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>双数组和Object.value是不同持有者；队列满的分支不代表Object.value被清。接收长度检查在锁外，不声称完整并发队列合同。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>正常发送后清该发送槽；只减少队列持有，Object.value、显示仓库和消费者仍可继续持有图像。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>NotifyValueChanged先将FillValue返回值赋给Object.value，再以同一value引用构造RenderDataEventArgs，连同Object包装Tuple。静态构造建立两个各1000槽的object[]；接收计数小于1000时入队，满时此体不入队，也没有本体补发循环，最后仍重置已收Feature计数。后台线程交换发送/接收数组，逐项调用OnValueChanged，再在正常返回后把已发送槽设null、更新发送计数，并Sleep(3)。这条通知路径会跨越一次异步排队，不是同步直接把原生回调显示到控件。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>internal void NotifyValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2016f40b061e71dab3d0937c31dc541634852396004de04f33d0743557be88c3" href="../../证据/2016f40b061e71dab3d0937c31dc541634852396004de04f33d0743557be88c3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2016f40b061e</small></a><p>static Object()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="25e529fe11071cc89c26b311351f8a110792c1ba86c0f5adbadcf37bcb17e33c" href="../../证据/25e529fe11071cc89c26b311351f8a110792c1ba86c0f5adbadcf37bcb17e33c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>25e529fe1107</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::NotifyValueChanged 0x060001db</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6f3b84c19dc36d1220cfd6faee32ef82e17bcc1baf4b0e905871cd35b550e79" href="../../证据/d6f3b84c19dc36d1220cfd6faee32ef82e17bcc1baf4b0e905871cd35b550e79.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6f3b84c19dc</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::.cctor 0x060001d0</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="273c17e23a7f34429bb7978817edcb3c4344a59cbd7d34784f9d390ab151161f" href="../../证据/273c17e23a7f34429bb7978817edcb3c4344a59cbd7d34784f9d390ab151161f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>273c17e23a7f</small></a><p>.&lt;>c::&lt;.cctor>b__13_0 0x06001024</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="419ff5f1ba8c5ed57ef791d778e845fcb41770f34d7fa4292d2f6274f6a5504a" href="../../证据/419ff5f1ba8c5ed57ef791d778e845fcb41770f34d7fa4292d2f6274f6a5504a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>419ff5f1ba8c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：线程while(true)的完整关闭/Join及宿主退出协议尚未闭合；不能依据后台线程标记推断通知已经排空。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：只确认入队和发送的本体顺序；队列积压、超过1000项的实际丢通知与并发时序未运行注入。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC01" id="RC01"><summary>RC01 · ValueEventArgs.ExecuteCount与固定标志 → buffer / spare入仓路由及整仓覆盖</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>仓库装的是ImageData/事件对象引用，不是复制像素帧；ExecuteCount是入仓批次标记，不应画成固定容量逐帧历史列表。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>同一执行计数的多次回调在所选仓内合并；新批次在同一仓覆盖旧批次。spare与buffer计数相等时只记录错误日志，未在该体强制去重或丢弃。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Clear字典移除该仓持有的引用，没有对每张ImageData执行Dispose、解除固定或释放共享映射。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>三个仓库均有ImageData字典和shape字典：display供TryGetImage/GetShapeStore读取，buffer和spare供回调入仓。SetDataToStore先拒绝sender为空或非ValueEventArgs，再按(NeedFixed &amp;&amp; e.ExecuteCount != FixedExcuteCount) || e.ExecuteCount == SpareExecuteCount选择spare；若所选spare批次改变，就更新SpareExecuteCount并Clear整套spare图像/图形仓。其它回调走buffer，批次改变则更新BufferExecuteCount并Clear整套buffer仓。同一批次再次到达只更新相关键，未更新键不在此路径自动清除。NeedFixedSpare并不出现在这个分流谓词里。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>private Dictionary&lt;string, ImageData> displayImageStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d466077ed678fd281c1b970d22b7b11f07d4af56a5d30b89ab23960e7ee066b7" href="../../证据/d466077ed678fd281c1b970d22b7b11f07d4af56a5d30b89ab23960e7ee066b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d466077ed678</small></a><p>public void SetDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a><p>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb787362f3f6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::SetDataToStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="607f54f594575d973842149b52502e5f73ff9b2ee14fff6e99aaac03caccee62" href="../../证据/607f54f594575d973842149b52502e5f73ff9b2ee14fff6e99aaac03caccee62.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>607f54f59457</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::SetRenderDataToStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="520b3aeb33a62e9a38e07fa69d07e734ccd61ff5b86a72b0e7c137f13398e2c7" href="../../证据/520b3aeb33a62e9a38e07fa69d07e734ccd61ff5b86a72b0e7c137f13398e2c7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>520b3aeb33a6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_BufferExecuteCount</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4c68392ec1ef2e9b2f0337d87545e40e827cbcd3d13bc0f8bde6a2d9de6752f3" href="../../证据/4c68392ec1ef2e9b2f0337d87545e40e827cbcd3d13bc0f8bde6a2d9de6752f3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4c68392ec1ef</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_SpareExecuteCount</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f07415d3eb6a66b7dfca41e9e26d5b164a2fa08c349072f619df969e1e29e13e" href="../../证据/f07415d3eb6a66b7dfca41e9e26d5b164a2fa08c349072f619df969e1e29e13e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f07415d3eb6a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：实际回调顺序、所有生产者的ExecuteCount分配及调用线程约束未在本切片闭合；不能把此分流谓词推成所有线程间的完整隔离保证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC02" id="RC02"><summary>RC02 · BeforeExchange / ExchangeBuffer → 仓库角色交换后旧display转成待写仓并继续持图</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>例：display=D0、buffer=B0；普通交换后display=B0、buffer=D0。旧D0的对象内容仍存在，交换的是字段引用。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>已显示的上一批图像可留在角色改变后的仓中；同一批次的后续写入未必触发整仓Clear，必须分别跟踪字典身份、字段角色和计数。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>交换本身不消除旧display持图，也不让ModuleDisplayDecorator/ImageViewBox的已取引用自动失效。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>BeforeExchange把FixedExcuteCount设为请求计数：等于SpareExecuteCount时置NeedFixedSpare，否则置NeedFixed；它不检查该请求一定等于BufferExecuteCount，也不先清另一侧已有标志。Exchange按捕获的NeedFixedSpare调用ExchangeBuffer：true时交换display与spare的图像/图形字典引用，false时交换display与buffer引用。不是逐项复制、逐像素复制或转移后清空。原display字典带着旧ImageData变成spare/buffer，继续持有旧值，直到后续相关键被覆盖、该仓新批次Clear、ClearDisplayStore（若它此时又是display）或DeInit。ExchangeBuffer也不交换BufferExecuteCount/SpareExecuteCount字段，因此不能把计数字段当成每个字典对象内所有键都已逐项认证的帧身份。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>public void BeforeExchange(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a3a618743e1fc086dc09826434e5db7c97caa0de0fa2e82fccf7c0cdaaa2b36" href="../../证据/2a3a618743e1fc086dc09826434e5db7c97caa0de0fa2e82fccf7c0cdaaa2b36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a3a618743e1</small></a><p>private void ExchangeBuffer(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da1ab55f0d543842f088cd74f47b7f310239a485e0e686ec19a5f45adf85a26b" href="../../证据/da1ab55f0d543842f088cd74f47b7f310239a485e0e686ec19a5f45adf85a26b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da1ab55f0d54</small></a><p>public bool IsBusy =></p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b872bf3475abf461dd0858b6a314a12250fb47e89f0047bf2d2fe3e3c6d5662c" href="../../证据/b872bf3475abf461dd0858b6a314a12250fb47e89f0047bf2d2fe3e3c6d5662c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b872bf3475ab</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::BeforeExchange</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0c9bb3c7691fc9f7fb5ae1d2766ce205a2004aaf67e01095ccbfab2c17eafb43" href="../../证据/0c9bb3c7691fc9f7fb5ae1d2766ce205a2004aaf67e01095ccbfab2c17eafb43.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0c9bb3c7691f</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::ExchangeBuffer</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9d46dfc61e5fd2f8f836811cd808781c86c92796354fd9857ae7a9607a1fda2" href="../../证据/e9d46dfc61e5fd2f8f836811cd808781c86c92796354fd9857ae7a9607a1fda2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9d46dfc61e5</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_IsBusy</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8edc1e2e511392c6ed798cca5e406763f6f185a45c2041151ee9e8fb4054383f" href="../../证据/8edc1e2e511392c6ed798cca5e406763f6f185a45c2041151ee9e8fb4054383f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8edc1e2e5113</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：IsBusy只是两个bool的OR；所选体未显示对声明_exchangelock加锁，不能据名字证明跨线程交换原子性，也不能在无运行时序证据时直接宣称实际数据竞争。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：外部调用方如何避免重复BeforeExchange和错误计数请求需结合ModuleResultView/回调调度继续核对。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC03" id="RC03"><summary>RC03 · Exchange等待与Object.GetDataSendFinishState → 回调计数等待完成不等于最后像素读者退出</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>等待对象是发送/接收计数与请求批次，不是图像引用计数、GCHandle、内存映射租约或WPF位图最后读者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>正常交换后两个固定标志复位，但请求旧计数也可能满足helper的退出条件；不能把该门扩展成完整同帧提交保证。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这里没有释放ImageData或其像素；若等待不退出或helper抛异常，不能从正常尾部推断标志已复位或窗口关闭已排空。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Exchange在GetDataSendFinishState(procID,executeCount)返回true时每次Sleep(3)，直到false才交换仓库，并在正常尾部把NeedFixedSpare/NeedFixed都设false。所选体没有超时、取消或finally复位。该helper按executeCount对maxStoreLen取余选计数槽，读取过程的最近发送执行计数；当槽内sent==received，或请求executeCount早于过程最近计数时，清该槽两计数并返回false，否则返回true。因此不能仅按“FinishState”名称把退出循环解释成这张图所有像素消费者都已处理完，或所请求旧批次一定仍是显示仓。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>public void Exchange(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="575d215b71d36a36907c7e4f6f2753d2479dbe44d7a7e37d9b1d5f37ce48d2ae" href="../../证据/575d215b71d36a36907c7e4f6f2753d2479dbe44d7a7e37d9b1d5f37ce48d2ae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>575d215b71d3</small></a><p>public static bool GetDataSendFinishState(</p><p>原件 · 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd90f3ddc0b68fd5b39f3c461fb997e4dd169888f2ad27a2c18dd2a9d5e62c49" href="../../证据/fd90f3ddc0b68fd5b39f3c461fb997e4dd169888f2ad27a2c18dd2a9d5e62c49.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd90f3ddc0b6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::Exchange</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2fb165a6d3bc74029356a587efa5133b68ccddb877a2ef4b4171daf0393ff10b" href="../../证据/2fb165a6d3bc74029356a587efa5133b68ccddb877a2ef4b4171daf0393ff10b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2fb165a6d3bc</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::GetDataSendFinishState</p><p>原件 · 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="befc290f805e3813b8aabec688720de5788af851293633853ee3dc3346c75466" href="../../证据/befc290f805e3813b8aabec688720de5788af851293633853ee3dc3346c75466.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>befc290f805e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：sent/received计数所有写入点、环槽复用、溢出及内存可见性未在此有限切片恢复；没有执行厂商等待循环或原生读者测量。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC04" id="RC04"><summary>RC04 · ClearDisplayStore / Init / DeInit → 仅清当前display、清三仓及迟到回调的边界</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>清仓、清选择身份、禁止下层存值、原生像素释放是四个不同层次；A链ModuleResultView另持有的ImageData不由此字段写入直接清掉。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>ClearDisplayStore仍保留两待写仓里的旧图；DeInit删除三仓持有，但已交给装饰器、视图或扩展消费者的对象可继续可达。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>所选清理体没有调用ImageData.Dispose、FreeHGlobal或共享映射关闭；不能用DeInit的完成代替最后读者和所有像素已释放的证据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ClearDisplayStore仅Clear当前display图像/图形字典，不改buffer/spare、三个计数、两个固定标志或SelectedImage等选择引用。Init只设isInit=true。DeInit则设isInit=false，Clear三套图像/图形字典，清计数和固定标志，置CheckImagesName/SelectedImage/SelectedInputImage为空；没有逐图Dispose或像素free。SetRenderDataToStore以isInit阻止继续入值，但SetDataToStore本身并未先检查isInit：反初始化后迟到的有效回调仍可更新仓库计数和走Clear，然后在下层不存值。所以DeInit不等同所有生产回调已经停止或排空。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public void ClearDisplayStore()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf" href="../../证据/9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dfdc6e88917</small></a><p>public void Init()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2" href="../../证据/910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>910f799075bb</small></a><p>public void DeInit()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42" href="../../证据/4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4119f226ce97</small></a><p>public void SetDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a><p>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb787362f3f6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::ClearDisplayStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792" href="../../证据/2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2dab3ce386c5</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::DeInit</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95" href="../../证据/cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb340b8a3316</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::Init</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b" href="../../证据/aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aeb564366760</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：三仓只属于RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator的A链；不得归到没有引用RenderDataCenter的RenderControlBase/tempImageStore B链。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原机异步排空、外部消费者、图像/位图与native资源最终释放仍未验证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS02" id="RS02"><summary>RS02 · RenderDataCenter.SelectedImage缓存 → 模块回调/流程UpdateRender → 装饰器图像引用</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>缓存字典、回调局部变量、装饰器字段共享同一个ImageData对象；所选写入/读取未逐像素复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>SelectedImage键来自当前选中的DisplayObject；BeforeExchange/Exchange与OwnerProcessID、执行计数相关，未成功渲染还可ClearDisplayStore。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>交换/清字典与装饰器/显示控件引用退出是不同动作；清缓存不能证明已经显示的位图或图像字段被清掉。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>RenderDataCenter.SetImageToStore将ValueEventArgs.Value as ImageData直接保存在SelectedImage键，并可能原地写Tag=SelectedImage.DisplayName；TryGetImage仅从displayImageStore返回引用。ModuleResultView自执行回调在忙/渲染门后BeforeExchange，再排到Dispatcher，Exchange指定OwnerProcessID/ExecuteCount并取SelectedImage；自执行分支还比较image.Tag与当前SelectedImage.DisplayName，然后赋ImageDataSource或交ResultViewAddition。流程UpdateRender则在工作线程与UI Dispatcher两处比较捕获的moduleDecorator是否仍为m_CurrentInfo后赋图；没有在此分支复用自执行的同一Tag比较。两条来源不得合并为一个无条件赋值。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>private void SetImageToStore(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fc1e0d9c45ec53bbac232419d5cee3166703289cc6a2d3f689dd90a73c5127b5" href="../../证据/fc1e0d9c45ec53bbac232419d5cee3166703289cc6a2d3f689dd90a73c5127b5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fc1e0d9c45ec</small></a><p>public bool TryGetImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="115e8f144e2ccbfc661e4d080956a03545ebde28e6a20fa8a9e59e6e642c9705" href="../../证据/115e8f144e2ccbfc661e4d080956a03545ebde28e6a20fa8a9e59e6e642c9705.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>115e8f144e2c</small></a><p>public void OnModuleCallBackArrived(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e80cb8ac689ad01a53a54e14d5df6835ca3cb2c4b5bb3166e7109d75c5760c22" href="../../证据/e80cb8ac689ad01a53a54e14d5df6835ca3cb2c4b5bb3166e7109d75c5760c22.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e80cb8ac689a</small></a><p>private void UpdateRender(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f8e34f3ffb35f44563bb635c90afd10be7f9b2785100182d459480a522fff6b" href="../../证据/9f8e34f3ffb35f44563bb635c90afd10be7f9b2785100182d459480a522fff6b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f8e34f3ffb3</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::OnModuleCallBackArrived</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11f695bd82dc1b85082921702be42f527939ba8334287e7b12c9a345ab5be59c" href="../../证据/11f695bd82dc1b85082921702be42f527939ba8334287e7b12c9a345ab5be59c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11f695bd82dc</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::UpdateRender</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="febb959e20a1bcf4b686f12bc79bfd7a7532c34b6ec3bf2109afdf63e3c09bec" href="../../证据/febb959e20a1bcf4b686f12bc79bfd7a7532c34b6ec3bf2109afdf63e3c09bec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>febb959e20a1</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::TryGetImage</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed5d6808b925aa23a569b696273187cedc04901dd76a73529ef2b8797663e41d" href="../../证据/ed5d6808b925aa23a569b696273187cedc04901dd76a73529ef2b8797663e41d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed5d6808b925</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：部分真正赋值位于编译器闭包；本次新CIL清单记录入口体，闭包相关原CIL另见已存render-store证据；不声称所有排队回调与当前选择在原机均已实测。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ResultViewAddition可改写显示路径，不能把插件扩展路径视为普通ImageDataSource赋值同义。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS03" id="RS03"><summary>RS03 · 图像下拉选择 / 主动刷新 → SelectedImage.DisplayObject.GetValue → UpdateImageView</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>选择身份ImageViewItem/DisplayObject与实际GetValue返回的ImageData分离；curImageData是视图的又一持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>自执行缓存无图的fallback另要求所选DisplayValue是当前ModuleSource拥有的IVmIO；流程UpdateRender fallback不具有完全相同Owner谓词。主动刷新读取计数门也与回调计数门不同。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>无选中值时选择处理会UpdateImageView(null)清显示；无效尺寸/格式可ClearImage或被ResultViewAddition接管，不代表原数据对象已销毁。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原图像下拉ItemsSource=ImageViewList、SelectedItem双向绑定SelectedImage、SelectedValuePath=DisplayObject，SelectionChanged进imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged。SelectedImage setter解除旧DisplayObject输出过滤与ValueChanged订阅，再为新对象SetOutputFilter/订阅，写renderDataCenter.SelectedImage并通知属性。选择处理最终调用UpdateModuleViewResultShow：按IsClearLastExecuteResult选择ExecuteCount或uint.MaxValue，优先对选中DisplayObject.GetValue；若没有选中项则取显示声明中首个image/pixelinfoimage对象；再清图形并UpdateImageView。后者普通分支赋装饰器与curImageData，同一引用无像素克隆。该拉取分支可在回调缓存没有SelectedImage图像时补取，不能只画回调字典一条通道。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>ItemsSource=&quot;{Binding ImageViewList}&quot;</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c22ff970d66a98ca9db37490c233b89ff86e42464f40b16e02e4678fe42bfeb9" href="../../证据/c22ff970d66a98ca9db37490c233b89ff86e42464f40b16e02e4678fe42bfeb9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c22ff970d66a</small></a><p>public ImageViewItem SelectedImage</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5da447c8ac2c14445f5446789bfafc5ffc83ac37f506c214ac9301ab5813c1ef" href="../../证据/5da447c8ac2c14445f5446789bfafc5ffc83ac37f506c214ac9301ab5813c1ef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5da447c8ac2c</small></a><p>private void imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8678ebcd100f40b4faac4d74ccccdd63c8c2244dc75decfbed1b4b9fea00ced4" href="../../证据/8678ebcd100f40b4faac4d74ccccdd63c8c2244dc75decfbed1b4b9fea00ced4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8678ebcd100f</small></a><p>public void UpdateModuleViewResultShow(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="52d605365dcecb0512b9900e53fcab00d970d3bdcdc2be29c4204710bc4a0a32" href="../../证据/52d605365dcecb0512b9900e53fcab00d970d3bdcdc2be29c4204710bc4a0a32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>52d605365dce</small></a><p>public void UpdateImageView(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a7b728ea00d86d97c83a73e2f53a58c9e9487132e2eaa7b5289bc5906151887e" href="../../证据/a7b728ea00d86d97c83a73e2f53a58c9e9487132e2eaa7b5289bc5906151887e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a7b728ea00d8</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::set_SelectedImage</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e7fa272da9003eceeaa55fb29efe63dcb9539e4faf409f27de5cb94ec0814273" href="../../证据/e7fa272da9003eceeaa55fb29efe63dcb9539e4faf409f27de5cb94ec0814273.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e7fa272da900</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::UpdateModuleViewResultShow</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb13acea8d82a057f710ca10ca5ca475fe619b2a1241493de2bae8c0b6e48ba0" href="../../证据/bb13acea8d82a057f710ca10ca5ca475fe619b2a1241493de2bae8c0b6e48ba0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb13acea8d82</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::UpdateImageView</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3032b3a9affc43d99b7887f310562d3c281ca978f2523cebba3d78b7272d41f" href="../../证据/b3032b3a9affc43d99b7887f310562d3c281ca978f2523cebba3d78b7272d41f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3032b3a9aff</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：本报告未把抽象“取图”虚构为名为getImage的已定位成员；实际调用是Object.GetValue、RenderDataCenter.TryGetImage等。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：此处不重新证明每个原生图像生产者到Object.GetValue的所有分支；已有ImageData返回与共享内存桥接证据单列。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS01" id="RS01"><summary>RS01 · ModuleResultView.ModuleSource → ModuleDisplayDecorator → m_CurrentInfo.ImageDataSource → ImageViewBox.ImageDataSource声明</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>装饰器object字段持有ImageData引用；ImageViewBox为另一依赖属性持有者。绑定声明不等于本机活实例绑定已执行。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>当前装饰器随ModuleSource重建；同一个ImageData对象重复赋值不通知，不能用每次setter推断每帧都建立新图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>setter不释放旧像素，也不调用旧图像Dispose；模块切换的Dispose/清视图另由RS05逐步说明。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ModuleResultView的ModuleSource变化经DoSourceChanged释放旧装饰器、清数据仓库，再建立DecorateSource=newValue且ParentUI=this的ModuleDisplayDecorator并Init；resultGrid与localImageGrid使用该装饰器上下文。ImageDataSource的setter仅比较object引用、赋给imageDataSource字段并通知属性变化，没有复制像素。原moduleresultview.baml离线输出中，imageView显式绑定m_CurrentInfo.ImageDataSource，imageViewIn绑定ImageDataSourceIn；InitializeComponent包含该资源LoadComponent入口。这是主模块结果视图自己的显示链，不可误串到RenderControlBase。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>private void DoSourceChanged(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61" href="../../证据/6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6a0665aa30cc</small></a><p>if (imageDataSource != value)</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f0acf11a33139a29834c8f9aa4a4b60a480fb748d3f4c78da8dec873310001ff" href="../../证据/f0acf11a33139a29834c8f9aa4a4b60a480fb748d3f4c78da8dec873310001ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f0acf11a3313</small></a><p>Name=&quot;imageView&quot; Margin=&quot;1&quot;</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="28337d2f103fc2983f7cac75c560eefdd1aec63b851b06307bfa9c3bd652e14f" href="../../证据/28337d2f103fc2983f7cac75c560eefdd1aec63b851b06307bfa9c3bd652e14f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>28337d2f103f</small></a><p>Name=&quot;imageViewIn&quot; Margin=&quot;1&quot;</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="50a03f526926bc18545374771cb198d43225c2f716c2e34c6229de83faca425c" href="../../证据/50a03f526926bc18545374771cb198d43225c2f716c2e34c6229de83faca425c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>50a03f526926</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::DoSourceChanged</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="42bcccb38e0fea961e7be61b49377e8a79cc1bf517e128cc100e13b85a1d580e" href="../../证据/42bcccb38e0fea961e7be61b49377e8a79cc1bf517e128cc100e13b85a1d580e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>42bcccb38e0f</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::set_ImageDataSource</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a557789