5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92f2d19cba44892275615eda06bd3932e18ab9ce914b565c39aea2808e6976b8" href="../../证据/92f2d19cba44892275615eda06bd3932e18ab9ce914b565c39aea2808e6976b8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92f2d19cba44</small></a><p>public ImageViewItem SelectedImage</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c681eeb8817d81ef867c9e33280883316e3846cb1774336b25aeb24903f7f1a8" href="../../证据/c681eeb8817d81ef867c9e33280883316e3846cb1774336b25aeb24903f7f1a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c681eeb8817d</small></a><p>public ImageViewItem SelectedInputImage</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f243556546a40b4ed76d4c91a548387628da7cb233c4d7b42464a4fa6ea8d866" href="../../证据/f243556546a40b4ed76d4c91a548387628da7cb233c4d7b42464a4fa6ea8d866.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f243556546a4</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.DisplayImageListDecorator::set_SelectedImage / 0x0600085d</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93a14ee9fee8f82c8fa82ee24da57e3133451af82227e099f164a27964cf8fbe" href="../../证据/93a14ee9fee8f82c8fa82ee24da57e3133451af82227e099f164a27964cf8fbe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93a14ee9fee8</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.DisplayImageListDecorator::set_SelectedInputImage / 0x06000866</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5771f8f6bbf4e32e50a458edadade3a3d06133360e41cee2aae7c06a15691206" href="../../证据/5771f8f6bbf4e32e50a458edadade3a3d06133360e41cee2aae7c06a15691206.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5771f8f6bbf4</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原生生产者到ValueEventArgs.Value的同一帧生命周期、每次回调的运行期实例归属仍需生产端证据。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：普通模块配置视图是否实际选择此RenderControlBase实例，要由宿主装配/运行证据另行确认。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB02" id="RB02"><summary>RB02 · P_ValueChanged的image/pixelinfoimage分支 → SelectedImage / SelectedInputImage直接引用赋值</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Dictionary&lt;string,object>只保存Value引用；读取时再as Apps.Data.ImageData。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>同键覆盖旧引用；ExecuteCount跟随接收事件更新，不构成完整代次隔离保证。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>覆盖仅撤销该字典的一份旧引用；没有图像.Dispose或像素Free。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>P_ValueChanged先在计数不同的情况下直接更新ExecuteCount，再在ValueType为image或pixelinfoimage且sender为Apps.XmlParser.Object时加_imageslock。若sender是当前背景或输入图的DisplayObject，直接将e2.Value赋给tempImageStore相应键；不按执行计数在这个接收体内拒绝旧值。非图像对象另进入tempShapeStore，不与图像字节共用一个结构。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>internal void P_ValueChanged(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="327728e0ad69fbc9d4477e48fc4470c8a86910ac6e31c392166293f88495895b" href="../../证据/327728e0ad69fbc9d4477e48fc4470c8a86910ac6e31c392166293f88495895b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>327728e0ad69</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::P_ValueChanged / 0x0600033d</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83d11bcdab93a9327f6b3904a00227f2451b995f8135ef1fd7c2552ea56da72a" href="../../证据/83d11bcdab93a9327f6b3904a00227f2451b995f8135ef1fd7c2552ea56da72a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83d11bcdab93</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不得从锁保护字典推断源ImageData.Buffer、共享映射或ValueEventArgs内部像素线程安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：多计数回调乱序与生产端DataSendFinish标志的真实时序未执行确认。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB03" id="RB03"><summary>RB03 · UpdateRender读取tempImageStore → 同一个ImageData进入ImageDataSource及清仓条件</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>同一个ImageData引用：回调仓库 → 局部变量 → CLR属性；所选方法没有new ImageData/Clone/像素复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>消费仓库键不等于释放属性所持图像；相同引用不触发这个分支的重新赋值。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>SelectedImage置null或SelectedInputImage.Remove只清仓库持有；ImageDataSource/绑定目标可继续持有。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>UpdateRender把SelectedImage键取出的对象as ImageData，与当前ImageDataSource作引用比较。只有不同才进入更新；若为空且选中Object.Owner.ExecuteCount等于控件ExecuteCount，才用obj.GetValue(uint.MaxValue)回退取值。然后把imageData（包括null）直接赋给ImageDataSource；若仓库有SelectedImage键，在锁中把该键置null并返回。相同引用时不重设背景图，而可能处理SelectedInputImage并移除该键。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>private void UpdateRender(uint excuteCount)</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90ceb9d57b5daab1626792612edd997589a594700d643b732479fae98f3bf0d9" href="../../证据/90ceb9d57b5daab1626792612edd997589a594700d643b732479fae98f3bf0d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90ceb9d57b5d</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::UpdateRender / 0x06000340</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ddf7b896b41d037711230671eaef69b5009af6320e587375b3e55bda4a555ed5" href="../../证据/ddf7b896b41d037711230671eaef69b5009af6320e587375b3e55bda4a555ed5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ddf7b896b41d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：GetValue回退体属于另一取值路径；这里不保证其返回的对象来自同一个回调批次或原生buffer。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：相同ImageData对象而内部Buffer发生变化的刷新策略，不能仅凭引用比较推成自动重新呈现。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB04" id="RB04"><summary>RB04 · UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute → 自执行的替换/空图/回退与图形异步分支</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>此方法仍然是图像引用转交；图形更新调度另用tempShapeStore/tempImageStore。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>成功替换清整个临时图仓，空图与同引用路径按不同条件继续；不是统一FIFO。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Clear临时字典不回收仍被ImageDataSource、图形扩展或事件持有的数据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>自执行更新先从SelectedImage取对象：非null且不同引用时赋ImageDataSource，并在锁中清整个tempImageStore后返回；若空图且选中DisplayValue是IVmIO、Owner等于此次moduleSource且当前属性非null，则赋null。否则仅在当前ImageDataSource为空且选中对象GetValue(uint.MaxValue)返回ImageData时赋回退图；其余情况Dispatcher.BeginInvoke更新图形。它与普通UpdateRender的清仓和空图条件不同，不能合并为“每轮总会清图”。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>private void UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b28da2a627f8f7ec606323cb563949e11876812ddc2e3fac68690979dbab9b9c" href="../../证据/b28da2a627f8f7ec606323cb563949e11876812ddc2e3fac68690979dbab9b9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b28da2a627f8</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute / 0x06000341</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e0125a6e065ccbe440bfeab0c6f299e2199c0de9e39d0dee1f0b123bdb75387c" href="../../证据/e0125a6e065ccbe440bfeab0c6f299e2199c0de9e39d0dee1f0b123bdb75387c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e0125a6e065c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：编译器生成Dispatcher回调及所有图形消费/异常路径未在本次独立CIL清单逐个展开；不把异步调度当作完整排空保证。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：自执行原生模块标志和原机实际回调到达顺序未运行证实。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB05" id="RB05"><summary>RB05 · ImageDataSource CLR属性通知 + 原BAML绑定 → 该RenderControlBase中的VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox.ImageDataSource</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>源CLR getter返回的同一对象，经声明的WPF绑定交给目标IImageData依赖属性；这是静态值传递关系，不是新像素所有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>setter引用相同不发本属性变更；绑定目标、源字段和转换器缓存可分别持有对象。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>源setter和BAML绑定不含源像素释放；后续位图转换/共享映射读取应沿OD01–OD07另追。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ImageDataSource getter返回imageDataSource字段；setter仅在引用不同时替换字段并OnPropertyChanged(&quot;ImageDataSource&quot;)。OnPropertyChanged直接发PropertyChanged事件。原rendercontrolbase.baml离线解码的根Name=us，其imagecontrol别名明确指向VMBaseControls程序集；Name=imageView的ImageViewBox把目标ImageDataSource绑定到ElementName=us的ImageDataSource，imageViewIn则绑ImageDataSourceIn，没有声明转换器或图像克隆操作。InitializeComponent的原CIL加载/VMControls.WPF;component/rendercontrolbase.xaml，将静态资源声明、源属性和目标控件对齐。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>return imageDataSource;</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8e173b10abaab941dec4c5f07e061d850c5f57df81a51acbbee5ee06d204fc65" href="../../证据/8e173b10abaab941dec4c5f07e061d850c5f57df81a51acbbee5ee06d204fc65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8e173b10abaa</small></a><p>if (imageDataSource != value)</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="974a05401d01878abbeba6f7f4d171fc83bb518ebca0beeb874afa77c7fb711d" href="../../证据/974a05401d01878abbeba6f7f4d171fc83bb518ebca0beeb874afa77c7fb711d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>974a05401d01</small></a><p>public virtual void OnPropertyChanged(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b4b1c6887da489b35586d22bd302bc682ed4755a32c99e81b22224515ffdcfcd" href="../../证据/b4b1c6887da489b35586d22bd302bc682ed4755a32c99e81b22224515ffdcfcd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b4b1c6887da4</small></a><p>原BAML根类/元素名/目标程序集</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="45ba697afb9559bf97cbbc617c26772aea99f232ce8560028adaa06310ba0b28" href="../../证据/45ba697afb9559bf97cbbc617c26772aea99f232ce8560028adaa06310ba0b28.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>45ba697afb95</small></a><p>原BAML背景图绑定</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="315c4b956faaaf9847e295494bba39748eaf54f550308b2cb66d1e53d8caaa94" href="../../证据/315c4b956faaaf9847e295494bba39748eaf54f550308b2cb66d1e53d8caaa94.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>315c4b956faa</small></a><p>原BAML输入图绑定</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0bd7f4d80321755658b1a25f2bc3d52e9f79317280566c89bcecf7c82d93b4f1" href="../../证据/0bd7f4d80321755658b1a25f2bc3d52e9f79317280566c89bcecf7c82d93b4f1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0bd7f4d80321</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::set_ImageDataSource / 0x06000330</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f00487433b34144c6e882b01826bbbc75946d4ad3826bee2b155b3eb2af66590" href="../../证据/f00487433b34144c6e882b01826bbbc75946d4ad3826bee2b155b3eb2af66590.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f00487433b34</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::InitializeComponent / 0x0600039f</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="039b9668191e21cad2dd9cf8f0964c7acce0df59cd29ca3a9a3bd52851ce5ab4" href="../../证据/039b9668191e21cad2dd9cf8f0964c7acce0df59cd29ca3a9a3bd52851ce5ab4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>039b9668191e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：已闭合RenderControlBase这条静态声明/成员链；不等于WPF运行时绑定成功、活动实例、Dispatcher线程或原桌面画面已验证。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ModuleResultView使用m_CurrentInfo.ImageDataSource和RenderDataCenter，是另一个宿主/仓库链，不能串接为本链上游。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF01" id="IF01"><summary>IF01 · RenderControlBase自执行回调排队 → Task闭包保留控件/事件/sender，稍后才读当前状态</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Task/Dispatcher持有闭包，闭包持有控件与事件引用；图像至少可经控件稍后访问的临时仓库/属性间接可达，不是提交时复制一帧。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>OwnerProcessID、选图/临时仓库属于被捕获控件的当前字段；任务不是冻结后的全套来源快照。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>丢弃Task/Dispatcher返回句柄不取消工作；本方法未提供等待其结束后再退役控件/缓存的所有权协议。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OnModuleResultCallBackArrived仅在回调Value为bIsSelfExecute=1时考虑Task.Run；needUpdateRender=false时先清临时相关项并返回。实际排队的编译器闭包字段是valueEventArgs、&lt;>4__this、sender，没有一张独立ImageData快照。工作体开始后才从事件读取ExecuteCount，并经所捕获控件读取OwnerProcessID，while GetDataSendFinishState为true就Sleep(3)，结束再调用UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute(sender)。原CIL调用Task.Run(Action)后立即pop返回Task，没有在这个方法保存/await该句柄。另一个Dispatcher.BeginInvoke闭包同样保留该控件并在执行时选imageView/imageViewIn更新ROI。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>private void OnModuleResultCallBackArrived(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e1b45d06009250cd283fca06c30e99a87cfa48c2bf347576acca1e86e38a0342" href="../../证据/e1b45d06009250cd283fca06c30e99a87cfa48c2bf347576acca1e86e38a0342.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e1b45d060092</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0 captured fields</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="70a7534756244d48ba9e74bbbc77053ff3f5bb4913f7db73a9620250ad1ee4ce" href="../../证据/70a7534756244d48ba9e74bbbc77053ff3f5bb4913f7db73a9620250ad1ee4ce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>70a753475624</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::OnModuleResultCallBackArrived / 0x0600033e</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e016fdbeff470b28b74ca9d10181af859f1d887ddb637acf04f569d551ede71b" href="../../证据/e016fdbeff470b28b74ca9d10181af859f1d887ddb637acf04f569d551ede71b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e016fdbeff47</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0::&lt;OnModuleResultCallBackArrived>b__0 / 0x06000e3e</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f22e48a598591ec402123afe9c7bdbb7fc3f11b0e1e66eb565b4fb4eff7d3390" href="../../证据/f22e48a598591ec402123afe9c7bdbb7fc3f11b0e1e66eb565b4fb4eff7d3390.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f22e48a59859</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0::&lt;OnModuleResultCallBackArrived>b__1 / 0x06000e3f</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="752cd891fba4394e3f6620dd7a7b516024ddd18c212b3b7576bd4a6c0b71a1ff" href="../../证据/752cd891fba4394e3f6620dd7a7b516024ddd18c212b3b7576bd4a6c0b71a1ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>752cd891fba4</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚未运行原版乱序/切模块场景，不能从缺少本方法的取消句柄直接宣称实际必现过期显示或泄漏。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute对非null图、空图、回退的门分别见RB04；不能把sender归属校验扩大为全部分支统一校验。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF02" id="IF02"><summary>IF02 · 流程完成信号与图形计数筛选 → 普通Task稍后读取当前图像仓库</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>形状事件、临时图像引用与回调计数分开持有；没有提交时独立ImageData数组。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>排队后UpdateRender才读取控件当前tempImageStore；计数筛图门不能代替图像最后读者/身份门。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Task.Run(Action)返回值同样pop；工作体没有取消token、超时计数或卸载检查，轮询持续条件仅为所调用状态函数的返回值。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived要求Value是nWorkStatus=0的模块工作状态；先处理needUpdateRender，再在tempShapeStore中移除与nExecuteCount不符的图形事件，并检查IsNeedRender时间门后启动Task。该Task闭包只保存valueEventArgs和控件this；ExecuteCount在工作体中读取。计数0直接UpdateImageView(null)，非0则轮询当前OwnerProcessID的GetDataSendFinishState，再调用UpdateRender(executeCount)。这次计数筛选作用于临时图形表，不是把tempImageStore复制成受同一计数封装的帧包。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>private void OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ada9bc8c6e2dcebbd1dea7c2e718aa48af948dcfb3b2d8a90cb96f32e4eb14ba" href="../../证据/ada9bc8c6e2dcebbd1dea7c2e718aa48af948dcfb3b2d8a90cb96f32e4eb14ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ada9bc8c6e2d</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass55_0 captured fields</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed8e079fee44131f4c4bfc5b7daebe7e35a6d647f2036523a7f7e7329a5eedfd" href="../../证据/ed8e079fee44131f4c4bfc5b7daebe7e35a6d647f2036523a7f7e7329a5eedfd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed8e079fee44</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived / 0x0600033f</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ea2030c96a6c3252218a7bfba2b231779bee8c45a9525fca8846397339656a24" href="../../证据/ea2030c96a6c3252218a7bfba2b231779bee8c45a9525fca8846397339656a24.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ea2030c96a6c</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass55_0::&lt;OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived>b__0 / 0x06000e41</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="99e218adf5741b7380a33f898859ad8388169404f6629eb90d5412bacd576e99" href="../../证据/99e218adf5741b7380a33f898859ad8388169404f6629eb90d5412bacd576e99.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>99e218adf574</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：GetDataSendFinishState的生产端协议和何时终止轮询尚未在此闭合，不把函数名解释为已证明全部原生读写完成。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：IsNeedRender是显示节流/准入的一部分，不证明任务已排空或所有旧图像被释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF03" id="IF03"><summary>IF03 · UpdateVMResultShow的Dispatcher.Invoke委托 → 执行时读取ModuleSource/ModuleParams/选图，而非保存旧ImageData</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>委托目标是控件this；ImageData局部变量在Dispatcher动作内部才创建/取得，保留的是GetValue返回引用。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>ModuleParams为null时此委托不继续读取；若控件已有另一组当前配置，则按执行时配置取值。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本方法未提交/拥有一份旧图像副本；其读取和最终Source持有按RB03/RB05/OD链分别解释。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>UpdateVMResultShow使用Dispatcher.Invoke(Action)，其编译器委托是控件实例方法&lt;UpdateVMResultShow>b__62_0，先检查执行时的ModuleSource和ModuleParams非null，再读取当前GetDisplayList与SelectedImage.DisplayObject.GetValue(uint.MaxValue)，或遍历当前显示列表取首个图像；之后UpdateImageView(imageData)并绘制当前图形。这个路径有非null门，但没有保存请求时的module身份后再比较的原子快照。Invoke也不同于前两条Task.Run/BeginInvoke，不能把所有显示调用一概称为同一异步帧队列。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>public void UpdateVMResultShow()</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ea64fee502b1630e2b561797f0c53f23eddd15b0aec2316bda3e52bb25fab22" href="../../证据/8ea64fee502b1630e2b561797f0c53f23eddd15b0aec2316bda3e52bb25fab22.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ea64fee502b</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::UpdateVMResultShow / 0x06000346</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c56e4e41f252a03412c5cfeb61a04c3e2e472f0eeb88a99283acc9a839f571d3" href="../../证据/c56e4e41f252a03412c5cfeb61a04c3e2e472f0eeb88a99283acc9a839f571d3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c56e4e41f252</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::&lt;UpdateVMResultShow>b__62_0 / 0x060003a4</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="422bd838ef0b13d08a6a69267bff65b13c8ee4ba7409032b21bb02d1fca05288" href="../../证据/422bd838ef0b13d08a6a69267bff65b13c8ee4ba7409032b21bb02d1fca05288.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>422bd838ef0b</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：没有运行模块切换与Dispatcher排队时序，不能据当前字段读取直接断言错帧；只确认本动作不是请求时的配置/像素快照。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它宿主的Dispatcher/RenderThreadPool门属于独立路径，本事实不替代ModuleResultView的A链准入分析。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF04" id="IF04"><summary>IF04 · ImageViewBox默认转换 → Byte2ImageSource.Resize → 同步调用内的fixed/映射源与并行行闭包</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>外层IImageData参数及fixed源数组/本次映射 → 指针局部闭包 → WriteableBitmap.BackBuffer；不是完整帧对象的独立深复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>源和目标缓存仍由原控件/转换器对象持有；指针闭包自身不是生产者缓冲的所有者。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>固定/映射的作用域围绕当前转换调用，释放与异常解锁边界仍按OD05/OD06；不能因有并行循环就推断源缓冲在全部上游任务完成前已安全退役。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>默认ImageViewBox.ImageSourceChanged→DoImageSourceChanged→SetImageSource直接调用Byte2ImageSource.BuiltImageSourceA，没有在这三个选定体中建立Task.Run/Dispatcher委托。Buffer路径在fixed(image.Buffer)作用域内调用Resize，direct映射路径则在using映射范围内调用Resize。Resize使用Parallel.For行循环；已另取真实编译器闭包CIL与字段，行闭包持有源像素指针、目标bufferptr、stride/channel等以及父局部闭包引用，按行读源写目标。这里没有返回Task或把像素所有权/跨轮租约交给调用方；不能将Parallel的行闭包和上游排队的显示Task混作同一个生命周期。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（10）</summary><p>private bool DoImageSourceChanged()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="eb645bdf436a74d640269555192591aa4da2438e4dad0b9932752abdc5be30a8" href="../../证据/eb645bdf436a74d640269555192591aa4da2438e4dad0b9932752abdc5be30a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>eb645bdf436a</small></a><p>public unsafe ImageSource BuiltImageSourceA(IImageData image, int width, int height, ref bool status</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="db6a190b2bcca6b908b3fcda73ff7d303527de5597c26601cf8488412cf621c4" href="../../证据/db6a190b2bcca6b908b3fcda73ff7d303527de5597c26601cf8488412cf621c4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <smal