p>原体按0x3a0字节记录顺序逐项查找，以记录开头字符串与本次路径作逐字节比较，遇NUL且完全相等才置命中。命中后从同一记录+0x328取已有主图指针，+0x310/+0x314/+0x318/+0x31c取元数据，+0x338取随附64位描述字段；非命中才进入文件图像对象的虚表+0x38读取分支。所选命中代码先恢复描述再调用输出或拼接，不重新走NP01的像素复制准入分支。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>CMyAlgorithmManager::Process</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="99c78f3faffa978a900e96856a07113f6b7f1117fceb47a1b5f116b9dc3a2722" href="../../证据/99c78f3faffa978a900e96856a07113f6b7f1117fceb47a1b5f116b9dc3a2722.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>99c78f3faffa</small></a><p>CMyAlgorithmManager::Process</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fad8689fc3aad6f5c800332e56cb910ec7e32e22b1ff1bfbd5820348daa2a152" href="../../证据/fad8689fc3aad6f5c800332e56cb910ec7e32e22b1ff1bfbd5820348daa2a152.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fad8689fc3aa</small></a><p>CMyAlgorithmManager::Process</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d58d9eee61f1a7132f3787527db31d7f59b7e72ea4ce743dccd4fc9897a40815" href="../../证据/d58d9eee61f1a7132f3787527db31d7f59b7e72ea4ce743dccd4fc9897a40815.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d58d9eee61f1</small></a><p>CMyAlgorithmManager::Process</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7734c76e173fbf911f77a00f743ce24cb1160b13d955048784a4d71cd5da6c90" href="../../证据/7734c76e173fbf911f77a00f743ce24cb1160b13d955048784a4d71cd5da6c90.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7734c76e173f</small></a><p>CMyAlgorithmManager::Process</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6099526a2e82459c331953fa29d1fad62bb81acf9b8be5f57752d975b4068ed3" href="../../证据/6099526a2e82459c331953fa29d1fad62bb81acf9b8be5f