confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>根容器、模块记录、参数数组、chunk数组和pData像素分别有释放门；公开模式字段与内部释放字独立。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>该API清调用者查询容器，不意味着原SDK内部cache、托管副本或显示位图清空。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>内部字1跳过所选pData删除并非证明最后读者安全；根释放后外部像素的真正owner/复用仍须继续追踪。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原IMVS_RELEASE_MEMORY_TYPE中历史结果列表为值9；本次直接读取原native跳转表9项得到0x6af272。该片段先MOV RDX,RSI再call0x6c1390，其中RSI由分发入口R8保存，证实传入查询根指针；返回后另delete根。0x6c1390按每模块0xe8、每参数0xd0、每图像chunk0x120遍历：pImage中的像素指针非0且元素+0x114为0才调用delete[]，随后清指针；元素数组本身仍另delete[]。因此释放查询描述数组，并不无条件释放每个图像像素，更不等于关闭所有映射与显示读者。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>1806af09c</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cf3f161b6f6bef9d39fb405b8d2ff89a8fb0bd41ce14ea9f8fc13ee801a31e46" href="../../证据/cf3f161b6f6bef9d39fb405b8d2ff89a8fb0bd41ce14ea9f8fc13ee801a31e46.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cf3f161b6f6b</small></a><p>1806af272</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3571e2280915f10aa297eccb9a73551b2ff14af05646c2ed0350229b2e20972" href="../../证据/e3571e2280915f10aa297eccb9a73551b2ff14af05646c2ed0350229b2e20972.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3571e228091</small></a><p>                if (*(longlong *)(uVar8 + 0xa8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e1a265ced8f579232a260db4ef0f98dab9d38573b15592fe069379e62e097940" href="../../证据/e1a265ced8f579232a260db4ef0f98dab9d38573b15592fe069379e62e097940.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e1a265ced8f5</small></a><p>1806c14c8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b04df70330654ea8bfc5b5c58b11a8e727769f8db5d4da3750a6a7f921cb569" href="../../证据/0b04df70330654ea8bfc5b5c58b11a8e727769f8db5d4da3750a6a7f921cb569.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b04df703306</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它selector/异常/部分构造失败的全清理未全部关闭；所选private释放字不能反推全部模式下像素owner。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="DI04" id="DI04"><summary>DI04 · ModuleManager.PreProData / NativeData2Data / LargeObject → 类型化结果与chunk载荷</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文 · 复用既有证据</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>模块/执行计数/时间元数据；nParamType；MemoryType/MemoryPtr/MemoryAddress</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>先复制结果描述，再按参数类型处理；image/chunk在isFilter时可跳过</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>描述复制不保证所有chunk字节已脱离native内存</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>PreProData复制模块元数据并分配pInfo，逐项转UTF8名和NativeData2Data。图像/chunk走LargeObject：nUseRealData=0保留内存地址名；2保留地址名、原指针和长度；1设置指针/长度后FillData。不能把整个结果统称深拷贝。GetValueFromServer再按nParamType取对应数组，图像与chunk仍是载荷包装。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::PreProData</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8ab46be910fa43cc5b5d2f73cd427b7588d397b608d72d4cd822a487183e6d7" href="../../证据/f8ab46be910fa43cc5b5d2f73cd427b7588d397b608d72d4cd822a487183e6d7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8ab46be910f</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::NativeData2Data</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e2fc25c017ba61e618dd1336bfd67572c337a96ef5a0bb5efa6ac947a14bf0e" href="../../证据/4e2fc25c017ba61e618dd1336bfd67572c337a96ef5a0bb5efa6ac947a14bf0e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e2fc25c017b</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::LargeObject</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="542e00e2f30c03b1505ac899b67ef73292ea85637399f640614c59b3aa17fa7c" href="../../证据/542e00e2f30c03b1505ac899b67ef73292ea85637399f640614c59b3aa17fa7c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>542e00e2f30c</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::GetValueFromServer</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="700779dffee5077bf6af09d43b7ae50d59ea6a291f2b05e8ffb1e043a731632d" href="../../证据/700779dffee5077bf6af09d43b7ae50d59ea6a291f2b05e8ffb1e043a731632d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>700779dffee5</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：DI07—DI09已补FillData/GetData、全局池及共享头；native容器释放后全部消费者的指针有效期仍须继续闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="DI05" id="DI05"><summary>DI05 · XmlParser.Object.FillImageValue / ObjectBase.GetImageValue → Apps.Data.ImageData → 渲染仓库</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文 · 复用既有证据</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>ImageBuffer数组引用或MemoryAddress字符串；宽/高/像素格式/ExecuteCount</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>数据特征还原图像；已有ImageData直接返回同一对象</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>原RenderDataCenter清字典不在此调用图像Dispose</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>图像特征为chunk时，IsMemory分支取地址名，其余GetData取数组；包装ImageData保存该数组/地址、尺寸、像素格式及执行计数。已有ImageData则直接返回。Apps.Data.ImageData.Buffer getter/setter只是ImageBuffer字段读写。渲染仓库存入相同对象，选中图还改其Tag，不能画成隔离深拷贝；与SDK ImageBaseData是两种类型/路径。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::FillImageValue</p><p>原件 · 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d9cd946eb69de9aec137837bb751a26cd097f9ce30b1c2b7ff8bf15fc47a044a" href="../../证据/d9cd946eb69de9aec137837bb751a26cd097f9ce30b1c2b7ff8bf15fc47a044a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d9cd946eb69d</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.ObjectBase::GetImageValue</p><p>原件 · 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d2ebd5fa44d50daa2f0d4c929e58b503fe4e4895dd50814fd3477eee8966d6ac" href="../../证据/d2ebd5fa44d50daa2f0d4c929e58b503fe4e4895dd50814fd3477eee8966d6ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d2ebd5fa44d5</small></a><p>Apps.Data.ImageData::get_Buffer</p><p>原件 · 2ad51c179d4a5cf7e0c0373cd1526de8a75d53a3ea6cbe3ef73c0c5268e1c55c / MVID cb38f3bc-780b-400d-89f5-0ba51ce23489 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="52b7318e5f26b7f6fcbe1123e58ecf0e5d4e0e7ba4c23eba784856a2fd196a36" href="../../证据/52b7318e5f26b7f6fcbe1123e58ecf0e5d4e0e7ba4c23eba784856a2fd196a36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>52b7318e5f26</small></a><p>Apps.Data.ImageData::set_Buffer</p><p>原件 · 2ad51c179d4a5cf7e0c0373cd1526de8a75d53a3ea6cbe3ef73c0c5268e1c55c / MVID cb38f3bc-780b-400d-89f5-0ba51ce23489 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c79a44db135e876ff11cc44b5f043443c13fe33b81e9ea252b9acc6f41d1a06a" href="../../证据/c79a44db135e876ff11cc44b5f043443c13fe33b81e9ea252b9acc6f41d1a06a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c79a44db135e</small></a><p>Image reference storage and shared Tag</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2ca56bfbd7228b49e620c46e8a565d9eea9d56220211c6599a4df8c6176e1f66" href="../../证据/2ca56bfbd7228b49e620c46e8a565d9eea9d56220211c6599a4df8c6176e1f66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2ca56bfbd722</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原生生产者与各UI载荷的同实例桥、BaseNode/历史/扩展组件的最后引用及像素最终释放仍待核；显示MemoryAddress与执行计数的选定分支另由OD01–OD07取证，不再列为未取得显示体。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="DR01" id="DR01"><summary>DR01 · VmIO读取落后 → VmModule.RefreshResult → 最近结果查询 → 转换 → 核心回调消费者</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文 · 复用既有证据</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>模块ID/Root.ExecuteCount；批次列表和原生页指针</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>门条件可不查询；按选定执行次数逆序处理批次</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>try/finally始终尝试queryResult.Release</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>RefreshResult在Root为空、正在报告运行、禁用或执行计数一致时返回；否则查询最近结果，按IsClearLastExecuteResult选择计数并预处理后调用VmSolution结果回调入口。正常尾更新模块及Inputs/Outputs的ExecuteCount。catch仅处理VmException，finally释放查询容器；不能把单个finally理解为所有嵌套图像payload均已独立。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（1）</summary><p>VM.Core.VmModule::RefreshResult</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="27f6e7b799b405a0efa2d1389d3a3f605d519785c22fa882c737bb310ca561fc" href="../../证据/27f6e7b799b405a0efa2d1389d3a3f605d519785c22fa882c737bb310ca561fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>27f6e7b799b4</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：核心回调完整字段写入顺序、native查询数据与chunk借用内存的交叉所有权仍需继续；正常尾计数更新不等于异常路径也更新。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="DR03" id="DR03"><summary>DR03 · RenderDataCenter按ExecuteCount收图像/形状 → display / buffer / spare三仓引用交换</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文 · 复用既有证据</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Dictionary保存ImageData及ValueEventArgs对象引用</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>轮次变化Clear目标仓；BeforeExchange设固定标志，Exchange换引用</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>DeInit清六字典、选择引用和计数；不是逐像素析构</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>三仓交换移动Dictionary引用，不复制每张图像。ClearDisplayStore只清显示仓；DeInit清全部仓与选图字段。所选Clear/DeInit体没有遍历调用像素释放；因而清缓存引用、停止收到新值和底层映射释放是不同阶段。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>Reference exchange</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="452b7bfa3c8d86c3bfbbda09d29e4f2ed407a32acf6965147feb6300b1c16235" href="../../证据/452b7bfa3c8d86c3bfbbda09d29e4f2ed407a32acf6965147feb6300b1c16235.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>452b7bfa3c8d</small></a><p>Store reset and reference release</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da66bb68359e0f9274362bfd3d8549671695b26eb3cc96cc5e872aa59fa79db6" href="../../证据/da66bb68359e0f9274362bfd3d8549671695b26eb3cc96cc5e872aa59fa79db6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da66bb68359e</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::DeInit</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95" href="../../证据/cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb340b8a3316</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Object的发送完成信号消费者、显示线程借用期和图像MemoryAddress真实释放仍未全闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IU02" id="IU02"><summary>IU02 · 两条已证静态显示链 → 原机活实例、扩展分支与最后读者</summary><p>unknown · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>A、B链分别持有ImageData并绑定到各自ImageViewBox，不把两套仓库串成一条实例链。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>静态仓库交换、字段更新和选择门已按各宿主列出；实际回调重入和同帧一致性仍未实测。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>不由消费者关闭映射或清界面推断生产者缓冲已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原版A链RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator与B链tempImageStore→RenderControlBase的成员赋值和原BAML绑定已分别定位。尚未在原机核实具体活动实例、模板命中与所有异步/扩展消费者退役；剩余未知不再描述为静态绑定缺失。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（0）</summary></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原版A链RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator与B链tempImageStore→RenderControlBase的成员赋值和原BAML绑定已分别定位。尚未在原机核实具体活动实例、模板命中与所有异步/扩展消费者退役；剩余未知不再描述为静态绑定缺失。</p></details></article><article><h4>当前独立实现</h4><p>工具返回后还有失败过滤、字典包装和下游读值；scope缓存与单轮记录分别持有。</p><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS03" id="IS03"><summary>IS03 · PathCache / PixelFormat / 路径列表变更 → 按路径首批保留，不是LRU</summary><p>independent-implementation · 本地文件</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Dictionary&lt;string,IImageData>以Ordinal路径字符串为键，字典保留最终图像引用，不在Add时再复制像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>容量是新增准入上限，不是持续强制裁剪；列表Paths和像素Cache是不同容器。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Cache.Clear只移除字典引用；已发布结果仍可能保留同一图像，不能称立即释放像素。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>本地模式按所选路径字符串查State.Cache，命中直接取同一IImageData；未命中仅在Count&lt;PathCache时Add，不执行LRU替换。当前源码仅在执行到本地分支且PixelFormat参数改变时Clear全部Cache。降低PathCache（含变0）、删除列表项、切换CurrentImagePath、目录dirty刷新或文件内容变化，本段都没有逐项驱逐Cache；旧条目可继续占容量，仍命中的同路径可继续使用旧像素。进入相机或SDK模式本身也不执行这里的Clear。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>if(!state.Paths.SequenceEqual(paths,StringComparer.Ordinal))</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5862cd16f69d06062bd59e3f11c358e588f403f4e7e86d3cea58511e4168e7c" href="../../证据/a5862cd16f69d06062bd59e3f11c358e588f403f4e7e86d3cea58511e4168e7c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5862cd16f69</small></a><p>if(state.PixelFormat!=c.Integer(&quot;PixelFormat&quot;))</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d" href="../../证据/c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9b08bf7272f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未运行文件覆盖/参数切换的桌面时序探针；这里是源码确认的当前保留策略，不能用产品源码中的native注释代证原版相同。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS07" id="IS07"><summary>IS07 · StitchEnable / retained StitchBuffer → 拼接图像快照与下一轮前缀分开</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>原image像素 → State拼接工作数组 → 输出图像构造器私有副本；随后State前缀更新不修改已产生输出像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>尺寸/宽度/范围失败、触发清空与长度重分配是不同分支；宽度不符或start+height越界在拷贝前失败。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>重分配解除State对旧工作数组的引用；禁用拼接并未主动清缓存，最终回收仍由引用可达性决定。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>拼接有效时State保留StitchWidth及StitchBuffer。ClearTrigger命中会Array.Clear当前数组并把宽度设0，不立即释放数组。总输出字节长度改变才new StitchBuffer；本轮原图先复制到prefix之后，再调用GrayImage/RgbImage构造器复制完整StitchBuffer为输出快照，最后将原图指定条带复制到State.StitchBuffer开头，作为下一轮前缀。这个先构造输出、后改前缀的顺序意味着输出不共享随后更新的State数组。关闭拼接分支不会清掉已保留的StitchBuffer。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>if(c.Boolean(&quot;StitchEnable&quot;)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e1042e25105cdd8f9b995b42f3c90bf48d8f6d9e77e0352c058820c0c1de8827" href="../../证据/e1042e25105cdd8f9b995b42f3c90bf48d8f6d9e77e0352c058820c0c1de8827.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e1042e25105c</small></a><p>public GrayImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="39d9da2fcf35ee2429d744eb635fcc15fe77c20be34579af98e801af2a4afd97" href="../../证据/39d9da2fcf35ee2429d744eb635fcc15fe77c20be34579af98e801af2a4afd97.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>39d9da2fcf35</small></a><p>public RgbImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef631d278ac8a85a7c631785877a3353dbe5f4c318b357999250a368dff37e36" href="../../证据/ef631d278ac8a85a7c631785877a3353dbe5f4c318b357999250a368dff37e36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef631d278ac8</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：这里只证明Gray/Rgb所选当前构造路径；额外外部图像格式/stride/原生拼接内存布局不能据channels分支泛化为兼容。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS08" id="IS08"><summary>IS08 · 图像源局部image / 附加Mono8转换 → ModuleResult.Image与ImageMono8</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>主图包装不深复制；附加Mono8转换另建独立图像数组；metadata不承载像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>成功ModuleResult可能与State.Cache、提交者或CameraFrame同时持有主图。后续结果字典复制的深度由框架另核。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>输出局部变量退出不释放仍被结果或缓存引用的像素；RGB附加灰度也需追其独立消费者。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Image输出通过PortValue.Image包装当前image；本地缓存命中、SDK单槽、相机frame.Image在未拼接时分别传入各自原对象。宽高/格式/序列等是独立标量输出，不是新图像。OutMono8只有image为RgbImage时生成额外图像：ImageColorConversion先分配灰度临时数组，再经GrayImage构造器复制；主Image不被替换。相机/SDK移除名称与路径字段，SDK还移除SNCode；这些输出缺席不能解释为内部帧/计数被清空。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>var outputs=new Dictionary&lt;string,PortValue></p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="44ad5f5c413f02966f6e4e38a8086bd65cf30d972ece78874b017d579de7f51b" href="../../证据/44ad5f5c413f02966f6e4e38a8086bd65cf30d972ece78874b017d579de7f51b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>44ad5f5c413f</small></a><p>public static PortValue Image(GrayImage</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c10d4bc7e4ab04defcfbad550dfd4a31f0a573de4e58f4537bffd425c40b426" href="../../证据/2c10d4bc7e4ab04defcfbad550dfd4a31f0a573de4e58f4537bffd425c40b426.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c10d4bc7e4a</small></a><p>public static GrayImage ToMono8(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c1808fa887a4aa3edc7ec51ca822db2df9c859d2d86b9248edee1d6d1e96b808" href="../../证据/c1808fa887a4aa3edc7ec51ca822db2df9c859d2d86b9248edee1d6d1e96b808.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c1808fa887a4</small></a><p>public GrayImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="39d9da2fcf35ee2429d744eb635fcc15fe77c20be34579af98e801af2a4afd97" href="../../证据/39d9da2fcf35ee2429d744eb635fcc15fe77c20be34579af98e801af2a4afd97.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>39d9da2fcf35</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：主窗只选某端口显示、历史是否保留及结果过滤由消费者另核，不能只见成功返回就宣称所有输出都被界面显示或及时释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD03" id="TD03"><summary>TD03 · ImageBufferPlugin刷新/发布 → FIFO图像 → 多轮结果引用</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>入队深复制与发布引用包装是两个不同动作；最多15槽，数量0仍先复制再裁剪为空。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>FIFO由scope.State或插件fallback持有；CreateRuntime不新建FIFO，非1刷新值不会裁剪已有队列。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>State不是IDisposable，Reset只删fallback键；scope移除也只是移除持有/按接口条件Dispose，不逐帧释放图像。旧结果持有者必须另算。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>缓存图像在刷新标志等于1时复制支持的Gray/Rgb/Raw图像入队，再按数量裁剪；成功输出枚举队列并PortValue.Image(image)，这里不再次复制像素。后续暂停刷新可以让多轮结果包装同一缓存图像对象。队首淘汰仅Dequeue，不能使仍被旧结果引用的对象消失。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>sealed class State</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4ad170352bb7e355b91693536cb21f38e80ca372d494ba96d5982a4e6f8a0534" href="../../证据/4ad170352bb7e355b91693536cb21f38e80ca372d494ba96d5982a4e6f8a0534.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4ad170352bb7</small></a><p>State GetState(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4243df0dd5579c0994fd658086bd23caff558055ef47cbc8a7aa2b01d17ee455" href="../../证据/4243df0dd5579c0994fd658086bd23caff558055ef47cbc8a7aa2b01d17ee455.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4243df0dd557</small></a><p>public void Reset(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3a1499513935d50838ebaeebe32e311dc2db518e144db700f3ec897f411ebcc7" href="../../证据/3a1499513935d50838ebaeebe32e311dc2db518e144db700f3ec897f411ebcc7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3a1499513935</small></a><p>if(count is &lt;0 or >15)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="81d8431b2bd9a888d074ca3dd27e1693f600009a588d5803c013e6afe280fc6e" href="../../证据/81d8431b2bd9a888d074ca3dd27e1693f600009a588d5803c013e6afe280fc6e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>81d8431b2bd9</small></a><p>public static PortValue Image(IImageData</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="092c5732f860c1a1e41ab524b09f7a4e51e920b7c6a9942b9690cef447f70110" href="../../证据/092c5732f860c1a1e41ab524b09f7a4e51e920b7c6a9942b9690cef447f70110.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>092c5732f860</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ImageBuffer原生队列及其析构需要原函数体；此处与既有IB事实相互补充，非原版完全等价结论。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD04" id="TD04"><summary>TD04 · ModuleResult返回与运行器清理 → GraphExecutor过滤 / 校验 → NodeRunRecord</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>ModuleResult与NodeRunRecord是不同边界；容器复制不等于图像像素复制，readonly也不是内部对象所有权证明。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>每轮records以nodeId保存；WorkflowRunContext.Complete再把值投影到流程输出/显示/局部变量，可能增加同一图像的持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>单轮运行器Dispose不等于输出图像或跨轮scope状态Dispose；丢弃这一轮失败Outputs也不等于清工具旧缓存。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>GraphExecutor先在finally释放实现IDisposable/IAsyncDisposable的单轮module，随后检查取消、超时、异常、结果状态以及输出描述符。失败且PreserveFailedOutputs=false时直接Record失败，未传Outputs，记录使用Empty；所以插件字典里曾构造的状态输出不一定发布。通过检查的成功/NoMatch结果（以及显式保留失败输出的路径）复制输出字典并包ReadOnlyDictionary，值仍是同一PortValue；CompoundOutputFields.Expand也先浅复制已有键值，只为适用的复合值追加投影字段。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>try{if(n.ModuleId==WorkflowCalls.ModuleId)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d317aea19ef91d5936fda2930148f9d2681564f831764c508254611847c6da66" href="../../证据/d317aea19ef91d5936fda2930148f9d2681564f831764c508254611847c6da66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d317aea19ef9</small></a><p>if(result.Status==ModuleStatus.Failed&amp;&amp;!result.PreserveFailedOutputs)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4" href="../../证据/1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1edcf7aa0e18</small></a><p>if(result.Continuation==ModuleContinuation.SuppressSuccessors)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="740d3d3a65cc1f2d66f6abbeccd2bc8f702bbb1d06ce9f05d7e2a2055c2a63b2" href="../../证据/740d3d3a65cc1f2d66f6abbeccd2bc8f702bbb1d06ce9f05d7e2a2055c2a63b2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>740d3d3a65cc</small></a><p>public sealed record ModuleResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8068dbf59f6204b9a64a01f18ca2373075df61cdacd433f9c7383e36b5b7b8bb" href="../../证据/8068dbf59f6204b9a64a01f18ca2373075df61cdacd433f9c7383e36b5b7b8bb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8068dbf59f62</small></a><p>public static IReadOnlyDictionary&lt;string,PortValue> Expand(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0393d7321deb734b4f7b6d3efc5263f228b96ac4efa3a74d8620d73e536057fb" href="../../证据/0393d7321deb734b4f7b6d3efc5263f228b96ac4efa3a74d8620d73e536057fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0393d7321deb</small></a><p>public ExecutionSessionResult Complete(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="41375ef4db365a6a1fcd5aa4286a2a6e6dd256c790c91f2bef851f60c2c0d468" href="../../证据/41375ef4db365a6a1fcd5aa4286a2a6e6dd256c790c91f2bef851f60c2c0d468.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>41375ef4db36</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不会据清理函数名推断所有输出载荷释放；实际原子性、并发读者和native最后读者仍须按真实对象追踪。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD08" id="TD08"><summary>TD08 · 会话结果 / 当前结果视图 / 两类历史 → 多持有者退役与方案切换</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>workflowSessions与results可指同一记录；主框架历史和二值化摘要不是像素历史，LastResult则可以继续持有输出图像。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>session以流程ID索引，覆盖或清除只改变相应容器引用；二值化窗口关闭只标closed，不能据此假设LastResult已置null。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>方案切换、清列表、关闭窗口、scope释放和最后图像读者退出必须分别核对；托管图像没有逐帧Dispose协议，不能宣布立即归还全部像素。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>当前运行完成后经owner检查提交，StoreWorkflowCallResults把ExecutionSessionResult放进workflowSessions；RestoreWorkflowResults把session中的同一NodeRunRecord赋给results，不深复制图像。切方案ReplaceExecutionScope清configurationResults/workflowSessions/results等并关闭旧scope，这些清理不证明所有外部持有者同时清除。主框架FrameworkRunHistory仅保存序号/时间/状态文字/流程ID/耗时，最多500条，不保存图像；二值化窗口的history也只是最多256条状态摘要，但LastResult单独保留NodeRunRecord。Present先更新LastResult和摘要，再按100ms门决定是否更新图像/表格，故不同显示持有者可能短暂不同步。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（10）</summary><p>var owner=CaptureExecutionOwner();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="69e206d71a60d17b7049f94f5289854bc00b3c6f6f99724715efe2b36aa18992" href="../../证据/69e206d71a60d17b7049f94f5289854bc00b3c6f6f99724715efe2b36aa18992.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>69e206d71a60</small></a><p>var session=await Task.Run(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69" href="../../证据/5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c3a2427db92</small></a><p>void StoreWorkflowCallResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c" href="../../证据/3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b3117a036fd</small></a><p>void RestoreWorkflowResults()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="253883732654ea20b383d45cb4ffa669f1a4a052833062819ee404acd1d70b01" href="../../证据/253883732654ea20b383d45cb4ffa669f1a4a052833062819ee404acd1d70b01.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>253883732654</small></a><p>void ReplaceExecutionScope()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403" href="../../证据/059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059edbdec789</small></a><p>public const int MaximumRecords</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="20858fb17f06f256d0195e8b9ac4c68eb01088946c7d49b91fce4295b7cd4562" href="../../证据/20858fb17f06f256d0195e8b9ac4c68eb01088946c7d49b91fce4295b7cd4562.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>20858fb17f06</small></a><p>public void Append(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3ca2f5c148d6538acbd7e94ed19f071c43f79d98a9b06cf037c40b6acdccacca" href="../../证据/3ca2f5c148d6538acbd7e94ed19f071c43f79d98a9b06cf037c40b6acdccacca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3ca2f5c148d6</small></a><p>public sealed record FrameworkRunHistoryEntry(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58ede53f5394246631d3d74bcf4454b5dc0f77a2659efc25410966a579eb76bf" href="../../证据/58ede53f5394246631d3d74bcf4454b5dc0f77a2659efc25410966a579eb76bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58ede53f5394</small></a><p>void Present(NodeRunRecord result)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="402b682a9427dbdb949e35a3421a43561938be5baaaa98d1877540fc5b37ef61" href="../../证据/402b682a9427dbdb949e35a3421a43561938be5baaaa98d1877540fc5b37ef61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>402b682a9427</small></a><p>Closed+=(_,_)=>closed=true;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="825f4f79447b69c3d2381ae15532c441e3a533fb1f7b78207f0c2fb1c1f64d59" href="../../证据/825f4f79447b69c3d2381ae15532c441e3a533fb1f7b78207f0c2fb1c1f64d59.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>825f4f79447b</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：没有把历史文字条数当成保留像素帧数；实际WPF窗口可达性、全部调试引用与内存峰值需要单独运行证据，当前未执行。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR01" id="CR01"><summary>CR01 · 新一轮开始 / 停止 / 抛取消异常 → 隐藏旧结果视图与保存旧会话是两个动作</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>results是可见NodeRunRecord索引，workflowSessions是完整ExecutionSessionResult；隐藏索引不等于移除图像持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>旧session可继续保持Nodes、WorkflowOutputs、WorkflowDisplays、LocalVariables和Calls中的PortValue引用；不能将空白显示当零像素缓存。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>停止请求不等于清旧结果或FIFO；本轮没有新session时不会自动用空session覆盖旧session。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>BeginWorkflowResults增加过程执行计数，仅在count>1、workStatus非0且清旧结果偏好开启时，标记该过程及所调用子过程为cleared并清当前results视图；它不删除workflowSessions。RunCore返回session才StoreWorkflowCallResults覆盖对应会话并移除cleared标记。若Task.Run被取消或执行抛异常而没有返回session，catch只改状态文字，旧session仍在；偏好开启时可处于隐藏状态，未开启时也未由这个catch主动清除。工具栏停止只Cancel activeRun，FinishWorkflowRun清运行标记并Dispose该取消源，不清会话或插件scope状态。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p> void BeginWorkflowResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="906d7cf57bdf8339ab5ca2514f2fba86c6ae18a05d1a7b4e33387608010c9e52" href="../../证据/906d7cf57bdf8339ab5ca2514f2fba86c6ae18a05d1a7b4e33387608010c9e52.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>906d7cf57bdf</small></a><p>    public bool ShouldClearAtBegin(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="57dd650ccb3cd900f30c8d8be2152928f992a15bc6916d26e3ec9cbc815dda73" href="../../证据/57dd650ccb3cd900f30c8d8be2152928f992a15bc6916d26e3ec9cbc815dda73.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>57dd650ccb3c</small></a><p>   var session=await Task.Run(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69" href="../../证据/5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c3a2427db92</small></a><p>  catch(OperationCanceledException){if(IsCurrentExecutionOwner(owner))</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f1bef6a5732fecdbfba501aa4508ca1daea445ecf4da78732bfd3248f5fd227" href="../../证据/0f1bef6a5732fecdbfba501aa4508ca1daea445ecf4da78732bfd3248f5fd227.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f1bef6a5732</small></a><p> void StoreWorkflowCallResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c" href="../../证据/3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b3117a036fd</small></a><p> void FinishWorkflowRun(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dd56ae0fac7064eb4fb05031cb8171ca88a0b21718cf16a701e45bf8cba48aa" href="../../证据/9dd56ae0fac7064eb4fb05031cb8171ca88a0b21718cf16a701e45bf8cba48aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dd56ae0fac7</small></a><p>stopToolButton=Tool(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="61a0f0198b10cfd38182295471ce9f343d73ba976360d21b616ee810a24b93e7" href="../../证据/61a0f0198b10cfd38182295471ce9f343d73ba976360d21b616ee810a24b93e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61a0f0198b10</small></a><p>public sealed record ExecutionSessionResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a624e1107d0fc0939aaeebd75f8cf5259eab85a687e6877a8ebbffc7440706a7" href="../../证据/a624e1107d0fc0939aaeebd75f8cf5259eab85a687e6877a8ebbffc7440706a7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a624e1107d0f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：此事实仅区分返回session与抛异常两条路径，不把所有取消都判成保留旧会话；返回Cancelled session的覆盖路径见CR02。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR02" id="CR02"><summary>CR02 · GraphExecutor本轮取消 / 失败 / 跳过 → 本轮混合结果可替换上轮会话；旧插件状态另留</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>取消后保留的可能是本轮成功前缀，不是自动合并上一轮成功图像；失败记录与成功记录的图像持有不同。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>覆盖旧会话只移除该字典入口的旧引用，不清插件缓存、配置结果、调试记录或独立视图；新session本身仍可保留本轮成功图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清输出字典、返回取消状态、取消源Dispose均没有逐帧图像Dispose语义。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>GraphExecutor每轮新建records，不拿上一轮NodeRunRecord补失败节点。节点开始前发现取消会Record(Cancelled)且输出默认Empty；前驱失败或不可用会Record(Skipped)且输出Empty。单节点执行后取消/超时/异常与失败输出过滤按TD04生成本轮记录，已经成功完成的前序节点记录不因此统一清空。最终把全部本轮记录组成session，状态可为Cancelled/Failed/TimedOut。RunCore只检查owner、未以session成功作为发布前提，所以正常返回的取消/失败session也可替换workflowSessions，包含本轮早先成功节点图像与后续空输出。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>  var calls=new Dictionary&lt;string,ExecutionSessionResult>();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c7144a5f850927830edc406166c971f52e77b9968d6f6ea0aec41d31578cea76" href="../../证据/c7144a5f850927830edc406166c971f52e77b9968d6f6ea0aec41d31578cea76.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c7144a5f8509</small></a><p>   void Record(NodeRunStatus s,</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f1440ee0600786c122f0d86ac78832d707143388f584c292c495a9f8eb204f54" href="../../证据/f1440ee0600786c122f0d86ac78832d707143388f584c292c495a9f8eb204f54.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f1440ee06007</small></a><p>   if(executionEdges.Where(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11cf5bf31a1b62f258250b166cff21ce3305c5ec960ca40048bbb592167d77bf" href="../../证据/11cf5bf31a1b62f258250b166cff21ce3305c5ec960ca40048bbb592167d77bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11cf5bf31a1b</small></a><p>   if(cancellationToken.IsCancellationRequested){Record(NodeRunStatus.Cancelled,code:</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4" href="../../证据/1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1edcf7aa0e18</small></a><p>  var all=validation.ExecutionOrder.Select(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f" href="../../证据/f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f68913b1df0b</small></a><p>   WorkflowCallbacks.PublishModuleResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="267f0dc129d0e1d9039b2874b4463ef9adafd5a3a1001d76e3cd72a5e464bab6" href="../../证据/267f0dc129d0e1d9039b2874b4463ef9adafd5a3a1001d76e3cd72a5e464bab6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>267f0dc129d0</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Task.Run调度前取消或外层异常可能不产生session，需与CR01分别判断；未执行竞争、GC或内存峰值探针。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR03" id="CR03"><summary>CR03 · GraphEditorDocument.DeleteNodes → Changed → scope节点状态移除不等于裁剪旧session/配置记录</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>编辑文档的节点/JSON历史与运行NodeRunRecord在不同容器；删除图结构不自动改写历史运行session。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>configurationResults还可保存已删节点的旧记录；新配置请求available从旧session与configurationResults组装引用视图。具体能否再被有效订阅消费仍受当前文档解析和验证限制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>scope移除仅退役该层state持有；显示不再列出节点不等于所有结果载荷不可达。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>DeleteNodes修改节点、连线与配置引用，Edit提交文档后发Changed；主窗Changed调用ValidateToolConfigurationOwner、RetainExecutionNodes和刷新。RetainExecutionNodes只将现存(过程,模块,节点)集合交scope.RetainProcedureNodes并裁剪pointAliasPresentation。scope移除对应参数缓存与state，state若IDisposable才Dispose。这个删除链没有按被删节点裁剪workflowSessions.Nodes、configurationResults或toolDebugRecords；这些容器先前保存的记录不能因文档节点消失而推定已释放。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>    public void DeleteNodes(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="55d45978667d8145c9adc9da30a45d75ec8b9741f7221a07673f0ad6d36d96be" href="../../证据/55d45978667d8145c9adc9da30a45d75ec8b9741f7221a07673f0ad6d36d96be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>55d45978667d</small></a><p>        SolutionStore.ValidateStructure(next); RecordEditHistory();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b89579065a8ee9f9af3570bc103d2944630d50bee54ddd11515cddf3118608d2" href="../../证据/b89579065a8ee9f9af3570bc103d2944630d50bee54ddd11515cddf3118608d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b89579065a8e</small></a><p>doc.Changed+=()=></p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85" href="../../证据/bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bff6c0b3eb08</small></a><p> void RetainExecutionNodes()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b" href="../../证据/649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>649bacd49f44</small></a><p> public void RemoveNode(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a><p> void RetainProcedureNodes(IEnumerable&lt;(string Procedure,string Module,string Node)> current,string? only)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac" href="../../证据/fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd003545d04d</small></a><p>  var available=(workflowSessions.TryGetValue(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="981b8452e46fdcdc33b3db47f2114d8e3c2f5be28823b36d88836b7b543560a6" href="../../证据/981b8452e46fdcdc33b3db47f2114d8e3c2f5be28823b36d88836b7b543560a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>981b8452e46f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：只证明所选删除/Changed链没有这些裁剪，不宣称任意其它用户动作永远不会清记录；结果字典的最终可达时刻未测。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR04" id="CR04"><summary>CR04 · ImageSource状态缓存 / SDK待提交帧 / ImageBuffer FIFO → scope退役、Reset、像素格式变化分别影响哪些持有者</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>源Cache、PendingFrame、拼接数组、FIFO和NodeRunRecord是不同持有者；State.Dispose并不表示它的每个字段被清空。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>即使state从scope字典移除，正在运行的局部state引用或旧结果仍可能继续持有像素；停止不触发这里的Reset。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>是否由GC回收取决于其它引用；本切片只报告显式字段/容器变化，不宣称旧字节立刻归还系统。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ImageSource.State除Cache还持PendingFrame及StitchBuffer；其Dispose仅Dispose Folder并置null，不主动Clear Cache、清PendingFrame或StitchBuffer。SDK提交以Interlocked.Exchange替换PendingFrame，执行SDK模式再Exchange为null取走，不克隆。文件模式仅像素格式变化时Clear Cache，路径命中复用同一图像；缓存容量参数只限制新准入，不在此段按减少后的容量主动裁剪。ImageBuffer.State不是IDisposable，FIFO淘汰/Reset及scope移除均只是移除特定持有，旧结果仍可指向已出队图像（复制/发布见TD03）。主窗InvalidateSourceResults清results、调用fallback Reset并移除scope节点，却未在此方法清workflowSessions或configurationResults。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p> sealed class State:IDisposable</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89f6bf8036f5d726b62111368975cd50b32b1df8611de20688bbe3fe4a9d7186" href="../../证据/89f6bf8036f5d726b62111368975cd50b32b1df8611de20688bbe3fe4a9d7186.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89f6bf8036f5</small></a><p> public void SubmitImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e95d5c3ddca051a3b34f99a3ef3062deccf4070cd0b6ca5ec44633d55904fad8" href="../../证据/e95d5c3ddca051a3b34f99a3ef3062deccf4070cd0b6ca5ec44633d55904fad8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e95d5c3ddca0</small></a><p> public void Reset(ModuleExecutionScope</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105" href="../../证据/92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92647cab0979</small></a><p> public void Reset(string nodeId)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943" href="../../证据/13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13df7359670c</small></a><p>    if(state.PixelFormat!=</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d" href="../../证据/c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9b08bf7272f</small></a><p>     image=Interlocked.Exchange(ref state.PendingFrame,null)!;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30ce5b0d645bf5ba8fa53f0cded075c39a1ec1afa54cb9cd0511427e6077413b" href="../../证据/30ce5b0d645bf5ba8fa53f0cded075c39a1ec1afa54cb9cd0511427e6077413b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30ce5b0d645b</small></a><p> sealed class State {</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3cd0cb0fbffbb7a8227782f59fd5f627759a587ca5984feb13b1e97e1d90e5cf" href="../../证据/3cd0cb0fbffbb7a8227782f59fd5f627759a587ca5984feb13b1e97e1d90e5cf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3cd0cb0fbffb</small></a><p> void InvalidateSourceResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9768a53926729a080ff8249575d37b3e3fce7bbc03804fea3956145139ca4818" href="../../证据/9768a53926729a080ff8249575d37b3e3fce7bbc03804fea3956145139ca4818.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9768a5392672</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：无scope fallback状态的外部调用/所有Reset时序未穷尽；已知的托管持有关系不能替代native相机帧租用与释放证据。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR05" id="CR05"><summary>CR05 · 工具调试 / 普通配置自执行 / 关闭编辑器 → 停止调度与LastResult、Task结果、宿主缓存分别退役</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>完成Task&lt;T>、配置执行器LastResult、configurationResults、toolDebugRecords和工具窗口LastResult是独立持有者，不能统一命名成一个“会话结果”。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>正常失败record可覆盖配置缓存旧记录；配置失活导致不发布时旧configurationResults可留存。调试Invalidate还只做宿主特定失效标记，不消灭其它session旧引用。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>停止、Dispose调度器、从窗口集合移除、清LastResult和清宿主记录是不同动作；不能从窗口关闭推断所有输出图像已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>当前实际类型是ToolDebugSession和ExecutionSessionResult，并未发现名为ToolExecutionSession/RunRecord的同一实体。ToolDebugSession.active保存Start返回的Task，完成finally仅清取消源/更新状态，不把active置null；若为RunOnce，该完成Task可继续持有NodeRunRecord直到active被下次Start替换或session不再可达。StopAsync取消并等待active，不清已保存结果。普通配置调度ToolConfigurationExecution.Dispatch开始把LastResult=null，完成再置结果；StopAsync只取消轮询并等loop，不清LastResult；DisposeAsync再等待inFlight也不清它。宿主RunConfiguredTool按owner/配置存活/节点身份准入后缓存record，不限成功状态；关闭配置可阻止晚发布，但CloseToolConfiguration没有清configurationResults。独立调试窗口的关闭另等待session.DisposeAsync后移除session集合项，不等同清宿主toolDebugRecords。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（9）</summary><p> Task? active;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2" href="../../证据/5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5222f1b9a889</small></a><p>   async Task&lt;T> Execute()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7" href="../../证据/d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d22473d11e55</small></a><p> public async Task StopAsync()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392" href="../../证据/d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d03635ba61cc</small></a><p> async Task Dispatch(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7" href="../../证据/17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>17ad97750ddb</small></a><p> public async Task StopAsync(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38" href="../../证据/7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c2e184d34c3</small></a><p>  }catch(Exception ex){record=new(nodeId,</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742" href="../../证据/de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de435e16af18</small></a><p> void CloseToolConfiguration()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde" href="../../证据/4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4ae7013d1039</small></a><p> void BindToolEditorLifetime(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6" href="../../证据/560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>560abd8d493d</small></a><p> void StoreToolDebugResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3" href="../../证据/f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f654b99be709</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Task对象是否实际继续可达取决于窗口/context/session持有；此处只指出字段可达链，不声称关闭后必然泄漏。工具窗口内部额外结果/图像字段仍按各工具另核。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR06" id="CR06"><summary>CR06 · 切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>scope的租约控制state/services清理；NodeRunRecord与WPF/工具显示引用不由同一引用计数统一管理。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>失败资源被保留用于CleanupFailures诊断；旧在飞方法局部引用、关闭窗口/context、外部消费者与结果Task可另外保持载荷可达。FrameworkRunHistory只存摘要（TD08），不能把它当图像历史释放机制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>新owner阻止旧结果进入新方案，但不是销毁所有旧像素；窗口生命周期、scope清理、查询容器释放和最后图像读者退出需分别说明。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>切方案ReplaceExecutionScope先使执行owner失效、取消当前请求，显式Clear调试记录、configurationResults、workflowSessions、results等，再Dispose旧scope并创建新scope。scope.Dispose先closing并Cancel，只有取消完成且leases==0才Release；Release清state/services/参数字典，再逐个Dispose可释放资源，失败资源额外存failedResources。主窗关闭与切方案不同：DrainWorkflowBeforeClose先取消活动流程并等activeRun换出；独立调试session由OnClosing等停。OnClosed关闭owner/回调队列、关配置并Dispose scope，但该体没有Clear workflowSessions/results/configurationResults或逐个清控件图像。只可说关闭启动退役，不能说所有外部对象已同步归零。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p> void ReplaceExecutionScope()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403" href="../../证据/059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059edbdec789</small></a><p> public void Dispose(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf" href="../../证据/4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e8fd932d9bb</small></a><p> void Release(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a><p> void RecordCleanupFailure(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a><p> async void DrainWorkflowBeforeClose(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb" href="../../证据/6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6be2984eb8a0</small></a><p> protected override async void OnClosing(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797" href="../../证据/f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6d959502fe5</small></a><p> protected override void OnClosed(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b" href="../../证据/9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9244b0ac6bbc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：没有强制GC、原机内存峰值或最终外部读者测量；不得由静态Dispose路径推断释放的精确时刻、无泄漏或native等价。</p></details></article></div></details><details class="dd-pipeline-stage" data-pipeline-stage="display"><summary>④ 送到显示 · 图像预览、通用图文显示和专用窗口是不同入口。</summary><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article><h4>原版：已证片段与明确缺口</h4><p>原版IImageData.Buffer与MemoryAddress两支、位图复用、执行计数门和映射关闭逐项展开。</p><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OD01" id="OD01"><summary>OD01 · 原ImageViewBox.ImageDataSource / DoImageSourceChanged → 实际Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::BuiltImageSourceA</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>原消费者接收VMControls.RenderInterface.IImageData；它不是当前VisionCore.IImageData，也不是SDK的ImageBaseData。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>控件持有ImageDataSource及转换器；输出ImageSource另存到Source。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这条调用本身不证明释放源IImageData或其外部指针。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ImageViewBox的_byte2Image字段与SetImageSource中的CIL调用均指向Apps.BaseData程序集的Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource，不能用VM.Controls或HikPcUI.ImageView同名类替代。ImageSourceChanged调用DoImageSourceChanged，扩展ImageBoxAddition可先处理并返回；默认路径按IsDirectDownSampling进入SetImageSource。SetImageSource根据尺寸/高质量/裁剪分支调用带ref status的9参数BuiltImageSourceA，status=false时提前返回，不赋新Source。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>原字段的真实程序集/类型</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVI