4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4526d16269ce4cdaf79562a72a0f0440f98e746bc7f72319a7ca83ee57799ff2" href="../../证据/4526d16269ce4cdaf79562a72a0f0440f98e746bc7f72319a7ca83ee57799ff2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4526d16269ce</small></a><p>Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::Resize / 0x06000045</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="773c67a771f5e96be72770df726818a43b791fd7353b61f00c9e1e4b3943b415" href="../../证据/773c67a771f5e96be72770df726818a43b791fd7353b61f00c9e1e4b3943b415.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>773c67a771f5</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原msvcrt memcpy调用与运行期像素/裁剪/线程异常尚未执行验证，未把C#反编译签名当作新的native ABI恢复结论。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Resize的编译器生成Parallel.For闭包未在本轮独立CIL清单逐一列出；本事实依据所附离线反编译体和调用指令，未宣称所有并行分支等价。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OD06" id="OD06"><summary>OD06 · 一次共享映射访问退出 → 映射关闭与位图Unlock是不同保证</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>共享映射句柄/视图、临时fixed和WPF位图锁是三类不同资源。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>失败返回不自动清m_wbBitmap；源/目标引用仍可能存在。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本次using的Dispose有CIL finally支撑；位图Unlock仅正常路径见调用，异常分支仍是有限风险边界。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>GetImageBufferByFileNameDirectly的CIL有两个finally区域，对应using的ViewAccessor/MemoryMappedFile Dispose；正常路径在Resize/AddDirtyRect后执行bmp.Unlock。没有覆盖Lock→Resize→AddDirtyRect的Unlock finally。9参数Buffer路径同样没有异常处理区包住Lock/Unlock。因此映射能在异常退出时Dispose，不能据此断言位图必定解锁；捕获并返回null也不等于完成全部资源收尾。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>private unsafe byte[] GetImageBufferByFileNameDirectly(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9be8a72a77e4de440a1c94631834fd680d9ef2e6c9a89cec8f3226c968de3ce7" href="../../证据/9be8a72a77e4de440a1c94631834fd680d9ef2e6c9a89cec8f3226c968de3ce7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9be8a72a77e4</small></a><p>Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::GetImageBufferByFileNameDirectly / 0x0600003a</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e2e1198952d664aae0afa3b25643a85ce84bcc5bd010d1fb6c7c75086285ead7" href="../../证据/e2e1198952d664aae0afa3b25643a85ce84bcc5bd010d1fb6c7c75086285ead7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e2e1198952d6</small></a><p>Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::BuiltImageSourceA / 0x06000039</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3f75b53f4605f26d12e03c951345b410973e0d32bd4777053d27fa95495912e" href="../../证据/b3f75b53f4605f26d12e03c951345b410973e0d32bd4777053d27fa95495912e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3f75b53f460</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚未进行异常注入或原桌面运行，不能断言实际必现锁遗留或泄漏；这里只说明选定函数体没有异常解锁保证。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：生产者共享区的最终关闭、最后读者与操作系统映射对象最终销毁仍不在此证明范围。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OD07" id="OD07"><summary>OD07 · 转换器Clear / 控件ImageSourceChanged(null) → 只移除相应引用，旧对象还可被事件接收者持有</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>控件Source、转换器m_wbBitmap、ImageDataSource及事件接收者可能各自持有对象。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>Clear只清转换器位图引用；null源回调也不构成全图像缓存清空协议。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>受控的托管引用移除不等于FreeHGlobal或生产者释放；实际GC/原生最后读者必须另追。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Byte2ImageSource.Clear只把m_wbBitmap设为null，没有释放外部共享像素或清IImageData.Buffer。控件ImageSourceChanged在新图为空时清Source、尺寸并Init；随后仍把旧/新IImageData传给ImageSourceChangeEvent，再通知OnSetImageEnd。选定回调和默认初始化体没有对旧图调用Dispose，不能把界面清空解释为旧图所有引用和像素已退役。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>public void Clear()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2721a0b73fb94332603188378c9a4f67a16a0843978558f0abdad65573291cff" href="../../证据/2721a0b73fb94332603188378c9a4f67a16a0843978558f0abdad65573291cff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2721a0b73fb9</small></a><p>private static void ImageSourceChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957" href="../../证据/78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78da8122f616</small></a><p>public void Init()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\V