efdcf203" href="../../证据/040656f3dc5a6a00ff3bebbb663a6af19b3b156e1e8a8870e4e87348efdcf203.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>040656f3dc5a</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::IO_ValueChanged 0x060000e3</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0842678ceaa89565f00aaf9e8f22106673abbbe71f4168dc3d870f068a162606" href="../../证据/0842678ceaa89565f00aaf9e8f22106673abbbe71f4168dc3d870f068a162606.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0842678ceaa8</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::ClearValueStore 0x060000e4</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb2a9a8548ba93be0cedde69b6d36425c8643c771cdbd2c46343bee01fced370" href="../../证据/fb2a9a8548ba93be0cedde69b6d36425c8643c771cdbd2c46343bee01fced370.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb2a9a8548ba</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：GetValue的全部数据类型/索引/数组拼接语义与多个IO并发回调的原子性未由所选方法证明；不能从WeakEventManager推断像素已释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON02" id="ON02"><summary>ON02 · Object.FeatureNotifyValueChanged的特征到齐门 → FillImageValue → 带计数的ImageData载荷</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>多个特征 → 同一轮ImageData；创建包装对象不表示共享像素也复制了一份。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>固定Feature保留；新轮清非固定槽；对象Value字段与后续通知元组可以额外持有图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清Feature槽仅减少对应持有，不归还所有chunk/共享生产者缓冲。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>父Object在计数变化、首次计数或已收数为0时清非固定Feature槽并重置计数，然后保留本次Feature值引用。只有已收Feature数等于ValueStore.Length才NotifyValueChanged。图像填充从Image特征取chunk：共享模式保留地址名，非共享模式GetData取数组，赋给新ImageData的ImageBuffer/MemoryAddress并写宽高、格式、NeedCheckExecuteCount=true及ExecuteCount；输入已是ImageData时直接返回原对象。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>internal void FeatureNotifyValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f45a381c6c0730836cc136fe49d49c47c15c4c0809e1380c92586eba34c0ecd" href="../../证据/8f45a381c6c0730836cc136fe49d49c47c15c4c0809e1380c92586eba34c0ecd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f45a381c6c0</small></a><p>private object FillImageValue(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="571ca486fafd6290179d4ca8c98d04b093a59b140ef694403fd3aa0e64409199" href="../../证据/571ca486fafd6290179d4ca8c98d04b093a59b140ef694403fd3aa0e64409199.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>571ca486fafd</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::FeatureNotifyValueChanged 0x060001d8</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ac3ce88ed8b8042bb6fb0386a97bc70ddf990a68c307009186c8062e4b6bd87" href="../../证据/8ac3ce88ed8b8042bb6fb0386a97bc70ddf990a68c307009186c8062e4b6bd87.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ac3ce88ed8b</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::FillImageValue 0x060001e0</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="034720684b7a763cdd8e72aa90ab2e660c370de501184b832be2ce256b61275f" href="../../证据/034720684b7a763cdd8e72aa90ab2e660c370de501184b832be2ce256b61275f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>034720684b7a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：特征计数门不证明原生生产者写入与读取之间有完整帧租约；GetImageValue主动拉取是另一分支，不套用此通知门。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON03" id="ON03"><summary>ON03 · Object.NotifyValueChanged → 双数组通知队列 → 后台OnValueChanged分发</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Tuple持Object与事件，事件Value持ImageData；传递是引用包装，不是隔离像素快照。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>双数组和Object.value是不同持有者；队列满的分支不代表Object.value被清。接收长度检查在锁外，不声称完整并发队列合同。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>正常发送后清该发送槽；只减少队列持有，Object.value、显示仓库和消费者仍可继续持有图像。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>NotifyValueChanged先将FillValue返回值赋给Object.value，再以同一value引用构造RenderDataEventArgs，连同Object包装Tuple。静态构造建立两个各1000槽的object[]；接收计数小于1000时入队，满时此体不入队，也没有本体补发循环，最后仍重置已收Feature计数。后台线程交换发送/接收数组，逐项调用OnValueChanged，再在正常返回后把已发送槽设null、更新发送计数，并Sleep(3)。这条通知路径会跨越一次异步排队，不是同步直接把原生回调显示到控件。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>internal void NotifyValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2016f40b061e71dab3d0937c31dc541634852396004de04f33d0743557be88c3" href="../../证据/2016f40b061e71dab3d0937c31dc541634852396004de04f33d0743557be88c3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2016f40b061e</small></a><p>static Object()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="25e529fe11071cc89c26b311351f8a110792c1ba86c0f5adbadcf37bcb17e33c" href="../../证据/25e529fe11071cc89c26b311351f8a110792c1ba86c0f5adbadcf37bcb17e33c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>25e529fe1107</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::NotifyValueChanged 0x060001db</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6f3b84c19dc36d1220cfd6faee32ef82e17bcc1baf4b0e905871cd35b550e79" href="../../证据/d6f3b84c19dc36d1220cfd6faee32ef82e17bcc1baf4b0e905871cd35b550e79.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6f3b84c19dc</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::.cctor 0x060001d0</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="273c17e23a7f34429bb7978817edcb3c4344a59cbd7d34784f9d390ab151161f" href="../../证据/273c17e23a7f34429bb7978817edcb3c4344a59cbd7d34784f9d390ab151161f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>273c17e23a7f</small></a><p>.&lt;>c::&lt;.cctor>b__13_0 0x06001024</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="419ff5f1ba8c5ed57ef791d778e845fcb41770f34d7fa4292d2f6274f6a5504a" href="../../证据/419ff5f1ba8c5ed57ef791d778e845fcb41770f34d7fa4292d2f6274f6a5504a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>419ff5f1ba8c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：线程while(true)的完整关闭/Join及宿主退出协议尚未闭合；不能依据后台线程标记推断通知已经排空。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：只确认入队和发送的本体顺序；队列积压、超过1000项的实际丢通知与并发时序未运行注入。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON04" id="ON04"><summary>ON04 · ObjectBase.OnValueChanged / Object.ClearValueStore → 事件接收与聚合清理各有边界</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>事件args.Value、Object.value、Feature.ValueStore与队列Tuple不是同一个持有位置。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清聚合容器不撤销队列中既有引用；数据仓与UI的执行计数门需沿后续链核对。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>仅清引用/重建标记；未在本体回收所有ImageData像素或原生共享资源。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ObjectBase.OnValueChanged调用ValueChanged(this,args)，事件处理异常被该体捕获并记录。Object.ClearValueStore先把临时value替换成新List&lt;object>并清valueExecuteCount，再清非固定Feature槽并要求Feature下轮重建；没有逐图像Dispose。Clear并不会修改已经入队的RenderDataEventArgs.Value，因此旧通知在没有其它门阻止时仍可能继续被接收。接收方仍须按其自己的owner/计数/忙碌门决定入仓与呈现。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>internal void OnValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="56b33bf756cbf1d1c48606f952cbb2c1358904881251c1354c8c547dcc63b071" href="../../证据/56b33bf756cbf1d1c48606f952cbb2c1358904881251c1354c8c547dcc63b071.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>56b33bf756cb</small></a><p>internal override void ClearTempValue()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3447f3a7f9cb7bb54779fae8e0a8e6fc25ef6df7a96eeb8bbf03d20545a494ce" href="../../证据/3447f3a7f9cb7bb54779fae8e0a8e6fc25ef6df7a96eeb8bbf03d20545a494ce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3447f3a7f9cb</small></a><p>public void ClearValueStore()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0418005d0b222840ef02cf08de56542075d1e4bfc685465ce919c8185c47fa1b" href="../../证据/0418005d0b222840ef02cf08de56542075d1e4bfc685465ce919c8185c47fa1b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0418005d0b22</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.ObjectBase::OnValueChanged 0x06000133</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e74d3a2f1bff9f5f819e3a3d12fc9ea445caf3070defc67ad67b89208a5f3ba7" href="../../证据/e74d3a2f1bff9f5f819e3a3d12fc9ea445caf3070defc67ad67b89208a5f3ba7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e74d3a2f1bff</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::ClearValueStore 0x060001dd</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="351b401031a60718ade58c9b27583f10ce7f4ac08e4cee1929b1e62389f60749" href="../../证据/351b401031a60718ade58c9b27583f10ce7f4ac08e4cee1929b1e62389f60749.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>351b401031a6</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：某一处理器异常对多订阅者分发的具体影响、日志处理自身失败和所有订阅者的生命周期仍需另证；不把异常被记录等同全部处理成功。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB01" id="RB01"><summary>RB01 · 选中图像的Apps.XmlParser.Object.ValueChanged → RenderControlBase.P_ValueChanged局部图像仓库</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>事件携带ValueEventArgs.Value；传递图像对象引用，没有在所选事件接入与存储体内复制像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>选项改变更新订阅对象；选中背景图和输入图分两个键。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>解除弱事件处理器与移除输出过滤不是释放图像像素；对象可能仍被控件、列表或其它消费者持有。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>RenderControlBase.InitRenderControl创建DisplayImageListDecorator，ParentUI=this。该decorator在SelectedImage/SelectedInputImage变更时，从旧DisplayObject解除ValueChanged，再对新图像Object添加ParentUI.P_ValueChanged处理器并设置输出过滤。接收回调的控件随后把选中图像值保留在自己的tempImageStore。这是RenderControlBase专属静态路径，不是RenderDataCenter仓库的别名。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>private void InitRenderControl(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92f2d19cba44892275615eda06bd3932e18ab9ce914b565c39aea2808e6976b8" href="../../证据/92f2d19cba44892275615eda06bd3932e18ab9ce914b565c39aea2808e6976b8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92f2d19cba44</small></a><p>public ImageViewItem SelectedImage</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c681eeb8817d81ef867c9e33280883316e3846cb1774336b25aeb24903f7f1a8" href="../../证据/c681eeb8817d81ef867c9e33280883316e3846cb1774336b25aeb24903f7f1a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c681eeb8817d</small></a><p>public ImageViewItem SelectedInputImage</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f243556546a40b4ed76d4c91a548387628da7cb233c4d7b42464a4fa6ea8d866" href="../../证据/f243556546a40b4ed76d4c91a548387628da7cb233c4d7b42464a4fa6ea8d866.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f243556546a4</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.DisplayImageListDecorator::set_SelectedImage / 0x0600085d</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="93a14ee9fee8f82c8fa82ee24da57e3133451af82227e099f164a27964cf8fbe" href="../../证据/93a14ee9fee8f82c8fa82ee24da57e3133451af82227e099f164a27964cf8fbe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>93a14ee9fee8</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.DisplayImageListDecorator::set_SelectedInputImage / 0x06000866</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5771f8f6bbf4e32e50a458edadade3a3d06133360e41cee2aae7c06a15691206" href="../../证据/5771f8f6bbf4e32e50a458edadade3a3d06133360e41cee2aae7c06a15691206.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5771f8f6bbf4</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原生生产者到ValueEventArgs.Value的同一帧生命周期、每次回调的运行期实例归属仍需生产端证据。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：普通模块配置视图是否实际选择此RenderControlBase实例，要由宿主装配/运行证据另行确认。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB02" id="RB02"><summary>RB02 · P_ValueChanged的image/pixelinfoimage分支 → SelectedImage / SelectedInputImage直接引用赋值</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Dictionary&lt;string,object>只保存Value引用；读取时再as Apps.Data.ImageData。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>同键覆盖旧引用；ExecuteCount跟随接收事件更新，不构成完整代次隔离保证。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>覆盖仅撤销该字典的一份旧引用；没有图像.Dispose或像素Free。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>P_ValueChanged先在计数不同的情况下直接更新ExecuteCount，再在ValueType为image或pixelinfoimage且sender为Apps.XmlParser.Object时加_imageslock。若sender是当前背景或输入图的DisplayObject，直接将e2.Value赋给tempImageStore相应键；不按执行计数在这个接收体内拒绝旧值。非图像对象另进入tempShapeStore，不与图像字节共用一个结构。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>internal void P_ValueChanged(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="327728e0ad69fbc9d4477e48fc4470c8a86910ac6e31c392166293f88495895b" href="../../证据/327728e0ad69fbc9d4477e48fc4470c8a86910ac6e31c392166293f88495895b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>327728e0ad69</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::P_ValueChanged / 0x0600033d</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="83d11bcdab93a9327f6b3904a00227f2451b995f8135ef1fd7c2552ea56da72a" href="../../证据/83d11bcdab93a9327f6b3904a00227f2451b995f8135ef1fd7c2552ea56da72a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>83d11bcdab93</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不得从锁保护字典推断源ImageData.Buffer、共享映射或ValueEventArgs内部像素线程安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：多计数回调乱序与生产端DataSendFinish标志的真实时序未执行确认。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB03" id="RB03"><summary>RB03 · UpdateRender读取tempImageStore → 同一个ImageData进入ImageDataSource及清仓条件</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>同一个ImageData引用：回调仓库 → 局部变量 → CLR属性；所选方法没有new ImageData/Clone/像素复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>消费仓库键不等于释放属性所持图像；相同引用不触发这个分支的重新赋值。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>SelectedImage置null或SelectedInputImage.Remove只清仓库持有；ImageDataSource/绑定目标可继续持有。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>UpdateRender把SelectedImage键取出的对象as ImageData，与当前ImageDataSource作引用比较。只有不同才进入更新；若为空且选中Object.Owner.ExecuteCount等于控件ExecuteCount，才用obj.GetValue(uint.MaxValue)回退取值。然后把imageData（包括null）直接赋给ImageDataSource；若仓库有SelectedImage键，在锁中把该键置null并返回。相同引用时不重设背景图，而可能处理SelectedInputImage并移除该键。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>private void UpdateRender(uint excuteCount)</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="90ceb9d57b5daab1626792612edd997589a594700d643b732479fae98f3bf0d9" href="../../证据/90ceb9d57b5daab1626792612edd997589a594700d643b732479fae98f3bf0d9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>90ceb9d57b5d</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::UpdateRender / 0x06000340</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ddf7b896b41d037711230671eaef69b5009af6320e587375b3e55bda4a555ed5" href="../../证据/ddf7b896b41d037711230671eaef69b5009af6320e587375b3e55bda4a555ed5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ddf7b896b41d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：GetValue回退体属于另一取值路径；这里不保证其返回的对象来自同一个回调批次或原生buffer。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：相同ImageData对象而内部Buffer发生变化的刷新策略，不能仅凭引用比较推成自动重新呈现。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB04" id="RB04"><summary>RB04 · UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute → 自执行的替换/空图/回退与图形异步分支</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>此方法仍然是图像引用转交；图形更新调度另用tempShapeStore/tempImageStore。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>成功替换清整个临时图仓，空图与同引用路径按不同条件继续；不是统一FIFO。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Clear临时字典不回收仍被ImageDataSource、图形扩展或事件持有的数据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>自执行更新先从SelectedImage取对象：非null且不同引用时赋ImageDataSource，并在锁中清整个tempImageStore后返回；若空图且选中DisplayValue是IVmIO、Owner等于此次moduleSource且当前属性非null，则赋null。否则仅在当前ImageDataSource为空且选中对象GetValue(uint.MaxValue)返回ImageData时赋回退图；其余情况Dispatcher.BeginInvoke更新图形。它与普通UpdateRender的清仓和空图条件不同，不能合并为“每轮总会清图”。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>private void UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b28da2a627f8f7ec606323cb563949e11876812ddc2e3fac68690979dbab9b9c" href="../../证据/b28da2a627f8f7ec606323cb563949e11876812ddc2e3fac68690979dbab9b9c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b28da2a627f8</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute / 0x06000341</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e0125a6e065ccbe440bfeab0c6f299e2199c0de9e39d0dee1f0b123bdb75387c" href="../../证据/e0125a6e065ccbe440bfeab0c6f299e2199c0de9e39d0dee1f0b123bdb75387c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e0125a6e065c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：编译器生成Dispatcher回调及所有图形消费/异常路径未在本次独立CIL清单逐个展开；不把异步调度当作完整排空保证。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：自执行原生模块标志和原机实际回调到达顺序未运行证实。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB05" id="RB05"><summary>RB05 · ImageDataSource CLR属性通知 + 原BAML绑定 → 该RenderControlBase中的VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox.ImageDataSource</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>源CLR getter返回的同一对象，经声明的WPF绑定交给目标IImageData依赖属性；这是静态值传递关系，不是新像素所有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>setter引用相同不发本属性变更；绑定目标、源字段和转换器缓存可分别持有对象。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>源setter和BAML绑定不含源像素释放；后续位图转换/共享映射读取应沿OD01–OD07另追。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ImageDataSource getter返回imageDataSource字段；setter仅在引用不同时替换字段并OnPropertyChanged(&quot;ImageDataSource&quot;)。OnPropertyChanged直接发PropertyChanged事件。原rendercontrolbase.baml离线解码的根Name=us，其imagecontrol别名明确指向VMBaseControls程序集；Name=imageView的ImageViewBox把目标ImageDataSource绑定到ElementName=us的ImageDataSource，imageViewIn则绑ImageDataSourceIn，没有声明转换器或图像克隆操作。InitializeComponent的原CIL加载/VMControls.WPF;component/rendercontrolbase.xaml，将静态资源声明、源属性和目标控件对齐。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>return imageDataSource;</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8e173b10abaab941dec4c5f07e061d850c5f57df81a51acbbee5ee06d204fc65" href="../../证据/8e173b10abaab941dec4c5f07e061d850c5f57df81a51acbbee5ee06d204fc65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8e173b10abaa</small></a><p>if (imageDataSource != value)</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="974a05401d01878abbeba6f7f4d171fc83bb518ebca0beeb874afa77c7fb711d" href="../../证据/974a05401d01878abbeba6f7f4d171fc83bb518ebca0beeb874afa77c7fb711d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>974a05401d01</small></a><p>public virtual void OnPropertyChanged(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b4b1c6887da489b35586d22bd302bc682ed4755a32c99e81b22224515ffdcfcd" href="../../证据/b4b1c6887da489b35586d22bd302bc682ed4755a32c99e81b22224515ffdcfcd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b4b1c6887da4</small></a><p>原BAML根类/元素名/目标程序集</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="45ba697afb9559bf97cbbc617c26772aea99f232ce8560028adaa06310ba0b28" href="../../证据/45ba697afb9559bf97cbbc617c26772aea99f232ce8560028adaa06310ba0b28.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>45ba697afb95</small></a><p>原BAML背景图绑定</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="315c4b956faaaf9847e295494bba39748eaf54f550308b2cb66d1e53d8caaa94" href="../../证据/315c4b956faaaf9847e295494bba39748eaf54f550308b2cb66d1e53d8caaa94.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>315c4b956faa</small></a><p>原BAML输入图绑定</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0bd7f4d80321755658b1a25f2bc3d52e9f79317280566c89bcecf7c82d93b4f1" href="../../证据/0bd7f4d80321755658b1a25f2bc3d52e9f79317280566c89bcecf7c82d93b4f1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0bd7f4d80321</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::set_ImageDataSource / 0x06000330</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f00487433b34144c6e882b01826bbbc75946d4ad3826bee2b155b3eb2af66590" href="../../证据/f00487433b34144c6e882b01826bbbc75946d4ad3826bee2b155b3eb2af66590.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f00487433b34</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::InitializeComponent / 0x0600039f</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="039b9668191e21cad2dd9cf8f0964c7acce0df59cd29ca3a9a3bd52851ce5ab4" href="../../证据/039b9668191e21cad2dd9cf8f0964c7acce0df59cd29ca3a9a3bd52851ce5ab4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>039b9668191e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：已闭合RenderControlBase这条静态声明/成员链；不等于WPF运行时绑定成功、活动实例、Dispatcher线程或原桌面画面已验证。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ModuleResultView使用m_CurrentInfo.ImageDataSource和RenderDataCenter，是另一个宿主/仓库链，不能串接为本链上游。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB06" id="RB06"><summary>RB06 · 图像选择清空 / ClearImageView / DeInitRenderControl → 临时仓库和显示引用退役分开</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>控件属性、临时字典、图像列表和事件订阅分别持有或关联对象。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清空选择与更换模块走不同退役入口；DeInit本身不证明所有显示引用都清空。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>装饰器Dispose负责其列表/事件；没有因此证明共享内存生产者或WPF位图已最终销毁。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged在SelectedValue为空时清扩展图形、ShapeList、初始化imageView并将ImageDataSource=null；ClearImageView主图分支也经UpdateImageView(null)清背景引用。DeInitRenderControl则解除显示对象事件/过滤，ModuleParams=null，Dispose图像列表装饰器并分别在锁中清tempImageStore/tempShapeStore，解绑renderStatusModule并减SubscribeCount。该方法没有把ImageDataSource置null，也没有逐图像Dispose，故仓库反初始化、UI清空和原生像素释放不能当作同一个动作。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>private void imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab65074ed2ac677a753c19c00fefc1dbe8919aeeb2ea365da4fa1e1f9d9e34e3" href="../../证据/ab65074ed2ac677a753c19c00fefc1dbe8919aeeb2ea365da4fa1e1f9d9e34e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab65074ed2ac</small></a><p>public void ClearImageView(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a><p>private void UpdateImageView(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5379587232315e1f33543cbba588658f77897de9d75ee679c24419648fc8651f" href="../../证据/5379587232315e1f33543cbba588658f77897de9d75ee679c24419648fc8651f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>537958723231</small></a><p>private void DeInitRenderControl(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd54f79e142f125a655c4d07e9310e85bb8a245d4d63a47aebeeec9d3c7ab8cc" href="../../证据/bd54f79e142f125a655c4d07e9310e85bb8a245d4d63a47aebeeec9d3c7ab8cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd54f79e142f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：所有Unloaded/模块更换/异常路径是否在飞任务排空后才释放仍未闭合；不从Dispose名称推断最后读者结束。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：源ImageData、imageView内部转换器位图和图形扩展的最终持有者仍须分别核对。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB07" id="RB07"><summary>RB07 · imageView.OnSetImageEnd状态通知 → 失败时不继续提交图形/输入图，卸载仅退委托</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>背景图转换完成状态 → 回调 → 图形/输入图是独立更新边界。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>失败返回可留下尚未消费的临时条目；不能假设每次完成事件都清完整仓库。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Unloaded退委托不等于取消此前Task.Run/Dispatcher任务，也不释放源像素。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Loaded为背景imageView安装OnSetImageEnd和OnFreshExtendContent委托；Unloaded仅退掉这两个委托。imageView_OnSetImageEnd若msg能解析为false则直接返回；否则先UpdateShapesWithCallBackData，再在双图模式且存在SelectedInputImage时把该引用赋ImageDataSourceIn并移除临时键。状态通知影响图像之后的形状/输入图处理，不等于统一原子提交，也不保证失败时旧显示对象已释放。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>private void RenderControlBase_Loaded(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02dcdec672a78167a1b0c819c237287e2fd11dabcecb00ceb468c16096457675" href="../../证据/02dcdec672a78167a1b0c819c237287e2fd11dabcecb00ceb468c16096457675.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02dcdec672a7</small></a><p>private void RenderControlBase_Unloaded(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d" href="../../证据/e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e39cf2e044e0</small></a><p>private void imageView_OnSetImageEnd(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="94d06db87343b11b91d31d139f7f727b13993f6a4c0852b93e137ef0cf923f75" href="../../证据/94d06db87343b11b91d31d139f7f727b13993f6a4c0852b93e137ef0cf923f75.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>94d06db87343</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::imageView_OnSetImageEnd / 0x06000342</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2aa5d7a69c56108514759a2fa8b1c15020c692d77b62d1b1a22eb11d70eecf38" href="../../证据/2aa5d7a69c56108514759a2fa8b1c15020c692d77b62d1b1a22eb11d70eecf38.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2aa5d7a69c56</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：整个图像、文字、形状、双图的同一计数/同帧原子呈现仍未证明；原模块执行异常与映射busy错误不统一为一条失败合同。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS01" id="RS01"><summary>RS01 · ModuleResultView.ModuleSource → ModuleDisplayDecorator → m_CurrentInfo.ImageDataSource → ImageViewBox.ImageDataSource声明</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>装饰器object字段持有ImageData引用；ImageViewBox为另一依赖属性持有者。绑定声明不等于本机活实例绑定已执行。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>当前装饰器随ModuleSource重建；同一个ImageData对象重复赋值不通知，不能用每次setter推断每帧都建立新图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>setter不释放旧像素，也不调用旧图像Dispose；模块切换的Dispose/清视图另由RS05逐步说明。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ModuleResultView的ModuleSource变化经DoSourceChanged释放旧装饰器、清数据仓库，再建立DecorateSource=newValue且ParentUI=this的ModuleDisplayDecorator并Init；resultGrid与localImageGrid使用该装饰器上下文。ImageDataSource的setter仅比较object引用、赋给imageDataSource字段并通知属性变化，没有复制像素。原moduleresultview.baml离线输出中，imageView显式绑定m_CurrentInfo.ImageDataSource，imageViewIn绑定ImageDataSourceIn；InitializeComponent包含该资源LoadComponent入口。这是主模块结果视图自己的显示链，不可误串到RenderControlBase。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>private void DoSourceChanged(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61" href="../../证据/6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6a0665aa30cc</small></a><p>if (imageDataSource != value)</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f0acf11a33139a29834c8f9aa4a4b60a480fb748d3f4c78da8dec873310001ff" href="../../证据/f0acf11a33139a29834c8f9aa4a4b60a480fb748d3f4c78da8dec873310001ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f0acf11a3313</small></a><p>Name=&quot;imageView&quot; Margin=&quot;1&quot;</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="28337d2f103fc2983f7cac75c560eefdd1aec63b851b06307bfa9c3bd652e14f" href="../../证据/28337d2f103fc2983f7cac75c560eefdd1aec63b851b06307bfa9c3bd652e14f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>28337d2f103f</small></a><p>Name=&quot;imageViewIn&quot; Margin=&quot;1&quot;</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="50a03f526926bc18545374771cb198d43225c2f716c2e34c6229de83faca425c" href="../../证据/50a03f526926bc18545374771cb198d43225c2f716c2e34c6229de83faca425c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>50a03f526926</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::DoSourceChanged</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="42bcccb38e0fea961e7be61b49377e8a79cc1bf517e128cc100e13b85a1d580e" href="../../证据/42bcccb38e0fea961e7be61b49377e8a79cc1bf517e128cc100e13b85a1d580e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>42bcccb38e0f</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::set_ImageDataSource</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="623825664b4768b8dd52645b84e2838c903c3423aa2a18306e3b22abcf0cfaeb" href="../../证据/623825664b4768b8dd52645b84e2838c903c3423aa2a18306e3b22abcf0cfaeb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>623825664b47</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::InitializeComponent</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="267e045821dfbf8b9f464d46d2cfd7ebc23bd81f10bb9b217e68a59aef691f96" href="../../证据/267e045821dfbf8b9f464d46d2cfd7ebc23bd81f10bb9b217e68a59aef691f96.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>267e045821df</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：BAML载荷与离线XAML分别核hash；没有独立逐条验证全部原BAML语义或运行绑定。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：具体ImageData持有的Buffer/MemoryAddress如何显示由ImageViewBox/Byte2ImageSource继续消费，字段赋值本身不完成像素释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS02" id="RS02"><summary>RS02 · RenderDataCenter.SelectedImage缓存 → 模块回调/流程UpdateRender → 装饰器图像引用</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>缓存字典、回调局部变量、装饰器字段共享同一个ImageData对象；所选写入/读取未逐像素复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>SelectedImage键来自当前选中的DisplayObject；BeforeExchange/Exchange与OwnerProcessID、执行计数相关，未成功渲染还可ClearDisplayStore。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>交换/清字典与装饰器/显示控件引用退出是不同动作；清缓存不能证明已经显示的位图或图像字段被清掉。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>RenderDataCenter.SetImageToStore将ValueEventArgs.Value as ImageData直接保存在SelectedImage键，并可能原地写Tag=SelectedImage.DisplayName；TryGetImage仅从displayImageStore返回引用。ModuleResultView自执行回调在忙/渲染门后BeforeExchange，再排到Dispatcher，Exchange指定OwnerProcessID/ExecuteCount并取SelectedImage；自执行分支还比较image.Tag与当前SelectedImage.DisplayName，然后赋ImageDataSource或交ResultViewAddition。流程UpdateRender则在工作线程与UI Dispatcher两处比较捕获的moduleDecorator是否仍为m_CurrentInfo后赋图；没有在此分支复用自执行的同一Tag比较。两条来源不得合并为一个无条件赋值。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>private void SetImageToStore(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fc1e0d9c45ec53bbac232419d5cee3166703289cc6a2d3f689dd90a73c5127b5" href="../../证据/fc1e0d9c45ec53bbac232419d5cee3166703289cc6a2d3f689dd90a73c5127b5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fc1e0d9c45ec</small></a><p>public bool TryGetImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="115e8f144e2ccbfc661e4d080956a03545ebde28e6a20fa8a9e59e6e642c9705" href="../../证据/115e8f144e2ccbfc661e4d080956a03545ebde28e6a20fa8a9e59e6e642c9705.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>115e8f144e2c</small></a><p>public void OnModuleCallBackArrived(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e80cb8ac689ad01a53a54e14d5df6835ca3cb2c4b5bb3166e7109d75c5760c22" href="../../证据/e80cb8ac689ad01a53a54e14d5df6835ca3cb2c4b5bb3166e7109d75c5760c22.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e80cb8ac689a</small></a><p>private void UpdateRender(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f8e34f3ffb35f44563bb635c90afd10be7f9b2785100182d459480a522fff6b" href="../../证据/9f8e34f3ffb35f44563bb635c90afd10be7f9b2785100182d459480a522fff6b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f8e34f3ffb3</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::OnModuleCallBackArrived</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11f695bd82dc1b85082921702be42f527939ba8334287e7b12c9a345ab5be59c" href="../../证据/11f695bd82dc1b85082921702be42f527939ba8334287e7b12c9a345ab5be59c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11f695bd82dc</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::UpdateRender</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="febb959e20a1bcf4b686f12bc79bfd7a7532c34b6ec3bf2109afdf63e3c09bec" href="../../证据/febb959e20a1bcf4b686f12bc79bfd7a7532c34b6ec3bf2109afdf63e3c09bec.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>febb959e20a1</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::TryGetImage</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed5d6808b925aa23a569b696273187cedc04901dd76a73529ef2b8797663e41d" href="../../证据/ed5d6808b925aa23a569b696273187cedc04901dd76a73529ef2b8797663e41d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed5d6808b925</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：部分真正赋值位于编译器闭包；本次新CIL清单记录入口体，闭包相关原CIL另见已存render-store证据；不声称所有排队回调与当前选择在原机均已实测。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ResultViewAddition可改写显示路径，不能把插件扩展路径视为普通ImageDataSource赋值同义。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS03" id="RS03"><summary>RS03 · 图像下拉选择 / 主动刷新 → SelectedImage.DisplayObject.GetValue → UpdateImageView</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>选择身份ImageViewItem/DisplayObject与实际GetValue返回的ImageData分离；curImageData是视图的又一持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>自执行缓存无图的fallback另要求所选DisplayValue是当前ModuleSource拥有的IVmIO；流程UpdateRender fallback不具有完全相同Owner谓词。主动刷新读取计数门也与回调计数门不同。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>无选中值时选择处理会UpdateImageView(null)清显示；无效尺寸/格式可ClearImage或被ResultViewAddition接管，不代表原数据对象已销毁。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原图像下拉ItemsSource=ImageViewList、SelectedItem双向绑定SelectedImage、SelectedValuePath=DisplayObject，SelectionChanged进imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged。SelectedImage setter解除旧DisplayObject输出过滤与ValueChanged订阅，再为新对象SetOutputFilter/订阅，写renderDataCenter.SelectedImage并通知属性。选择处理最终调用UpdateModuleViewResultShow：按IsClearLastExecuteResult选择ExecuteCount或uint.MaxValue，优先对选中DisplayObject.GetValue；若没有选中项则取显示声明中首个image/pixelinfoimage对象；再清图形并UpdateImageView。后者普通分支赋装饰器与curImageData，同一引用无像素克隆。该拉取分支可在回调缓存没有SelectedImage图像时补取，不能只画回调字典一条通道。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>ItemsSource=&quot;{Binding ImageViewList}&quot;</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c22ff970d66a98ca9db37490c233b89ff86e42464f40b16e02e4678fe42bfeb9" href="../../证据/c22ff970d66a98ca9db37490c233b89ff86e42464f40b16e02e4678fe42bfeb9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c22ff970d66a</small></a><p>public ImageViewItem SelectedImage</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5da447c8ac2c14445f5446789bfafc5ffc83ac37f506c214ac9301ab5813c1ef" href="../../证据/5da447c8ac2c14445f5446789bfafc5ffc83ac37f506c214ac9301ab5813c1ef.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5da447c8ac2c</small></a><p>private void imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8678ebcd100f40b4faac4d74ccccdd63c8c2244dc75decfbed1b4b9fea00ced4" href="../../证据/8678ebcd100f40b4faac4d74ccccdd63c8c2244dc75decfbed1b4b9fea00ced4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8678ebcd100f</small></a><p>public void UpdateModuleViewResultShow(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="52d605365dcecb0512b9900e53fcab00d970d3bdcdc2be29c4204710bc4a0a32" href="../../证据/52d605365dcecb0512b9900e53fcab00d970d3bdcdc2be29c4204710bc4a0a32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>52d605365dce</small></a><p>public void UpdateImageView(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a7b728ea00d86d97c83a73e2f53a58c9e9487132e2eaa7b5289bc5906151887e" href="../../证据/a7b728ea00d86d97c83a73e2f53a58c9e9487132e2eaa7b5289bc5906151887e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a7b728ea00d8</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::set_SelectedImage</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e7fa272da9003eceeaa55fb29efe63dcb9539e4faf409f27de5cb94ec0814273" href="../../证据/e7fa272da9003eceeaa55fb29efe63dcb9539e4faf409f27de5cb94ec0814273.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e7fa272da900</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::UpdateModuleViewResultShow</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb13acea8d82a057f710ca10ca5ca475fe619b2a1241493de2bae8c0b6e48ba0" href="../../证据/bb13acea8d82a057f710ca10ca5ca475fe619b2a1241493de2bae8c0b6e48ba0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb13acea8d82</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::UpdateImageView</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3032b3a9affc43d99b7887f310562d3c281ca978f2523cebba3d78b7272d41f" href="../../证据/b3032b3a9affc43d99b7887f310562d3c281ca978f2523cebba3d78b7272d41f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3032b3a9aff</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：本报告未把抽象“取图”虚构为名为getImage的已定位成员；实际调用是Object.GetValue、RenderDataCenter.TryGetImage等。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：此处不重新证明每个原生图像生产者到Object.GetValue的所有分支；已有ImageData返回与共享内存桥接证据单列。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS04" id="RS04"><summary>RS04 · 模块结果树的行点击/刷新 → SelectedItemPath与DisplayValue更新；不是图像下拉选择</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>树持有模块/IO及显示值投影；SelectedItemPath是字符串路径，不是ImageData。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>ResultData是装饰器持有的结果树根集合；RefreshResultTree不在此体内缓存图像或建立独立像素历史。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清ResultData移除树根引用；不等价ClearImage，也不代表原IO结果载荷或显示位图释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原moduleresultview BAML离线输出把resultTreeView.ItemsSource绑定到ResultData，模块模板展开Outputs，VmIO模板展开Children；ModuleDisplayDecorator.Init把当前模块加进ResultData。其合并的ModuleViewStyle资源在行MouseLeftButtonDown触发SelectedCommand，SelectedCommandExecute只读取FullName、去掉%字符并设置SelectedItemPath，没有调用GetValue、UpdateImageView或改变SelectedImage。RefreshResultTree仅在模块结果树Tab被选且ModuleSource存在时，对指定类型叶IO触发DisplayValue属性通知。因此结果树点击、树值刷新、图像下拉选择是三个不同入口，不能从“点了结果树”推定切换了主图。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>&lt;TreeView Name=&quot;resultTreeView&quot;</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3c4b7a080ce08a9c62251d9a1b667655c8cd7b57f3ca388dd2260fbf13395017" href="../../证据/3c4b7a080ce08a9c62251d9a1b667655c8cd7b57f3ca388dd2260fbf13395017.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3c4b7a080ce0</small></a><p>HierarchicalDataTemplate x:Key=&quot;{DataTemplateKey {x:Type VMCore:VmModule}}&quot;</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ce2601460209069df31b6c9d52c3c6c6198fe3c4c877f8a3e792a2b33ed15b8" href="../../证据/0ce2601460209069df31b6c9d52c3c6c6198fe3c4c877f8a3e792a2b33ed15b8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ce260146020</small></a><p>&lt;i:EventTrigger EventName=&quot;MouseLeftButtonDown&quot;></p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="28761ff5327ff8c9c266f55948fbf9f56ba7171d0bfdf9a29188516e3f6002b5" href="../../证据/28761ff5327ff8c9c266f55948fbf9f56ba7171d0bfdf9a29188516e3f6002b5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>28761ff5327f</small></a><p>private void SelectedCommandExecute(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b7b17d179a1c56b1a9908e6175eca43ea0faa23e61f630bc8a9ac59c94c8e229" href="../../证据/b7b17d179a1c56b1a9908e6175eca43ea0faa23e61f630bc8a9ac59c94c8e229.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b7b17d179a1c</small></a><p>ResultData.Add(vmModule);</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="df047f54bf382434dff6604d2e105793367c8709e2232888c6f91cb36bad948d" href="../../证据/df047f54bf382434dff6604d2e105793367c8709e2232888c6f91cb36bad948d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>df047f54bf38</small></a><p>public void RefreshResultTree()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9f7e9c6bedbe30bc175b20d4fb988508e69f44f99f82b18bd7190326b9e6c2f" href="../../证据/c9f7e9c6bedbe30bc175b20d4fb988508e69f44f99f82b18bd7190326b9e6c2f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9f7e9c6bedb</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::SelectedCommandExecute</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="810ba2505ab0d196562acd8354f1d37db9128463d545330a79223d5a4d95066e" href="../../证据/810ba2505ab0d196562acd8354f1d37db9128463d545330a79223d5a4d95066e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>810ba2505ab0</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::RefreshResultTree</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="afceaa271d39ce95d4daf2a3082684cdfcfaf9728a596488a92d5e8cbd3f9af2" href="../../证据/afceaa271d39ce95d4daf2a3082684cdfcfaf9728a596488a92d5e8cbd3f9af2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>afceaa271d39</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：结果树样式载荷已独立离线提取并与旧本地XAML核同hash；仍不证明活树Template/事件已在原机命中。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它插件/自定义结果控件可能提供额外图像操作，不能据所选通用树否定所有自定义行为。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS05" id="RS05"><summary>RS05 · 模块切换 / OwnerWin_Closed / 装饰器Dispose → 清图像字段、退订事件、清缓存与原始像素寿命分列</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>装饰器、视图curImageData、ImageViewBox依赖属性、数据中心字典和显示位图是不同持有层；断开这些引用的时间点并非一个。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>切模块释放旧装饰器并建新装饰器；Owner窗口关闭触发置ModuleSource为空；ResultViewAddition扩展仍有独立清理行为。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清图像字段/集合与DeInit是可见收尾步骤，最后原生读者、GC回收和WPF位图内部资源释放仍须另证；不据Dispose名称宣称无泄漏或绝对安全。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OwnerWin_Closed把ModuleSource设null，普通模块切换DoSourceChanged会Dispose旧m_CurrentInfo并置null。装饰器Dispose退订流程/模块、输入和显示对象事件，在Dispatcher调用ParentUI.ClearModuleView，再清dataRecords/ShapeList/ResultData、DeInitImageList、停RecordTimer并RenderDataCenter.DeInit。ClearModuleView调用UpdateImageView(null)，普通校验分支进ClearImage，将装饰器.ImageDataSource与curImageData置null；同时清图形/数据网格/图层。上述选定方法没有逐像素Free、共享内存映射释放或ImageData.Dispose调用，因此只能证明各自持有/订阅退出，不能据此断言所有原生像素或已生成位图立即释放。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>private void OwnerWin_Closed(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea" href="../../证据/77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77eba1381c18</small></a><p>private void DoSourceChanged(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61" href="../../证据/6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6a0665aa30cc</small></a><p>public void Dispose()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459" href="../../证据/3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3aa76a52b393</small></a><p>public void ClearModuleView()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc" href="../../证据/58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58bb804df3e5</small></a><p>public void ClearImage()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7" href="../../证据/0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0238d62ec541</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::Dispose</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab" href="../../证据/2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b50786594b4</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::ClearImage</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe" href="../../证据/07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07ec8671b645</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::OwnerWin_Closed</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88" href="../../证据/f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8931fd1ab77</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ResultViewAddition.CheckUpdateImageView/OnModuleCallBackArrived可改变清空/呈现分支，扩展组件全部行为未闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未确认原程序关闭/切换时所有异步工作、消费者与native buffer的最后读者；不得声称本次做过原机内存回收验收。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF01" id="IF01"><summary>IF01 · RenderControlBase自执行回调排队 → Task闭包保留控件/事件/sender，稍后才读当前状态</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Task/Dispatcher持有闭包，闭包持有控件与事件引用；图像至少可经控件稍后访问的临时仓库/属性间接可达，不是提交时复制一帧。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>OwnerProcessID、选图/临时仓库属于被捕获控件的当前字段；任务不是冻结后的全套来源快照。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>丢弃Task/Dispatcher返回句柄不取消工作；本方法未提供等待其结束后再退役控件/缓存的所有权协议。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OnModuleResultCallBackArrived仅在回调Value为bIsSelfExecute=1时考虑Task.Run；needUpdateRender=false时先清临时相关项并返回。实际排队的编译器闭包字段是valueEventArgs、&lt;>4__this、sender，没有一张独立ImageData快照。工作体开始后才从事件读取ExecuteCount，并经所捕获控件读取OwnerProcessID，while GetDataSendFinishState为true就Sleep(3)，结束再调用UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute(sender)。原CIL调用Task.Run(Action)后立即pop返回Task，没有在这个方法保存/await该句柄。另一个Dispatcher.BeginInvoke闭包同样保留该控件并在执行时选imageView/imageViewIn更新ROI。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>private void OnModuleResultCallBackArrived(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e1b45d06009250cd283fca06c30e99a87cfa48c2bf347576acca1e86e38a0342" href="../../证据/e1b45d06009250cd283fca06c30e99a87cfa48c2bf347576acca1e86e38a0342.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e1b45d060092</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0 captured fields</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="70a7534756244d48ba9e74bbbc77053ff3f5bb4913f7db73a9620250ad1ee4ce" href="../../证据/70a7534756244d48ba9e74bbbc77053ff3f5bb4913f7db73a9620250ad1ee4ce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>70a753475624</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::OnModuleResultCallBackArrived / 0x0600033e</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e016fdbeff470b28b74ca9d10181af859f1d887ddb637acf04f569d551ede71b" href="../../证据/e016fdbeff470b28b74ca9d10181af859f1d887ddb637acf04f569d551ede71b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e016fdbeff47</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0::&lt;OnModuleResultCallBackArrived>b__0 / 0x06000e3e</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f22e48a598591ec402123afe9c7bdbb7fc3f11b0e1e66eb565b4fb4eff7d3390" href="../../证据/f22e48a598591ec402123afe9c7bdbb7fc3f11b0e1e66eb565b4fb4eff7d3390.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f22e48a59859</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass54_0::&lt;OnModuleResultCallBackArrived>b__1 / 0x06000e3f</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="752cd891fba4394e3f6620dd7a7b516024ddd18c212b3b7576bd4a6c0b71a1ff" href="../../证据/752cd891fba4394e3f6620dd7a7b516024ddd18c212b3b7576bd4a6c0b71a1ff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>752cd891fba4</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚未运行原版乱序/切模块场景，不能从缺少本方法的取消句柄直接宣称实际必现过期显示或泄漏。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：UpdateRenderAfterSelfExecute对非null图、空图、回退的门分别见RB04；不能把sender归属校验扩大为全部分支统一校验。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF02" id="IF02"><summary>IF02 · 流程完成信号与图形计数筛选 → 普通Task稍后读取当前图像仓库</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>形状事件、临时图像引用与回调计数分开持有；没有提交时独立ImageData数组。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>排队后UpdateRender才读取控件当前tempImageStore；计数筛图门不能代替图像最后读者/身份门。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Task.Run(Action)返回值同样pop；工作体没有取消token、超时计数或卸载检查，轮询持续条件仅为所调用状态函数的返回值。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived要求Value是nWorkStatus=0的模块工作状态；先处理needUpdateRender，再在tempShapeStore中移除与nExecuteCount不符的图形事件，并检查IsNeedRender时间门后启动Task。该Task闭包只保存valueEventArgs和控件this；ExecuteCount在工作体中读取。计数0直接UpdateImageView(null)，非0则轮询当前OwnerProcessID的GetDataSendFinishState，再调用UpdateRender(executeCount)。这次计数筛选作用于临时图形表，不是把tempImageStore复制成受同一计数封装的帧包。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>private void OnPreduceResultCallBackArrived(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ada9bc8c6e2dcebbd1dea7c2e718aa48af948dcfb3b2d8a90cb96f32e4eb14ba" href="../../证据/ada9bc8c6e2dcebbd1dea7c2e718aa48af948dcfb3b2d8a90cb96f32e4eb14ba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ada9bc8c6e2d</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__Displ