ram Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7b5cb5290747c1ad09fdaaa0b4e870509fbc2637114fd5f78e736f070492b955" href="../../证据/7b5cb5290747c1ad09fdaaa0b4e870509fbc2637114fd5f78e736f070492b955.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7b5cb5290747</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass27_2::&lt;Resize>b__1 / 0x06000079</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="431fcc395ab61cf8a4bea1f1df76aa8d6f3c1efa53ce766b7802f90297dbda0f" href="../../证据/431fcc395ab61cf8a4bea1f1df76aa8d6f3c1efa53ce766b7802f90297dbda0f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>431fcc395ab6</small></a><p>.&lt;>c__DisplayClass27_3::&lt;Resize>b__2 / 0x0600007b</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7945280ade343e1975e0b8b41f7d6c0d86016b3cde81a6401f3a45fd64963e92" href="../../证据/7945280ade343e1975e0b8b41f7d6c0d86016b3cde81a6401f3a45fd64963e92.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7945280ade34</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：所核仅普通ImageViewBox到9参数转换/Resize；ImageBoxAddition覆盖路径和其它彩色/范围/3D重载不能自动继承此范围结论。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原生生产者是否在读取期间覆盖共享区、外部取消/线程中止与像素竞争未运行确认。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF05" id="IF05"><summary>IF05 · ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>清空控件属性与排队闭包的强引用是两套可达关系；旧工作仍可通过this访问当前属性/仓库。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清临时仓库不销毁控件实例，且其它路径可能在其后重新赋ImageDataSource。这里只界定缺少哪一种排空保证，不断言必然覆盖新帧。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>退订阻止后续相关事件接入，不撤回已经创建的Task/Dispatcher委托；最后读者与像素释放仍需宿主层关闭协议和运行证据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>已核选定ClearImageView调用Init/UpdateImageView(null)或清输入图属性，Unloaded退掉OnSetImageEnd与OnFreshExtendContent委托，DeInitRenderControl解除显示事件/过滤并清临时字典。对应CIL中没有等待此前两条Task.Run返回句柄、DispatcherOperation.Abort或取消token操作；Task调用点又没有保留该句柄。这些动作因此不能作为已排队闭包不再持有控件、不能再读当前状态/调用更新的证明。下一次源为空的ImageViewBox回调仍是自己的同步清显示/通知旧新图像事件链，不构成上游工作排空屏障。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>public void ClearImageView(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a><p>private void RenderControlBase_Unloaded(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d" href="../../证据/e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e39cf2e044e0</small></a><p>private void DeInitRenderControl(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a><p>private static void ImageSourceChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957" href="../../证据/78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78da8122f616</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::ClearImageView / 0x06000345</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747" href="../../证据/a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a08ab0b721c3</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::RenderControlBase_Unloaded / 0x06000338</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3" href="../../证据/d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70a3f93d624</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da" href="../../证据/b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b970a4656f4d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不能仅凭选定体没有取消调用断言原程序全局不存在排空；进程/父窗口关闭及其它所有者仍需独立追踪。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未观察原机清空/卸载与回调竞争，实际过期呈现、异常或内存滞留是否发生及概率均未知。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC01" id="RC01"><summary>RC01 · ValueEventArgs.ExecuteCount与固定标志 → buffer / spare入仓路由及整仓覆盖</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>仓库装的是ImageData/事件对象引用，不是复制像素帧；ExecuteCount是入仓批次标记，不应画成固定容量逐帧历史列表。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>同一执行计数的多次回调在所选仓内合并；新批次在同一仓覆盖旧批次。spare与buffer计数相等时只记录错误日志，未在该体强制去重或丢弃。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Clear字典移除该仓持有的引用，没有对每张ImageData执行Dispose、解除固定或释放共享映射。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>三个仓库均有ImageData字典和shape字典：display供TryGetImage/GetShapeStore读取，buffer和spare供回调入仓。SetDataToStore先拒绝sender为空或非ValueEventArgs，再按(NeedFixed &amp;&amp; e.ExecuteCount != FixedExcuteCount) || e.ExecuteCount == SpareExecuteCount选择spare；若所选spare批次改变，就更新SpareExecuteCount并Clear整套spare图像/图形仓。其它回调走buffer，批次改变则更新BufferExecuteCount并Clear整套buffer仓。同一批次再次到达只更新相关键，未更新键不在此路径自动清除。NeedFixedSpare并不出现在这个分流谓词里。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>private Dictionary&lt;string, ImageData> displayImageStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d466077ed678fd281c1b970d22b7b11f07d4af56a5d30b89ab23960e7ee066b7" href="../../证据/d466077ed678fd281c1b970d22b7b11f07d4af56a5d30b89ab23960e7ee066b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d466077ed678</small></a><p>public void SetDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a><p>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb787362f3f6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::SetDataToStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="607f54f594575d973842149b52502e5f73ff9b2ee14fff6e99aaac03caccee62" href="../../证据/607f54f594575d973842149b52502e5f73ff9b2ee14fff6e99aaac03caccee62.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>607f54f59457</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::SetRenderDataToStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="520b3aeb33a62e9a38e07fa69d07e734ccd61ff5b86a72b0e7c137f13398e2c7" href="../../证据/520b3aeb33a62e9a38e07fa69d07e734ccd61ff5b86a72b0e7c137f13398e2c7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>520b3aeb33a6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_BufferExecuteCount</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4c68392ec1ef2e9b2f0337d87545e40e827cbcd3d13bc0f8bde6a2d9de6752f3" href="../../证据/4c68392ec1ef2e9b2f0337d87545e40e827cbcd3d13bc0f8bde6a2d9de6752f3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4c68392ec1ef</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_SpareExecuteCount</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f07415d3eb6a66b7dfca41e9e26d5b164a2fa08c349072f619df969e1e29e13e" href="../../证据/f07415d3eb6a66b7dfca41e9e26d5b164a2fa08c349072f619df969e1e29e13e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f07415d3eb6a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：实际回调顺序、所有生产者的ExecuteCount分配及调用线程约束未在本切片闭合；不能把此分流谓词推成所有线程间的完整隔离保证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC02" id="RC02"><summary>RC02 · BeforeExchange / ExchangeBuffer → 仓库角色交换后旧display转成待写仓并继续持图</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>例：display=D0、buffer=B0；普通交换后display=B0、buffer=D0。旧D0的对象内容仍存在，交换的是字段引用。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>已显示的上一批图像可留在角色改变后的仓中；同一批次的后续写入未必触发整仓Clear，必须分别跟踪字典身份、字段角色和计数。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>交换本身不消除旧display持图，也不让ModuleDisplayDecorator/ImageViewBox的已取引用自动失效。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>BeforeExchange把FixedExcuteCount设为请求计数：等于SpareExecuteCount时置NeedFixedSpare，否则置NeedFixed；它不检查该请求一定等于BufferExecuteCount，也不先清另一侧已有标志。Exchange按捕获的NeedFixedSpare调用ExchangeBuffer：true时交换display与spare的图像/图形字典引用，false时交换display与buffer引用。不是逐项复制、逐像素复制或转移后清空。原display字典带着旧ImageData变成spare/buffer，继续持有旧值，直到后续相关键被覆盖、该仓新批次Clear、ClearDisplayStore（若它此时又是display）或DeInit。ExchangeBuffer也不交换BufferExecuteCount/SpareExecuteCount字段，因此不能把计数字段当成每个字典对象内所有键都已逐项认证的帧身份。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>public void BeforeExchange(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2a3a618743e1fc086dc09826434e5db7c97caa0de0fa2e82fccf7c0cdaaa2b36" href="../../证据/2a3a618743e1fc086dc09826434e5db7c97caa0de0fa2e82fccf7c0cdaaa2b36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2a3a618743e1</small></a><p>private void ExchangeBuffer(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da1ab55f0d543842f088cd74f47b7f310239a485e0e686ec19a5f45adf85a26b" href="../../证据/da1ab55f0d543842f088cd74f47b7f310239a485e0e686ec19a5f45adf85a26b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da1ab55f0d54</small></a><p>public bool IsBusy =></p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b872bf3475abf461dd0858b6a314a12250fb47e89f0047bf2d2fe3e3c6d5662c" href="../../证据/b872bf3475abf461dd0858b6a314a12250fb47e89f0047bf2d2fe3e3c6d5662c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b872bf3475ab</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::BeforeExchange</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0c9bb3c7691fc9f7fb5ae1d2766ce205a2004aaf67e01095ccbfab2c17eafb43" href="../../证据/0c9bb3c7691fc9f7fb5ae1d2766ce205a2004aaf67e01095ccbfab2c17eafb43.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0c9bb3c7691f</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::ExchangeBuffer</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e9d46dfc61e5fd2f8f836811cd808781c86c92796354fd9857ae7a9607a1fda2" href="../../证据/e9d46dfc61e5fd2f8f836811cd808781c86c92796354fd9857ae7a9607a1fda2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e9d46dfc61e5</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::get_IsBusy</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8edc1e2e511392c6ed798cca5e406763f6f185a45c2041151ee9e8fb4054383f" href="../../证据/8edc1e2e511392c6ed798cca5e406763f6f185a45c2041151ee9e8fb4054383f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8edc1e2e5113</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：IsBusy只是两个bool的OR；所选体未显示对声明_exchangelock加锁，不能据名字证明跨线程交换原子性，也不能在无运行时序证据时直接宣称实际数据竞争。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：外部调用方如何避免重复BeforeExchange和错误计数请求需结合ModuleResultView/回调调度继续核对。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC04" id="RC04"><summary>RC04 · ClearDisplayStore / Init / DeInit → 仅清当前display、清三仓及迟到回调的边界</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>清仓、清选择身份、禁止下层存值、原生像素释放是四个不同层次；A链ModuleResultView另持有的ImageData不由此字段写入直接清掉。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>ClearDisplayStore仍保留两待写仓里的旧图；DeInit删除三仓持有，但已交给装饰器、视图或扩展消费者的对象可继续可达。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>所选清理体没有调用ImageData.Dispose、FreeHGlobal或共享映射关闭；不能用DeInit的完成代替最后读者和所有像素已释放的证据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ClearDisplayStore仅Clear当前display图像/图形字典，不改buffer/spare、三个计数、两个固定标志或SelectedImage等选择引用。Init只设isInit=true。DeInit则设isInit=false，Clear三套图像/图形字典，清计数和固定标志，置CheckImagesName/SelectedImage/SelectedInputImage为空；没有逐图Dispose或像素free。SetRenderDataToStore以isInit阻止继续入值，但SetDataToStore本身并未先检查isInit：反初始化后迟到的有效回调仍可更新仓库计数和走Clear，然后在下层不存值。所以DeInit不等同所有生产回调已经停止或排空。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public void ClearDisplayStore()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf" href="../../证据/9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dfdc6e88917</small></a><p>public void Init()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2" href="../../证据/910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>910f799075bb</small></a><p>public void DeInit()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42" href="../../证据/4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4119f226ce97</small></a><p>public void SetDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a><p>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb787362f3f6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::ClearDisplayStore</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792" href="../../证据/2dab3ce386c5cdd8936ba2893c26bd5a9df2302492d1c1847d3f6b05d4a9e792.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2dab3ce386c5</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::DeInit</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95" href="../../证据/cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb340b8a3316</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::Init</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b" href="../../证据/aeb564366760ee8d7a09e3269f25f302bfcc439ce5884fc9e8a19bdb3813037b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>aeb564366760</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：三仓只属于RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator的A链；不得归到没有引用RenderDataCenter的RenderControlBase/tempImageStore B链。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原机异步排空、外部消费者、图像/位图与native资源最终释放仍未验证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="NB03" id="NB03"><summary>NB03 · 原SetOutImage → 写元数据后提交像素描述及额外栈参数</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>缓存中的描述 → 临时提交描述，包含既有像素地址、长度以及ABI额外参数；不是已确认端到端零复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>循环输出可再次发布相同缓存像素；接收方如何保存或复用待其callee证据。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>SetOutImage所释放的临时std::string不能画成图像像素释放；接收方租约和最后读者仍未知。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>SetOutImage按输出名前缀依次写Width、Height、PixelFormat，任一失败走返回；成功时组装临时图像描述，将缓存描述+0x10像素指针和+c长度写入，调用VM_M_SetImageEx。0x18000e902–e916还将缓存描述+0x20字段写到调用前[RSP+0x20]，该第五实参未显示在伪码调用签名中，必须保留。当前原件IAT0x1800122e8确认为VM_M_SetImageEx。在该体未再调用像素memcpy；这证明提交侧使用描述/指针，不证明ModuleFrame接收方不复制或不持有它。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>        memset(local_d0</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="163e57ae6285b9aef21b6004a22873bf6efe8aa471b48c848f6a19f8bfc2dedb" href="../../证据/163e57ae6285b9aef21b6004a22873bf6efe8aa471b48c848f6a19f8bfc2dedb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>163e57ae6285</small></a><p>18000e8ce</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3ec759e8369ef3febbeca2c701bb4a185d70b4e36deabb971039118b0e50a477" href="../../证据/3ec759e8369ef3febbeca2c701bb4a185d70b4e36deabb971039118b0e50a477.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3ec759e8369e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：VM_M_SetImageEx第五实参的确切语义及调用后接收方的复制、持有和释放没有由名称或反编译签名推断。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="NM02" id="NM02"><summary>NM02 · 原分配函数返回值与映射头 → 像素地址base+0x80、共享名和分离的头字段</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>映射头 / 像素区 / 共享名地址不同；两个返回槽也不等于复制了两份像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>容量足够的复用路径跳过部分创建头初始化，但公共尾段仍更新长度与+0x50；不能把整个映射每轮清零。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>头的offset/标志字段与消费者协议可比较，但尚未证明ModuleFrame如何写执行计数、何时允许复用及同帧读取。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>0x7fa0所选创建/扩容成功支在映射首地址写像素长度，+0xe写ushort0x80，+8写byte0，并把描述中的共享名复制到头+0x10的0x40字节区域。之后公共尾段更新长度和头+0x50的uint0，向第四实参输出base+0x80，向第五实参输出描述+0x14的共享名地址。0x18000827f–0x1800082d9汇编核对了这些写入及两个返回槽。因此CopyImage保存到描述+0x20的附加值可定位为该共享名地址，而非凭名称猜为所有权令牌。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>    plVar4 = (longlong *)*plVar15;</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="27849712167741a1c361f6ac38c2d3c0a8f108608f8c5ad78fef6660b8da71a8" href="../../证据/27849712167741a1c361f6ac38c2d3c0a8f108608f8c5ad78fef6660b8da71a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>278497121677</small></a><p>  *param_4 = *plVar15 + 0x80;</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f5eba9cc09d8f659594caa3241a7014088362a3729fd4a2c68df176c4cba0364" href="../../证据/f5eba9cc09d8f659594caa3241a7014088362a3729fd4a2c68df176c4cba0364.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f5eba9cc09d8</small></a><p>18000827f</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e557e81e04c1ab5c04318f78b75cf899d15885068d98f95ebe2cf99f024b6dd" href="../../证据/1e557e81e04c1ab5c04318f78b75cf899d15885068d98f95ebe2cf99f024b6dd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e557e81e04c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：消费者offset>84/计数门另由OD取证；协议对齐不能替代生产者到消费者的同实例、同计数与完整租约证据。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="PB03" id="PB03"><summary>PB03 · pImageValue / pChunkValue → VmIO.SetValue → 图像跳过FillData，chunk先填充；同引用入值与排队</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>输入为SDK chunk描述符数组或ByteData数组；IO事件仍是类型化载荷，之后FeatureBase/Object才组装ImageData（见ON01/ON02），不是此处直接生成ImageData。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>image不强制FillData使其可能继续依赖共享名/借用指针；非image的FillData也不能绕开DI07/DI08已证的缓存/复制池规则。队列事件与IO可同时保持载荷可达。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这里没有释放原生查询结果容器；也没有像素租约或最后读者协议。查询finally Release不能推出image事件载荷已复制或已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>静态SetValueFromServer按ImageType直接把pImageValue传给SetValue，ChunkType传pChunkValue，ByteType传pByteValue。SetValue只在newValue是chunk描述符枚举且TypeName != image时逐项FillData；图像类型跳过这一步。随后_value=newValue，_valueList首次Add同引用，IsImageIOParent时覆盖第0项，否则追加并标记待合并。needRaiseEvent为true才进入InvokeValueChangedEvent；后者还要RaiseValueChanged且IsOpenSetValueToDisplay，调用MergeIOLoopValue后将_value、ExecuteCount、TypeName装进事件参数并排队。该桥不是把所有图像都先转成独立byte[]再通知。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>internal static void SetValueFromServer(VmIO io,</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13626b47b6418ff21cc98b42c906a495e8f07a9fd26e7603b8bc640135ec8453" href="../../证据/13626b47b6418ff21cc98b42c906a495e8f07a9fd26e7603b8bc640135ec8453.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13626b47b641</small></a><p>private void SetValue&lt;T>(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="768dc014ee93337d42cc07a081d15d2b4533291765469c7ec042334b54dd4067" href="../../证据/768dc014ee93337d42cc07a081d15d2b4533291765469c7ec042334b54dd4067.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>768dc014ee93</small></a><p>internal void InvokeValueChangedEvent()</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5a426e6ac3fedfaf0baed1e55900d6700c0c90aa7766f0f63265965d4910c0db" href="../../证据/5a426e6ac3fedfaf0baed1e55900d6700c0c90aa7766f0f63265965d4910c0db.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5a426e6ac3fe</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::SetValueFromServer</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fdb41d65e5fe2fd4c725d7c9ff1602acae9c52057f52c6baed7926d6cc449713" href="../../证据/fdb41d65e5fe2fd4c725d7c9ff1602acae9c52057f52c6baed7926d6cc449713.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fdb41d65e5fe</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::SetValue</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9c9f933f6ae86d942dbee3aecd84750913dbed5fbe76f967925bf096a0973aa" href="../../证据/c9c9f933f6ae86d942dbee3aecd84750913dbed5fbe76f967925bf096a0973aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9c9f933f6ae</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::InvokeValueChangedEvent</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f7450e07bc8c42353c42dab13e477bfa57024d58147cb12f9227c1b8258daff8" href="../../证据/f7450e07bc8c42353c42dab13e477bfa57024d58147cb12f9227c1b8258daff8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f7450e07bc8c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：MergeIOLoopValue的合并复制与特定图像父节点配置需独立跟踪；这里不把readonly、队列对象或计数相同作为像素稳定保证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ04" id="RQ04"><summary>RQ04 · DynamicOutput.GetOutputImage / GetOutputImageV2 → 主动OneResult物化字节与已有IO载荷按模式构造SDK图像两分支</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>旧入口输出ByteArrayData.pData；V2输出SDK ImageBaseData。二者都不是UI Apps.Data.ImageData，也不直接接RenderDataCenter。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>旧入口对GetData(false)返回值不再额外复制；V2浅模式保持共享名/映射对象，深模式使用字节数组，后续SDK指针、pin及映射寿命仍分别见DI01–03。浅模式遇非0/2的MemoryType可返回仅填几何元数据、未挂共享对象的ImageBaseData，不能虚构自动回退复制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这些调用者没有释放查询页容器；旧入口使用映射true的OneResult，不能套用历史分页Release。V2构造对象不等于复制/释放原IO载荷；SDK Dispose解除pin与共享映射关闭仍是分开的机制。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>旧GetOutputImage先验证输出IO存在，再QueryModuleOneResult→PreProData；按type4及去%后的参数名找图像，nValueNum>0时只取第0个chunk.GetData(false)，把所得byte[]及长度直接赋ByteArrayData。V2不走该旧入口：它调用VmModule.GetImageByteData读取IMAGE父IO的第0子项chunk及宽高格式子项；浅复制模式只在MemoryType0/2时取共享名，其余模式调用GetData(false)。V2浅复制新建ImageBaseData、填宽高格式，有共享名才InitImageObjBySharedMem（new SharedMemoryItemVM(name,模块ExecuteCount)）；非浅复制用得到的数组构造ImageBaseData。IO.Value可能先触发DR01按计数刷新，不能把V2误画成无条件重新OneResult或PB回调路径。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public ByteArrayData GetOutputImage(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c9334a81378ce99e32f6a1fddb6878cbbe2f06de4efd0483b882d42f67b6b4b" href="../../证据/2c9334a81378ce99e32f6a1fddb6878cbbe2f06de4efd0483b882d42f67b6b4b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c9334a81378</small></a><p>public ImageBaseData GetOutputImageV2(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8c9050ada41e5b22991a315c314c6788c16a30809aac387ec43e755623d8c3fc" href="../../证据/8c9050ada41e5b22991a315c314c6788c16a30809aac387ec43e755623d8c3fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8c9050ada41e</small></a><p>public IVmImageData GetImageByteData(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="442220815679a7d78086bd28813d80c671967954e2b373ed78be9d65bffab3ac" href="../../证据/442220815679a7d78086bd28813d80c671967954e2b373ed78be9d65bffab3ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>442220815679</small></a><p>public void InitImageObjBySharedMem(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2dd127846362aac9bf7d968a6979c3f5219a97e67577a253f97f7bbc0b425771" href="../../证据/2dd127846362aac9bf7d968a6979c3f5219a97e67577a253f97f7bbc0b425771.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2dd127846362</small></a><p>VM.Core.DynamicOutput::GetOutputImage</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd