ls><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它类型/映射模式及分割/数值转换的全部错误语义没有由本切片泛化；中间描述来源到ModuleFrame同一次写入仍未闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="SN04" id="SN04"><summary>SN04 · 原动态释放selector9 → 图像数组与像素指针按内部字分开清理</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>根容器、模块记录、参数数组、chunk数组和pData像素分别有释放门；公开模式字段与内部释放字独立。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>该API清调用者查询容器，不意味着原SDK内部cache、托管副本或显示位图清空。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>内部字1跳过所选pData删除并非证明最后读者安全；根释放后外部像素的真正owner/复用仍须继续追踪。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原IMVS_RELEASE_MEMORY_TYPE中历史结果列表为值9；本次直接读取原native跳转表9项得到0x6af272。该片段先MOV RDX,RSI再call0x6c1390，其中RSI由分发入口R8保存，证实传入查询根指针；返回后另delete根。0x6c1390按每模块0xe8、每参数0xd0、每图像chunk0x120遍历：pImage中的像素指针非0且元素+0x114为0才调用delete[]，随后清指针；元素数组本身仍另delete[]。因此释放查询描述数组，并不无条件释放每个图像像素，更不等于关闭所有映射与显示读者。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>1806af09c</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cf3f161b6f6bef9d39fb405b8d2ff89a8fb0bd41ce14ea9f8fc13ee801a31e46" href="../../证据/cf3f161b6f6bef9d39fb405b8d2ff89a8fb0bd41ce14ea9f8fc13ee801a31e46.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cf3f161b6f6b</small></a><p>1806af272</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3571e2280915f10aa297eccb9a73551b2ff14af05646c2ed0350229b2e20972" href="../../证据/e3571e2280915f10aa297eccb9a73551b2ff14af05646c2ed0350229b2e20972.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3571e228091</small></a><p>                if (*(longlong *)(uVar8 + 0xa8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e1a265ced8f579232a260db4ef0f98dab9d38573b15592fe069379e62e097940" href="../../证据/e1a265ced8f579232a260db4ef0f98dab9d38573b15592fe069379e62e097940.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e1a265ced8f5</small></a><p>1806c14c8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b04df70330654ea8bfc5b5c58b11a8e727769f8db5d4da3750a6a7f921cb569" href="../../证据/0b04df70330654ea8bfc5b5c58b11a8e727769f8db5d4da3750a6a7f921cb569.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b04df703306</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它selector/异常/部分构造失败的全清理未全部关闭；所选private释放字不能反推全部模式下像素owner。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="DR03" id="DR03"><summary>DR03 · RenderDataCenter按ExecuteCount收图像/形状 → display / buffer / spare三仓引用交换</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文 · 复用既有证据</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Dictionary保存ImageData及ValueEventArgs对象引用</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>轮次变化Clear目标仓；BeforeExchange设固定标志，Exchange换引用</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>DeInit清六字典、选择引用和计数；不是逐像素析构</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>三仓交换移动Dictionary引用，不复制每张图像。ClearDisplayStore只清显示仓；DeInit清全部仓与选图字段。所选Clear/DeInit体没有遍历调用像素释放；因而清缓存引用、停止收到新值和底层映射释放是不同阶段。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>Reference exchange</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="452b7bfa3c8d86c3bfbbda09d29e4f2ed407a32acf6965147feb6300b1c16235" href="../../证据/452b7bfa3c8d86c3bfbbda09d29e4f2ed407a32acf6965147feb6300b1c16235.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>452b7bfa3c8d</small></a><p>Store reset and reference release</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da66bb68359e0f9274362bfd3d8549671695b26eb3cc96cc5e872aa59fa79db6" href="../../证据/da66bb68359e0f9274362bfd3d8549671695b26eb3cc96cc5e872aa59fa79db6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da66bb68359e</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::DeInit</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95" href="../../证据/cb340b8a33164e25592f527c23b4fb6ca600d3347037e5f19067e60c79fb2b95.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb340b8a3316</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Object的发送完成信号消费者、显示线程借用期和图像MemoryAddress真实释放仍未全闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IU02" id="IU02"><summary>IU02 · 两条已证静态显示链 → 原机活实例、扩展分支与最后读者</summary><p>unknown · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>A、B链分别持有ImageData并绑定到各自ImageViewBox，不把两套仓库串成一条实例链。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>静态仓库交换、字段更新和选择门已按各宿主列出；实际回调重入和同帧一致性仍未实测。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>不由消费者关闭映射或清界面推断生产者缓冲已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原版A链RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator与B链tempImageStore→RenderControlBase的成员赋值和原BAML绑定已分别定位。尚未在原机核实具体活动实例、模板命中与所有异步/扩展消费者退役；剩余未知不再描述为静态绑定缺失。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（0）</summary></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原版A链RenderDataCenter→ModuleResultView/ModuleDisplayDecorator与B链tempImageStore→RenderControlBase的成员赋值和原BAML绑定已分别定位。尚未在原机核实具体活动实例、模板命中与所有异步/扩展消费者退役；剩余未知不再描述为静态绑定缺失。</p></details></article><article><h4>当前独立实现</h4><p>自动来源准入、选中结果预览、显示帧及位图复制分开；二值化有Image输出不代表自动接入所有显示入口。</p><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS10" id="IS10"><summary>IS10 · LoadPreview / PrepareSave → 预览临时解码与持久化编码资源是另外两条支路</summary><p>independent-implementation · 本地文件</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>运行像素缓存 / 预览解码像素 / 保存的编码文件字节与Base64是三种载荷。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>预览不表示当前工具已经运行；保存列表和首N像素缓存的准入/容量彼此独立。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>using关闭编码流，不消灭资源字符串、最终预览图像或主运行缓存；这些由后续文档/显示持有者决定寿命。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>LoadPreview每次独立OpenEncodedImage并解码，不查询State.Cache。PrepareSave克隆节点参数，取配置列表或文件夹目录列表；SolSaveImageData为true时最多取120条路径，复制编码流到byte[]，计算hash并Base64写ResourceDocument，返回新参数与资源快照。它保存编码文件资源，而不是把正在运行的Cache、PendingFrame或StitchBuffer序列化。预览流在using退出关闭；保存中的stream和MemoryStream各自using，输出ResourceDocument继续持有Base64字符串。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>public VisionCore.IImageData LoadPreview(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd6e41496a3152e3ad79354b6e888860fce81a0e029c9eed047b5f45c5aba74c" href="../../证据/cd6e41496a3152e3ad79354b6e888860fce81a0e029c9eed047b5f45c5aba74c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd6e41496a31</small></a><p>public ToolAssetSnapshot PrepareSave(NodeDocument node,string baseDirectory,ResourceCatalog resources,ModuleExecutionScope? scope)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b8ad4dcda665119b00f2ab13c49383fddd75947f58e4229e17cc6531b0447a2" href="../../证据/3b8ad4dcda665119b00f2ab13c49383fddd75947f58e4229e17cc6531b0447a2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b8ad4dcda66</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：方案加载、资源验证实现、资源删除/去重及主窗预览释放需沿其消费者继续核；这条保存分支不证明原.sol格式兼容。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD05" id="TD05"><summary>TD05 · 当前主窗结果到图像显示的能力准入 → 图像选择器 / 通用frame / 鼠标结果预览三条路径</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>结果图像、来源列表条目、ToolDisplayFrame是三种载荷/能力，不能按同名Image合并。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>图像选择器记activeImageSourceId/activeImageOutputPort；通用provider准入与鼠标选择节点各自独立。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>没有provider时清通用presenter并回退普通Preview显示；这只涉及显示引用，不清结果或FIFO。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>RefreshRight只将IToolImageListProvider或IToolImageOutputProvider加入自动图像源列表；ImageBuffer实现后者且声明15个输出，ImageBinary类并未实现这些接口，也未实现IToolDisplayProvider。RefreshToolDisplay仅向IToolDisplayProvider请求LastDisplay。主窗另有Preview.MouseLeftButtonDown入口：图像Tab且已有Preview.Source时，从所选节点结果的首个图像输出取图再ToBitmap。InputImage(selected)这个名字不能解释成图连接输入。因此二值化Image输出可以存在，却不自动成为图像选择器来源或通用图文frame；鼠标结果预览是另一入口。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>void RefreshRight()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bfd9ca97aac4abf305f6a475836967f2ab864bcf92b81f8a9acda604515dc7f6" href="../../证据/bfd9ca97aac4abf305f6a475836967f2ab864bcf92b81f8a9acda604515dc7f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bfd9ca97aac4</small></a><p>IImageData? InputImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62e9e3dc783b2e0ccad6ceeebf26d10e2d83a5ed3f7dcff137a02a352a312708" href="../../证据/62e9e3dc783b2e0ccad6ceeebf26d10e2d83a5ed3f7dcff137a02a352a312708.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62e9e3dc783b</small></a><p>public MainWindow()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85" href="../../证据/bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bff6c0b3eb08</small></a><p>public sealed class ImageBinaryPlugin:</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ecdcb84e0970d14c313dc62da163217d0b5f4365e67b9b6b3591a674c4e0eb44" href="../../证据/ecdcb84e0970d14c313dc62da163217d0b5f4365e67b9b6b3591a674c4e0eb44.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ecdcb84e0970</small></a><p>public sealed class ImageBufferPlugin:</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c133cf2d819e549b3cfb7fa3347681338fead6586862b9069a3693b911ecc1f8" href="../../证据/c133cf2d819e549b3cfb7fa3347681338fead6586862b9069a3693b911ecc1f8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c133cf2d819e</small></a><p>public IReadOnlyList&lt;ToolImageOutput> ImageOutputs</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0526b40e37ce683ec428a52a33358483160004c680bdeb3dada1eef87d2946f2" href="../../证据/0526b40e37ce683ec428a52a33358483160004c680bdeb3dada1eef87d2946f2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0526b40e37ce</small></a><p>var provider=node is null?null:</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="dc8d25a697dd8b4240cb193c145c1edd5d359c9b460d3f4e3d22519c162b5135" href="../../证据/dc8d25a697dd8b4240cb193c145c1edd5d359c9b460d3f4e3d22519c162b5135.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>dc8d25a697dd</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：本事实与现有B13一致，不声称原版二值化也具有同样三入口或界面交互；未进行桌面视觉验收。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD06" id="TD06"><summary>TD06 · RefreshSelectedImageSourcePreview / ToBitmap → 源结果图像 → 普通WPF预览位图</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>算法图像引用 → 可选预览格式转换 → Pixels.ToArray → 新BitmapSource；Freeze不是释放算法图像或清缓存。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>每次调用ToBitmap新建位图；此方法没有位图池。预览之外的结果对象仍可能保留原像素。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Preview.Source=null只是解除此图像控件的持有；结果、源缓存、工具窗口和其它消费者不因此释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>普通预览先清Preview.Source，按已选来源节点及指定port（或首个图像输出）读取结果。如果节点根本没有results记录，且属于本地文件模式，才可能按CurrentImagePath经provider.LoadPreview或LoadBmp回退；已有失败记录但无图像不会走该回退。ToBitmap先ImagePreview.Packed，明确调用g.Pixels.ToArray向BitmapSource.Create提供数组，再Freeze。Gray/Rgb的Packed返回原图；Raw可能另建转换图像。因此显示位图构建有明确像素数组复制，不能把普通Preview当作直接显示上游裸指针。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>void RefreshSelectedImageSourcePreview()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="abba73bd6ed7f13d6029045baca0f1b2416445bfd4456265c19c3ca61c9d2b4e" href="../../证据/abba73bd6ed7f13d6029045baca0f1b2416445bfd4456265c19c3ca61c9d2b4e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>abba73bd6ed7</small></a><p>BitmapSource? ToBitmap(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="68db73b4a78aa876da960783f3c91b7e69a69a8bba8de8a0c359017a5ed28975" href="../../证据/68db73b4a78aa876da960783f3c91b7e69a69a8bba8de8a0c359017a5ed28975.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>68db73b4a78a</small></a><p>public static IImageData? Packed(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4322e2b62bd9e6d0e82ebcdc925b3a41f9e97fa3e33b77b688f652f2dcb496d4" href="../../证据/4322e2b62bd9e6d0e82ebcdc925b3a41f9e97fa3e33b77b688f652f2dcb496d4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4322e2b62bd9</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：这里只断言源码可见的显式ToArray与对象创建，不精确计算WPF内部额外复制/图形驱动内存或回收时点。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD07" id="TD07"><summary>TD07 · IToolDisplayProvider.LastDisplay → 三presenter → frame持有 / 图像层位图 / 文本和结果投影</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>image presenter.Frame保留完整ToolDisplayFrame；各图像层另有BitmapSource副本；TextBlock/表行是另一种投影。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清frame后尺寸归1；provider可能仍持有最近输出。最多三勾选图像层及文字/图形按frame重建。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Show(null)置Frame=null并移除该presenter的图像/标签引用，不调用frame.Image.Dispose或清provider缓存；同一图像的其它持有者继续有效。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>RefreshToolDisplay按请求代次、execution owner和当前流程判Current，先Show(null)清旧显示，再在node有结果且实现provider时取frame；Current通过后把同一frame传给图像、记录和结果列表presenter。图像presenter把Frame字段设为frame，清文字/几何children与旧image.Source/图像层，然后按选中图像和勾选层重建WPF图像。Bitmap辅助函数同样Pixels.ToArray→BitmapSource.Create→Freeze。记录presenter只取RecordText，列表presenter把ResultList投影为一个字典行；不能把这两者说成持有相同的整帧字段。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>long request=++toolDisplayRequestGeneration</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0" href="../../证据/011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>011023208dd4</small></a><p>Frame = frame; labels.Children.Clear(); image.Source = null;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17" href="../../证据/5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c262edb8d50</small></a><p>var selectedLayer=frame.SelectedImageName</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02" href="../../证据/187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>187a9b03f597</small></a><p>public void Show(ToolDisplayFrame? frame) { Text</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc" href="../../证据/0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d83ceb0af29</small></a><p>Columns.Clear(); ItemsSource = null;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c" href="../../证据/f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4570afb88fc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不因Current门或Freeze推断所有生产者线程安全；原版文字/几何/native图像的最后读者和生命周期仍独立核对。</p></details></article></div></details><details class="dd-pipeline-stage" data-pipeline-stage="retirement"><summary>⑤ 失效与释放 · 最后一个持有者退出，才可能真正回收。</summary><div class="dd-stage-columns"><article><h4>原版：已证片段与明确缺口</h4><p>关闭映射、解除固定、释放查询容器、清位图引用各有范围；异常与最后读者边界仍明确列出。</p><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OD06" id="OD06"><summary>OD06 · 一次共享映射访问退出 → 映射关闭与位图Unlock是不同保证</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>共享映射句柄/视图、临时fixed和WPF位图锁是三类不同资源。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>失败返回不自动清m_wbBitmap；源/目标引用仍可能存在。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本次using的Dispose有CIL finally支撑；位图Unlock仅正常路径见调用，异常分支仍是有限风险边界。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>GetImageBufferByFileNameDirectly的CIL有两个finally区域，对应using的ViewAccessor/MemoryMappedFile Dispose；正常路径在Resize/AddDirtyRect后执行bmp.Unlock。没有覆盖Lock→Resize→AddDirtyRect的Unlock finally。9参数Buffer路径同样没有异常处理区包住Lock/Unlock。因此映射能在异常退出时Dispose，不能据此断言位图必定解锁；捕获并返回null也不等于完成全部资源收尾。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>private unsafe byte[] GetImageBufferByFileNameDirectly(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9be8a72a77e4de440a1c94631834fd680d9ef2e6c9a89cec8f3226c968de3ce7" href="../../证据/9be8a72a77e4de440a1c94631834fd680d9ef2e6c9a89cec8f3226c968de3ce7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9be8a72a77e4</small></a><p>Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::GetImageBufferByFileNameDirectly / 0x0600003a</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e2e1198952d664aae0afa3b25643a85ce84bcc5bd010d1fb6c7c75086285ead7" href="../../证据/e2e1198952d664aae0afa3b25643a85ce84bcc5bd010d1fb6c7c75086285ead7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e2e1198952d6</small></a><p>Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::BuiltImageSourceA / 0x06000039</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3f75b53f4605f26d12e03c951345b410973e0d32bd4777053d27fa95495912e" href="../../证据/b3f75b53f4605f26d12e03c951345b410973e0d32bd4777053d27fa95495912e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3f75b53f460</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚未进行异常注入或原桌面运行，不能断言实际必现锁遗留或泄漏；这里只说明选定函数体没有异常解锁保证。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：生产者共享区的最终关闭、最后读者与操作系统映射对象最终销毁仍不在此证明范围。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OD07" id="OD07"><summary>OD07 · 转换器Clear / 控件ImageSourceChanged(null) → 只移除相应引用，旧对象还可被事件接收者持有</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>控件Source、转换器m_wbBitmap、ImageDataSource及事件接收者可能各自持有对象。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>Clear只清转换器位图引用；null源回调也不构成全图像缓存清空协议。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>受控的托管引用移除不等于FreeHGlobal或生产者释放；实际GC/原生最后读者必须另追。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Byte2ImageSource.Clear只把m_wbBitmap设为null，没有释放外部共享像素或清IImageData.Buffer。控件ImageSourceChanged在新图为空时清Source、尺寸并Init；随后仍把旧/新IImageData传给ImageSourceChangeEvent，再通知OnSetImageEnd。选定回调和默认初始化体没有对旧图调用Dispose，不能把界面清空解释为旧图所有引用和像素已退役。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>public void Clear()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2721a0b73fb94332603188378c9a4f67a16a0843978558f0abdad65573291cff" href="../../证据/2721a0b73fb94332603188378c9a4f67a16a0843978558f0abdad65573291cff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2721a0b73fb9</small></a><p>private static void ImageSourceChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957" href="../../证据/78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78da8122f616</small></a><p>public void Init()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="887a139b5074059d29f9e62319b5cca44067dab7f7d82f4bcc059b673f02c556" href="../../证据/887a139b5074059d29f9e62319b5cca44067dab7f7d82f4bcc059b673f02c556.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>887a139b5074</small></a><p>Apps.BaseData.Byte2ImageSource::Clear / 0x06000033</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.BaseData.dll · SHA256 435628fd494d33dbd4c242d98939162e0406101b1e77287556b1a04c7a4e1d6a / MVID b537fea2-7c48-4764-95c5-67bf1b261b29 · ev_8c68ba52e71fbaedc0819c39a328f1c8525bb9db7f3589089f7b7d59123a57b5</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ed4327373031c0a1136b730f140caa87e61c2e75a99077a4b0477052afbbbf73" href="../../证据/ed4327373031c0a1136b730f140caa87e61c2e75a99077a4b0477052afbbbf73.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ed4327373031</small></a><p>VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox::ImageSourceChanged / 0x060000bd</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ed44ef002286c14f7dad35bca246559bffa70e65b9f5f4c510c5cbe67612b66" href="../../证据/0ed44ef002286c14f7dad35bca246559bffa70e65b9f5f4c510c5cbe67612b66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ed44ef00228</small></a><p>VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox::Init / 0x060000d1</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6849b5a919a0be17287716976edb5d8c02c9d7155d45e5c6e5eb28a7f7cc7d04" href="../../证据/6849b5a919a0be17287716976edb5d8c02c9d7155d45e5c6e5eb28a7f7cc7d04.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6849b5a919a0</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ImageBoxAddition.InitOut/ImageSourceChangedOut和事件订阅者可有额外处理，本事实不推断其所有分支。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚未核RenderDataCenter实例到此活控件的binding、窗口退订和历史/导出的最终持有者，原版全链生命周期仍未闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON01" id="ON01"><summary>ON01 · VmIO.ValueChanged → FeatureBase.IO_ValueChanged → 按执行计数聚合Feature.ValueStore → Object.FeatureNotifyValueChanged</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>VmIO事件值Array → FeatureBase.ValueStore槽位保留同一引用 → 父Object值；不在这里统一复制像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>执行计数/重建门决定新建聚合容器；清标记和实际换数组是不同时间点。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>弱事件退订不清所有数据；ClearValueStore未逐元素Dispose，旧ValueStore引用要到后续替换或对象退役再减少。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>FeatureBase.SetOutputFilter为每个vmIO安装WeakEventManager处理器，RemoveOutputFilter对应退订。回调在执行计数变化、ValueStore为空或重建标记为true时新建object[]，收到Array时直接存入该数组引用；待VmIO_Notnull_Count等于已收数后，GetValue组值并调用父Object.FeatureNotifyValueChanged，随后ClearValueStore只设重建标记，不立即清旧数组。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>public void SetOutputFilter()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="32510c6434b913be1a6f6bd6fce1fc0647846189e69800261024fa1f64b7f3f0" href="../../证据/32510c6434b913be1a6f6bd6fce1fc0647846189e69800261024fa1f64b7f3f0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>32510c6434b9</small></a><p>private void IO_ValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3faadd80b5dfcab9f5b7e0dc2878a6da18a87a2d91187bce46641b4838c77a65" href="../../证据/3faadd80b5dfcab9f5b7e0dc2878a6da18a87a2d91187bce46641b4838c77a65.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3faadd80b5df</small></a><p>internal void ClearValueStore()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1d9128166716d4d315ea390920d98914acefe1849875a17f80831b3c62f4dbc0" href="../../证据/1d9128166716d4d315ea390920d98914acefe1849875a17f80831b3c62f4dbc0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1d9128166716</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::SetOutputFilter 0x060000e1</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1cb236dfeb86dc6320fdc7139105a75475dbd279259f6a01ecd05f102a3eb38f" href="../../证据/1cb236dfeb86dc6320fdc7139105a75475dbd279259f6a01ecd05f102a3eb38f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1cb236dfeb86</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::RemoveOutputFilter 0x060000e2</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="040656f3dc5a6a00ff3bebbb663a6af19b3b156e1e8a8870e4e87348efdcf203" href="../../证据/040656f3dc5a6a00ff3bebbb663a6af19b3b156e1e8a8870e4e87348efdcf203.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>040656f3dc5a</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::IO_ValueChanged 0x060000e3</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0842678ceaa89565f00aaf9e8f22106673abbbe71f4168dc3d870f068a162606" href="../../证据/0842678ceaa89565f00aaf9e8f22106673abbbe71f4168dc3d870f068a162606.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0842678ceaa8</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.FeatureBase::ClearValueStore 0x060000e4</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fb2a9a8548ba93be0cedde69b6d36425c8643c771cdbd2c46343bee01fced370" href="../../证据/fb2a9a8548ba93be0cedde69b6d36425c8643c771cdbd2c46343bee01fced370.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fb2a9a8548ba</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：GetValue的全部数据类型/索引/数组拼接语义与多个IO并发回调的原子性未由所选方法证明；不能从WeakEventManager推断像素已释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON02" id="ON02"><summary>ON02 · Object.FeatureNotifyValueChanged的特征到齐门 → FillImageValue → 带计数的ImageData载荷</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>多个特征 → 同一轮ImageData；创建包装对象不表示共享像素也复制了一份。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>固定Feature保留；新轮清非固定槽；对象Value字段与后续通知元组可以额外持有图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清Feature槽仅减少对应持有，不归还所有chunk/共享生产者缓冲。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>父Object在计数变化、首次计数或已收数为0时清非固定Feature槽并重置计数，然后保留本次Feature值引用。只有已收Feature数等于ValueStore.Length才NotifyValueChanged。图像填充从Image特征取chunk：共享模式保留地址名，非共享模式GetData取数组，赋给新ImageData的ImageBuffer/MemoryAddress并写宽高、格式、NeedCheckExecuteCount=true及ExecuteCount；输入已是ImageData时直接返回原对象。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>internal void FeatureNotifyValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8f45a381c6c0730836cc136fe49d49c47c15c4c0809e1380c92586eba34c0ecd" href="../../证据/8f45a381c6c0730836cc136fe49d49c47c15c4c0809e1380c92586eba34c0ecd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8f45a381c6c0</small></a><p>private object FillImageValue(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="571ca486fafd6290179d4ca8c98d04b093a59b140ef694403fd3aa0e64409199" href="../../证据/571ca486fafd6290179d4ca8c98d04b093a59b140ef694403fd3aa0e64409199.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>571ca486fafd</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::FeatureNotifyValueChanged 0x060001d8</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ac3ce88ed8b8042bb6fb0386a97bc70ddf990a68c307009186c8062e4b6bd87" href="../../证据/8ac3ce88ed8b8042bb6fb0386a97bc70ddf990a68c307009186c8062e4b6bd87.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ac3ce88ed8b</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::FillImageValue 0x060001e0</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="034720684b7a763cdd8e72aa90ab2e660c370de501184b832be2ce256b61275f" href="../../证据/034720684b7a763cdd8e72aa90ab2e660c370de501184b832be2ce256b61275f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>034720684b7a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：特征计数门不证明原生生产者写入与读取之间有完整帧租约；GetImageValue主动拉取是另一分支，不套用此通知门。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON03" id="ON03"><summary>ON03 · Object.NotifyValueChanged → 双数组通知队列 → 后台OnValueChanged分发</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Tuple持Object与事件，事件Value持ImageData；传递是引用包装，不是隔离像素快照。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>双数组和Object.value是不同持有者；队列满的分支不代表Object.value被清。接收长度检查在锁外，不声称完整并发队列合同。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>正常发送后清该发送槽；只减少队列持有，Object.value、显示仓库和消费者仍可继续持有图像。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>NotifyValueChanged先将FillValue返回值赋给Object.value，再以同一value引用构造RenderDataEventArgs，连同Object包装Tuple。静态构造建立两个各1000槽的object[]；接收计数小于1000时入队，满时此体不入队，也没有本体补发循环，最后仍重置已收Feature计数。后台线程交换发送/接收数组，逐项调用OnValueChanged，再在正常返回后把已发送槽设null、更新发送计数，并Sleep(3)。这条通知路径会跨越一次异步排队，不是同步直接把原生回调显示到控件。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>internal void NotifyValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2016f40b061e71dab3d0937c31dc541634852396004de04f33d0743557be88c3" href="../../证据/2016f40b061e71dab3d0937c31dc541634852396004de04f33d0743557be88c3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2016f40b061e</small></a><p>static Object()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="25e529fe11071cc89c26b311351f8a110792c1ba86c0f5adbadcf37bcb17e33c" href="../../证据/25e529fe11071cc89c26b311351f8a110792c1ba86c0f5adbadcf37bcb17e33c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>25e529fe1107</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::NotifyValueChanged 0x060001db</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d6f3b84c19dc36d1220cfd6faee32ef82e17bcc1baf4b0e905871cd35b550e79" href="../../证据/d6f3b84c19dc36d1220cfd6faee32ef82e17bcc1baf4b0e905871cd35b550e79.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d6f3b84c19dc</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::.cctor 0x060001d0</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="273c17e23a7f34429bb7978817edcb3c4344a59cbd7d34784f9d390ab151161f" href="../../证据/273c17e23a7f34429bb7978817edcb3c4344a59cbd7d34784f9d390ab151161f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>273c17e23a7f</small></a><p>.&lt;>c::&lt;.cctor>b__13_0 0x06001024</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="419ff5f1ba8c5ed57ef791d778e845fcb41770f34d7fa4292d2f6274f6a5504a" href="../../证据/419ff5f1ba8c5ed57ef791d778e845fcb41770f34d7fa4292d2f6274f6a5504a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>419ff5f1ba8c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：线程while(true)的完整关闭/Join及宿主退出协议尚未闭合；不能依据后台线程标记推断通知已经排空。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：只确认入队和发送的本体顺序；队列积压、超过1000项的实际丢通知与并发时序未运行注入。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="ON04" id="ON04"><summary>ON04 · ObjectBase.OnValueChanged / Object.ClearValueStore → 事件接收与聚合清理各有边界</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>事件args.Value、Object.value、Feature.ValueStore与队列Tuple不是同一个持有位置。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清聚合容器不撤销队列中既有引用；数据仓与UI的执行计数门需沿后续链核对。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>仅清引用/重建标记；未在本体回收所有ImageData像素或原生共享资源。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ObjectBase.OnValueChanged调用ValueChanged(this,args)，事件处理异常被该体捕获并记录。Object.ClearValueStore先把临时value替换成新List&lt;object>并清valueExecuteCount，再清非固定Feature槽并要求Feature下轮重建；没有逐图像Dispose。Clear并不会修改已经入队的RenderDataEventArgs.Value，因此旧通知在没有其它门阻止时仍可能继续被接收。接收方仍须按其自己的owner/计数/忙碌门决定入仓与呈现。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>internal void OnValueChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="56b33bf756cbf1d1c48606f952cbb2c1358904881251c1354c8c547dcc63b071" href="../../证据/56b33bf756cbf1d1c48606f952cbb2c1358904881251c1354c8c547dcc63b071.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>56b33bf756cb</small></a><p>internal override void ClearTempValue()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3447f3a7f9cb7bb54779fae8e0a8e6fc25ef6df7a96eeb8bbf03d20545a494ce" href="../../证据/3447f3a7f9cb7bb54779fae8e0a8e6fc25ef6df7a96eeb8bbf03d20545a494ce.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3447f3a7f9cb</small></a><p>public void ClearValueStore()</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0418005d0b222840ef02cf08de56542075d1e4bfc685465ce919c8185c47fa1b" href="../../证据/0418005d0b222840ef02cf08de56542075d1e4bfc685465ce919c8185c47fa1b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0418005d0b22</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.ObjectBase::OnValueChanged 0x06000133</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e74d3a2f1bff9f5f819e3a3d12fc9ea445caf3070defc67ad67b89208a5f3ba7" href="../../证据/e74d3a2f1bff9f5f819e3a3d12fc9ea445caf3070defc67ad67b89208a5f3ba7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e74d3a2f1bff</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::ClearValueStore 0x060001dd</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\Apps.XmlParser.dll · SHA256 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · ev_b3a71726ac88c3bfa26cb2a7f52cae18a1c0b089aa5306d29d074a63ad2ee5f7</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="351b401031a60718ade58c9b27583f10ce7f4ac08e4cee1929b1e62389f60749" href="../../证据/351b401031a60718ade58c9b27583f10ce7f4ac08e4cee1929b1e62389f60749.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>351b401031a6</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：某一处理器异常对多订阅者分发的具体影响、日志处理自身失败和所有订阅者的生命周期仍需另证；不把异常被记录等同全部处理成功。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB06" id="RB06"><summary>RB06 · 图像选择清空 / ClearImageView / DeInitRenderControl → 临时仓库和显示引用退役分开</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>控件属性、临时字典、图像列表和事件订阅分别持有或关联对象。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清空选择与更换模块走不同退役入口；DeInit本身不证明所有显示引用都清空。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>装饰器Dispose负责其列表/事件；没有因此证明共享内存生产者或WPF位图已最终销毁。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged在SelectedValue为空时清扩展图形、ShapeList、初始化imageView并将ImageDataSource=null；ClearImageView主图分支也经UpdateImageView(null)清背景引用。DeInitRenderControl则解除显示对象事件/过滤，ModuleParams=null，Dispose图像列表装饰器并分别在锁中清tempImageStore/tempShapeStore，解绑renderStatusModule并减SubscribeCount。该方法没有把ImageDataSource置null，也没有逐图像Dispose，故仓库反初始化、UI清空和原生像素释放不能当作同一个动作。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>private void imageListCombobox_SelectionChanged(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ab65074ed2ac677a753c19c00fefc1dbe8919aeeb2ea365da4fa1e1f9d9e34e3" href="../../证据/ab65074ed2ac677a753c19c00fefc1dbe8919aeeb2ea365da4fa1e1f9d9e34e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ab65074ed2ac</small></a><p>public void ClearImageView(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a><p>private void UpdateImageView(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5379587232315e1f33543cbba588658f77897de9d75ee679c24419648fc8651f" href="../../证据/5379587232315e1f33543cbba588658f77897de9d75ee679c24419648fc8651f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>537958723231</small></a><p>private void DeInitRenderControl(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd54f79e142f125a655c4d07e9310e85bb8a245d4d63a47aebeeec9d3c7ab8cc" href="../../证据/bd54f79e142f125a655c4d07e9310e85bb8a245d4d63a47aebeeec9d3c7ab8cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd54f79e142f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：所有Unloaded/模块更换/异常路径是否在飞任务排空后才释放仍未闭合；不从Dispose名称推断最后读者结束。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：源ImageData、imageView内部转换器位图和图形扩展的最终持有者仍须分别核对。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RB07" id="RB07"><summary>RB07 · imageView.OnSetImageEnd状态通知 → 失败时不继续提交图形/输入图，卸载仅退委托</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>背景图转换完成状态 → 回调 → 图形/输入图是独立更新边界。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>失败返回可留下尚未消费的临时条目；不能假设每次完成事件都清完整仓库。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Unloaded退委托不等于取消此前Task.Run/Dispatcher任务，也不释放源像素。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Loaded为背景imageView安装OnSetImageEnd和OnFreshExtendContent委托；Unloaded仅退掉这两个委托。imageView_OnSetImageEnd若msg能解析为false则直接返回；否则先UpdateShapesWithCallBackData，再在双图模式且存在SelectedInputImage时把该引用赋ImageDataSourceIn并移除临时键。状态通知影响图像之后的形状/输入图处理，不等于统一原子提交，也不保证失败时旧显示对象已释放。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>private void RenderControlBase_Loaded(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02dcdec672a78167a1b0c819c237287e2fd11dabcecb00ceb468c16096457675" href="../../证据/02dcdec672a78167a1b0c819c237287e2fd11dabcecb00ceb468c16096457675.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02dcdec672a7</small></a><p>private void RenderControlBase_Unloaded(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d" href="../../证据/e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e39cf2e044e0</small></a><p>private void imageView_OnSetImageEnd(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="94d06db87343b11b91d31d139f7f727b13993f6a4c0852b93e137ef0cf923f75" href="../../证据/94d06db87343b11b91d31d139f7f727b13993f6a4c0852b93e137ef0cf923f75.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>94d06db87343</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::imageView_OnSetImageEnd / 0x06000342</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2aa5d7a69c56108514759a2fa8b1c15020c692d77b62d1b1a22eb11d70eecf38" href="../../证据/2aa5d7a69c56108514759a2fa8b1c15020c692d77b62d1b1a22eb11d70eecf38.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2aa5d7a69c56</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：整个图像、文字、形状、双图的同一计数/同帧原子呈现仍未证明；原模块执行异常与映射busy错误不统一为一条失败合同。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RS05" id="RS05"><summary>RS05 · 模块切换 / OwnerWin_Closed / 装饰器Dispose → 清图像字段、退订事件、清缓存与原始像素寿命分列</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>装饰器、视图curImageData、ImageViewBox依赖属性、数据中心字典和显示位图是不同持有层；断开这些引用的时间点并非一个。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>切模块释放旧装饰器并建新装饰器；Owner窗口关闭触发置ModuleSource为空；ResultViewAddition扩展仍有独立清理行为。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清图像字段/集合与DeInit是可见收尾步骤，最后原生读者、GC回收和WPF位图内部资源释放仍须另证；不据Dispose名称宣称无泄漏或绝对安全。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OwnerWin_Closed把ModuleSource设null，普通模块切换DoSourceChanged会Dispose旧m_CurrentInfo并置null。装饰器Dispose退订流程/模块、输入和显示对象事件，在Dispatcher调用ParentUI.ClearModuleView，再清dataRecords/ShapeList/ResultData、DeInitImageList、停RecordTimer并RenderDataCenter.DeInit。ClearModuleView调用UpdateImageView(null)，普通校验分支进ClearImage，将装饰器.ImageDataSource与curImageData置null；同时清图形/数据网格/图层。上述选定方法没有逐像素Free、共享内存映射释放或ImageData.Dispose调用，因此只能证明各自持有/订阅退出，不能据此断言所有原生像素或已生成位图立即释放。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>private void OwnerWin_Closed(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea" href="../../证据/77eba1381c18ae333c336303e627b674a27b8d40c057c3b62f64ce5f6f65c5ea.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>77eba1381c18</small></a><p>private void DoSourceChanged(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61" href="../../证据/6a0665aa30cc6ecd36b589302074079e86f81edb1b0c1c0db4cd2e365000aa61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6a0665aa30cc</small></a><p>public void Dispose()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459" href="../../证据/3aa76a52b3939a782ed147194741829f4e3a27a60e5e0a174a80bee7107ab459.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3aa76a52b393</small></a><p>public void ClearModuleView()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc" href="../../证据/58bb804df3e53c239e7a121254001fb01e87ec2215a8a6abc044f44e7bf953fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58bb804df3e5</small></a><p>public void ClearImage()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7" href="../../证据/0238d62ec5416cb8b1cdfcaf9326ab4aeced0f9988b6e041d13037ec111d02e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0238d62ec541</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.ModuleDisplayDecorator::Dispose</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab" href="../../证据/2b50786594b412238a248c254d15b9bca86a6039f0eb8ababaa55035c38b0bab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2b50786594b4</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::ClearImage</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe" href="../../证据/07ec8671b64589b6cc6d740f35c9c03a6c60b9858519bdf4278b6dd7be01bffe.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07ec8671b645</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.ModuleResultView::OwnerWin_Closed</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88" href="../../证据/f8931fd1ab774876025fc99df65c91318bce22229f27e674c4bc2ef00800ff88.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8931fd1ab77</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ResultViewAddition.CheckUpdateImageView/OnModuleCallBackArrived可改变清空/呈现分支，扩展组件全部行为未闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未确认原程序关闭/切换时所有异步工作、消费者与native buffer的最后读者；不得声称本次做过原机内存回收验收。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="NP02" id="NP02"><summary>NP02 · 原Process：帧描述保留列表达到阈值 → FreeBuf通知 → 摘链 → 删除列表节点</summary><p>source-confirmed · 相机帧</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>保留的是含图像描述的列表节点；通知传描述地址/固定长度，不是把其像素数组直接delete。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>达到阈值后循环处理队首直到条件不再成立；不把该缓冲保留列表与NP01路径图像缓存容器当作同一结构。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本段没有检查FreeBuf返回码，也没有取得接收方实现，故仅确认通知与本地摘链，不确认外部native像素已归还或最后读者安全。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>所选Process分支将this+0x25c90列表长度与this+0x25c80阈值比较，满足条件时从队首处理。节点+0x30非0才调用VM_M_SetBinayData，参数取节点+0x10模块标识、字符串FreeBuf、节点+0x18描述地址与0x40字节长度，然后无论该调用返回值如何都继续摘链、长度减一与operator_delete节点。原汇编0x18000e6a5–0x18000e6b9明确R8=RBX+0x18、R9D=0x40、RDX=FreeBuf字符串地址、ECX=[RBX+0x10]；当前原件IAT 0x18002d598确认为ModuleFrame.dll::VM_M_SetBinayData。发送归还通知、删除列表节点与生产者底层帧真正释放是三个边界。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>if ((ulonglong)(longlong)*(int *)(this + 0x25c80)</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="79de8983ec58b60d4147410c69d77a33031baafe3ff737b648b5c06f2e50cf23" href="../../证据/79de8983ec58b60d4147410c69d77a33031baafe3ff737b648b5c06f2e50cf23.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>79de8983ec58</small></a><p>0x18000e66c:</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a0924a9a862eb4aff27e453770bf0c1983dee1e92b5650119a3a94ff38337065" href="../../证据/a0924a9a862eb4aff27e453770bf0c1983dee1e92b5650119a3a94ff38337065.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a0924a9a862e</small></a><p>0x18000e735:</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9f592d657620675c10b300ecb1784a8fafc627832f89250df7ee0ec97b1cb8d" href="../../证据/c9f592d657620675c10b300ecb1784a8fafc627832f89250df7ee0ec97b1cb8d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9f592d65762</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：camera是CameraImage/FreeBuf帧归还支路的研究归组，完整模式前置条件和设备调用时序尚未闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不从FreeBuf名称推断已经完成释放，也不从operator_delete列表节点推断其指向图像一同释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="NP03" id="NP03"><summary>NP03 · 原CMyAlgorithmManager.DeInit@0x12470 → 有界等待、句柄关闭与多类资源退役</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>线程句柄、缓存描述指针、图像实例与列表节点是不同资源域，不能合并一个“清图像”动作。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>本条仅记录DeInit所选清理顺序/字段门；不补未取得的虚表callee行为。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>WaitForSingleObject的2000ms等待与CloseHandle不能证明线程确已退出；DestroyImageInstance伪码显示的实参不完整，不能据其显示签名臆断被释放对象ABI或全部像素寿命。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>已取回且与保留REA记录逐字匹配的DeInit原体设置停止字节、发送事件；若线程句柄非0，调用WaitForSingleObject(...,2000)后直接CloseHandle并置0，伪码中未分支使用等待结果。它另遍历路径缓存记录，在两个非0指针门下分别调用this+0x10虚表+0x10并清记录指针；对多个图像实例调用DestroyImageInstance后清相应字段，还向保留帧列表发送FreeBuf，再删除列表节点。原件PE导出精确绑定DeInit RVA0x12470，不能再记作“当前根源码体缺失”。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（1）</summary><p>int __thiscall CMyAlgorithmManager::DeInit</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3aae9aa83d3d7be8e6e991076d376cd1af890cc28d4fea6a59f6617d553340a6" href="../../证据/3aae9aa83d3d7be8e6e991076d376cd1af890cc28d4fea6a59f6617d553340a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3aae9aa83d3d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：本条复核的是原件身份/PE导出与保留伪码，尚无该函数专属汇编实参再核；特别不据DestroyImageInstance显示成零参数就断言没有传入寄存器。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：线程等待超时路径、共享缓冲callee、重复释放与显示最后读者须继续逐体追踪，未执行原版或设备。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="NC04" id="NC04"><summary>NC04 · 原SetParam(&quot;ClearImage&quot;) → 路径列表游标/逻辑长度复位</summary><p>source-confirmed · 本地文件</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>两组路径容器的游标和逻辑末尾，与0x3a0图像缓存容器是不同字段。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>本条只确认所选ClearImage setter的直接字段副作用；不假定后续Process或其他回调不会另行处理失效。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>逻辑末尾回退/游标复位不等于delete列表存储，也不等于释放已缓存的像素块。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>所选ClearImage分支进入两把临界区，写this+0x24878和+0x248c8为-1，将+0x24888设为+0x24880、+0x248d8设为+0x248d0，并将+0x3a4的8字节清零，然后经释放临界区公共出口返回。该完整所选分支没有更新路径像素缓存的+0x25d50/+0x25d58字段，也没有逐项调用缓存释放虚接口；清路径列表不能直接写作已释放全部像素缓存。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>CMyAlgorithmManager::SetParam</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="569d3d8eb903ba2d052b65d61c68fd074abd3afe05bc1af1f318c19f3b824961" href="../../证据/569d3d8eb903ba2d052b65d61c68fd074abd3afe05bc1af1f318c19f3b824961.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>569d3d8eb903</small></a><p>CMyAlgorithmManager::SetParam</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="27896da05e0ba2d169fe0c88b6ccd71f2d7c1a7dc659b2001589e63b32e0e585" href="../../证据/27896da05e0ba2d169fe0c88b6ccd71f2d7c1a7dc659b2001589e63b32e0e585.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>27896da05e0b</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：该setter没有专属保留汇编，未知的格式化日志寄存器参数不从伪码显示签名臆断。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不能由本分支扩大断言DeleteImage、PathCache setter或外部通知都不释放缓存。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="NC05" id="NC05"><summary>NC05 · 原CMyAlgorithmManager析构 → DeInit之后单独释放缓存记录存储</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>容器存储与条目指向像素/共享分配分别退役；本条不是新发现的逐图像释放实现。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>析构删除缓存记录数组本身。只有DeInit而未析构时，不能由NP03推断这三个容器字段已经清0。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>析构顺序与delete字段由保留伪码确认；无析构专属汇编，虚表+0x10的具体callee、状态返回、最终映射解除和跨进程最后读者未证明。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>析构原体先调用DeInit(this)、MonitoringSubFolderDeInit(this)，随后若this+0x25d50非0，operator_delete该容器起始存储，并把+0x25d50/+0x25d58/+0x25d60三个字段清0。结合NP03可区分：DeInit逐记录发共享释放调用并清图像指针，析构另行释放容器本身。不能把其中任一步代替另一资源域的退役。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（1）</summary><p>CMyAlgorithmManager::~CMyAlgorithmManager</p><p>原件 · 91ea3659be97e51edeab0c913779d4555d51dcd0d6288086fbf9916d35b942db · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bbc7c3bea83e1649ddd7ab0ca5f1a6b44e3af5d82238a21552657d916b34d1de" href="../../证据/bbc7c3bea83e1649ddd7ab0ca5f1a6b44e3af5d82238a21552657d916b34d1de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bbc7c3bea83e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：DeInit(this+0x10虚表+0x10)实际函数地址/本体及完整ABI尚缺；不能从接口名认定已成功free像素。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：没有启动原版线程，不将所见清理顺序等同于已验证的并发安全或手工验收。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IF05" id="IF05"><summary>IF05 · ClearImageView / RenderControlBase_Unloaded / DeInitRenderControl → 清引用、退委托不撤销已经排队的工作</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>清空控件属性与排队闭包的强引用是两套可达关系；旧工作仍可通过this访问当前属性/仓库。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清临时仓库不销毁控件实例，且其它路径可能在其后重新赋ImageDataSource。这里只界定缺少哪一种排空保证，不断言必然覆盖新帧。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>退订阻止后续相关事件接入，不撤回已经创建的Task/Dispatcher委托；最后读者与像素释放仍需宿主层关闭协议和运行证据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>已核选定ClearImageView调用Init/UpdateImageView(null)或清输入图属性，Unloaded退掉OnSetImageEnd与OnFreshExtendContent委托，DeInitRenderControl解除显示事件/过滤并清临时字典。对应CIL中没有等待此前两条Task.Run返回句柄、DispatcherOperation.Abort或取消token操作；Task调用点又没有保留该句柄。这些动作因此不能作为已排队闭包不再持有控件、不能再读当前状态/调用更新的证明。下一次源为空的ImageViewBox回调仍是自己的同步清显示/通知旧新图像事件链，不构成上游工作排空屏障。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>public void ClearImageView(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016" href="../../证据/2860cadca62d0863149ddda496baf2465b663ebcc204560d2b3d3e4ef745b016.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2860cadca62d</small></a><p>private void RenderControlBase_Unloaded(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d" href="../../证据/e39cf2e044e0798f1f795a7adc873a3db241477cdcfdd684cbff470edd83ea3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e39cf2e044e0</small></a><p>private void DeInitRenderControl(</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da" href="../../证据/87cd0d7f2acec173cabca2103da2b0f5269dbdf3c5525613f0bf4c631545f5da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>87cd0d7f2ace</small></a><p>private static void ImageSourceChanged(</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMBaseControls.dll · SHA256 d3ed7ce6cca860ac89d671dc0fe4ee239a97063d18bed94d3ad97595d5d52555 / MVID 47136107-aecc-42c7-bdbd-a8641253cae6 · ev_5c1629545e518889b4c51540fb2fdd45cf5fddbcf01680c5ce4ccafad278ab2a</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957" href="../../证据/78da8122f6161c9aa648708613f025f50a4209a1f42aabe26f6c313a94a2e957.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>78da8122f616</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::ClearImageView / 0x06000345</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747" href="../../证据/a08ab0b721c33446e242502cf2c4106f1e0d38598500426ddc2f545580f7b747.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a08ab0b721c3</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::RenderControlBase_Unloaded / 0x06000338</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3" href="../../证据/d70a3f93d6248c0e21e63579ce85439cfe4021c3f9e5ea13e84e9afb111c08b3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d70a3f93d624</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.RenderControlBase::DeInitRenderControl / 0x0600033c</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da" href="../../证据/b970a4656f4def286a3239e695f0526a178ef6053f39264e9cc12eb5f24e58da.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b970a4656f4d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不能仅凭选定体没有取消调用断言原程序全局不存在排空；进程/父窗口关闭及其它所有者仍需独立追踪。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未观察原机清空/卸载与回调竞争，实际过期呈现、异常或内存滞留是否发生及概率均未知。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC03" id="RC03"><summary>RC03 · Exchange等待与Object.GetDataSendFinishState → 回调计数等待完成不等于最后像素读者退出</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>等待对象是发送/接收计数与请求批次，不是图像引用计数、GCHandle、内存映射租约或WPF位图最后读者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>正常交换后两个固定标志复位，但请求旧计数也可能满足helper的退出条件；不能把该门扩展成完整同帧提交保证。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这里没有释放ImageData或其像素；若等待不退出或helper抛异常，不能从正常尾部推断标志已复位或窗口关闭已排空。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Exchange在GetDataSendFinishState(procID,executeCount)返回true时每次Sleep(3)，直到false才交换仓库，并在正常尾部把NeedFixedSpare/NeedFixed都设false。所选体没有超时、取消或finally复位。该helper按executeCount对maxStoreLen取余选计数槽，读取过程的最近发送执行计数；当槽内sent==received，或请求executeCount早于过程最近计数时，清该槽两计数并返回false，否则返回true。因此不能仅按“FinishState”名称把退出循环解释成这张图所有像素消费者都已处理完，或所请求旧批次一定仍是显示仓。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>public void Exchange(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="575d215b71d36a36907c7e4f6f2753d2479dbe44d7a7e37d9b1d5f37ce48d2ae" href="../../证据/575d215b71d36a36907c7e4f6f2753d2479dbe44d7a7e37d9b1d5f37ce48d2ae.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>575d215b71d3</small></a><p>public static bool GetDataSendFinishState(</p><p>原件 · 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd90f3ddc0b68fd5b39f3c461fb997e4dd169888f2ad27a2c18dd2a9d5e62c49" href="../../证据/fd90f3ddc0b68fd5b39f3c461fb997e4dd169888f2ad27a2c18dd2a9d5e62c49.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd90f3ddc0b6</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.RenderDataCenter::Exchange</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2fb165a6d3bc74029356a587efa5133b68ccddb877a2ef4b4171daf0393ff10b" href="../../证据/2fb165a6d3bc74029356a587efa5133b68ccddb877a2ef4b4171daf0393ff10b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2fb165a6d3bc</small></a><p>Apps.XmlParser.Object::GetDataSendFinishState</p><p>原件 · 78ec7ae1e5adefff29197099c7109b153a3f75d092b7c3e9dc253d8c1b25a8d1 / MVID d0604401-ab61-48a4-938b-faad16d74e7c · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="befc290f805e3813b8aabec688720de5788af851293633853ee3dc3346c75466" href="../../证据/befc290f805e3813b8aabec688720de5788af851293633853ee3dc3346c75466.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>befc290f805e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：sent/received计数所有写入点、环槽复用、溢出及内存可见性未在此有限切片恢复；没有执行厂商等待循环或原生读者测量。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RC04" id="RC04"><summary>RC04 · ClearDisplayStore / Init / DeInit → 仅清当前display、清三仓及迟到回调的边界</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>清仓、清选择身份、禁止下层存值、原生像素释放是四个不同层次；A链ModuleResultView另持有的ImageData不由此字段写入直接清掉。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>ClearDisplayStore仍保留两待写仓里的旧图；DeInit删除三仓持有，但已交给装饰器、视图或扩展消费者的对象可继续可达。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>所选清理体没有调用ImageData.Dispose、FreeHGlobal或共享映射关闭；不能用DeInit的完成代替最后读者和所有像素已释放的证据。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ClearDisplayStore仅Clear当前display图像/图形字典，不改buffer/spare、三个计数、两个固定标志或SelectedImage等选择引用。Init只设isInit=true。DeInit则设isInit=false，Clear三套图像/图形字典，清计数和固定标志，置CheckImagesName/SelectedImage/SelectedInputImage为空；没有逐图Dispose或像素free。SetRenderDataToStore以isInit阻止继续入值，但SetDataToStore本身并未先检查isInit：反初始化后迟到的有效回调仍可更新仓库计数和走Clear，然后在下层不存值。所以DeInit不等同所有生产回调已经停止或排空。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public void ClearDisplayStore()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf" href="../../证据/9dfdc6e88917df22aa767bba9224c59f9310e9ae411914e3d226142b79076ecf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dfdc6e88917</small></a><p>public void Init()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2" href="../../证据/910f799075bb238e56c41844ac5bb0ff53e40938b44941a317a8de903f057cf2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>910f799075bb</small></a><p>public void DeInit()</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42" href="../../证据/4119f226ce97808b04ee46443250f6e4d6ae12953659bee3e485b9f31ad23e42.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4119f226ce97</small></a><p>public void SetDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d" href="../../证据/0d2098082e0ba811f958441d3b1c94c72080086d8abeda85f96f507340e9eb3d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d2098082e0b</small></a><p>private void SetRenderDataToStore(</p><p>原件 · 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb787362f3f60cc2eca9784e9377a135b040cb61c81a2304af095ffa2ce132ac" href="../../证据/bb787362f3f60cc2eca9