tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>淘汰分支摘链、减计数并operator_delete列表节点；此体未显式调用接口像素归还，不能据此认定像素泄漏或已经回收。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Process读取BufferCount，拒绝小于0或大于15的值；RefreshFlag读取后只有等于1才GetInImage→CopyImage，任一失败返回错误，不进入该轮追加。成功经helper0x18000f630创建记录并链接到列表尾，增加this+0xd8计数；随后仅在该刷新分支循环删队首直到数量不大于BufferCount。RefreshFlag不等于1会跳过这一整段，所以只降低BufferCount并不在这条路径立即缩容；BufferCount=0而刷新为1仍先取得/复制/追加再淘汰。输出循环不从队列移除元素。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>  VM_M_GetInt(param_1,&quot;BufferCount&quot;</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="64cea2ecbcf40d06f5e4d8b437a3e44eaf90d79e20f55e2b188eec54b8866114" href="../../证据/64cea2ecbcf40d06f5e4d8b437a3e44eaf90d79e20f55e2b188eec54b8866114.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>64cea2ecbcf4</small></a><p>  if (0xf &lt; local_438)</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0e13347bb7a2a50e62d57b6a576dbeb1dc73da929e6b66e324da3c58a9068d75" href="../../证据/0e13347bb7a2a50e62d57b6a576dbeb1dc73da929e6b66e324da3c58a9068d75.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0e13347bb7a2</small></a><p>    iVar13 = CopyImage</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="418319bb2465c6e7878296b72f332054b3521f119e0d945b94329a213df95fd7" href="../../证据/418319bb2465c6e7878296b72f332054b3521f119e0d945b94329a213df95fd7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>418319bb2465</small></a><p>18000e001</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1900b0cd48dcbdb6532360ee433cbb419c781aca7eca84d84b053e660a58513a" href="../../证据/1900b0cd48dcbdb6532360ee433cbb419c781aca7eca84d84b053e660a58513a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1900b0cd48dc</small></a><p>18000e105</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff94