df" href="../../证据/5747ecccf771c1ff8a036c7ae869b4633f9a25affd5a63dae2242a5fed4ee1df.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5747ecccf771</small></a><p>  FUN_180007de0</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7b4c7a9b6639d1a838f0d5bdbb1da8cee490963d77ab2175254acf701721de01" href="../../证据/7b4c7a9b6639d1a838f0d5bdbb1da8cee490963d77ab2175254acf701721de01.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7b4c7a9b6639</small></a><p>18000dc54</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="498e4aa8eb176febd19213f6f445b9677fc1f1e9b466092ea303f47c762c27fb" href="../../证据/498e4aa8eb176febd19213f6f445b9677fc1f1e9b466092ea303f47c762c27fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>498e4aa8eb17</small></a><p>    for (puVar7 =</p><p>原件 · ab8850d7a747df693152ef7e095a5e0ef87eff9410c2424e9b7c84e435717869 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e445dfe6da0a2e59a4e385ed7d0a23f15657bd20d7b0a5f4993ee777fd21907f" href="../../证据/e445dfe6da0a2e59a4e385ed7d0a23f15657bd20d7b0a5f4993ee777fd21907f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e445dfe6da0a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：基类析构末尾的反编译间接跳转警告保留；引用控制块所有callee、模块Destroy调用时序和最后像素读者仍未闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="PB03" id="PB03"><summary>PB03 · pImageValue / pChunkValue → VmIO.SetValue → 图像跳过FillData，chunk先填充；同引用入值与排队</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>输入为SDK chunk描述符数组或ByteData数组；IO事件仍是类型化载荷，之后FeatureBase/Object才组装ImageData（见ON01/ON02），不是此处直接生成ImageData。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>image不强制FillData使其可能继续依赖共享名/借用指针；非image的FillData也不能绕开DI07/DI08已证的缓存/复制池规则。队列事件与IO可同时保持载荷可达。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这里没有释放原生查询结果容器；也没有像素租约或最后读者协议。查询finally Release不能推出image事件载荷已复制或已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>静态SetValueFromServer按ImageType直接把pImageValue传给SetValue，ChunkType传pChunkValue，ByteType传pByteValue。SetValue只在newValue是chunk描述符枚举且TypeName != image时逐项FillData；图像类型跳过这一步。随后_value=newValue，_valueList首次Add同引用，IsImageIOParent时覆盖第0项，否则追加并标记待合并。needRaiseEvent为true才进入InvokeValueChangedEvent；后者还要RaiseValueChanged且IsOpenSetValueToDisplay，调用MergeIOLoopValue后将_value、ExecuteCount、TypeName装进事件参数并排队。该桥不是把所有图像都先转成独立byte[]再通知。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>internal static void SetValueFromServer(VmIO io,</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13626b47b6418ff21cc98b42c906a495e8f07a9fd26e7603b8bc640135ec8453" href="../../证据/13626b47b6418ff21cc98b42c906a495e8f07a9fd26e7603b8bc640135ec8453.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13626b47b641</small></a><p>private void SetValue&lt;T>(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="768dc014ee93337d42cc07a081d15d2b4533291765469c7ec042334b54dd4067" href="../../证据/768dc014ee93337d42cc07a081d15d2b4533291765469c7ec042334b54dd4067.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>768dc014ee93</small></a><p>internal void InvokeValueChangedEvent()</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5a426e6ac3fedfaf0baed1e55900d6700c0c90aa7766f0f63265965d4910c0db" href="../../证据/5a426e6ac3fedfaf0baed1e55900d6700c0c90aa7766f0f63265965d4910c0db.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5a426e6ac3fe</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::SetValueFromServer</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fdb41d65e5fe2fd4c725d7c9ff1602acae9c52057f52c6baed7926d6cc449713" href="../../证据/fdb41d65e5fe2fd4c725d7c9ff1602acae9c52057f52c6baed7926d6cc449713.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fdb41d65e5fe</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::SetValue</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9c9f933f6ae86d942dbee3aecd84750913dbed5fbe76f967925bf096a0973aa" href="../../证据/c9c9f933f6ae86d942dbee3aecd84750913dbed5fbe76f967925bf096a0973aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9c9f933f6ae</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmIO::InvokeValueChangedEvent</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f7450e07bc8c42353c42dab13e477bfa57024d58147cb12f9227c1b8258daff8" href="../../证据/f7450e07bc8c42353c42dab13e477bfa57024d58147cb12f9227c1b8258daff8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f7450e07bc8c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：MergeIOLoopValue的合并复制与特定图像父节点配置需独立跟踪；这里不把readonly、队列对象或计数相同作为像素稳定保证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="PB04" id="PB04"><summary>PB04 · SDK NativeData2Data的nParamType 4 / 5 / 6 → 图像描述符、chunk描述符与普通字节结果三种载荷</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>type4/5是载荷描述符新包装，不等于其像素深拷贝；type6的hexValue在此处确实新分配复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>type6展示文本截断不截断hexValue；type4异常标志未清计数与type5清计数是不同失败保留规则，不应合并。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>托管数组复制与原生查询容器释放是不同动作；本方法未证明共享映射、借用像素或native生产缓存已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>NativeData2Data把type4的pImageValue和type5的pChunkValue分别解析为原生chunk描述符数组，再逐项new托管chunk并调用LargeObject；两者都受isFilter影响。type5在LargeObject报告isExcOccur后把nValueNum置0并break，type4虽传该标志却没有同样清计数分支。type6普通ByteData则逐项new byte[nLen]并Marshal.Copy，把完整数组存hexValue，strValue最多转换前4096字节。因此“结果里有byte[]”必须区分普通ByteData、chunk.GetData物化及ImageData.Buffer，不可混为同一个原生图像对象或统一所有权。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>case 4:</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cda28b0597ec7a853fa64f928b23fbce007973af801587c085b6861679e78e61" href="../../证据/cda28b0597ec7a853fa64f928b23fbce007973af801587c085b6861679e78e61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cda28b0597ec</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::NativeData2Data</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="686a7be81e63253e8065259feac5c639108aa0ce4555915e5a4e10a493a7f450" href="../../证据/686a7be81e63253e8065259feac5c639108aa0ce4555915e5a4e10a493a7f450.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>686a7be81e63</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::PreProData</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="da5879a0410f89d8cbe95c58def4da61f0c8155c2fba59765dd024889154c292" href="../../证据/da5879a0410f89d8cbe95c58def4da61f0c8155c2fba59765dd024889154c292.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>da5879a0410f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：VM_M_SetImageEx的第五实参、native缓存描述符、SDK chunk的strValue/pData与ImageData.ExecuteCount之间尚缺同次生产/消费实例的直接桥证据；共享头偏移相似不能填补该缺口。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ01" id="RQ01"><summary>RQ01 · ModuleParam字符串/二进制参数读取 → GetParamValue字符串返回与GetBinaryData固定托管数组的独立通道</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>GetParamValue输出string；GetBinaryData(ref byte[])输出此方法分配的托管数组，pin只是临时地址固定，不是像素永久租约。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>成功返回数组由调用者继续持有；参数读取自身不写VmIO结果缓存，也不调用PB回调桥。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>GCHandle.Free仅解除这次数组固定，不释放托管数组；此ref byte[]分支没有调用历史查询容器Release。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ModuleParam字符串索引getter在Parent未Dispose时，普通参数调用GetParamValue并要求错误抛出；VmModuleSet且键以%开头则走动态运行参数查询。ModuleManager.GetParamValue无长度重载传4096给显式长度重载，再把ref string交IMVS_GetParamValue；它没有查询模块结果或构造ImageData。ModuleParam二进制索引另走GetBinaryData：普通路径先查长度、new byte[length]并固定该数组，把数组地址交IMVS_GetBinaryData写入；调用返回后解除固定，finally再次检查保证异常也解除固定。native错误时把data置null。参数二进制读取不能被画成SDK结果chunk/共享图像名返回的同一路径。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public virtual string this[string key]</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89be3ef2d0428f8e3a544243521b37587d317a58abf50effa5064a71e7225602" href="../../证据/89be3ef2d0428f8e3a544243521b37587d317a58abf50effa5064a71e7225602.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89be3ef2d042</small></a><p>byte[] IUserBytesData.this[string key]</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a1b9a356c292060c70e67b3f061fbaf53c9aa0bfcaad3511e42e33806503ff58" href="../../证据/a1b9a356c292060c70e67b3f061fbaf53c9aa0bfcaad3511e42e33806503ff58.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a1b9a356c292</small></a><p>public void GetParamValue(uint nModuleID, string strName, int </p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="94092b68fb802c6639fd5c49059984fbdf16a1765a12889bce6926f829662cf1" href="../../证据/94092b68fb802c6639fd5c49059984fbdf16a1765a12889bce6926f829662cf1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>94092b68fb80</small></a><p>public int GetBinaryData(uint moduleId, string paramName, ref byte[]</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="37d3cb5f5e038d1ebe41e21903289c3340518315c7aa8b18760937db1ab1fbf0" href="../../证据/37d3cb5f5e038d1ebe41e21903289c3340518315c7aa8b18760937db1ab1fbf0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>37d3cb5f5e03</small></a><p>VM.Core.ModuleParam::get_Item</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fec48e8d8c50020f9100180f81d0a4dc12babdb60874726b2d057a82ccbf9595" href="../../证据/fec48e8d8c50020f9100180f81d0a4dc12babdb60874726b2d057a82ccbf9595.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fec48e8d8c50</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::GetParamValue</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="899f07f099c67f1f7adfca5ec3ca11800d64fad98639d1672f2062f8a71c8450" href="../../证据/899f07f099c67f1f7adfca5ec3ca11800d64fad98639d1672f2062f8a71c8450.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>899f07f099c6</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::GetParamValue</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c6ffb5748afbd7d7bd81bc8aa5d5b004564876b83498f4cf9b61a9f55711c08" href="../../证据/2c6ffb5748afbd7d7bd81bc8aa5d5b004564876b83498f4cf9b61a9f55711c08.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c6ffb5748af</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::GetBinaryData</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f41c57cbfaaacf8d98fecb8514739f0b450a0d20dbbc82dea89e8fe83a408062" href="../../证据/f41c57cbfaaacf8d98fecb8514739f0b450a0d20dbbc82dea89e8fe83a408062.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f41c57cbfaaa</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：动态参数、out IntPtr二进制重载以及native参数存储的寿命不由此ref byte[]路径代替；未执行native查询。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ02" id="RQ02"><summary>RQ02 · QueryModuleHistoryResultData主动查询 → PreProData托管结果数组与正常尾释放；不是无条件像素深拷贝</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>新分配的是托管结果描述符数组；其内部image/chunk载荷的所有权必须逐分支解释，不等于整批像素都独立。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>本方法直接返回转换结果，不把它提交给VmSolution结果回调或VmIO；调用方保存数组可独立延长其中引用的可达性。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>正常尾请求释放查询根容器；返回后的共享名、复制池指针与外部像素的有效性不能由此Release成功推出。异常路径是否有native外层回收仍未知。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>此方法明确以bResBuffFirst=false、bNeedImage=true、bUseResStructMap=false查询历史页。成功且根指针非零后读取结构、展开原结果数组，为每项调用ModuleManager.PreProData，再调用IMVS_ReleaseDynamicMemory释放历史结果列表，错误码非零则抛异常，最后返回托管结果数组。尽管注释称“深拷贝”，方法没有逐图强制GetData或复制共享映射：图像是否借用、保留共享名或已物化仍由DI04/DI07中LargeObject与chunk分支决定。预处理或结构展开抛异常时，该体没有finally保证走到正常尾Release。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>public ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX_Data[] QueryModuleHistoryResultData(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c89528c775244a8b6825a9ec835e8d991bd62768a57243b54d2b39d8a1fca29" href="../../证据/5c89528c775244a8b6825a9ec835e8d991bd62768a57243b54d2b39d8a1fca29.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c89528c7752</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::QueryModuleHistoryResultData</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f5855c829665e2df874ddfecc95a59d0da72c3d2393feed4c9233d334cb5b294" href="../../证据/f5855c829665e2df874ddfecc95a59d0da72c3d2393feed4c9233d334cb5b294.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f5855c829665</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：native释放种类的递归释放范围、借用像素在根容器释放后的有效期及异常外部清理尚未闭合；不能仅因无finally就声称原机已发生泄漏。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ03" id="RQ03"><summary>RQ03 · 历史分页查询 / QueryModuleOneResult → 显式所有权页句柄与映射结构返回的不同契约</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>OneResult返回包含指针的原始结果结构，尚未PreProData；历史页另向调用者提供查询根句柄。原始结构不是ImageData或已独立byte[]。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>OneResult本体不向VmIO提交结果，也不发布PB01事件；映射结构可能由native结果缓存管理，其实际有效期未在托管体说明。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本体没有显式Release并不足以判定泄漏，也不足以保证可永久保留；必须恢复bUseResStructMap=true的native所有权契约。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>历史分页重载以bUseResStructMap=false查询，成功时把根pQueryModuResInfoList交ref pstModuleResBuff，并返回浅结构；成功释放才把传入ref置零（容器Release的非幂等边界见DR02）。QueryModuleOneResult则请求index0、count1，只显式传bResBuffFirst（默认true）；ServerSDKAPI默认bNeedImage=true、bUseResStructMap=true。OneResult成功且nNum==1时只返回array[0]，其余正常情况返回null；未把本地查询根指针传给调用方，也没有本体显式Release。两条路径的映射模式不同，不能要求或推定调用方用同一容器释放协议。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_QUERY_MODULE_RES_INFO_LIST? QueryModuleHistoryResult(uint nModuleID, int nIndex, uint </p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b9e2e504cb3f0db9f2a6e195347b7787d499c9d9d65fbea1ad1a82d1dead7307" href="../../证据/b9e2e504cb3f0db9f2a6e195347b7787d499c9d9d65fbea1ad1a82d1dead7307.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b9e2e504cb3f</small></a><p>public int ReleaseModuleHistoryResult(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="00fa40a130c8139de3f081dadc2add7bcd0c9351efd7fc8562303c16a22cf9d7" href="../../证据/00fa40a130c8139de3f081dadc2add7bcd0c9351efd7fc8562303c16a22cf9d7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>00fa40a130c8</small></a><p>public ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_MODULE_RESULT_INFO_LIST_EX? QueryModuleOneResult(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="476577d41fc4f856ec2706f213d03931fd9bb02c9c2b00ccc511b3c890dc18a2" href="../../证据/476577d41fc4f856ec2706f213d03931fd9bb02c9c2b00ccc511b3c890dc18a2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>476577d41fc4</small></a><p>public static int IMVS_QueryModuleHistoryResult(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="101aa8ff02f52ff0598f105e46ffd819c6f9863b69d551e17e04b62fa787df4b" href="../../证据/101aa8ff02f52ff0598f105e46ffd819c6f9863b69d551e17e04b62fa787df4b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>101aa8ff02f5</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::QueryModuleHistoryResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d2a09f5e808ac8a517dfd85b6fb19cd25a03e3ce2a1389f409d260ed676ab3d1" href="../../证据/d2a09f5e808ac8a517dfd85b6fb19cd25a03e3ce2a1389f409d260ed676ab3d1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d2a09f5e808a</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::ReleaseModuleHistoryResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="10819bfdb712bc2cc5b8055252489581273fbb28ced5c45188c314282f5947fd" href="../../证据/10819bfdb712bc2cc5b8055252489581273fbb28ced5c45188c314282f5947fd.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>10819bfdb712</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::QueryModuleOneResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="56edddf6a82f7044ad214fa5e6e6adfbfb8464608922b98c812f902d504fade0" href="../../证据/56edddf6a82f7044ad214fa5e6e6adfbfb8464608922b98c812f902d504fade0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>56edddf6a82f</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ServerSDKAPI::IMVS_QueryModuleHistoryResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a25d72e897a875b3c3198009e270fc8882070abec741f44d57c865180e8e2263" href="../../证据/a25d72e897a875b3c3198009e270fc8882070abec741f44d57c865180e8e2263.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a25d72e897a8</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：映射结果是否借用缓存、何时换帧/覆盖、是否按模块保存根容器及并发查询失效规则仍是native未知；不能把映射true等同历史页false的malloc所有权。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="RQ04" id="RQ04"><summary>RQ04 · DynamicOutput.GetOutputImage / GetOutputImageV2 → 主动OneResult物化字节与已有IO载荷按模式构造SDK图像两分支</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>旧入口输出ByteArrayData.pData；V2输出SDK ImageBaseData。二者都不是UI Apps.Data.ImageData，也不直接接RenderDataCenter。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>旧入口对GetData(false)返回值不再额外复制；V2浅模式保持共享名/映射对象，深模式使用字节数组，后续SDK指针、pin及映射寿命仍分别见DI01–03。浅模式遇非0/2的MemoryType可返回仅填几何元数据、未挂共享对象的ImageBaseData，不能虚构自动回退复制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这些调用者没有释放查询页容器；旧入口使用映射true的OneResult，不能套用历史分页Release。V2构造对象不等于复制/释放原IO载荷；SDK Dispose解除pin与共享映射关闭仍是分开的机制。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>旧GetOutputImage先验证输出IO存在，再QueryModuleOneResult→PreProData；按type4及去%后的参数名找图像，nValueNum>0时只取第0个chunk.GetData(false)，把所得byte[]及长度直接赋ByteArrayData。V2不走该旧入口：它调用VmModule.GetImageByteData读取IMAGE父IO的第0子项chunk及宽高格式子项；浅复制模式只在MemoryType0/2时取共享名，其余模式调用GetData(false)。V2浅复制新建ImageBaseData、填宽高格式，有共享名才InitImageObjBySharedMem（new SharedMemoryItemVM(name,模块ExecuteCount)）；非浅复制用得到的数组构造ImageBaseData。IO.Value可能先触发DR01按计数刷新，不能把V2误画成无条件重新OneResult或PB回调路径。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p>public ByteArrayData GetOutputImage(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2c9334a81378ce99e32f6a1fddb6878cbbe2f06de4efd0483b882d42f67b6b4b" href="../../证据/2c9334a81378ce99e32f6a1fddb6878cbbe2f06de4efd0483b882d42f67b6b4b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2c9334a81378</small></a><p>public ImageBaseData GetOutputImageV2(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8c9050ada41e5b22991a315c314c6788c16a30809aac387ec43e755623d8c3fc" href="../../证据/8c9050ada41e5b22991a315c314c6788c16a30809aac387ec43e755623d8c3fc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8c9050ada41e</small></a><p>public IVmImageData GetImageByteData(</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="442220815679a7d78086bd28813d80c671967954e2b373ed78be9d65bffab3ac" href="../../证据/442220815679a7d78086bd28813d80c671967954e2b373ed78be9d65bffab3ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>442220815679</small></a><p>public void InitImageObjBySharedMem(</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2dd127846362aac9bf7d968a6979c3f5219a97e67577a253f97f7bbc0b425771" href="../../证据/2dd127846362aac9bf7d968a6979c3f5219a97e67577a253f97f7bbc0b425771.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2dd127846362</small></a><p>VM.Core.DynamicOutput::GetOutputImage</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b14df34eec9074f8d308dac5a714653ded2ad277aef61ad7cb5792110e16bded" href="../../证据/b14df34eec9074f8d308dac5a714653ded2ad277aef61ad7cb5792110e16bded.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b14df34eec90</small></a><p>VM.Core.DynamicOutput::GetOutputImageV2</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d8f631ca311a37d1b5ede47dd41448ba6f8ccd16af891dc05c15447558278daa" href="../../证据/d8f631ca311a37d1b5ede47dd41448ba6f8ccd16af891dc05c15447558278daa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d8f631ca311a</small></a><p>VM.Core.VmModule::GetImageByteData</p><p>原件 · 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c2bb861235f457a2d8ff8439f9dc72851b2e1dd1f1014376d04e7262f9be78e4" href="../../证据/c2bb861235f457a2d8ff8439f9dc72851b2e1dd1f1014376d04e7262f9be78e4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c2bb861235f4</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleResultManager::InitImageObjBySharedMem</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="57b43645cf5c82bd38a1803843b5a792b9b11fd18014a48933f034042fbe1a90" href="../../证据/57b43645cf5c82bd38a1803843b5a792b9b11fd18014a48933f034042fbe1a90.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>57b43645cf5c</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原机同次宽高格式与共享图像的帧一致性、模块ExecuteCount与共享头当前计数的完整校验规则仍需运行/native证据；名字相同不证明同一实例。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="WL01" id="WL01"><summary>WL01 · 原CVmObjectBase平台注册 → 无后缀IMVS_RegisterOutputPlatformInfoCallBack及静态委托根</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>平台通用回调=外层结构指针+user指针；不是直接的单模块图像数组回调。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>静态委托字段与静态事件保持托管引用；ModuleManager构造订阅OnModuleResultExCallBack，不据此声称全部实例生命周期与解订阅已闭合。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>DestroyHandle是native句柄边界，不证明回调已排空；委托被静态引用与native停止调用是两项独立寿命条件。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>CVmObjectBase将delegateOutputCallBackFunc保存在静态字段PlatformInfoCallBack，再以mhandle、此委托和default(IntPtr) user调用ServerSDKAPI.IMVS_RegisterOutputPlatformInfoCallBack。包装直接调用同名NativeMethods，DllImport绑定.\iMVS-6000PlatformSDK.dll，CharSet.Ansi，无EntryPoint改名；V32是另一独立声明/包装，不是这条注册边。delegateOutputCallBack声明StdCall/Ansi，参数为两个IntPtr、返回void。静态字段保持托管委托可达，所选DisconnectServer仅FtpDeInit、DestroyHandle及清mhandle，未清委托字段。注册非0分支只new VmException，没有throw，故不能把走到后续初始化当成注册成功。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>CVmObjectBase.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="785528b2b56b08e9fd37146affa777dec5dcaae8a5dc76006529efddd82fbeb0" href="../../证据/785528b2b56b08e9fd37146affa777dec5dcaae8a5dc76006529efddd82fbeb0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>785528b2b56b</small></a><p>CVmObjectBase.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb46c900a63e4a0dbf222fc409a3527292192d623bb440baf67f66948e728932" href="../../证据/bb46c900a63e4a0dbf222fc409a3527292192d623bb440baf67f66948e728932.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb46c900a63e</small></a><p>CVmObjectBase.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0dc273aa8a29a7ed67e2f0bd152c1a89c20f6d70b6aa733d4cc0b11468b02cb5" href="../../证据/0dc273aa8a29a7ed67e2f0bd152c1a89c20f6d70b6aa733d4cc0b11468b02cb5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0dc273aa8a29</small></a><p>delegateOutputCallBack.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f9a933fa6b37fa8ad4e5d9164a9badafb49963a09aab27068c138fa655d651f3" href="../../证据/f9a933fa6b37fa8ad4e5d9164a9badafb49963a09aab27068c138fa655d651f3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f9a933fa6b37</small></a><p>ServerSDKAPI.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9588abb20fa5b49501aab8c4da9ae97794d3359563c4d12f464e410747a7ef0e" href="../../证据/9588abb20fa5b49501aab8c4da9ae97794d3359563c4d12f464e410747a7ef0e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9588abb20fa5</small></a><p>NativeMethods.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7f2bd3d12b9349363b3b3b5908bbdd0fd8e7c21e21d5a5beb6e57584a4a3b2b7" href="../../证据/7f2bd3d12b9349363b3b3b5908bbdd0fd8e7c21e21d5a5beb6e57584a4a3b2b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7f2bd3d12b93</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：尚无实际注册运行结果、native callback排空/解绑本体；不将静态root等同于线程安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：本条只针对当前ConnectServer实际caller，不把其他PF/Object/V32导出并入同一路。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="WL05" id="WL05"><summary>WL05 · 原LargeObject nUseRealData与IMVS_MODULE_CHUNK_VALUE_EX_Data → 共享名延迟读取、指针入池复制或最终byte[]复制</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>模式0/2在LargeObject时延迟持有名字/地址描述；模式1默认即时复制到SDK共享池。之后GetData()返回托管数组又是一层复制。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>对象pData缓存的是SDK池地址；池wrap或扩容可改变该地址内容/有效性，不能把对象还存活当作原帧仍有效。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>共享映射正常路径UnmapViewOfFile/CloseHandle；池扩容释放旧HGlobal，未见按每个chunk单独free池片段的机制。返回byte[]交GC；生产者指针仍须其生命周期协议。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>LargeObject模式0只保存共享名并置IsMemory；模式2保存共享名、native指针和长度但仍IsMemory；模式1保存指针/长度且立即FillData。FillData通过ImvsSdkDefine.GetByteFromMemoryIntptr默认bUseMemPool=true进MemoryHelper.VMReadFromMemoryPtr，GetBytes取得池区后memcpy复制；禁用pool的该helper支路才直接返回原pointer。共享名FillData走VMReadFromMemory，读16字节头，解析长度/状态字节8/偏移14，复制映射内容到池或byte[]后Unmap/Close。对象GetData()另建byte[]并Marshal.Copy，是再一次独立内容复制。池GetBytes在容量越界时offset回0，单块超过容量时free旧pool再分配，故池指针缓存不是永久不可变像素所有权。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>ModuleManager.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="472615a54b2680de5eb9ec76bc979b1cda7220ad3c7a303ad7b76408c638a4b6" href="../../证据/472615a54b2680de5eb9ec76bc979b1cda7220ad3c7a303ad7b76408c638a4b6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>472615a54b26</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4777db9ae688b46f3d8966bc1eea385713d051b1c404ddbee72761eb97b180ab" href="../../证据/4777db9ae688b46f3d8966bc1eea385713d051b1c404ddbee72761eb97b180ab.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4777db9ae688</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9416949c498b3f3bc211558c76dc7eb96de5e2bf2aed505dfb8a2e01ed57d7ee" href="../../证据/9416949c498b3f3bc211558c76dc7eb96de5e2bf2aed505dfb8a2e01ed57d7ee.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9416949c498b</small></a><p>ImvsSdkDefine.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6eb8aa45f7fa6fd202509757aabaedada66c6afa176b370ef1a04e2c2f37c68f" href="../../证据/6eb8aa45f7fa6fd202509757aabaedada66c6afa176b370ef1a04e2c2f37c68f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6eb8aa45f7fa</small></a><p>MemoryHelper.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="82cc07837eb973ef6d4693ba4c5388deb3f1ab243707aa89b5afea89324e7465" href="../../证据/82cc07837eb973ef6d4693ba4c5388deb3f1ab243707aa89b5afea89324e7465.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>82cc07837eb9</small></a><p>MemoryHelper.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b259f943bf2371dc4748d5694f6a07f6c5b78b2455aa66e0e57174716b971258" href="../../证据/b259f943bf2371dc4748d5694f6a07f6c5b78b2455aa66e0e57174716b971258.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b259f943bf23</small></a><p>MemoryHelper.cs</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a7