 <small>839e56fa415f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：实际桌面DLL装载及原生异步调用者/注销排空仍未执行核验。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="SN02" id="SN02"><summary>SN02 · 原历史查询→0x69df50→0x6b9950 → 构造结果记录并写入header执行计数字段</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>模块header执行计数、图像chunk字段与映射头计数是不同存储位置。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>记录数组/每参数容器分别分配；字段布局一致不证明回调与主动查询取自同一运行实例。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>header发布与动态查询容器释放分别追踪，不能以header已填充推断像素已复制。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>IMVS_QueryModuleHistoryResult通过句柄门后转0x69df50；该路径按0xe8字节构造每模块记录，并逐项调用0x6b9950。转换体把中间字段uStack_68高32位写piVar32[0x2d]，即结果记录偏移0xb4=180；原汇编0x1806b9cdf也明确写[RDI+0xb4]。这与WL03实取的x64托管nExecuteCount偏移一致，定位了结果header的一处原生写入；它没有在这里证明图像映射头+80也同时写入相同值。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>        uVar5 = FUN_18069df50</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4d8c42c37459e1b2f4b7d07d42029bb67032a18673f390ed4bb1634159ee727e" href="../../证据/4d8c42c37459e1b2f4b7d07d42029bb67032a18673f390ed4bb1634159ee727e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4d8c42c37459</small></a><p>      iVar11 = FUN_1806b9950</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="94edf608db2f5f89710a88bbc1c7c847197ab938c91a65e05c98068e9b2540f9" href="../../证据/94edf608db2f5f89710a88bbc1c7c847197ab938c91a65e05c98068e9b2540f9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>94edf608db2f</small></a><p>  piVar32[2] =</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b108eb53b8cbcaf2e243ee3f4d57de0b7367831b276650a43be97e1f9aea150c" href="../../证据/b108eb53b8cbcaf2e243ee3f4d57de0b7367831b276650a43be97e1f9aea150c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b108eb53b8cb</small></a><p>1806b9cd8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="41a0b424409a35cbe8ea5a76d0cc6a080e4c780154b157413fc798277c51db9e" href="../../证据/41a0b424409a35cbe8ea5a76d0cc6a080e4c780154b157413fc798277c51db9e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>41a0b424409a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：中间执行计数的业务生成、与映射头的同帧一致性、回调路径的全部版本分支仍待核。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="SN03" id="SN03"><summary>SN03 · 原type4图像字符串→288字节chunk → 长度/指针/共享名、公开模式和内部释放标志分开写</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>288字节元素是图像载荷描述；pData、nLen、strValue及nUseRealData与WL02的元数据布局分开对应。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>描述指向的原像素可能来自共享映射，描述数组自身是另外一次分配；不能将二者寿命混用。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>0x114在托管布局属于保留区，但原生释放体确实读取它；不能只凭nUseRealData模式值判断最终free。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>0x6b9950所选type4分支设置参数type=4，在图像数组按0x120=288字节分配元素。有效转换分支将描述按原件分隔符下划线拆分，至少两个token才继续：长度经atoi，第二项按原%p格式解析像素地址，第三项存在时复制到元素+0xc的260字节名称域；写长度+8、公开模式+0x110为2、内部字+0x114为1。所选无有效数据分支则置像素/长度为0、模式为1、内部字为0。模式与内部字并不是同一个字段；所选分支没有把整张图像复制进这个描述元素。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>                auVar9._8_8_ = 0;</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ca49c68c079e5ea1a9df5f94067fa6eadf94c497b13b8bd3ab42a66dc4029ae6" href="../../证据/ca49c68c079e5ea1a9df5f94067fa6eadf94c497b13b8bd3ab42a66dc4029ae6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ca49c68c079e</small></a><p>1806ba9b1</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="35f402975e8652f88b688895ec3e58fc6dfbcb87490dd010c6de7245011a45f5" href="../../证据/35f402975e8652f88b688895ec3e58fc6dfbcb87490dd010c6de7245011a45f5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>35f402975e86</small></a><p>                  *(undefined4 *)(lVar21 + 8 + *(longlong *)(puVar36 + 0x2a)) = uVar16;</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="558416f61cdbe199da601864d95583759a86becb71540d049ced32b82cbc264e" href="../../证据/558416f61cdbe199da601864d95583759a86becb71540d049ced32b82cbc264e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>558416f61cdb</small></a><p>1806baaa5</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a9478120d65dbfd78fabc66417a61af2d0b5d8aab7b2e610b8b0d8c462b59a94" href="../../证据/a9478120d65dbfd78fabc66417a61af2d0b5d8aab7b2e610b8b0d8c462b59a94.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a9478120d65d</small></a><p>1806bab57</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb41e603dde39baf32dbe1031a6833140062057853b2a8b180577473e4a9c075" href="../../证据/bb41e603dde39baf32dbe1031a6833140062057853b2a8b180577473e4a9c075.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb41e603dde3</small></a><p>Image descriptor protocol and distinct fields</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7a1a52ce081fa74aa958f9af3d8918349f13665cdb086ff87cee475d58375f3e" href="../../证据/7a1a52ce081fa74aa958f9af3d8918349f13665cdb086ff87cee475d58375f3e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7a1a52ce081f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它类型/映射模式及分割/数值转换的全部错误语义没有由本切片泛化；中间描述来源到ModuleFrame同一次写入仍未闭合。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="SN04" id="SN04"><summary>SN04 · 原动态释放selector9 → 图像数组与像素指针按内部字分开清理</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>根容器、模块记录、参数数组、chunk数组和pData像素分别有释放门；公开模式字段与内部释放字独立。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>该API清调用者查询容器，不意味着原SDK内部cache、托管副本或显示位图清空。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>内部字1跳过所选pData删除并非证明最后读者安全；根释放后外部像素的真正owner/复用仍须继续追踪。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>原IMVS_RELEASE_MEMORY_TYPE中历史结果列表为值9；本次直接读取原native跳转表9项得到0x6af272。该片段先MOV RDX,RSI再call0x6c1390，其中RSI由分发入口R8保存，证实传入查询根指针；返回后另delete根。0x6c1390按每模块0xe8、每参数0xd0、每图像chunk0x120遍历：pImage中的像素指针非0且元素+0x114为0才调用delete[]，随后清指针；元素数组本身仍另delete[]。因此释放查询描述数组，并不无条件释放每个图像像素，更不等于关闭所有映射与显示读者。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>1806af09c</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cf3f161b6f6bef9d39fb405b8d2ff89a8fb0bd41ce14ea9f8fc13ee801a31e46" href="../../证据/cf3f161b6f6bef9d39fb405b8d2ff89a8fb0bd41ce14ea9f8fc13ee801a31e46.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cf3f161b6f6b</small></a><p>1806af272</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e3571e2280915f10aa297eccb9a73551b2ff14af05646c2ed0350229b2e20972" href="../../证据/e3571e2280915f10aa297eccb9a73551b2ff14af05646c2ed0350229b2e20972.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e3571e228091</small></a><p>                if (*(longlong *)(uVar8 + 0xa8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e1a265ced8f579232a260db4ef0f98dab9d38573b15592fe069379e62e097940" href="../../证据/e1a265ced8f579232a260db4ef0f98dab9d38573b15592fe069379e62e097940.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e1a265ced8f5</small></a><p>1806c14c8</p><p>原件 · b62d7e15588ccda6671228aebc11fec3e27aca878f0e03067e44b17d5a54a9a1 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b04df70330654ea8bfc5b5c58b11a8e727769f8db5d4da3750a6a7f921cb569" href="../../证据/0b04df70330654ea8bfc5b5c58b11a8e727769f8db5d4da3750a6a7f921cb569.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b04df703306</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：其它selector/异常/部分构造失败的全清理未全部关闭；所选private释放字不能反推全部模式下像素owner。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OR01" id="OR01"><summary>OR01 · ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged → 关闭当前参数窗后替换DecoratorSolution</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>旧/新IVmSolution、参数Window与方案装饰器是不同持有者；新建装饰器不证明旧图像payload已销毁。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>仅更新方案装饰器引用；关闭窗口的事件尾部另见OR03，不能把两步之间未核的binding当同一图像实例链。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本体没有原图像free/Dispose；参数窗Close与最终图像最后读者分别保留。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Solution依赖属性变化回调先看curTabControlBase是否为IsClosing=false的BaseWindow，仅该门通过才Close当前参数窗；新方案非null时创建新的VmSolutionDecorator并设DecorateSource，否则把DecoratorSolution置null。所选体对old solution的if块为空，没有直接调用旧decorator.Dispose、ClearDataStore或图像释放。这个外层入口不可用窗口关闭名补成渲染对象全部回收。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（1）</summary><p>ProcedureConfigControl.OnSolutionChanged</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="66d97591386a9a7e00aae5a6a2080ff500e87d4c569b561f420b34d5a02e3508" href="../../证据/66d97591386a9a7e00aae5a6a2080ff500e87d4c569b561f420b34d5a02e3508.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>66d97591386a</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：当前活宿主是否发生该DP变化、窗口是否确实关闭及该窗口卸载后的显示源解绑顺序未运行确认。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：旧DecoratorSolution是否另由集合/容器清理，尚未取得完整caller到payload退出的绑定链。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OR02" id="OR02"><summary>OR02 · ProcedureConfigControl流程容器更换/Remove/Reset → 解除集合订阅、移除装饰项与条件清选中项</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>装饰集合、选中项、通知布尔与底层模块结果仓分开；集合Clear仅撤销该容器的引用。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>集合与选择变化可能再由binding触发视图换源；本事实不将该后续关系自动升级为已证的图像释放。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Remove/Clear/取消订阅已见，未见直接像素释放；原显示换源后的局部DeInit是已有V02/V12等独立关系。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OnProceduresChanged对旧集合RemoveHandler并ClearProcedures，对新集合先Remove再Add CollectionChanged handler，随后按复制状态重新AddProcedures。ClearProcedures调用ResetDisposeStatus把IsDisposeNotify先true再false，再清DecoratedProcedures/DecoratedModules。Remove通知逐来源移除匹配装饰项，并仅在OldItems含当前DecorateSource时把SelectedItem/SelectedTabItem置null；Reset调用ClearProcedures。所选体没有逐装饰项调用Dispose。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>ProcedureConfigControl.OnProceduresChanged and Clear/Remove</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0ebd1cd7c85e604d2eb842e30a7156a103a019508e466ffb4b99f6422754ad32" href="../../证据/0ebd1cd7c85e604d2eb842e30a7156a103a019508e466ffb4b99f6422754ad32.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0ebd1cd7c85e</small></a><p>ProcedureConfigControl.Procedures_CollectionChanged</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="302ef77afbc17b5c17cd08f4da2c761586626c3e34313e5f7ff67593dfc5625c" href="../../证据/302ef77afbc17b5c17cd08f4da2c761586626c3e34313e5f7ff67593dfc5625c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>302ef77afbc1</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：已定位SearchDryPopup一个消费者及其退搜索事件行为；其它消费者与Release包装Dispose的更外层caller仍未闭合；包装层到MainViewControl的直接调用另见OR07。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：单模块删除的所有选择同步和全部UI消费者未闭合；不能以流程集合Remove代表所有模块删除都已清屏。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OR03" id="OR03"><summary>OR03 · 参数窗Closed → CurTabControlBase_Closed → 清窗引用/Tag，关闭参数与ROI状态</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>参数窗口、ModuleResultView.Tag、参数打开标志与主图像来源分别持有；Tag原先登记参数窗，退出仅解除该关联。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>主显示是否保留图像应按各显示仓的已有证据判断，不由关闭配置操作概括。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本体解除窗口/Tag引用并改变ROI准入；未证明图像像素、结果或渲染任务已释放/排空。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>参数窗创建后以WeakEventManager登记Closed。Closed处理使用Dispatcher.Invoke把curTabControlBase置null；ROIPartUI若是ModuleResultView只把其Tag置null，随后IsOpenParams=false、SetRoiVisible(false)，再让Undo服务RemoveEmptyOperation。这个所见关闭尾部没有把ModuleSource或ImageDataSource置null，也没有调用ClearDataStore/Decorator.Dispose。关参数窗不能直接读成清除主界面图像/历史结果。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>ProcedureConfigControl params window Closed registration</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="63ba9b45cd4a9537b1511ebea21413f332a068eff50fc77f15ec8292b857889e" href="../../证据/63ba9b45cd4a9537b1511ebea21413f332a068eff50fc77f15ec8292b857889e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>63ba9b45cd4a</small></a><p>ProcedureConfigControl.CurTabControlBase_Closed</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6