K CloseOneModule。删除结构/断IO关系和结果载荷最后读者不是同一保证。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>VmModule.Dispose</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VM.Core.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / retained manifest MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_758f593356d11c17370747b341d4b1992a0fe8ab3fd3176f70d4a6831c3d8517</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5b6e186007280557e1210b314f2380ba97c283370ed8c605740367c8fc4cbac" href="../../证据/a5b6e186007280557e1210b314f2380ba97c283370ed8c605740367c8fc4cbac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5b6e1860072</small></a><p>VmModule.CommonDispose and CloseModuleInterface</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VM.Core.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / retained manifest MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_758f593356d11c17370747b341d4b1992a0fe8ab3fd3176f70d4a6831c3d8517</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="2ab54e649a807b2a3d5121b39dadc80c41442f139b0f3ddc217a96b7f25dacb0" href="../../证据/2ab54e649a807b2a3d5121b39dadc80c41442f139b0f3ddc217a96b7f25dacb0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>2ab54e649a80</small></a><p>VmIO.Dispose</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VM.Core.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / retained manifest MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_758f593356d11c17370747b341d4b1992a0fe8ab3fd3176f70d4a6831c3d8517</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7211c13fdb00ec0d027c6fb98d3e836e9ee09f7acc514bd32673da848427d921" href="../../证据/7211c13fdb00ec0d027c6fb98d3e836e9ee09f7acc514bd32673da848427d921.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7211c13fdb00</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：CloseOneModule底层句柄/缓冲退出、删除后旧显示装饰器是否收到换源通知及所有最后读者未在本切片闭合。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：异常时IsOnDispose复位不等于前面已完成的IO/模型移除具有事务回滚。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OR05" id="OR05"><summary>OR05 · VmSolution.Dispose(bool isTakeOver) → 向VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle传0或1</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>后台接管参数、SDKMode路径、应用退出与托管渲染仓是不同边界。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>bool重载本体没有枚举图像或显示结果缓存；原/native handle释放和托管最后读者需要分列。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>确认SDK销毁请求的具体实参，不能由DestoryHandle名称推定像素/位图全部释放或所有回调已排空。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>现有应用退出已有L17调用VmSolution.Dispose(isRunBackground)。本轮只补到该bool重载的实际体：记录DestoryHandle日志，然后调用mVmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle(isTakeOver?1:0)。无参Dispose还有SDKMode的DestoryThirdHandle任务+SyncWaitor路径，另一路base.Dispose后调用bool重载并设置IsDispose；不能把这些重载自动当同一退出模式。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（1）</summary><p>VmSolution.Dispose overloads</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VM.Core.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 936763f6c8a1bf9fcf59f22acebca8feb09b5f3d5701ae77c82bdc81e626190d / retained manifest MVID 290025bc-e040-4cd5-94dd-cd49b9af9c99; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_758f593356d11c17370747b341d4b1992a0fe8ab3fd3176f70d4a6831c3d8517</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0a3f5530efb9f56b35bfa7ad7170731d57c50b4dae70ef188cfaa13e7d1afb63" href="../../证据/0a3f5530efb9f56b35bfa7ad7170731d57c50b4dae70ef188cfaa13e7d1afb63.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0a3f5530efb9</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：VmInterfaceManager.DestoryHandle原生接收体、后台接管实际存活资源、异步回调全部停止时点未取，本轮不启动原版。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OR06" id="OR06"><summary>OR06 · MainViewControl.Dispose可调用入口 → 仅将其模板ModuleResultView.ModuleSource设null</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>模板子控件引用mrv与当前ModuleSource独立；将来源设null是视图源解绑，不等于直接释放所有底层图像。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>若WPF判定值未变化，源变化回调是否再次发生不能由本体保证；实际场景顺序未验证。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>仅证此可调用API局部效果，自动触发和最后像素回收均未闭合。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>OnApplyTemplate把m_ModuleView取为ModuleResultView，Dispose仅在mrv非null时将ModuleSource置null。该属性后续若实际发生变化，可关联已有V02的旧decorator清理；本体没有调用RenderThreadPool.ShutDown，也没有直接清所有图层/历史仓。本轮已定位Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose的直接调用（OR07）；该Release.Dispose在具体退出/换方案场景中的更外层caller仍未闭合，不能宣称每次切方案/主窗关闭都必经。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>MainViewControl.OnApplyTemplate</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0431aae4b9643d76cbdb092681e0a1fee3dd47a9ea5d0b37b1ad98c70f3a9e99" href="../../证据/0431aae4b9643d76cbdb092681e0a1fee3dd47a9ea5d0b37b1ad98c70f3a9e99.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0431aae4b964</small></a><p>MainViewControl.Dispose</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="36b92bec24219f0e5d773fbe516505ddeebad224dbc6fe5239f3348014294ee1" href="../../证据/36b92bec24219f0e5d773fbe516505ddeebad224dbc6fe5239f3348014294ee1.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>36b92bec2421</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.MainViewControl.Dispose / 0x06000182</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / actual PE MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1145a4f5f1a5532137ac46fefbd6b1a1f5ccab036134adc5a587093d9080ccca" href="../../证据/1145a4f5f1a5532137ac46fefbd6b1a1f5ccab036134adc5a587093d9080ccca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1145a4f5f1a5</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：初始三个PE的5630个有体方法查得0直接引用，仅是有限scope；随后补入Release层986个方法并定位VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose直接调用（OR07）。它的更外层caller、224个接口候选和动态分派仍未知，不能声称每次切方案/关主窗都已释放图像。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OR07" id="OR07"><summary>OR07 · Release.VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose → 退宿主事件 → MainViewControl.Dispose → Content=null</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>shell窗口、Release用户控件、普通MainViewControl与其ModuleResultView是不同层；这个静态直接caller已接上OR06，但不把所有对象合并为一个实例。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>包装Dispose会撤销Content引用和方案事件订阅；不证明历史结果/排队工作或native像素最后读者已退。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>只有实际调用该Release.Dispose后才到普通MainViewControl源解绑；它的具体更外层调用者/触发器和异常路径仍待核。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>已恢复的Release包装层Dispose先调用自身Unloaded处理以解除方案事件，再解除RestoreDefaultDisplay，mainViewControl非null才调用其Dispose，最后Content=null。新PE扫描确认其method token 0x06000038、IL offset 40的call目标正是VMControls.WPF.MainViewControl.Dispose（MemberRef 0x0a000086），不是接口候选猜测。保留shell MainWindow.xaml实例化Release控件、该控件XAML嵌入普通MainViewControl的声明，原三份对应BAML资源已重取。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>VmMainViewConfigControl.Dispose</p><p>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\Applications\myLibs\VMControls.WPF.Release.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / retained manifest MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_a918cd360fa79355d034af6cececb5969cb4d437