te-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="327e119e4c09f1db6f1ca72038df0a5358cc4f6be4f93431e56ff1078c5eb3fb" href="../../证据/327e119e4c09f1db6f1ca72038df0a5358cc4f6be4f93431e56ff1078c5eb3fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>327e119e4c09</small></a><p>VMControls.WPF.Release.VmMainViewConfigControl::Dispose / 0x06000038</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.Release.dll · Rehashed SHA256 c016bd0a78681672a6615ceebb4bc4b9f114c4f7037771a6cd9348309655b9b6 / actual PE MVID 5f9126e4-1370-4549-8835-ca81604c764b · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7381cbf37a0ed78115f422b7342f4fec3123aeaa0cd91a1b4229b4f008d0849e" href="../../证据/7381cbf37a0ed78115f422b7342f4fec3123aeaa0cd91a1b4229b4f008d0849e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7381cbf37a0e</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：谁在具体关闭主窗/切方案操作中调用Release.Dispose尚未定位，不能由XAML构造或IDisposable实现推自动调用。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原生像素与显示最后读者、全部异常退出和主宿主实际运行顺序仍未知。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="OR08" id="OR08"><summary>OR08 · ResetDisposeStatus → ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify → true通知只解除搜索控件事件，不调用图像Dispose</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>搜索弹窗、其宿主Window事件引用、MainViewControl图像来源和结果仓分开。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>退搜索事件仅影响所列订阅；DeleteSelf本体也没有清SearchResultCollection或销毁渲染仓的合同。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这一个已定位消费者的局部事件退役已证；其余消费者、模板活绑定及像素最后读者均另列。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus将IsDisposeNotify先true再false。保留ZoomArea.xaml将祖先ProcedureConfigControl的该属性绑定到DryPopup.IsDisposeNotify；该DP注册OnDisposeStatusChanged，只有NewValue=true才DeleteSelf。DeleteSelf解除TextBox的TextChanged/LostFocus/GotFocus、清除按钮Click及宿主Window的LocationChanged/Deactivated，再_window=null。所选完整体没有调用MainViewControl.Dispose，不清图像或模块结果；这条通知不能再被当成图像释放触发器。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>ProcedureConfigControl.ResetDisposeStatus</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3375484b483239e0751c17bca2580121e8e95cb7cfb59ad9a9e19160d03676be" href="../../证据/3375484b483239e0751c17bca2580121e8e95cb7cfb59ad9a9e19160d03676be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3375484b4832</small></a><p>ZoomArea SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify binding</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fdf6f7ea70fb89883a6856e1060489ce7ec6a3692d54af0631acea42bcd0100c" href="../../证据/fdf6f7ea70fb89883a6856e1060489ce7ec6a3692d54af0631acea42bcd0100c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fdf6f7ea70fb</small></a><p>SearchDryPopup.IsDisposeNotify registration</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="435b9009f142317bc6ab4da9a1d4da3b33f4bab34e2e0fe78f9628d74d31ca82" href="../../证据/435b9009f142317bc6ab4da9a1d4da3b33f4bab34e2e0fe78f9628d74d31ca82.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>435b9009f142</small></a><p>SearchDryPopup.OnDisposeStatusChanged and DeleteSelf</p><p>D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/myLibs/VMControls.WPF.dll · Rehashed original SHA256 99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / retained manifest MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d; member CIL not freshly recaptured in this slice · ev_3eb1fd75ae8c1c32c6ae332a1cf0b6d1ea816b3794cf22eee230719d5af4dcd6</p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="027e1e5619a259e94d10d13d58c00dceebd323a96eca915ff4b20b805744b306" href="../../证据/027e1e5619a259e94d10d13d58c00dceebd323a96eca915ff4b20b805744b306.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>027e1e5619a2</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：当前只闭合一个静态模板消费者；原模板是否在特定宿主激活、其它IsDisposeNotify消费者与重复模板应用生命周期未穷举。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="DI08" id="DI08"><summary>DI08 · MemoryHelper.VMReadFromMemoryPtr / GetBytes → 共享静态复制池：偏移分配、回绕与扩容</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文 · 复用既有证据</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>static largeMemoryIntPtr/MaxMemoryLenth/offset；初始268435455字节</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>默认先GetBytes再memcpy；offset+length超容量则offset=0复用</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>只有单次请求超过容量时FreeHGlobal旧池并Alloc新池；所选体无逐chunk归还</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>静态构造分配268435455字节池，本次仅解码构造体，未执行分配。GetBytes从同一块原生内存返回偏移地址；容量不足回绕会复用旧位置，更大请求会释放旧池。VMReadFromMemoryPtr默认复制进该池，禁用池则直接返回传入地址；仅在所选体捕获AccessViolationException并设置ref错误。已有chunk引用不保证池中旧字节保持不变，不能把它视作永久缓存；GetBytes本体无锁，不推断调用端不存在其他同步。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.MemoryHelper::.cctor</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d198a828d2ba02e7de87cac0a7c36b943fcf42e250d908142762d4f0b5cb2234" href="../../证据/d198a828d2ba02e7de87cac0a7c36b943fcf42e250d908142762d4f0b5cb2234.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d198a828d2ba</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.MemoryHelper::GetBytes</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="113f8e536bfa09673db42f293abd577b24640d67f7f22f0f1a258c5cead7bc42" href="../../证据/113f8e536bfa09673db42f293abd577b24640d67f7f22f0f1a258c5cead7bc42.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>113f8e536bfa</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.MemoryHelper::VMReadFromMemoryPtr</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="80b6cdccacfd01b8374e0e5c69dee3cdba877aa82ee066e20750da3b12a2018f" href="../../证据/80b6cdccacfd01b8374e0e5c69dee3cdba877aa82ee066e20750da3b12a2018f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>80b6cdccacfd</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：静态池完整初始化/退出释放调用图、各线程外部同步和所有旧pData消费者仍需追；这里不执行原native分配/释放。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="DI09" id="DI09"><summary>DI09 · MemoryHelper共享头解析 → 拷贝读取与保留映射的不同寿命</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文 · 复用既有证据</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>长度Int64@0、标志byte@8、payload偏移Int16@14；借用分支执行计数UInt32@80</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>拷贝读取先映射16字节头，重映射payload后复制入池或byte[]；借用分支读128字节头</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>拷贝读取正常尾Unmap/Close；借用返回open/map句柄交SharedMemoryItemVM以后关闭</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>VMReadFromMemory从头覆盖传入startOffset：状态字节非0或负长度会早退。池模式memcpy后正常关闭映射；非池模式分配byte[]并Marshal.Copy后关闭。VMGetMemDataPtr则保留payload映射，把句柄、长度和执行计数写给调用者，返回view+payloadOffset。两个API不能共享同一个释放合同。拷贝体后半段没有finally包住复制，不能由正常尾Close宣称异常时也总能关闭。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.MemoryHelper::VMReadFromMemory</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="85a1ed8dc82d8b4e215abc1bb0b7ab1095623d53435efe96ef9b8906e6b4ff2b" href="../../证据/85a1ed8dc82d8b4e215abc1bb0b7ab1095623d53435efe96ef9b8906e6b4ff2b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>85a1ed8dc82d</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.MemoryHelper::VMGetMemDataPtr</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="395fcd59fa521ae14a297a5674a5fd6da6f6c946852654d2a9b9538a5f587fba" href="../../证据/395fcd59fa521ae14a297a5674a5fd6da6f6c946852654d2a9b9538a5f587fba.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>395fcd59fa52</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.SharedMemoryItemVM::DisposeRes</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="032ecf6be1920218d141a5fd5de05177736badccf52510788c90bf0f25b2b58c" href="../../证据/032ecf6be1920218d141a5fd5de05177736badccf52510788c90bf0f25b2b58c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>032ecf6be192</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：所选托管头读取不等于完整native生产协议；头与payload快照一致性、畸形偏移/溢出、执行计数检查消费者及异常关闭仍待证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="DR02" id="DR02"><summary>DR02 · QueryModuleRecentlyResult批次容器 → ReleaseModuleHistoryResult → 原native释放请求</summary><p>source-confirmed · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文 · 复用既有证据</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>ls保留每页pstModuleResBuff；nNums/pPbResultList描述页</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>按nTotalNum分页；无结果时Release已积累页后null</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Release逐页调用；本体未Clear原ls，也未建立幂等状态</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>SDK查询把每页原始缓冲地址加入ls。容器Release把ls[i]复制为局部IntPtr后按ref交ModuleManager；成功时该callee只将局部ref置零，原ls元素并未因此更新。返回码未由容器检查，也未清列表，故不能声称重复Release安全或所有页已成功释放。实际native只读捕获，未重复释放。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::QueryModuleRecentlyResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="67f9656efc1b40eb7fe42a6cb57203cf27cc468fec22d293f914cb7bb2030d78" href="../../证据/67f9656efc1b40eb7fe42a6cb57203cf27cc468fec22d293f914cb7bb2030d78.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>67f9656efc1b</small></a><p>.IMVS_QUERY_MODULE_RES_INFO_LIST_Class::Release</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9f03818f554e4c7ce2911de021ac5ce97bbcf7c7fc1f039dea8a63d0445012a6" href="../../证据/9f03818f554e4c7ce2911de021ac5ce97bbcf7c7fc1f039dea8a63d0445012a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9f03818f554e</small></a><p>VM.PlatformSDKCS.ModuleManager::ReleaseModuleHistoryResult</p><p>原件 · 34c0c90b00cb75a701685b96670b6490f61376f62eacc0ab29d240157db401c1 / MVID e7b3a3b0-7083-486a-8ca2-97cecec02ea2 · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="673d8a9503f2cb3d5005fdf9f477d705ca956036da8370925e1b61ea4936faeb" href="../../证据/673d8a9503f2cb3d5005fdf9f477d705ca956036da8370925e1b61ea4936faeb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>673d8a9503f2</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：IMVS_ReleaseDynamicMemory内部、失败后重试/双释放行为和外层是否保证恰一次释放仍需原native/调用链证明。</p></details></article><article><h4>当前独立实现</h4><p>窗口失效撤发布资格、节点/方案scope退役、临时native缓冲释放和托管引用回收是不同动作。</p><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS01" id="IS01"><summary>IS01 · ImageSourcePlugin.GetState / ExecuteAsync → 方案节点状态与本轮串行执行</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>State持Cache、PendingFrame、Folder/FolderPaths、Paths/Index/Sequence与StitchBuffer；本轮局部image和ModuleResult是另外的持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>同节点执行被State.Execution串行；整个插件没有持全局字典锁等待取图。SubmitImage交换PendingFrame不等于取得该执行信号量。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>本轮结束释放信号量和scope租约，不清缓存、拼接缓冲或待提交槽。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>有scope时使用scope.State(&quot;vision.image-source&quot;,NodeId)；真实root状态键另含ProcedureId。无scope时由插件实例按规范化BaseDirectory/NodeId保存State。Runtime只持owner，创建新Runtime不新建全部State。执行先持scope租约、链接调用token与scope.Stopping，参数/触发检查后才取得状态并等待State.Execution信号量；finally仅在成功进入信号量后Release。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>State GetState(ModuleExecutionContext context)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ba8f698edcb119342cee2dcddde7074069b73476a6b2051d31c5ea9bb543d250" href="../../证据/ba8f698edcb119342cee2dcddde7074069b73476a6b2051d31c5ea9bb543d250.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ba8f698edcb1</small></a><p>sealed class State:IDisposable</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e834393d2713cfd0ddfd942168e5a454545edac7aabc05f3d65cdfb3ac37ed3b" href="../../证据/e834393d2713cfd0ddfd942168e5a454545edac7aabc05f3d65cdfb3ac37ed3b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e834393d2713</small></a><p>using var lease=c.Scope?.Enter();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c6bb10623ad2ca48ad0893d3ae434c75b2a7c10d3a2d002c3232fa4af91cfc8f" href="../../证据/c6bb10623ad2ca48ad0893d3ae434c75b2a7c10d3a2d002c3232fa4af91cfc8f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c6bb10623ad2</small></a><p>state=owner.GetState(c);</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6f23e4c3cd93f05d6295d00340fcfd0f65a06ba85e60432d718fd452ce596392" href="../../证据/6f23e4c3cd93f05d6295d00340fcfd0f65a06ba85e60432d718fd452ce596392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6f23e4c3cd93</small></a><p>if(entered)state!.Execution.Release();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff19dc73faffc7460a28e01992e8cc8b3c89d14aa92ae9a59f0fef0fd90cf527" href="../../证据/ff19dc73faffc7460a28e01992e8cc8b3c89d14aa92ae9a59f0fef0fd90cf527.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff19dc73faff</small></a><p>public T State&lt;T></p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c" href="../../证据/b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b70c7dfc27c1</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：此处只核当前托管同步结构；不证明原版线程/回调调度或所有跨线程读者都经过同一门。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS03" id="IS03"><summary>IS03 · PathCache / PixelFormat / 路径列表变更 → 按路径首批保留，不是LRU</summary><p>independent-implementation · 本地文件</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>Dictionary&lt;string,IImageData>以Ordinal路径字符串为键，字典保留最终图像引用，不在Add时再复制像素。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>容量是新增准入上限，不是持续强制裁剪；列表Paths和像素Cache是不同容器。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Cache.Clear只移除字典引用；已发布结果仍可能保留同一图像，不能称立即释放像素。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>本地模式按所选路径字符串查State.Cache，命中直接取同一IImageData；未命中仅在Count&lt;PathCache时Add，不执行LRU替换。当前源码仅在执行到本地分支且PixelFormat参数改变时Clear全部Cache。降低PathCache（含变0）、删除列表项、切换CurrentImagePath、目录dirty刷新或文件内容变化，本段都没有逐项驱逐Cache；旧条目可继续占容量，仍命中的同路径可继续使用旧像素。进入相机或SDK模式本身也不执行这里的Clear。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>if(!state.Paths.SequenceEqual(paths,StringComparer.Ordinal))</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a5862cd16f69d06062bd59e3f11c358e588f403f4e7e86d3cea58511e4168e7c" href="../../证据/a5862cd16f69d06062bd59e3f11c358e588f403f4e7e86d3cea58511e4168e7c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a5862cd16f69</small></a><p>if(state.PixelFormat!=c.Integer(&quot;PixelFormat&quot;))</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d" href="../../证据/c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9b08bf7272f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未运行文件覆盖/参数切换的桌面时序探针；这里是源码确认的当前保留策略，不能用产品源码中的native注释代证原版相同。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS04" id="IS04"><summary>IS04 · LocalFolderSubscription文件事件 → 合并dirty → 目录路径列表 → 图像源执行</summary><p>independent-implementation · 本地文件</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>FileSystemWatcher通知 → 一个合并标志与路径列表；不把文件事件当成已经解码的新帧。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>FolderPaths刷新独立于Cache命中；同路径已缓存图像不因dirty自动重新解码。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>LocalFolderSubscription.Dispose在锁内标disposed并Dispose watcher；它不清图像源Cache。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>文件监视器仅持dirty标志与scope/node引用；Created/Deleted调用Changed(true)，Changed/Error调用Changed(false)，没有Rename订阅。Changed合并置dirty，只有requestRun且TriggerRun才请求运行。图像源执行ConsumeDirty后重建FolderPaths，RefreshImage为true时请求界面刷新；这不是像素缓存驱逐。离开文件夹模式或改变目录时关闭旧Folder；切换目录新建监视器。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>internal LocalFolderSubscription(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b204d0c93e4a998a273b34f4ff93e0fbc1ed12e560f8d3fc3bd0b1aa027d877d" href="../../证据/b204d0c93e4a998a273b34f4ff93e0fbc1ed12e560f8d3fc3bd0b1aa027d877d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b204d0c93e4a</small></a><p>void Changed(bool requestRun)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cb6a1ccc881159983e67372d5c6d51de8a553cc72aa7c17fd2581d4e04fe4a34" href="../../证据/cb6a1ccc881159983e67372d5c6d51de8a553cc72aa7c17fd2581d4e04fe4a34.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cb6a1ccc8811</small></a><p>if(!folderMode){state.Folder?.Dispose();state.Folder=null;}</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="561a669389e286fe59e8dcd94e06590b28e3aa025b7e2b0597cff83786cda941" href="../../证据/561a669389e286fe59e8dcd94e06590b28e3aa025b7e2b0597cff83786cda941.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>561a669389e2</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：原版完成端口事件与当前FileSystemWatcher并非已证明等价；事件丢失、并发改名和实际重入时序未运行核实。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS05" id="IS05"><summary>IS05 · SubmitImage(scope,node,image) → 单个PendingFrame引用槽 → SDK模式本轮image</summary><p>independent-implementation · SDK提交帧</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>提交者与PendingFrame可共用同一图像；消费只是引用转移到局部变量，并不创建图像副本。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>单槽最新提交覆盖，不是FIFO，不自动重用上轮已消费帧。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>覆盖/消费使槽解除旧引用，但提交者或旧结果仍可持有；当前image接口无统一Dispose合同。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>SubmitImage使用Interlocked.Exchange直接保存调用者传入的IImageData引用，没有克隆像素，也不排队；连续提交会覆盖尚未消费的旧槽，Exchange返回的旧值未被接收/Dispose。SDK模式执行以Exchange(PendingFrame,null)取走该引用；无帧则失败。取走后才检查取消并进入拼接/输出等后续分支；后续失败不会把该帧退回PendingFrame。SubmitImage的scope键必须与运行实际scope的procedure/module/node一致才能命中同一状态。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>public void SubmitImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bb8813bbe633b87c7eaadd31ae3bf21171f4f31296f596ad22a4ce6d73909782" href="../../证据/bb8813bbe633b87c7eaadd31ae3bf21171f4f31296f596ad22a4ce6d73909782.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bb8813bbe633</small></a><p>} else if(sourceMode==3){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8ac4f8733ef0b86e542cb7b36b9b92d7867893353c6aee48d2ddaaa819c892f6" href="../../证据/8ac4f8733ef0b86e542cb7b36b9b92d7867893353c6aee48d2ddaaa819c892f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8ac4f8733ef0</small></a><p>public T State&lt;T></p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c" href="../../证据/b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b70c7dfc27c1</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：SDK任意IImageData实现的内部缓冲是否可变/外借、以及调用者提交后继续写入是否安全，不能由引用槽或Interlocked保证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS06" id="IS06"><summary>IS06 · MvsCameraAcquisition.AcquireAsync → native临时缓冲 → 托管CameraFrame.Image</summary><p>independent-implementation · 相机帧</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>native采集缓冲 → 临时托管pixels → 构造器私有数组 → CameraFrame → 图像源image引用。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>设备句柄按cameraId保留于适配器；采集buffer/converted是每次调用的临时分配，不是源PathCache。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>两级native临时分配分别有finally；适配器Dispose停止/关闭/销毁已记入handles的设备并Unload ALC。静态libraries字典仍保留native库句柄，本Dispose没有NativeLibrary.Free。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>图像源取得IImageAcquisitionService后使用frame.Image引用，本身不在这里克隆。所选Mvs适配器在Task.Run的gate锁内读取相机；按PayloadSize分配native buffer。目标格式相符时Marshal.Copy到pixels；不符则额外分配converted，调用像素转换后Marshal.Copy，并在inner finally释放converted。返回CameraFrame前GrayImage/RgbImage构造器再复制pixels；outer finally释放buffer，因此此适配器返回的图像不借用已经释放的native buffer。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（9）</summary><p>var acquisition=c.Scope?.Service&lt;IImageAcquisitionService>();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3fe6260884a485a0f8551a76e626255f793384e8e1c80e9d2df4daf17b946992" href="../../证据/3fe6260884a485a0f8551a76e626255f793384e8e1c80e9d2df4daf17b946992.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3fe6260884a4</small></a><p>public ValueTask&lt;CameraFrame> AcquireAsync</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7096b3ee6cd40d856ad961597535b3f5f6c1efec4da268b106d4d637d28a947a" href="../../证据/7096b3ee6cd40d856ad961597535b3f5f6c1efec4da268b106d4d637d28a947a.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7096b3ee6cd4</small></a><p>object payload=Create(&quot;MVCC_INTVALUE_EX&quot;)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bd31ded643e85b6e135373ba1ff8fd15ec7243106ee1c11dca353fef6c1a75f9" href="../../证据/bd31ded643e85b6e135373ba1ff8fd15ec7243106ee1c11dca353fef6c1a75f9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bd31ded643e8</small></a><p>public void Dispose(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3984325f7fd5b9271f2ea9e147c459fddaafd772c3be7bdffd9aaf374b93db5b" href="../../证据/3984325f7fd5b9271f2ea9e147c459fddaafd772c3be7bdffd9aaf374b93db5b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3984325f7fd5</small></a><p>static readonly System.Collections.Concurrent.ConcurrentDictionary</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="991622a39a276116b97d13f12e7b08e7db09e1aa0e605250b5ea28dbe1eae8a8" href="../../证据/991622a39a276116b97d13f12e7b08e7db09e1aa0e605250b5ea28dbe1eae8a8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>991622a39a27</small></a><p>library=libraries.GetOrAdd(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0e2937453707587ed45e4b7c53dd4cc1e5f1cc2ac76e00f0c20eb7173c784932" href="../../证据/0e2937453707587ed45e4b7c53dd4cc1e5f1cc2ac76e00f0c20eb7173c784932.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0e2937453707</small></a><p>public GrayImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="39d9da2fcf35ee2429d744eb635fcc15fe77c20be34579af98e801af2a4afd97" href="../../证据/39d9da2fcf35ee2429d744eb635fcc15fe77c20be34579af98e801af2a4afd97.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>39d9da2fcf35</small></a><p>public RgbImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef631d278ac8a85a7c631785877a3353dbe5f4c318b357999250a368dff37e36" href="../../证据/ef631d278ac8a85a7c631785877a3353dbe5f4c318b357999250a368dff37e36.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef631d278ac8</small></a><p>public sealed record CameraFrame</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f407cec6c88d6a536e70c992701c67499aede13e8c5e161cb8a2eefde1728eff" href="../../证据/f407cec6c88d6a536e70c992701c67499aede13e8c5e161cb8a2eefde1728eff.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f407cec6c88d</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：未加载相机SDK、未采集设备；这里只核当前适配器源码。其它IImageAcquisitionService可有不同所有权策略，不能把本适配器的拷贝保证推广给全部服务。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：超时轮询/取消是合作检查，不证明native调用能被立刻抢占；Dispose中某个设备API抛错后的剩余清理也未由逐句成功保证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS09" id="IS09"><summary>IS09 · Reset / State.Dispose / scope退役 → 撤销状态持有 ≠ 确定释放所有像素</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>State、结果记录、预览图像和外部提交者是可能独立的引用持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>State从字典移除后仍可能暂被在飞执行持有；旧结果可继续持有已产生的图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这里确认的是移除状态、关闭watcher与scope清理；没有像素归零、立即GC或所有外部读者终止的保证。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>State.Dispose仅关闭Folder并设null，没有清Cache、PendingFrame、StitchBuffer，也没有Dispose Execution信号量。Reset(scope,node)通过scope.RemoveNode移除同procedure状态并调用State.Dispose；无scope的Reset(node)只从插件states字典移除，不调用被移除State.Dispose。root方案scope关闭先取消，等租约归零后清状态/拥有服务并Dispose可释放者；borrowed procedure scope.Dispose直接返回。因此不能把工具窗口关闭、单轮Runtime结束、Reset和方案关闭当成同一个释放事件。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>public void Dispose(){Folder?.Dispose();Folder=null;}</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b36ca791d92511568353cf1fb0d33867c4bf213aced36bdd042b169c60610ac9" href="../../证据/b36ca791d92511568353cf1fb0d33867c4bf213aced36bdd042b169c60610ac9.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b36ca791d925</small></a><p>public void Reset(ModuleExecutionScope</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105" href="../../证据/92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92647cab0979</small></a><p>public void Reset(string nodeId)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943" href="../../证据/13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13df7359670c</small></a><p>public void RemoveNode(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a><p>public void Dispose(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57" href="../../证据/02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02ecd73394ad</small></a><p>void Release(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：RemoveNode与在飞执行的所有者门由宿主另核；不从State.Dispose内容直接断言泄漏，也不以root租约退出证明全部显示/历史最后读者已结束。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="IS10" id="IS10"><summary>IS10 · LoadPreview / PrepareSave → 预览临时解码与持久化编码资源是另外两条支路</summary><p>independent-implementation · 本地文件</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>运行像素缓存 / 预览解码像素 / 保存的编码文件字节与Base64是三种载荷。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>预览不表示当前工具已经运行；保存列表和首N像素缓存的准入/容量彼此独立。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>using关闭编码流，不消灭资源字符串、最终预览图像或主运行缓存；这些由后续文档/显示持有者决定寿命。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>LoadPreview每次独立OpenEncodedImage并解码，不查询State.Cache。PrepareSave克隆节点参数，取配置列表或文件夹目录列表；SolSaveImageData为true时最多取120条路径，复制编码流到byte[]，计算hash并Base64写ResourceDocument，返回新参数与资源快照。它保存编码文件资源，而不是把正在运行的Cache、PendingFrame或StitchBuffer序列化。预览流在using退出关闭；保存中的stream和MemoryStream各自using，输出ResourceDocument继续持有Base64字符串。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（2）</summary><p>public VisionCore.IImageData LoadPreview(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="cd6e41496a3152e3ad79354b6e888860fce81a0e029c9eed047b5f45c5aba74c" href="../../证据/cd6e41496a3152e3ad79354b6e888860fce81a0e029c9eed047b5f45c5aba74c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>cd6e41496a31</small></a><p>public ToolAssetSnapshot PrepareSave(NodeDocument node,string baseDirectory,ResourceCatalog resources,ModuleExecutionScope? scope)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b8ad4dcda665119b00f2ab13c49383fddd75947f58e4229e17cc6531b0447a2" href="../../证据/3b8ad4dcda665119b00f2ab13c49383fddd75947f58e4229e17cc6531b0447a2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b8ad4dcda66</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：方案加载、资源验证实现、资源删除/去重及主窗预览释放需沿其消费者继续核；这条保存分支不证明原.sol格式兼容。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD04" id="TD04"><summary>TD04 · ModuleResult返回与运行器清理 → GraphExecutor过滤 / 校验 → NodeRunRecord</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>ModuleResult与NodeRunRecord是不同边界；容器复制不等于图像像素复制，readonly也不是内部对象所有权证明。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>每轮records以nodeId保存；WorkflowRunContext.Complete再把值投影到流程输出/显示/局部变量，可能增加同一图像的持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>单轮运行器Dispose不等于输出图像或跨轮scope状态Dispose；丢弃这一轮失败Outputs也不等于清工具旧缓存。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>GraphExecutor先在finally释放实现IDisposable/IAsyncDisposable的单轮module，随后检查取消、超时、异常、结果状态以及输出描述符。失败且PreserveFailedOutputs=false时直接Record失败，未传Outputs，记录使用Empty；所以插件字典里曾构造的状态输出不一定发布。通过检查的成功/NoMatch结果（以及显式保留失败输出的路径）复制输出字典并包ReadOnlyDictionary，值仍是同一PortValue；CompoundOutputFields.Expand也先浅复制已有键值，只为适用的复合值追加投影字段。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>try{if(n.ModuleId==WorkflowCalls.ModuleId)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d317aea19ef91d5936fda2930148f9d2681564f831764c508254611847c6da66" href="../../证据/d317aea19ef91d5936fda2930148f9d2681564f831764c508254611847c6da66.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d317aea19ef9</small></a><p>if(result.Status==ModuleStatus.Failed&amp;&amp;!result.PreserveFailedOutputs)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4" href="../../证据/1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1edcf7aa0e18</small></a><p>if(result.Continuation==ModuleContinuation.SuppressSuccessors)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="740d3d3a65cc1f2d66f6abbeccd2bc8f702bbb1d06ce9f05d7e2a2055c2a63b2" href="../../证据/740d3d3a65cc1f2d66f6abbeccd2bc8f702bbb1d06ce9f05d7e2a2055c2a63b2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>740d3d3a65cc</small></a><p>public sealed record ModuleResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="8068dbf59f6204b9a64a01f18ca2373075df61cdacd433f9c7383e36b5b7b8bb" href="../../证据/8068dbf59f6204b9a64a01f18ca2373075df61cdacd433f9c7383e36b5b7b8bb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>8068dbf59f62</small></a><p>public static IReadOnlyDictionary&lt;string,PortValue> Expand(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0393d7321deb734b4f7b6d3efc5263f228b96ac4efa3a74d8620d73e536057fb" href="../../证据/0393d7321deb734b4f7b6d3efc5263f228b96ac4efa3a74d8620d73e536057fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0393d7321deb</small></a><p>public ExecutionSessionResult Complete(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="41375ef4db365a6a1fcd5aa4286a2a6e6dd256c790c91f2bef851f60c2c0d468" href="../../证据/41375ef4db365a6a1fcd5aa4286a2a6e6dd256c790c91f2bef851f60c2c0d468.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>41375ef4db36</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不会据清理函数名推断所有输出载荷释放；实际原子性、并发读者和native最后读者仍须按真实对象追踪。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD07" id="TD07"><summary>TD07 · IToolDisplayProvider.LastDisplay → 三presenter → frame持有 / 图像层位图 / 文本和结果投影</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>image presenter.Frame保留完整ToolDisplayFrame；各图像层另有BitmapSource副本；TextBlock/表行是另一种投影。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>清frame后尺寸归1；provider可能仍持有最近输出。最多三勾选图像层及文字/图形按frame重建。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Show(null)置Frame=null并移除该presenter的图像/标签引用，不调用frame.Image.Dispose或清provider缓存；同一图像的其它持有者继续有效。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>RefreshToolDisplay按请求代次、execution owner和当前流程判Current，先Show(null)清旧显示，再在node有结果且实现provider时取frame；Current通过后把同一frame传给图像、记录和结果列表presenter。图像presenter把Frame字段设为frame，清文字/几何children与旧image.Source/图像层，然后按选中图像和勾选层重建WPF图像。Bitmap辅助函数同样Pixels.ToArray→BitmapSource.Create→Freeze。记录presenter只取RecordText，列表presenter把ResultList投影为一个字典行；不能把这两者说成持有相同的整帧字段。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（5）</summary><p>long request=++toolDisplayRequestGeneration</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0" href="../../证据/011023208dd4062299060f59880a42a7b6c3a347c961a8082a16f314694d4cd0.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>011023208dd4</small></a><p>Frame = frame; labels.Children.Clear(); image.Source = null;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17" href="../../证据/5c262edb8d5033f223006a465497bad17a1acb92da5c65898c4b6fe51b506a17.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c262edb8d50</small></a><p>var selectedLayer=frame.SelectedImageName</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02" href="../../证据/187a9b03f59713dabc98ef98fbd993721025a132f378bb576a3df9eb4d8dbd02.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>187a9b03f597</small></a><p>public void Show(ToolDisplayFrame? frame) { Text</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc" href="../../证据/0d83ceb0af29dbefc84e08ee90d7f67f206a59ced14a87db29e445ec9f42c2cc.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0d83ceb0af29</small></a><p>Columns.Clear(); ItemsSource = null;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c" href="../../证据/f4570afb88fcff97092854091ef3fef6e654e2d4ab2518e002cc9add9732b19c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f4570afb88fc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不因Current门或Freeze推断所有生产者线程安全；原版文字/几何/native图像的最后读者和生命周期仍独立核对。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="TD08" id="TD08"><summary>TD08 · 会话结果 / 当前结果视图 / 两类历史 → 多持有者退役与方案切换</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>workflowSessions与results可指同一记录；主框架历史和二值化摘要不是像素历史，LastResult则可以继续持有输出图像。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>session以流程ID索引，覆盖或清除只改变相应容器引用；二值化窗口关闭只标closed，不能据此假设LastResult已置null。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>方案切换、清列表、关闭窗口、scope释放和最后图像读者退出必须分别核对；托管图像没有逐帧Dispose协议，不能宣布立即归还全部像素。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>当前运行完成后经owner检查提交，StoreWorkflowCallResults把ExecutionSessionResult放进workflowSessions；RestoreWorkflowResults把session中的同一NodeRunRecord赋给results，不深复制图像。切方案ReplaceExecutionScope清configurationResults/workflowSessions/results等并关闭旧scope，这些清理不证明所有外部持有者同时清除。主框架FrameworkRunHistory仅保存序号/时间/状态文字/流程ID/耗时，最多500条，不保存图像；二值化窗口的history也只是最多256条状态摘要，但LastResult单独保留NodeRunRecord。Present先更新LastResult和摘要，再按100ms门决定是否更新图像/表格，故不同显示持有者可能短暂不同步。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（10）</summary><p>var owner=CaptureExecutionOwner();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="69e206d71a60d17b7049f94f5289854bc00b3c6f6f99724715efe2b36aa18992" href="../../证据/69e206d71a60d17b7049f94f5289854bc00b3c6f6f99724715efe2b36aa18992.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>69e206d71a60</small></a><p>var session=await Task.Run(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69" href="../../证据/5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c3a2427db92</small></a><p>void StoreWorkflowCallResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c" href="../../证据/3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b3117a036fd</small></a><p>void RestoreWorkflowResults()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="253883732654ea20b383d45cb4ffa669f1a4a052833062819ee404acd1d70b01" href="../../证据/253883732654ea20b383d45cb4ffa669f1a4a052833062819ee404acd1d70b01.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>253883732654</small></a><p>void ReplaceExecutionScope()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403" href="../../证据/059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059edbdec789</small></a><p>public const int MaximumRecords</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="20858fb17f06f256d0195e8b9ac4c68eb01088946c7d49b91fce4295b7cd4562" href="../../证据/20858fb17f06f256d0195e8b9ac4c68eb01088946c7d49b91fce4295b7cd4562.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>20858fb17f06</small></a><p>public void Append(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3ca2f5c148d6538acbd7e94ed19f071c43f79d98a9b06cf037c40b6acdccacca" href="../../证据/3ca2f5c148d6538acbd7e94ed19f071c43f79d98a9b06cf037c40b6acdccacca.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3ca2f5c148d6</small></a><p>public sealed record FrameworkRunHistoryEntry(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="58ede53f5394246631d3d74bcf4454b5dc0f77a2659efc25410966a579eb76bf" href="../../证据/58ede53f5394246631d3d74bcf4454b5dc0f77a2659efc25410966a579eb76bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>58ede53f5394</small></a><p>void Present(NodeRunRecord result)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="402b682a9427dbdb949e35a3421a43561938be5baaaa98d1877540fc5b37ef61" href="../../证据/402b682a9427dbdb949e35a3421a43561938be5baaaa98d1877540fc5b37ef61.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>402b682a9427</small></a><p>Closed+=(_,_)=>closed=true;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="825f4f79447b69c3d2381ae15532c441e3a533fb1f7b78207f0c2fb1c1f64d59" href="../../证据/825f4f79447b69c3d2381ae15532c441e3a533fb1f7b78207f0c2fb1c1f64d59.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>825f4f79447b</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：没有把历史文字条数当成保留像素帧数；实际WPF窗口可达性、全部调试引用与内存峰值需要单独运行证据，当前未执行。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR01" id="CR01"><summary>CR01 · 新一轮开始 / 停止 / 抛取消异常 → 隐藏旧结果视图与保存旧会话是两个动作</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>results是可见NodeRunRecord索引，workflowSessions是完整ExecutionSessionResult；隐藏索引不等于移除图像持有者。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>旧session可继续保持Nodes、WorkflowOutputs、WorkflowDisplays、LocalVariables和Calls中的PortValue引用；不能将空白显示当零像素缓存。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>停止请求不等于清旧结果或FIFO；本轮没有新session时不会自动用空session覆盖旧session。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>BeginWorkflowResults增加过程执行计数，仅在count>1、workStatus非0且清旧结果偏好开启时，标记该过程及所调用子过程为cleared并清当前results视图；它不删除workflowSessions。RunCore返回session才StoreWorkflowCallResults覆盖对应会话并移除cleared标记。若Task.Run被取消或执行抛异常而没有返回session，catch只改状态文字，旧session仍在；偏好开启时可处于隐藏状态，未开启时也未由这个catch主动清除。工具栏停止只Cancel activeRun，FinishWorkflowRun清运行标记并Dispose该取消源，不清会话或插件scope状态。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p> void BeginWorkflowResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="906d7cf57bdf8339ab5ca2514f2fba86c6ae18a05d1a7b4e33387608010c9e52" href="../../证据/906d7cf57bdf8339ab5ca2514f2fba86c6ae18a05d1a7b4e33387608010c9e52.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>906d7cf57bdf</small></a><p>    public bool ShouldClearAtBegin(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="57dd650ccb3cd900f30c8d8be2152928f992a15bc6916d26e3ec9cbc815dda73" href="../../证据/57dd650ccb3cd900f30c8d8be2152928f992a15bc6916d26e3ec9cbc815dda73.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>57dd650ccb3c</small></a><p>   var session=await Task.Run(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69" href="../../证据/5c3a2427db92b4e91b947080e765d7eee6df18eb8f50cf3ae982e9f778a08c69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5c3a2427db92</small></a><p>  catch(OperationCanceledException){if(IsCurrentExecutionOwner(owner))</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0f1bef6a5732fecdbfba501aa4508ca1daea445ecf4da78732bfd3248f5fd227" href="../../证据/0f1bef6a5732fecdbfba501aa4508ca1daea445ecf4da78732bfd3248f5fd227.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0f1bef6a5732</small></a><p> void StoreWorkflowCallResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c" href="../../证据/3b3117a036fd49cd57cfbbf2dd5f2f05538f7f2b735a5257fcf2c1b3bec49f1c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3b3117a036fd</small></a><p> void FinishWorkflowRun(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9dd56ae0fac7064eb4fb05031cb8171ca88a0b21718cf16a701e45bf8cba48aa" href="../../证据/9dd56ae0fac7064eb4fb05031cb8171ca88a0b21718cf16a701e45bf8cba48aa.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9dd56ae0fac7</small></a><p>stopToolButton=Tool(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="61a0f0198b10cfd38182295471ce9f343d73ba976360d21b616ee810a24b93e7" href="../../证据/61a0f0198b10cfd38182295471ce9f343d73ba976360d21b616ee810a24b93e7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>61a0f0198b10</small></a><p>public sealed record ExecutionSessionResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a624e1107d0fc0939aaeebd75f8cf5259eab85a687e6877a8ebbffc7440706a7" href="../../证据/a624e1107d0fc0939aaeebd75f8cf5259eab85a687e6877a8ebbffc7440706a7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a624e1107d0f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：此事实仅区分返回session与抛异常两条路径，不把所有取消都判成保留旧会话；返回Cancelled session的覆盖路径见CR02。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR02" id="CR02"><summary>CR02 · GraphExecutor本轮取消 / 失败 / 跳过 → 本轮混合结果可替换上轮会话；旧插件状态另留</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>取消后保留的可能是本轮成功前缀，不是自动合并上一轮成功图像；失败记录与成功记录的图像持有不同。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>覆盖旧会话只移除该字典入口的旧引用，不清插件缓存、配置结果、调试记录或独立视图；新session本身仍可保留本轮成功图像。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>清输出字典、返回取消状态、取消源Dispose均没有逐帧图像Dispose语义。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>GraphExecutor每轮新建records，不拿上一轮NodeRunRecord补失败节点。节点开始前发现取消会Record(Cancelled)且输出默认Empty；前驱失败或不可用会Record(Skipped)且输出Empty。单节点执行后取消/超时/异常与失败输出过滤按TD04生成本轮记录，已经成功完成的前序节点记录不因此统一清空。最终把全部本轮记录组成session，状态可为Cancelled/Failed/TimedOut。RunCore只检查owner、未以session成功作为发布前提，所以正常返回的取消/失败session也可替换workflowSessions，包含本轮早先成功节点图像与后续空输出。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（6）</summary><p>  var calls=new Dictionary&lt;string,ExecutionSessionResult>();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c7144a5f850927830edc406166c971f52e77b9968d6f6ea0aec41d31578cea76" href="../../证据/c7144a5f850927830edc406166c971f52e77b9968d6f6ea0aec41d31578cea76.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c7144a5f8509</small></a><p>   void Record(NodeRunStatus s,</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f1440ee0600786c122f0d86ac78832d707143388f584c292c495a9f8eb204f54" href="../../证据/f1440ee0600786c122f0d86ac78832d707143388f584c292c495a9f8eb204f54.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f1440ee06007</small></a><p>   if(executionEdges.Where(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="11cf5bf31a1b62f258250b166cff21ce3305c5ec960ca40048bbb592167d77bf" href="../../证据/11cf5bf31a1b62f258250b166cff21ce3305c5ec960ca40048bbb592167d77bf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>11cf5bf31a1b</small></a><p>   if(cancellationToken.IsCancellationRequested){Record(NodeRunStatus.Cancelled,code:</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4" href="../../证据/1edcf7aa0e18f242df1eb1159ae781bfbee4da1ae061d2377b257bd27a4c65a4.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1edcf7aa0e18</small></a><p>  var all=validation.ExecutionOrder.Select(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f" href="../../证据/f68913b1df0b35ac68aca5c58ab9b03e7c8a095b5fb0fd382db0189265a8ce1f.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f68913b1df0b</small></a><p>   WorkflowCallbacks.PublishModuleResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="267f0dc129d0e1d9039b2874b4463ef9adafd5a3a1001d76e3cd72a5e464bab6" href="../../证据/267f0dc129d0e1d9039b2874b4463ef9adafd5a3a1001d76e3cd72a5e464bab6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>267f0dc129d0</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Task.Run调度前取消或外层异常可能不产生session，需与CR01分别判断；未执行竞争、GC或内存峰值探针。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR03" id="CR03"><summary>CR03 · GraphEditorDocument.DeleteNodes → Changed → scope节点状态移除不等于裁剪旧session/配置记录</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>编辑文档的节点/JSON历史与运行NodeRunRecord在不同容器；删除图结构不自动改写历史运行session。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>configurationResults还可保存已删节点的旧记录；新配置请求available从旧session与configurationResults组装引用视图。具体能否再被有效订阅消费仍受当前文档解析和验证限制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>scope移除仅退役该层state持有；显示不再列出节点不等于所有结果载荷不可达。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>DeleteNodes修改节点、连线与配置引用，Edit提交文档后发Changed；主窗Changed调用ValidateToolConfigurationOwner、RetainExecutionNodes和刷新。RetainExecutionNodes只将现存(过程,模块,节点)集合交scope.RetainProcedureNodes并裁剪pointAliasPresentation。scope移除对应参数缓存与state，state若IDisposable才Dispose。这个删除链没有按被删节点裁剪workflowSessions.Nodes、configurationResults或toolDebugRecords；这些容器先前保存的记录不能因文档节点消失而推定已释放。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>    public void DeleteNodes(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="55d45978667d8145c9adc9da30a45d75ec8b9741f7221a07673f0ad6d36d96be" href="../../证据/55d45978667d8145c9adc9da30a45d75ec8b9741f7221a07673f0ad6d36d96be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>55d45978667d</small></a><p>        SolutionStore.ValidateStructure(next); RecordEditHistory();</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b89579065a8ee9f9af3570bc103d2944630d50bee54ddd11515cddf3118608d2" href="../../证据/b89579065a8ee9f9af3570bc103d2944630d50bee54ddd11515cddf3118608d2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b89579065a8e</small></a><p>doc.Changed+=()=></p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85" href="../../证据/bff6c0b3eb0883dc1057b705e28b693ec36d082a6414ba5eb28abcc7bdbffb85.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>bff6c0b3eb08</small></a><p> void RetainExecutionNodes()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b" href="../../证据/649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>649bacd49f44</small></a><p> public void RemoveNode(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a><p> void RetainProcedureNodes(IEnumerable&lt;(string Procedure,string Module,string Node)> current,string? only)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac" href="../../证据/fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd003545d04d</small></a><p>  var available=(workflowSessions.TryGetValue(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="981b8452e46fdcdc33b3db47f2114d8e3c2f5be28823b36d88836b7b543560a6" href="../../证据/981b8452e46fdcdc33b3db47f2114d8e3c2f5be28823b36d88836b7b543560a6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>981b8452e46f</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：只证明所选删除/Changed链没有这些裁剪，不宣称任意其它用户动作永远不会清记录；结果字典的最终可达时刻未测。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR04" id="CR04"><summary>CR04 · ImageSource状态缓存 / SDK待提交帧 / ImageBuffer FIFO → scope退役、Reset、像素格式变化分别影响哪些持有者</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>源Cache、PendingFrame、拼接数组、FIFO和NodeRunRecord是不同持有者；State.Dispose并不表示它的每个字段被清空。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>即使state从scope字典移除，正在运行的局部state引用或旧结果仍可能继续持有像素；停止不触发这里的Reset。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>是否由GC回收取决于其它引用；本切片只报告显式字段/容器变化，不宣称旧字节立刻归还系统。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>ImageSource.State除Cache还持PendingFrame及StitchBuffer；其Dispose仅Dispose Folder并置null，不主动Clear Cache、清PendingFrame或StitchBuffer。SDK提交以Interlocked.Exchange替换PendingFrame，执行SDK模式再Exchange为null取走，不克隆。文件模式仅像素格式变化时Clear Cache，路径命中复用同一图像；缓存容量参数只限制新准入，不在此段按减少后的容量主动裁剪。ImageBuffer.State不是IDisposable，FIFO淘汰/Reset及scope移除均只是移除特定持有，旧结果仍可指向已出队图像（复制/发布见TD03）。主窗InvalidateSourceResults清results、调用fallback Reset并移除scope节点，却未在此方法清workflowSessions或configurationResults。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（8）</summary><p> sealed class State:IDisposable</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="89f6bf8036f5d726b62111368975cd50b32b1df8611de20688bbe3fe4a9d7186" href="../../证据/89f6bf8036f5d726b62111368975cd50b32b1df8611de20688bbe3fe4a9d7186.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>89f6bf8036f5</small></a><p> public void SubmitImage(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="e95d5c3ddca051a3b34f99a3ef3062deccf4070cd0b6ca5ec44633d55904fad8" href="../../证据/e95d5c3ddca051a3b34f99a3ef3062deccf4070cd0b6ca5ec44633d55904fad8.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>e95d5c3ddca0</small></a><p> public void Reset(ModuleExecutionScope</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105" href="../../证据/92647cab0979a813914ff1ef88765ab76ac3b815ed8d7b195e4036d4c90da105.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>92647cab0979</small></a><p> public void Reset(string nodeId)</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943" href="../../证据/13df7359670c7f42485010007d0b0a3f25d04ade90e0b15f27e73159f7cf1943.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>13df7359670c</small></a><p>    if(state.PixelFormat!=</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d" href="../../证据/c9b08bf7272fe19106c06837d18e8fe34de27125b37fc2d2276a77a8ea75d91d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>c9b08bf7272f</small></a><p>     image=Interlocked.Exchange(ref state.PendingFrame,null)!;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="30ce5b0d645bf5ba8fa53f0cded075c39a1ec1afa54cb9cd0511427e6077413b" href="../../证据/30ce5b0d645bf5ba8fa53f0cded075c39a1ec1afa54cb9cd0511427e6077413b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>30ce5b0d645b</small></a><p> sealed class State {</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="3cd0cb0fbffbb7a8227782f59fd5f627759a587ca5984feb13b1e97e1d90e5cf" href="../../证据/3cd0cb0fbffbb7a8227782f59fd5f627759a587ca5984feb13b1e97e1d90e5cf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>3cd0cb0fbffb</small></a><p> void InvalidateSourceResults(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9768a53926729a080ff8249575d37b3e3fce7bbc03804fea3956145139ca4818" href="../../证据/9768a53926729a080ff8249575d37b3e3fce7bbc03804fea3956145139ca4818.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9768a5392672</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：无scope fallback状态的外部调用/所有Reset时序未穷尽；已知的托管持有关系不能替代native相机帧租用与释放证据。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR05" id="CR05"><summary>CR05 · 工具调试 / 普通配置自执行 / 关闭编辑器 → 停止调度与LastResult、Task结果、宿主缓存分别退役</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>完成Task&lt;T>、配置执行器LastResult、configurationResults、toolDebugRecords和工具窗口LastResult是独立持有者，不能统一命名成一个“会话结果”。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>正常失败record可覆盖配置缓存旧记录；配置失活导致不发布时旧configurationResults可留存。调试Invalidate还只做宿主特定失效标记，不消灭其它session旧引用。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>停止、Dispose调度器、从窗口集合移除、清LastResult和清宿主记录是不同动作；不能从窗口关闭推断所有输出图像已释放。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>当前实际类型是ToolDebugSession和ExecutionSessionResult，并未发现名为ToolExecutionSession/RunRecord的同一实体。ToolDebugSession.active保存Start返回的Task，完成finally仅清取消源/更新状态，不把active置null；若为RunOnce，该完成Task可继续持有NodeRunRecord直到active被下次Start替换或session不再可达。StopAsync取消并等待active，不清已保存结果。普通配置调度ToolConfigurationExecution.Dispatch开始把LastResult=null，完成再置结果；StopAsync只取消轮询并等loop，不清LastResult；DisposeAsync再等待inFlight也不清它。宿主RunConfiguredTool按owner/配置存活/节点身份准入后缓存record，不限成功状态；关闭配置可阻止晚发布，但CloseToolConfiguration没有清configurationResults。独立调试窗口的关闭另等待session.DisposeAsync后移除session集合项，不等同清宿主toolDebugRecords。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（9）</summary><p> Task? active;</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2" href="../../证据/5222f1b9a88904f5a5dd94c33435abff4b170b6f582a9d88d7307170b623d7e2.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>5222f1b9a889</small></a><p>   async Task&lt;T> Execute()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7" href="../../证据/d22473d11e55a85136428f9e85871a4c9736e0216fcbf94f8a3303db959972b7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d22473d11e55</small></a><p> public async Task StopAsync()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392" href="../../证据/d03635ba61cc497e221d27abad4f95c8d21f7cb872d50b0fb5e6dd404ab34392.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>d03635ba61cc</small></a><p> async Task Dispatch(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7" href="../../证据/17ad97750ddbdb1eca5d670992614b5fe04923e8de8d4a7bbbcd98abe89eaee7.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>17ad97750ddb</small></a><p> public async Task StopAsync(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38" href="../../证据/7c2e184d34c38dc51b4a341154c21fafa817e27a26c993f0044adab6a2445b38.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>7c2e184d34c3</small></a><p>  }catch(Exception ex){record=new(nodeId,</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742" href="../../证据/de435e16af18ef654977ecb4f322f199172aff53db1a457fbad80574ea25f742.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>de435e16af18</small></a><p> void CloseToolConfiguration()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde" href="../../证据/4ae7013d1039c64b158076a59b90b6c4159192d58e7127db05904e773c209bde.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4ae7013d1039</small></a><p> void BindToolEditorLifetime(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6" href="../../证据/560abd8d493dc3cc55d6ab695ea2bd4fc81bd84bd083e5db864f3f7b81b9b5f6.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>560abd8d493d</small></a><p> void StoreToolDebugResult(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3" href="../../证据/f654b99be7096785ff5c4c306c63f24c34a67a6f083c5615d6e9f4840bb586e3.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f654b99be709</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：Task对象是否实际继续可达取决于窗口/context/session持有；此处只指出字段可达链，不声称关闭后必然泄漏。工具窗口内部额外结果/图像字段仍按各工具另核。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CR06" id="CR06"><summary>CR06 · 切方案 / 关闭主窗 → 先阻止旧owner发布，scope等待租约；主窗关闭不等于全持有者清零</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>scope的租约控制state/services清理；NodeRunRecord与WPF/工具显示引用不由同一引用计数统一管理。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>失败资源被保留用于CleanupFailures诊断；旧在飞方法局部引用、关闭窗口/context、外部消费者与结果Task可另外保持载荷可达。FrameworkRunHistory只存摘要（TD08），不能把它当图像历史释放机制。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>新owner阻止旧结果进入新方案，但不是销毁所有旧像素；窗口生命周期、scope清理、查询容器释放和最后图像读者退出需分别说明。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>切方案ReplaceExecutionScope先使执行owner失效、取消当前请求，显式Clear调试记录、configurationResults、workflowSessions、results等，再Dispose旧scope并创建新scope。scope.Dispose先closing并Cancel，只有取消完成且leases==0才Release；Release清state/services/参数字典，再逐个Dispose可释放资源，失败资源额外存failedResources。主窗关闭与切方案不同：DrainWorkflowBeforeClose先取消活动流程并等activeRun换出；独立调试session由OnClosing等停。OnClosed关闭owner/回调队列、关配置并Dispose scope，但该体没有Clear workflowSessions/results/configurationResults或逐个清控件图像。只可说关闭启动退役，不能说所有外部对象已同步归零。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p> void ReplaceExecutionScope()</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403" href="../../证据/059edbdec78959762068e303ec96ee8bd8b5949dbf1185a4cdc704bd690f8403.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>059edbdec789</small></a><p> public void Dispose(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf" href="../../证据/4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e8fd932d9bb</small></a><p> void Release(){</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a><p> void RecordCleanupFailure(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a><p> async void DrainWorkflowBeforeClose(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb" href="../../证据/6be2984eb8a0ced82e645ad5b341ff9f2eeff1bd91922706f00d68bb58b4a1fb.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>6be2984eb8a0</small></a><p> protected override async void OnClosing(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797" href="../../证据/f6d959502fe59ffd5b4afa4b8b044e17cc3b1da9af33f62790bf710c6339e797.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f6d959502fe5</small></a><p> protected override void OnClosed(</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b" href="../../证据/9244b0ac6bbc3cfbdf8dc4d39210323edbd9c04dc225ccac1177ba978d7fea8b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9244b0ac6bbc</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：没有强制GC、原机内存峰值或最终外部读者测量；不得由静态Dispose路径推断释放的精确时刻、无泄漏或native等价。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CSR01" id="CSR01"><summary>CSR01 · ModuleExecutionScope.RegisterService&lt;T>替换旧owned服务 → 先撤owned标记，再Dispose；抛错可留下未回滚的旧映射</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>services以Type为key保留对象引用；ownedServices是按ReferenceEquality比较的跨Type集合。新旧服务引用与该集合标记分开。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>Service&lt;T>()仍可能查回旧previous。后续root Release的服务候选来自ownedServices而非services全值，所以若旧对象没有另在states等候选中，它不再因这个服务映射获得自动Dispose重试。另有state/服务别名时不能据这一条断言永不再被Dispose。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>这是服务替换入口的异常合同，区别于root Release逐资源catch/记失败后继续；服务注册并未采用同样的失败资源保留策略。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>条件必须同时满足：同T已有previous、新service不是同引用、ownedServices.Remove(previous)返回true且previous实现IDisposable。该条件链先从ownedServices删除旧对象，再调用previous.Dispose；只有其正常返回才写services[typeof(T)]=新service及按owned标记登记新对象。旧Dispose抛异常时方法无catch/finally回滚：services仍映射旧previous，旧owned标记已移除，新service未写入，异常直接向调用者传播，也不调用RecordCleanupFailure。不能把注册失败描述为原状态完全不变。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（4）</summary><p>RegisterService&lt;T> mutation order</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ef79a5bdf89ba032cc80169004e45707f3f8da518d0b728d8b3d630f50e98eb5" href="../../证据/ef79a5bdf89ba032cc80169004e45707f3f8da518d0b728d8b3d630f50e98eb5.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ef79a5bdf89b</small></a><p>Service&lt;T> query</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="a55462ac6451fc7c10fab1793f6eb70768b9c36f0d85e909505f02c4746e943d" href="../../证据/a55462ac6451fc7c10fab1793f6eb70768b9c36f0d85e909505f02c4746e943d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>a55462ac6451</small></a><p>Release candidate construction</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a><p>RecordCleanupFailure retention</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be" href="../../证据/667d84c52f018741334ebe41c9094af0e41b74238b795cd1b7c240d6bab018be.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>667d84c52f01</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：本条是源码静态事实；另列ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限合成Disposable替换异常。真实相机/工具服务、GUI与设备未观测，不直接宣称现有资源会触发。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：ownedServices按对象而非逐Type独立计数；所有多接口别名注册/外部所有者的实际组合未穷尽。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CSR02" id="CSR02"><summary>CSR02 · RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes批量裁剪 → 删除记录在Dispose之前完成；首个异常中断剩余裁剪</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>节点状态字典移除、参数字典移除、对象Dispose完成分别发生，不能用一个成功/失败标记代替。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>没有被循环走到的state仍由root.states持有，可在之后的裁剪或root关闭进入其它清理；已移除但Dispose失败对象不由本分支自动放入failedResources。若它另被owned服务/外部持有，则还需单独判断。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>单节点Remove/批量Retain与root Release有不同异常屏障；root Release的逐项继续保证不能外推到这两个入口。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>RemoveNode在root.gate内先删除effectiveParameters键，再从states.Remove取出value；离锁后仅当value实现IDisposable才Dispose，没有catch和RecordCleanupFailure。Dispose抛错时该node状态及参数已从这些字典移除，调用直接失败；重复RemoveNode找不到state就return，不自动重试旧对象。RetainProcedureNodes先批量删除不在keep中的全部参数键，再快照待移state键并foreach RemoveNode；其中一项抛错将中断剩余foreach，后续state仍可留在states，而其参数键可能已在第一阶段删除。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（3）</summary><p>RemoveNode removes then disposes</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69" href="../../证据/ff088aad88d8d8409e0a4d415d967d2fc4b0ac692180e6de62f6c72fa4d32e69.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>ff088aad88d8</small></a><p>RetainProcedureNodes two-phase pruning</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac" href="../../证据/fd003545d04d7cbe309b8965e71c44483cfb2bdcf37af963fb6bf3978a7ab2ac.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fd003545d04d</small></a><p>WPF RetainExecutionNodes caller</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b" href="../../证据/649bacd49f444bba56b31e370305693a6359a602663d27765cad1dce2840a31b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>649bacd49f44</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：WPF doc.Changed等上层对传播异常如何显示/恢复需按调用者另追；本切片不宣称文档编辑或整个solution关闭必然失败。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe已观测有限顺序Remove/Retain异常；并发与真实资源异常未观测，本条仍按源码关系取证。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CSR03" id="CSR03"><summary>CSR03 · root closing置位与API准入 / 租约 → 立即拒新状态与租约，不等于所有查询/删除都禁用</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>closing是操作级准入状态；cancellationComplete与leases控制root Release时机。借用view的存在本身不证明其API可继续使用。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>在Release前states/services可能仍保留；State即使只是想取已有值也先拒绝，Service查询则未使用同样策略。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Enter取得的Lease仅参与root TryRelease；Lease自身Interlocked.Exchange确保一次Exit。它不替代调用者在RemoveNode等入口的并发协调。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>root Dispose在gate下先设置closing=true再调用stopping.Cancel；State&lt;T>、RegisterService、Enter与参数Parameters入口均以closing抛ObjectDisposedException。与之不同，Service&lt;T>只锁gate查询，无closing检查：若活跃租约阻止Release清字典，它仍可在closing期间返回旧服务；Release清空后则返回null。ForProcedure只验证procedure字符串，可以继续生成borrowed view；RequestRun/RequestRefresh在closing直接返回。RemoveNode与RetainProcedureNodes没有closing或leases门，故root完整Release等待租约不能被概括成任何节点移除/替换都受同一租约保护。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>State&lt;T> closing gate</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c" href="../../证据/b70c7dfc27c1831ec0c54986c719bacb2e6064766684a2425b3188e5d8c7446c.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b70c7dfc27c1</small></a><p>RegisterService and Service asymmetry</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="b3568c9a7737fce55bd04f55f551e668924c85e43e247aa44d896525d087131e" href="../../证据/b3568c9a7737fce55bd04f55f551e668924c85e43e247aa44d896525d087131e.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>b3568c9a7737</small></a><p>ForProcedure borrowed view construction</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d" href="../../证据/9af9ceff47aa44aa1272f50a0c6141d393421d9080eb4221f686ec047ef1f97d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>9af9ceff47aa</small></a><p>RequestRun and RequestRefresh closing return</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="07915e3685efb2856e87527487a856905e5a7d0e119618882b5cfead1b861932" href="../../证据/07915e3685efb2856e87527487a856905e5a7d0e119618882b5cfead1b861932.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>07915e3685ef</small></a><p>Enter and RemoveNode guards differ</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="107ef872276da6c4d33e93d24646cc63e010650c4331e482387587e321c05994" href="../../证据/107ef872276da6c4d33e93d24646cc63e010650c4331e482387587e321c05994.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>107ef872276d</small></a><p>Dispose/TryRelease/Exit</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf" href="../../证据/4e8fd932d9bb3193cfa517bfb3fe01d6ac384e05ebb94607f447b5bf750a6daf.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>4e8fd932d9bb</small></a><p>Effective parameter closing gate</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="0b3d70d24c37752cfb43fca518915b9c500c26d7db1a300a2a2d4d57c0808956" href="../../证据/0b3d70d24c37752cfb43fca518915b9c500c26d7db1a300a2a2d4d57c0808956.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>0b3d70d24c37</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：代码未给出所有方法的全域并发安全保证；不将允许调用某查询/Remove的事实解释为对资源在用状态必然安全。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：stopping.Token在CancellationTokenSource已Dispose之后的外部访问合同未在这里运行验证，不作应用级行为推断。</p></details><details class="dd-pipeline-fact" data-pipeline-fact="CSR04" id="CSR04"><summary>CSR04 · 取消或资源Dispose异常后的root Dispose / Lease.Exit → root清理是一次性尝试；failedResources保留不等于排队重试</summary><p>independent-implementation · 模式未在此单独归因 / 通用上下文</p><table><tbody><tr><th>谁持有 / 传什么</th><td>CleanupFailures getter返回失败记录数组副本；内部failedResources保存真实资源引用。诊断快照与资源持有是两层。</td></tr><tr><th>哪里缓存 / 如何失效</th><td>失败对象及其Exception可继续使资源图可达；保留到root仍可达不等于资源已释放，也不等于有后台重试任务。</td></tr><tr><th>谁释放 / 释放到哪</th><td>Release前先清states/有效参数/services/ownedServices，失败不会把原索引恢复。普通单项Dispose抛Exception不会阻断后续项；但分配快照、RecordCleanupFailure自身异常或进程级故障等未被这一逐资源catch覆盖。</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>第2层：实际成员、分支和数据传递</summary><p>Dispose设置closing后，stopping.Cancel抛Exception会RecordCleanupFailure(cancel,stopping,error)，finally仍设置cancellationComplete并TryRelease；不是因取消回调异常就跳过该finally。TryRelease要求closing、cancellationComplete、leases==0且!releaseStarted，在真正Release前置releaseStarted=true。Release对各IDisposable的Exception分别记录后继续下一资源，并单独尝试stopping.Dispose；这点现有CR06已有，本事实新增明确重试边界：root重复Dispose因closing立即return，后续Exit也因releaseStarted不再启动第二遍，failedResources只保留对象，所选类没有重试/清空该表的方法。</p></details><details><summary>第3层：源码原文与身份（7）</summary><p>Dispose cancellation catch and finally</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57" href="../../证据/02ecd73394adadcadbfe782f92e3631482ad988c312710e067cd96fb94f20b57.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>02ecd73394ad</small></a><p>TryRelease once-only gate</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="72db19d30e20a46eec751d69f739869910654f19a0f7de0d83b7a4e63df74a60" href="../../证据/72db19d30e20a46eec751d69f739869910654f19a0f7de0d83b7a4e63df74a60.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>72db19d30e20</small></a><p>Exit can trigger final release</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="f8ca4e658a43e85ba68d55bf16d6ce8c43293c07089fdb1f9e2854aa5a3b34de" href="../../证据/f8ca4e658a43e85ba68d55bf16d6ce8c43293c07089fdb1f9e2854aa5a3b34de.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>f8ca4e658a43</small></a><p>Release catches each resource and token</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b" href="../../证据/fbceb2ae3ec43a55b9819669ecf3d6370e09056623df7d2b48450d5a06dcc73b.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>fbceb2ae3ec4</small></a><p>Diagnostic snapshot and actual failed object retention</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="62e552a2c3645bbeb9d712b2c3ae8d70a647bde8ebe5dfd80ae3d0cb5aceba9d" href="../../证据/62e552a2c3645bbeb9d712b2c3ae8d70a647bde8ebe5dfd80ae3d0cb5aceba9d.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>62e552a2c364</small></a><p>releaseStarted and closing fields</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="802be731c5ac6e255baee00602bf6d6a3680df36bfafa4d18628ba85983e0c72" href="../../证据/802be731c5ac6e255baee00602bf6d6a3680df36bfafa4d18628ba85983e0c72.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>802be731c5ac</small></a><p>Lease exits once</p><p>原件 · not revalidated in this slice · </p><a class="site-evidence-link" data-evidence-key="1e55e375b9038794e05eb7ab59d4278d46a36f4890c92dc633e436e1a3cdfa31" href="../../证据/1e55e375b9038794e05eb7ab59d4278d46a36f4890c92dc633e436e1a3cdfa31.html#content">查看完整原文／记录 ↗ <small>1e55e375b903</small></a></details><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：不把源码Exception catch扩大为任何OOM、进程退出或任意RecordCleanupFailure自身失败时也必完整清理。</p><p class="dd-gap">未闭合：本条是源码静态事实；另列合成ScopeRetirementProbe验证有限异常与重复Dispose。GC、真实资源/GUI/设备及native释放未观测，不以幂等调用门推成功释放/原版等价。</p></details></article></div></details><p class="dd-gap">按调查层分组，不声称五层已在原版同一活实例中无缝闭合；每条事实的分类、模式与未知保留。 本轮为静态源码追踪，未执行设备、原版或当前GUI；不以清字典/清显示推断最后读者已结束。</p></section></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><nav><a href="../index.html">首页／界面入口</a><a href="../主题/主界面入口.html">主界面</a><a href="../工具/index.html">工具窗口</a><a href="../数据/index.html">数据与 Owner</a><a href="../主题/执行与状态.html">执行与结果</a><a href="../清单/交付与兼容.html">范围／兼容</a></nav><p class="site-progress">文档分页不增加产品实施完成数。主框架口径：41/96＝42.71%；本批实施增量 0。</p></footer><script src="../公共资源/routes.js"></script><script src="../公共资源/site.js"></script></body></html>